[12049]={"'Necesitamos un huevo de dragonzuelo para presentarlo a los otros clanes.'","'Nosotros, los de Aughaire, tenemos muchos problemas. Demasiados, creo, para el líder Crannog, que ha perdido el ánimo y la esperanza. Pero quizás quieras ayudarnos, como hizo Golodir una vez?\
\
Estamos atrapados en un laberinto de leyes de clan. Los que sirven a Angmar han intentado que sea imposible para nosotros cumplir nuestras obligaciones. Si fallamos, estaremos sujetos a una guerra abierta.\
\
Nuestra primera obligación es obtener un huevo de dragonzuelo de Nád Nathair. Lo necesitamos como símbolo de honor para enfrentar los desafíos de sangre de los otros clanes. Sin embargo, nuestros cazadores son acosados sin piedad por nuestros enemigos cuando nos acercamos a los dragonzuelos. ¿Irás a la guarida de los dragonzuelos, no muy lejos al norte, y conseguirás un huevo para nosotros? Los dragonzuelos están rodeados de muchas bestias de las colinas, así que reconocerás la guarida por su presencia.\
\
Escucha bien: los dragonzuelos son enemigos temibles, pero no son padres devotos. Es mejor tomar un huevo de un nido que no esté vigilado por un dragonzuelo.'","El huevo de dragonzuelo","Se ha planteado un desafío al clan de Arzhur, pero se requiere un símbolo de honor antes de que el pueblo de Aughaire pueda cumplir sus obligaciones legales con los otros clanes de Angmar.","Lleva el huevo de dragonzuelo a Arzhur","'Bien. Has demostrado tu valía, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} .'","Huevo de dragonzuelo recolectado","La guarida de los dragonzuelos es Nád Nathair, al norte de Aughaire. Nád Nathair se reconoce no solo por los dragonzuelos sino por las muchas bestias de las colinas en la zona.\
\
El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que obtengas un huevo de dragonzuelo. El huevo se necesita como símbolo para que los hombres de Aughaire lo presenten a los otros clanes de las colinas. Te ha advertido que evites a los dragonzuelos al buscar el huevo.","Recolecta un huevo de dragonzuelo"},
[12050]={"Huevos de dragonzuelo destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La reina de los dragonzuelos gobierna las tierras salvajes de Urugarth, engendrando nidadas de crías que asolan el campo.","'Gormal me ha dicho que intentarás matar a la reina de los dragonzuelos. Es una noble misión y te deseo buena suerte, pero matar a la reina solo traerá un respiro temporal.\
\
Si no se controla, su nidada de huevos eclosionará y uno de sus crías ocupará su lugar. Debes destruir sus huevos y asegurarte de que nada herede su legado como el Azote de Urugarth.\
\
Continúa tu misión hacia Urugarth. Se encuentra al oeste.'","'Entra en Urugarth y destruye los huevos de la reina de los dragonzuelos.'","Destruye los huevos de dragonzuelo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La reina de los dragonzuelos y su nidada de huevos se encuentran en Urugarth, al oeste de Tármunn Sûrsa.\
\
Esmë te aconsejó destruir los huevos de la reina de los dragonzuelos.","La nidada de la reina de los dragonzuelos","Esmë está en Tármunn Súrsa, al este de Urugarth.\
\
Deberías regresar con Esmë para contarle tu éxito.","'¿Los huevos están destruidos? Eso es bueno. Los jóvenes dragonzuelos no son tan poderosos como la reina, pero son igual de feroces y malvados.'"},
[12051]={"Scoutmaster Ausma has sent you a special crossbow to help you take down flying cold-drakes.\
\
You should use the Drake-slayer crossbow to defeat flying cold-drakes.","Flying drakes defeated with 'The Drake-slayer' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A secret weapon to wield against the drakes has been brought to you!","Talk to Hórin in Fellgát","The drake-slayer has lived up to its name!\
\
You should talk to Hórin in Fellgát after the battle is over.","'${PLAYER}! I'm glad I found you in time. The Scoutmaster sent me to deliver this: a special crossbow she has crafted that should be very effective against aerial drakes! You will need these as well.'\
\
The scout hands you a bundle of black-metal bolts. They are covered in sharp barbs.\
\
'It's called \\qThe Drake-slayer!\\q Make it live up to its name!'","Pick up 'The Drake-slayer'","The Drake-slayer","'What have you there, ${PLAYER}? A crossbow?'\
\
You hand Hórin the Drake-slayer and tell him the story of its making and of its success during the battle.\
\
'Clever Ausma! Did she develop these black bolts herself as well? Hmm... Perhaps this is the key to defeating Hrímil once and for all...?'","Defeat flying drakes with 'The Drake-slayer' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12052]={"Defeat drake matrons in Belfalas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak to Abartârik","Defeat drakes in Belfalas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated drake matrons in Belfalas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated drakes in Belfalas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Therien has asked you to lessen the drake population in Belfalas.\
\
Drakes can be found in the countryside of Belfalas.","You should let Abartârik know that you defeated drakes in Belfalas.\
\
Abartârik is in Dol Amroth.","'You battled against drakes? I suppose I shouldn't be surprised, given the stories I've heard of you. Still, that is impressive! I had begun hearing reports of their presence but had yet to determine how to handle them.\
\
'Well, thank you for making my life that much the easier, hah!","'Merchants have brought back troubling reports of drakes being spotted in the wilds of Belfalas. If you plan to go adventuring about out there, maybe you could bring their numbers down. The beasts are large enough to carry off horse and rider both!\
\
'If you manage to defeat any of the drakes, head to Dol Amroth and speak with Abartârik. They will reward you for your efforts.'","The Drakes of Belfalas","Sightings of huge flying scaled beasts have been reported in the Belfalas countryside."},
[12053]={"'Has ejecutado la tragedia perfecta. Muy pronto, las reservas de la Liga de las Posadas estarán prácticamente agotadas, ¡y la Asociación Cervecera reinará en su lugar!'","Vacía toneles de la Liga de las Posadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Qué quieres? ¿Crees que esos toneles se vaciarán más si te quedas aquí charlando conmigo todo el día? Estos no son los toneles que buscas. Ahora, será mejor que sigas con tus asuntos y te marches.'","Toneles de la Liga de las Posadas vaciados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Jónar, un habitante siniestro y hosco de la Mansión de Thorin, se ha vuelto cada vez más agrio ante el éxito creciente de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Los toneles de la Liga de las Posadas pueden encontrarse repartidos por toda la Comarca. Deberías ir a El Pájaro y el Bebé en Cavada Grande, al Árbol de la Fiesta en Hobbiton, al Dragón Verde en Delagua, al Tronco Flotante en Los Ranales, a Casa del Bosque, a Bolgovado y a la Perca Dorada en Cepeda.\
\
Jónar ha insistido en que vacíes varios toneles de la Liga de las Posadas para sabotear a la liga de amantes de la cerveza, que crece demasiado rápido.","La Sequía de la Cerveza","Jónar se encuentra en un rincón oscuro de la posada de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Deberías regresar de inmediato junto a Jónar para contarle las noticias de tu éxito contra los hobbits y su facción rival.","'No puedo creer que mi primer intento de sabotaje haya sido frustrado por la naturaleza confiada y perezosa de esos tontos hobbits. Pero esto no puede salir mal.\
\
'Aquí tienes lo que harás a continuación. Escucha con atención: quiero que perfores los toneles que usan para servir sus patéticas cervezas hobbit. Si les haces agujeros, se vaciarán por todas partes y quedarán secos para el próximo hobbit que intente usarlos.\
\
'Con solo imaginar las caras de decepción de esos pequeños rostros blandos, se me escapa una lágrima de alegría. Ahora ve, deprisa, ¡y vacía esos toneles! No es un desperdicio cuando tanto bien sale de ello... para mí.'","Habla con Jónar en la Mansión de Thorin"},
[12054]={"You have located Meregyth. She is just ahead on the dock","Thane Sparhafoc is in the Fenmarch Mead Hall.\
\
After receiving her father's distressing news, a devastated Meregyth ran off. You should inform Thane Sparhafoc that you have delivered the unfortunate tidings.","Meregyth will most likely be found just west of the Mead Hall in Fenmarch.\
\
You have gathered an impressive bouquet of Arrowhead to give to Meregyth. Now you must deliver it and Thane Sparhafoc's message.","Collected arrowheads (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Arrowhead grows in Fenmarch, east of Aldburg.\
\
Thane Sparhafoc has asked you to deliver a message to his daughter Meregyth, but he first wants you to collect an arrangement of arrowhead to help soften the disappointment she is certain to feel.","'It's so calm and beautiful here.'","Meregyth can be found on a dock west of the Fenmarch Mead Hall.\
\
Deliver the arrowhead-arrangement and the message from her father, Thane Sparhafoc, regarding the unlikelihood that Éomer will still wed her now that he is heir to the throne of Rohan.","Talk to Thane Sparhafoc","'This is a family matter that I do not wish to involve others in, but I cannot bring myself to tell Meregyth what I have long known.\
\
'Now that Éomer is heir to the throne of Rohan, he is to marry a lady of much higher station, not the daughter of a marsh-lord.\
\
'If you could talk with her, it would remove a burden from my heart. Pick an arrangement of arrowhead, a flower which grows around Fenmarch, and deliver it to her along with my message.'","Meregyth accepts the flowers from you and listens intently to what you have to say.\
\
'Éomer will not marry me...?'\
\
Meregyth hangs her head as a tear rolls off her cheek and onto the dock.","Collect arrowheads (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Meregyth","The Dreaded Day","'I knew this would break her heart. I simply could not bring myself to tell her.\
\
'Thank you for delivering such unfortunate tidings. Hopefully when she has calmed herself, she will return in better spirits.\
\
'Now we have more dire matters to attend to.'","Find Meregyth","Thane Sparhafoc cannot bring himself to tell his daughter, Meregyth, that Éomer will most likely not wed her, now that he is heir to the throne of Rohan."},
[12055]={"Drank mysterious liquor (5/6)","Drink mysterious liquor (4/6)","Drinks can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel in central Lamedon.\
\
You should drink quickly to best the drinking champion of Jajax's Corsairs.","'Are you ready? Drink fast, if you can. We count as soon as you accept this challenge. If you fail, things may not go well for you....'","Drank mysterious liquor (6/6)","The Drinking Challenge","Drank mysterious liquor (4/6)","Drink mysterious liquor (1/6)","Liquor can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel.\
\
You should quickly drink the liquor in the tavern to challenge Damkalb.","Drink mysterious liquor (5/6)","Drink mysterious liquor (3/6)","Drank mysterious liquor (2/6)","You have a fixed amount of time in which to drink as much as Damkalb, the current drinking champion of the Corsairs under Jajax.","Drink mysterious liquor (2/6)","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Drink mysterious liquor (0/6)","Drank mysterious liquor (1/6)","Drank mysterious liquor (3/6)"},
[12056]={"'Bienvenido a nuestro asentamiento temporal, ${PLAYER}. Puedes descansar aquí un rato, pero procura no acomodarte demasiado. Tengo una tarea para ti.\
\
Hace varios días, nuestras fuerzas se dividieron en dos, y la mitad partió hacia el sur para explorar los pantanos del Bosque Ahogado. No hemos tenido noticias de ellos desde entonces, pero es importante que establezcamos alguna forma de comunicación con ellos.\
\
No creo que estén muy lejos, pero el viaje será peligroso. No hay criatura amistosa en el Bosque Negro, randir, ni una sola. Laidhriel te recibirá cuando la encuentres. Se encuentra con el destacamento del sur en Estolad Mernael.'","Habla con Laidhriel en el Bosque Ahogado","El Bosque Ahogado","'La tropa que buscas viajó hacia el sur, a la parte del bosque conocida como el Bosque Ahogado. Deberías hablar con Laidhriel, que va con ellos. Es mejor que mantengamos la comunicación con quienes están destacados cerca de nosotros.'","La segunda parte de la Hueste Dorada partió hacia el sur, hacia la zona anegada del bosque conocida como el Bosque Ahogado.\
\
Deberías buscar Estolad Mernael, el campamento de los elfos en el Bosque Ahogado, para que los elfos destinados en Troncosombríos puedan mantener la comunicación con sus hermanos cercanos.","Athradnir, un Galadhrim destinado en la Posada Embrujada, desea transmitir un mensaje a Laidhriel en Estolad Mernael.","'Mae govannen. Me alegra que Athradnir te haya enviado con nosotros, mellon. Hay mucho que hacer en estas tierras anegadas, pues estamos acosados por numerosos problemas.'"},
[12057]={"Continue following the bootprints that lead away from the banner south-west.","Look for clues you find and follow where they lead","Speak with Nimasi outside of the camp","You see a large camp in the distance - and Nimasi beckoning you at its edge","Examine the banner Nimasi found","Speak with Nimasi in southern Imhûlar.","'Thank you for looking after this situation in the south. I hope Surâsh is merely waylaid, and the situation is not worse.\
\
'Please, hurry back here after you are done. There is much still to do in Kûr Anzar, and we have only just begun.'","'Hurry! Get over here before you're seen!\
\
'Look at all the banners - and the furnishings for that tent. This must be the source of the attacks.\
\
'We need to investigate this camp, I'd wager this is where they are keeping Surâsh. There are so many of them, I wonder from where they all left.'","Look for clues you find to determine where they lead","Speak with Nimasi in southern Imhûlar","The bootprints turn south-west here, winding around the trees","Speak with Nimasi outside of the camp.","The bootprints veer due north-west here, toward a copse of dying trees","Continue following the bootprints that lead away from the banner north-west.","Follow the bootprints that lead away from the banner south-west and see where they lead.","Mizâdi has asked you to accompany the southern scout Nimasi to search for the missing Hamati scout Surâsh.","'Hashtal-gûr favoured outsider, and praise to the Shâra, who is indeed benevolent. We must find the source of these disappearances - or I fear for all of our safety.\
\
'This is the site where we were supposed to meet with Surâsh, but she never came. Instead I found the banner I gave you. As you can see, there are many bootprints around this area, and some leading away to the south.\
\
'I believe we can follow them to find the source of these disappearances, and the banners. I have not gone myself for fear of disappearing, but with the liberator of Kûr Anzar, I know we can overcome anything these lûbaras throw at us.'","You notice a series of bootprints moving away from the banner to the south-west","Look for clues to the south-west","Examine the banner Nimasi found.","The Drum Beats Louder"},
[12058]={"You see nothing here that looks suspicious","Retrieve the strange staff","The Drumming of the Grey Wood","Speak with Ceveneth","The staff does not look Orkish in nature","The strange staff can be found in the woods outside Crithost next to the Grey Wood.\
\
You should pick up the staff and bring it to Ceveneth.","The Grey Wood is west of Crithost.\
\
You should scout the edge of the Grey Wood for evidence of Orcs.","You see nothing here but an old, weathered Púkel-men statue","'Maybe this isn't important ${PLAYER}, but I keep hearing the faint sound of drumming from the woods near here.\
\
'Some say there are spirits and strange creatures in the woods. I've never believed such things because I've never seen anything strange in the Grey Wood. That being said, I've never been in the Grey Wood so what do I know!\
\
'Look, what concerns me is that the drumming might be some Orcs looking to attack us from behind. It might be worth checking out. At the very least, if you look into it and it isn't anything, it will put me at ease.'","You hand the staff to Ceveneth.\
\
'What a peculiar and very small staff! This isn't from an Orc, but where have I seen it before? Let me think...\
\
'Ah yes, from children's tale of the Woses! Do you know of these stories? They're about small creatures that live in the woods and love nature.\
\
'Perhaps there is more to this tale than I thought! That would certainly explain those strange, old Púkel-men statues about the edge of the forest! Well, I am glad there isn't an army of Orcs in the Grey Wood after all!'","Ceveneth has heard the sound of drums coming from the Grey Wood and believes Orcs may be planning to attack Crithost from the west.","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> the woods outside Crithost next to the Grey Woods","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> the Grey Wood near the stream that cuts through the woods","Something nearby catches your eye","<rgb=#FF0000>Look around</rgb> the Grey Wood near the Púkel-men statue","Ceveneth can be found in the hall of Crithost.\
\
You should speak with Ceveneth.","Take a <rgb=#FF0000>look around</rgb>"},
[12060]={"Rhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves vino a su padre, el alcalde, y que intentes averiguar si ha pasado algo importante.\
\
El vino está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Los ojos de Rhiangar brillan con lágrimas mientras toma suavemente el diario.","'¡Gracias por venir a verme! El pueblo todavía está conmocionado por el paso de esos jinetes negros. Quiero ayudar en todo lo que pueda. Si tienes tiempo, quizá tú también podrías echar una mano.'","Habla con Osian","Osian suspira y te mira de arriba abajo con desdén.","Mientras volvías a montar la cama del alcalde, llegó una persona nueva y está hablando con él.","Recoge la botella de vino","'No tengo ningún problema con Rhiangar, y me gustaría que se mostrara más cariñosa conmigo. Me he asegurado de cuidar a su querido padre en su ausencia, pero Cadwallon la echaba mucho de menos.\
\
'Ha sido muy difícil para él desde el accidente. Bueno, sus problemas se remontan a décadas atrás, cuando su esposa se fugó. Oh, no debería hablar de eso.'","Llévale el diario a Rhiangar","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le traigas el diario de su madre de la biblioteca.\
\
La biblioteca está en la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","'Mientras desmontabas la cama, padre recibió una visita, como seguramente habrás notado. Se trata de Osian Beddow, y estoy segura de que él es la razón por la que padre estaba en Tharbad, husmeando. Sospecho que también es la razón por la que papá resultó herido hace años. Osian siempre ha querido ser alcalde y, aunque le susurra palabras melosas al oído a papá, sus acciones me han llevado a creer que es más una avispa que una abeja.\
\
'Bueno, todavía tengo que terminar de preparar el guiso. ¿Podrías traer el vino a la mesa? Ah, y quizá podrías hablar con ellos. Quiero saber qué está pasando, pero Osian y yo no nos hablamos, y mi padre se calla en cuanto entro en la habitación.'","Mientras se cocina el guiso, Rhiangar te ha pedido que te reúnas con ella en la posada de Herne, La Posada de la Encrucijada.","El alcalde te mira con los ojos entrecerrados, pero acepta el vino.","'¿Por qué sigues aquí? Bah, el vino es bienvenido, aunque tú no lo seas. No te ofendas, pero mi hija no necesita a alguien como tú cerca dándole ideas descabelladas. Ya se escapó a la gran ciudad y abandonó sus obligaciones y a mí. Ha vuelto, pero ¿por cuánto tiempo?\
\
'Su madre era igual. Nunca se conformaba con sentar la cabeza. Siempre se escapaba a ver fortalezas en ruinas y a buscar elfos y Gente Pequeña en el sur, en la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.'","Rhiangar te ha pedido que le lleves vino a su padre, el alcalde, y que intentes averiguar si hay algo importante.\
\
El alcalde está en la mesa del comedor, en su casa, en Herne.","'¡Lo encontraste! ¡Qué recuerdos me trae esto! Después de que mi madre desapareciera, me pasaba horas leyendo sus escritos, buscando alguna pista sobre dónde había ido. Nunca creí que nos hubiera abandonado a propósito, como insiste mi padre. No, creo que corrió una suerte más trágica.\
\
'El guiso tiene que cocerse a fuego lento durante muchas horas, y también quiero ver cómo están los vecinos del pueblo. ¿Nos vemos en La Posada de la Encrucijada? Mucha gente sigue refugiada en la posada, consolándose unos a otros.'","Habla con Rhiangar","El diario es viejo y está muy usado.","Deberías llevar el diario a Rhiangar.\
\
Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","'Bueno, ¿qué dijeron? Oh, ¿Osian cuidó de mi padre en mi ausencia? No me había dado cuenta de que mi padre necesitaba cuidados hasta ahora. No, es un hombre adulto y era capaz cuando me fui. No dejaré que la culpa se apodere de mí y me quite la alegría que sentí al viajar y estudiar en Bree.\
\
'Pero lo que dijo mi padre es intrigante. ¿Mamá iba a visitar unas ruinas? ¡Sus palabras están despertando un recuerdo en mí! ${PLAYER}, ¿me harías el favor de buscar el diario de mi madre? Debería estar en la estantería de la biblioteca de mi padre.'","Busca el diario en la biblioteca","Habla con el alcalde Nevit","Deberías contarle a Rhiangar lo que has averiguado de Osian y el alcalde.\
\
Rhiangar está en la cocina de la casa del alcalde, en Herne.","Un invitado sospechoso"},
[12061]={"A note hangs from the board, signed by Mulnír:\
 \
'Dwarves have been seen entering Anglach with a host of Orcs and goblins. They must be loyal to the Captain of the Pit, and are surely aiding in the re-building of his war machine. I need someone to enter the foundry and defeat their leaders. Seek out Candúr at the Udûn Foothold for passage into Anglach.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Anglach: The Great Foundry to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Defeat Forge-master Svartárn","Dwarves loyal to the Captain of the Pit can be found within Anglach: The Great Foundry.\
\
You should defeat Dwarf-forgeworkers and their leaders.","Defeat Counsellor Grárnath","Defeat Dwarf-forgeworkers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Dwarf-forgeworkers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Dwarf-smiths of Anglach","Dwarves loyal to the Captain of the Pit have been seen within Anglach, aiding his war machine.","Defeated Forge-master Svartárn","Defeated Counsellor Grárnath"},
[12062]={"Offer water to dwarves at Blozronk (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'What is it? Why are you bothering--'\
\
Spakorth turns and flinches at once upon seeing you.\
\
'I... what do you want? Why have you come here? Whatever your purpose is here, we want no part of it!'\
\
One of Spakorth's expedition calls to him and tells him of the water you offered them.\
\
'You do not mean us harm? Sauron told us that the folk of the West were not to be trusted, especially those from the kingdoms of Men and Elves.\
\
'Well, then, let us speak and I shall decide if we have been misled.'","Talk to Spakorth at Blozronk","After discovering the Dwarves of Mordor escaped Sauron's wrath, Gimli seeks to reunite with his long-lost kin.","The Dwarves of Mordor might be found somewhere along the causeway to Barad-dûr.\
\
Overjoyed that his kin have escaped Sauron's wrath, Gimli has asked you to search for the Dwarves of Mordor.","The Dwarves of Mordor","Spakorth can be found at Blozronk in Dor Amarth.\
\
A dwarf named Spakorth has led the dwarves to the muddied waters of Blozronk. You should speak to him.","You have found a company of exhausted dwarves gathered near a muddied cistern!","Patrol the causeway towards Barad-dûr and search for the Dwarves of Mordor","The dwarves can be found at Blozronk along the causeway to Barad-dûr to the south-east of the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth.\
\
You have found a company of wounded dwarves in Dor Amarth. You should aid them as Gimli requested.","Offered water to dwarves at Blozronk (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Aye, this is a tricky land. I do not know what beasts could live in such a place, but dwarves are hardy folk!\
\
'These Dwarves of Mordor must dwell somewhere in the Doomfold, but perhaps they do not wish to be found. If they make use of dwarf-doors as the House of Durin once did in Khazad-dûm, even the most thorough search would never bear fruit. Let us hope it does not come to that!\
\
'You found the dwarf near the causeway that leads to the Dark Tower, didn't you? If you ask me, no dwarf would be wise to travel these lands alone, and even if one did, they would soon be sought out if they did not return.\
\
'Patrol the causeway to the east and see if you do not find others of his kin... and ones with better luck, I would hope!'"},
[12063]={"'¿Así que Ulfar sospecha que ese Olwir lidera a esos enanos bribones? Bueno, parecían estar algo organizados, así que no me sorprendería en absoluto.\
\
Quizá si puedes encontrar esas órdenes de las que hablaba Ulfar en uno de los cazadores o tramperos enanos, podrías averiguar dónde está Olwir y hacer que pague por su crimen!'","Ulfar está en los edificios de los enanos al norte de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Para evitar enfadar a los enanos con acusaciones de robo, el frontero Redondo te pidió que obtuvieras la ayuda de los enanos a través de su capataz, Ulfar. Redondo cree que Ulfar podría señalar a cualquier posible ladrón entre los suyos.","'No me sorprende que Olwir esté involucrado en esto. Varios enanos que han pasado últimamente son de mala reputación, ¡y él es el peor!\
\
Ojalá pudiera decirte dónde está, pero no lo he visto en unos días. Quizá los otros enanos lo hayan visto. De hecho, el otro día vi a varios de ellos reunidos alrededor de un pergamino. No escuché de qué hablaban, pero sí oí el nombre de Olwir.\
\
Ese pergamino podría haber sido sus órdenes. Si puedes ir al Pantano de los Juncos y conseguir algunas de esas cartas de los cazadores enanos de allí, quizá averigüemos qué está tramando Olwir.'","'¡Lo tengo! Hay un enano llamado Ulfar, con quien he tenido algunos tratos en el pasado. Podría sernos de ayuda. Creo que es una especie de capataz entre los enanos, o algo así.\
\
De hecho, el otro día hubo una pelea entre dos de los suyos, y Ulfar intervino y la detuvo. Los demás enanos parecían respetarlo, así que podría saber algo sobre su gente que nos sea útil.\
\
Deberías poder encontrar a Ulfar entre los edificios de los enanos al norte de Ojo de Aguja. Cuéntale lo que me contaste a mí, y con suerte podrá ayudarnos.'","Órdenes recogidas","Lleva las órdenes a Ulfar","'Bien, los has encontrado. ¡Como te dije, ese grupo no trama nada bueno! Ahora, entrégame las cartas, quiero echarles un vistazo...\
\
¡Insensatos! Estas órdenes que encontraste no fueron escritas por Olwir. Un enano llamado Skorgrím promete riquezas si Olwir puede entregar -- apenas lo creo -- ¡un troll de piedra! No he prestado atención a los cuentos de viejas sobre tales criaturas en el pantano, pero Olwir debió escucharlos y prometió uno como regalo.\
\
No puedo imaginar para qué querría un enano una criatura tan vil, pero no puede ser para nada bueno.'","Los Enanos de Ojo de Aguja","'El enano Ulfar parece ser un capataz o algo así entre los enanos de Ojo de Aguja. Deberías hablar con él entre los edificios de los enanos al norte del pueblo y ver si puede ayudarte.'","Recoge las órdenes","Los cazadores enanos merodean por las zonas norte y este del Pantano de los Juncos. El pantano se encuentra al sureste de Ojo de Aguja.\
\
Cuando le contaste a Ulfar la historia de la vaca de Filibert y la implicación de Olwir, no se sorprendió. Últimamente han pasado por Ojo de Aguja varios enanos de mala reputación, y Olwir parecía ser el peor de todos. Ulfar te ha pedido que consigas cartas de los cazadores enanos que sospecha que trabajan para Olwir.","'¿Has encontrado ya alguna orden? Busca entre los cazadores y tramperos del Pantano de los Juncos, pues probablemente lleven alguna instrucción consigo.'","Según Filibert Bolger, su vaca, Daffodil, fue robada por un enano llamado Olwir; sin embargo, el frontero Redondo duda en acusar a un enano de robo de vacas sin pruebas."},
[12065]={"Wald Arenilla te contó que Billina, la mejor gallina del Granjero Arenilla, ha dejado de poner huevos, y que el Granjero Arenilla considera sacrificarla si no vuelve a poner.","'¿Ves esa gallina allí, la grande? Ella es la reina del gallinero, y la favorita de papá, Billina.\
\
'Billina solía ser la mejor ponedora de huevos de todo el Occidente, pero el otro día dejó de poner huevos por completo. Papá dice que si no empieza a poner pronto, terminará como la cena. Yo sé que todavía puede poner huevos, y odiaría verla en mi plato, por muy gorda que esté.\
\
'Fuiste tan útil devolviendo esos huevos que estoy seguro de que podrás averiguar qué le pasa a Billina, ${PLAYER}.'","Billina está en el patio de la Granja de los Arenilla.\
\
Wald Arenilla te ha pedido ver si puedes descubrir qué le pasa a Billina.","Wald Arenilla puede encontrarse en la Granja de los Arenilla, al norte y este de Cavada Grande.\
\
Ahora que has descubierto qué aquejaba a Billina, debes hablar de nuevo con Wald Arenilla.","'¿Así que Billina solo tenía hambre de unas lombrices? Me alegra que hayas descubierto qué le pasaba. Ahora estará a salvo de la olla de papá.\
\
'Esa gallina es muy rara; si te toma cariño, te mostrará exactamente qué le preocupa. ¡Apuesto a que hablaría si supiera cómo hacerlo!'","Examina a Billina","Billina te mira y luego comienza a picotear el suelo. Parece que intenta mostrarte algo...\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>ADVERTENCIA: Esta misión inicia una misión especial de sesión. Serás desconectado de tu personaje normal y asumirás el papel de un PNJ amigable para jugadores. No podrás abandonar la Comarca con este personaje y tendrás un conjunto de habilidades únicas para esta sesión especial.</rgb>","'¿Has averiguado qué le molesta a Billina?'","El Ave Madrugadora"},
[12066]={"'¿Quién podrías ser? No creo haberte visto antes en el gallinero. Bueno, no importa.\
\
'¿Son lombrices lo que traes para mí? Simplemente no comeré nada que no sean lombrices estos días. No me he acostumbrado al nuevo pienso del corral.'","Billina está en el patio de la Granja de los Arenilla, al oeste de los Campos de los Arenilla.\
\
Ahora que has recogido algunas lombrices, debes hablar con Billina.","Recoge lombrices para Billina (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Billina tiene hambre de lombrices.","Rasca el suelo para revelar lombrices en el campo del Granjero Arenilla.","lombrices recogidas para Billina (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El Ave Madrugadora"},
[12068]={"'Ve ahora y habla con los Hijos de la tierra de Lehmä-koti.'","Los Hijos de la tierra de Lehmä-koti","Habla con los Hijos de la tierra de Lehmä-koti","'Cuando me quedé en Esteldín, entablé amistad con un grupo de Hijos de la tierra que vivían no muy lejos del refugio. Estaban resistiendo valientemente contra la opresión de Angmar. Al ver por lo que hemos pasado aquí, pienso en ellos y me pregunto si estarán bien.\
\
'Me gustaría que fueras a averiguarlo. Si es así, estoy seguro de que hay trabajo que hacer allí. Su campamento está al norte de Esteldín, justo más allá de Ram Dúath","Lehmä-koti se encuentra muy al este de Tinnudir, más allá de Ram Dúath.\
\
Los Montaraces te han enviado a Lehmä-koti para que hables con los Hijos de la tierra.","Lehmä-koti es un pequeño campamento de los Hijos de la tierra situado justo al otro lado de la frontera de Angmar.","'Angmar nos está presionando con fuerza. Nos vendría muy bien un poco de ayuda'"},
[12070]={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The East Gate: Enhancements I","Gather Tokens of Hytbold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin","'The East Gate has been rebuilt and now stands firmly, but there is much to do to finish it. Banners, flags, shields, and places for the warriors who will man it and stand to defend us against assault must all be set up and built.'","'Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'"},
[12071]={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The East Gate: Enhancements II","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar","Gather Tokens of Hytbold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The East Gate has been rebuilt and now stands firmly, but there is much to do to finish it. Banners, flags, shields, and places for the warriors who will man it and stand to defend us against assault must all be set up and built.'","'Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'"},
[12072]={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","The East Gate: Rebuild","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg","Gather Tokens of Hytbold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'","'Hytbold only has two gates: one in the east and one in the west. Both of the gates still stand, but the timbers are burnt out and would not hold against any concerted assault. The East Gate must be replaced and rebuilt if we are to have any security.'"},
[12073]={"'Aye, I am still alive. Had someone told you otherwise? I fought at Erebor, and though my father and King Brand both fell, I survived... mostly intact.'\
\
He gestures to his metal ear and agate eye.\
\
'The ones responsible for these paid dearly. \
\
'Though we suffered heavy losses, we were victorious. The Easterlings failed to sack either Járnfast or Erebor. However, instead of fleeing back East with their tails between their legs like the dogs they are, they stayed put!\
\
'They are holed up in the Dalish village, Utterby. You no doubt passed it on the way here. Perhaps we could easily deal with just the small remaining host from the battle, but more Easterlings are constantly streaming up the stair at Skald's Drop and adding to that host! It is only a matter of time before their numbers overwhelm what we have here in the Ironfold. More bloodshed seems unavoidable.\
\
'I have decisions to make. Difficult decisions. We could collapse the stair, and prevent more Easterlings from entering the Ironfold, but it would also cut off legitimate trade into the Dale-lands, and the route of the Zhélruka clan. And, if rumours are to be believed, the Easterlings are fleeing something terrible and they no longer have a home to which they may return. Aye, the Longbeards would be sympathetic to that plight, or at least they should be.\
\
'Please speak with my advisors, and the citizens of Járnfast. Hear their words, and relay them back to me. This matter is one that must be carefully considered.'","'Hmph. Let us collapse the stair and keep those Easterlings out of our land!'","You have found the weapons convoy sacked, and many dwarves dead.\
\
You should talk to the survivor, Vílur Strayfoot.","This is what remains of the weapons convoy","Talk to Járnfast Citizens","Talk to Lord Náin","Talk to Vílur Strayfoot","The convoy of weapons was coming from Hammerstead, north-west of Járnfast.\
\
You should find some sign of the convoy on the path from Hammerstead.","'I have heard that the Easterling refugees no longer have a home to return to. If we collapse the stair, would not that leave them stranded?'","'Those Easterlings are nothing but trouble, and bad for business! Throw them all out, I say!'","'It seems the Dwarves of the Ironfold are torn on what to do, as am I. I will have to think on this in solitude. In the meantime, I have work for you. \
\
'That convoy from Hammerstead was a shipment of weapons. Hógur's concern is justified. If it is as he fears, and the Easterlings have attacked it, my hand may be forced. I ask that you discover what became of this convoy by visiting the path it should have taken, and return to me as swiftly as you can.'","Find any sign of the convoy","'I agree something should be done about Utterby, but collapsing the stair seems rather rash!'","Hammerstead is under attack!","You should talk to Lord Náin, who can be found at his seat in Járnfast.","Talk to Féli","Lord Náin has asked you to speak to his advisors in Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Aldin, Hógur, and Féli.","'Aye, collapsing the stair may be the only solution. We must protect ourselves from the Easterlings.'","'Aye, collapsing the stair might be the best way to prevent the Easterlings from bolstering their numbers. More are entering the Ironfold every day. \
\
'Please tell Lord Náin that a convoy from Hammerstead never arrived. I fear the Easterlings ambushed them along the road.'","Vílur Strayfoot has warned you that an attack on Hammerstead is imminent!\
\
You should travel to Hammerstead!","Travel to Hammerstead","Náin the Slakeless, Lord of Járnfast, has many decisions to make regarding the Easterling host that occupies his lands.","Lord Náin has asked you to gauge the opinions of the citizens of Járnfast.\
\
You should talk to Járnfast citizens.","'We cannot collapse the stair. There are Zhélruka Dwarves coming that way. I would not have it said we treated fellow dwarves this way!'","The Easterling Menace","'Collapsing the stair? He cannot! There are Zhélruka Dwarves, distant cousins of ours, passing that way. We could not do something so low to other dwarves, even under the circumstances!'","TBD","'Perhaps collapsing the stair is the right answer, but I caution Lord Náin to do nothing without the council of Thorin Stonehelm, our King in Erebor, and our allies in Dale. The Stair is the main road into the East, and any action we take will surely affect them as well. This is much to consider before acting.'","Talk to Aldin","'I am unsure, ${CLASS}. It seems there are reasons for and against collapsing the stair. I trust Lord Náin to make the right decision.'","The Dwarves of Járnfast have not reached a consensus of opinion","Talk to Lóssi","'The Easterlings... ambushed us! They stole the weapons! Hammerstead! You must warn Hammerstead! I will live, just go! It is Lóssi, Captain of the Guard you want. He must be told!'","Talk to Hógur","'Vílur Strayfoot sent you? Yes, we could use some help! These Easterlings have been harassing us since the convoy left, and we are pinned down!'","Hammerstead is under attack by the Easterlings!\
\
You should find the captain of the guard, Lóssi."},
[12075]={"This poor woman looked as though she attempted to flee the massacre, but sadly she did not make it far....\
\
She is dead.","You have checked for signs of life amongst the fallen refugees along the road, but there are none.\
\
Every last one of this party fleeing the Stonedeans has been brutally slain.","The Eastward Path","This poor refugee was only very recently slain, not yet cold from death (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","This man appears to have been ridden down as he attempted to run towards the charred shelter of Marton. No breath stirs in his lifeless form.","You detect no pulse on this poor man.","The refugees can be found on the north-south road that lies east of Marton.\
\
You should check the refugees for signs of life.","Check the refugees for signs of life (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","A small company of refugees from the Stonedeans has walked down the road leading by Marton, but they seem to have met trouble upon the road.","Check for signs of life among the refugees","You cannot detect any signs of life in this poor man lying face-down in the tall grasses.\
\
He has many wounds from Orkish weapons. He fled this way to find sanctuary in Helm's Deep, and found only death.","This woman, surrounded by her scattered belongings, died here. These people fled the Stonedeans to find sanctuary in the Westfold.\
\
How could they know that they were only walking deeper into danger?","Completado","A small company of refugees from the Stonedeans has walked down the road leading by Marton, but they seem to have met trouble upon the road.\
\
You should check for signs of life among the fallen refugees."},
[12076]={"'To the south-east of here is the village of Lhanuch. It is the only significant settlement of Men in Enedwaith -- though we have seen evidence of a lost clan called the Turch-lûth -- and we shall have to pass near it on our path to Rohan.\
\
'Once it was a place we often stopped to rest on our journeys through Dunland, but no more. Some years ago there was an incident in Nan Laeglin, and Glynn Brenin, the chieftain of the Algraig clan known as the Uch-lûth, declared all outsiders -- or duvodiad, as they say -- unwelcome in his halls, especially those of us known as Rangers.\
\
'I would ask you to enter the village in our stead. Isengard is in motion, and we must learn anything we can before we pass Dunland. Glynn Brenin and his people should be able to tell us what we need to know. The people of Enedwaith are wary of strangers, but their laws of hospitality are ancient and deeply held. They will not turn you away without reason should you come to them in friendship.'","Approach the gates of Lhanuch","Himeinior told you that the Dúnedain are not welcome in the halls of Lhanuch, for the Uch-lûth are wary of strangers.","'We need the good will of the Uch-lûth at Lhanuch, ${PLAYER}.'","The guard is at the entrance to the Brenin's Hall of Lhanuch.\
\
The guard at the village gate instructed you to speak with the guard before the Brenin's Hall of Lhanuch.","'Who goes there? You have the look of a northerner about you. We have seen more of your kind of late, but I cannot say you are welcome here.\
\
'If you seek the hospitality of the Hall of Lhanuch, then I will not stop you...but the days grow dark, Duvodiad, and you may not find the mood of the brenin's hall to your liking.\
\
'Speak with the guard outside the brenin's hall. Perhaps he will let you in, perhaps not. Be the cause of trouble in our village, and you will be spitted to warn off the rest of your ilk....'","Lhanuch lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair, in Nan Laeglin.\
\
Himeinior has asked you to seek entry into the Uch-lûth village of Lhanuch.","Speak with the guard before the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch","'Halt! Declare yourself before the hall of Glynn Brenin, brenin of the Uch-lûth!\
\
'${PLAYER}? You must be one of the duvodiad that have been sneaking about of late. What ill-wind brings you before our gates like some beggar from out of the wild? If you wish to invoke the hospitality of our hall then so be it, but it shall be allowed at Glynn Brenin's discretion, not mine.\
\
'One word to the wise, Duvodiad. There has been rumour that Rangers from the wild have been skulking about of late. By the law of this house, they are not welcome, nor those who would spy for them in our midst. So watch your tongue and your idle hands, lest they earn you trouble.'","The Edge of the Wild"},
[12077]={"'So you have come, Duvodiad. The Forest Lords have spoken to us and said you would come. It seems they would speak with you, if you are able to prove your worth to them. Most odd.\
\
'Oh, do forgive young Enit. She knows little yet of the Forest Lords. They have ever been of fickle whim, and she takes such things rather personally, I am afraid.'","Talk to Tûm at Gwaed Brun","'I have no more to say to you!'","The Elders","'Go then and curse you! Speak with our Elder upon Gwaed Brun at the heart of the forest. Perhaps he knows the way to the Huntsman's hall. I know it not.\
\
'May you meet your doom there, Duvodiad. May the great spirits of the forest consume you!'","Enit was greatly angered and shamed by the spirit's rejection of her demands.\
\
In her anger she has told you to speak with her elders upon a great hill in the centre of the forest.","Tûm, the elder of the Derudh, is at Gwaed Brun, south of Galar Culch.\
\
Enit has instructed you to speak with Tûm, the Derudh elder."},
[12078]={"The Eldest House","Within the deepest reaches of Gloomingtarn, the Angmarim of the Iron Crown have unwittingly discovered a long-forgotten passage rumoured to conceal the greatest secret of Gloomingtarn.","'I know, ${PLAYER}. Perhaps this is not the wisest course... but there's no time!\
\
'If the Angmarim have found something at Mîn Lorg, we must stop them before they can steal whatever it is away from Mount Gundabad. If not, at least we'll have succeeded in driving a few of them off!\
\
'Are you with me?'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Hersegg is fortunate that you were with her. If you were not, I fear things might have gone differently. She is a proud Longbeard, but the Iron Crown is too great a foe for her—or any other—to face alone!\
\
'However, it seems the two of you have made a most curious discovery—and I am not certain what to make of him!'","'Hah! I knew I could count on you, ${PLAYER}. Come on!'","Talk to Hersegg","Hermáth Stormhammer can be found at Watchers' Roost.\
\
After thwarting the Iron Crown at Mîn Lorg, you have returned to Watchers' Roost with a curious dwarf named Thrástan—much to the surprise of Hermáth Stormhammer and his expedition. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.","Hersegg can be found at Mîn Lorg, within the encampment of Lochan Dúv in Gloomingtarn.\
\
Hersegg has asked you to accompany her into Mîn Lorg and confront the Iron Crown before they can pilfer anything else from Gloomingtarn.","Talk to Hermáth Stormhammer"},
[12079]={"'¿Los Eldgangs siguen habitando dentro de la Falla? Si logramos convencerlos de unirse a nuestra lucha, podríamos derrotar a Angmar.\
\
¡Rivendel debería ser informado de inmediato!'","Los Eldgang","'No eres como los otros pequeños que han venido aquí, los Ghâshfra...¿quizás nos ayudarás?'","Iorelen fue enviado a la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu para investigar las actividades de Angmar en la zona y la existencia de un hongo mortal que podría ser utilizado por el Enemigo para crear un arma terrible. También busca una raza de gigantes de la que se enteró a través de Glorfindel en Rivendel.","'El maestro Elrond me envió aquí a la Falla, que el Enemigo llama Nûrz Ghâshu, para investigar rumores de incursiones de las fuerzas de Angmar en ella. Hay vetas de metales valiosos y una variedad de hongos mortales que podrían ser usados para producir un arma terrible para el Enemigo.\
\
'El señor Glorfindel me habló también de una leyenda sobre una raza de gigantes que habitan en lo profundo del corazón de Nûrz Ghâshu. Esta leyenda me interesa mucho, porque se dice que estos gigantes, los Eldgang, no son malvados y podrían ayudarnos a combatir a Angmar.\
\
'¿Entrarías en la Falla y buscarías a los Eldgang? Si los encuentras, te recompensaré según tus acciones.'","Iorelen se encuentra en el campamento de Iorelen.\
\
Debes regresar a Iorelen y contarle lo que encontraste en la Falla.","Aprender más sobre los Eldgang","'Estoy interesado en aprender más sobre estos Eldgang.'","Los Eldgang se pueden encontrar en lo profundo de la Grieta de Nûrz Ghâshu.\
\
Iorelen te ha pedido que busques señales de los Eldgang, los legendarios gigantes de fuego de Nûrz Ghâshu."},
[12080]={"Los Elfos de Ered Luin permanecen para prepararse para el último viaje de los Elfos desde la Tierra Media, pero también para proteger la Tierra Media de los males que permanecen.","'Glamir habita en unas ruinas al noreste de aquí... deberías ir a verlo enseguida.'","La piedra élfica","'Saludos, . Aquí en mi vieja casa recibo pocas visitas. Pero estoy seguro de que no has venido a escuchar historias de antaño. ¿Qué te trae a estos salones desolados?\
\
'Dices que tumularios malvados rondan las tumbas al noreste de mi casa? Es realmente bueno que Gailthin te haya enviado a mí, y con la piedra élfica. Tengo una misión para ti, si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]}.'","'Si los tumularios agitan los huesos de los antiguos Edain, entonces ha surgido un mal en estas montañas que todos deberíamos temer. Los espíritus malignos que agitan los huesos de los Muertos son siervos de Angmar, del antiguo Rey Brujo y de la Sombra en el Este. Debo pedirte que busques este mal y le pongas fin por cualquier medio antes de que su oscuridad se extienda.\
\
'Lleva esta piedra élfica a Glamir. Ahora vive en las ruinas al noreste de Gondamon, en el extremo sur del lago de las Aguas Lúgubres.'","Glamir habita las ruinas situadas al noreste de Gondamon, en el extremo sur del lago de las Aguas Lúgubres.\
\
Gailthin te ha dado una piedra élfica y te ha pedido que vayas a ver a un Elfo llamado Glamir, que podría ayudarte contra los tumularios de Haudh Lin.","'¿Por qué has venido a este lugar?'","Lleva la piedra élfica a Glamir"},
[12081]={"'¿Qué es esto? ¿Seguro que no es otro regalo? No, esto es otra cosa, ¿no? ¿Cuál es el significado de esta vieja espada?\
\
'¿Esta es la espada de mi ancestro? ¿Dice que fue amigo y compañero de Penglir? Ahora lo entiendo. Me dio el arco en honor de mi bisabuelo.\
\
'¿Qué? ¿Crees que el regalo fue hecho para mí y no para mi antepasado? Bien, quizá tengas razón, después de todo. Será un desafío estar a la altura de esas glorias pasadas, pero quizá algún día pueda empuñar el arco sin vergüenza.'","Lleva la espada élfica a Celairant","'Estoy seguro de que el joven Celairant demostrará algún día su valía.'","Encuentra Elvellon, la espada élfica","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, tengo mucho por lo que estar a la altura. Solo puedo esperar demostrarme digno algún día.'","La espada élfica","'Encuentra Elvellon y entrégasela a Celairant con mi bendición.'","'Oh, ojalá fuera digno del regalo de Penglir, pero soy solo un tonto, apenas capaz de cuidar de mí mismo y mucho menos de una obra tan gloriosa del arte élfico.'","La espada Elvellon puede encontrarse en una lápida entre los montículos de los Edain, al noreste de Gondamon. Celairant está en el refugio del cazador, al oeste de Kheledûl. \
\
Penglir te ha pedido que recuperes una espada que colocó junto a la tumba de su compañero hace mucho tiempo y que se la lleves a Celairant.","Después de permitir que Starkath le quitara el arco, Celairant ahora está convencido de que no es digno del arma élfica.","'Celairant lleva la sangre de los Montaraces del Norte, y el nombre de un gran héroe figura entre sus antepasados, un Hombre a quien me sentí orgulloso de llamar amigo y compañero. Quizá Celairant sea joven según se cuentan los años entre los Hombres, pero a mi juicio todos los Hombres son jóvenes.\
\
'En tiempos pasados, honré a mi compañero caído depositando una espada en su tumba entre los montículos de los Edain. Puede que la espada todavía se encuentre allí. Lleva la inscripción Elvellon, o Amigo de los Elfos en la lengua de los Hombres. Quizá si encuentras la espada, eso convencerá al joven Celairant de no desdeñar mi regalo.'","'¿Comprende él el significado de mi regalo? Bueno, quizá no; pero al menos entiende que no se le dio a la ligera.'","'Gracias por tu ayuda. Haré todo lo posible por estar a la altura del legado de Penglir y de las hazañas de mi bisabuelo.'","Has encontrado Elvellon, la espada élfica"},
[12082]={"Speak to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward","Thane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Lanfrith's concerns.","Nothwulf can be found inside the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar believes that Nothwulf is distracted by matters that will hinder his skill in the coming battle, and has asked you to help dispatch his concerns.","'Nothwulf seems ready to focus on the task at hand now that his mind is at ease.\
\
'Osin has been heard worrying about the crofters and their lack of preparation. Speak with Osin and inquire about lending a hand, so that he may concern himself with his own readiness.'","Aid Nothwulf, of the Elfward, with his concerns","'The Orc forces have laid waste to the crofters to the north. We will not allow the same fate to befall the people of Faldham! My riders, the most brave and loyal men I have ever known, are called the Elfward. Each of them will have a part to play if we are to withstand the coming siege. \
\
'The Elfward have skill unmatched among all the riders of the plains, yet they are distracted by other concerns. This could prove to be our downfall on the battlefield. We must put their concerns to rest if hope is to be had of survival. Speak with Nothwulf and see what actions might put his mind at ease.'","The Elfward","'The Elfward seem wholly focused on the charge set before them. Early is the hour in which these foes approach our threshold, and we shall be ready to meet them with steel in hand.\
\
'You deserve much for your efforts, ${PLAYER}, but the day is not yet won. It would give me great honour to count you among the Elfward, the protectors of Faldham.'","Nothwulf's concern has been resolved","'Your helpful deeds have calmed Osin's concerns. Valuable will be his strength in the coming days.\
\
'I must request one more favour of you. Langfrith, one of the wisest of the Elfward has been concerned with another foe. Please speak with him and learn of his distress.'","Aid Langfrith, of the Elfward, with his concerns","Thane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Nothwulf's concerns.","Thane Elfmar resides in the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar awaits word regarding the resolution of Osin's concerns.","Langfrith's concerns have been resolved","Osin can be found outside the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Thane Elfmar wants Osin's distractions resolved, so that he may focus on the coming White Hand siege.","Thane Elfmar believes that the Elfward are distracted with concerns besides the ravaging White Hand army from the north, and wishes them to resolve their agitations to focus on the task at hand.","Langfrith prepares outside of the mead hall at the centre of Faldham.\
\
Elfmar believes that Langfrith will be distracted in the coming battle, if his concerns are not first dealt with.","Osin's concern has been resolved","Aid Osin, of the Elfward, with his concerns","Talk to Thane Elfmar about the preparations of the Elfward"},
[12083]={"Deberías decirle a Gurthern que has acabado con muchas esferas siniestras atrayentes.\
\
Gurthern está en Tyrn Gorthad, en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Esferas siniestras atrayentes derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL}","Tyrn Gorthad está encantado por elhudans, espíritus que atraen a los niños y hacen que los viajeros desaparezcan.","Las elhudan de Tyrn Gorthad","Acaba con las esferas siniestras atrayentes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vuelve con Gurthern","'Buen trabajo. Ojalá no causen más problemas.'","'Te animo a que hagas lo que puedas para reducir el número de estas esferas siniestras atrayentes, ${PLAYER}. Evitemos que se pierdan más niños.\
\
'Ten cuidado, ${PLAYER}. No sigas a las elhudan muy de cerca, pues les encanta atraer a la gente a los pantanos, pozos y aguas mortales.'","Gurthern te ha pedido que reduzcas el número de elhudan en Tyrn Gorthad.\
\
Tyrn Gorthad se encuentra en el noroeste de Cardolan."},
[12084]={"Habla con Daegennan en Gwingris","Daegennan está en Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Te indicaron que buscaras al Elfo Daegennan.","Los Elfos de Eregion necesitan la ayuda de aventureros experimentados.\
\
Un Explorador de Eregion te ha pedido que viajes al puesto avanzado élfico de Gwingris en Eregion, al sur de Rivendel. Una vez allí, debes buscar al Elfo Daegennan.","'Saludos, ${CLASS}. Hemos recibido recientemente noticias de nuestros exploradores de que el puesto avanzado de Gwingris, en Eregion, necesita aventureros experimentados como tú.\
\
'Dirígete a Eregion y mira hacia el noroeste. Allí encontrarás nuestro puesto avanzado de Gwingris. Cuando llegues, busca al Elfo Daegennan.'","'${PLAYERNAME:Bien hallado, amigo[m]|Bien hallada, amiga[f]} . ¿Estás aquí para ayudar a los Elfos de Eregion?'","'${PLAYER}, ¿qué sigues haciendo aquí? ¡Debes atender el llamado de los Elfos de Eregion!'","Los Elfos de Eregion"},
[12085]={"Habla con Daegennan en Gwingris","Daegennan está en Gwingris, en Eregion.\
\
Te indicaron que buscaras al Elfo Daegennan.","Los Elfos de Eregion necesitan la ayuda de aventureros experimentados.\
\
Un Explorador de Eregion te ha pedido que viajes al puesto avanzado élfico de Gwingris en Eregion, al sur de Rivendel. Una vez allí, debes buscar al Elfo Daegennan.","'Saludos, ${CLASS}. Hemos recibido recientemente noticias de nuestros exploradores de que el puesto avanzado de Gwingris, en Eregion, necesita aventureros experimentados como tú.\
\
'Dirígete a Eregion y mira hacia el noroeste. Allí encontrarás nuestro puesto avanzado de Gwingris. Cuando llegues, busca al Elfo Daegennan.'","'${PLAYERNAME:Bien hallado, amigo[m]|Bien hallada, amiga[f]} . ¿Estás aquí para ayudar a los Elfos de Eregion?'","'${PLAYER}, ¿qué sigues haciendo aquí? ¡Debes atender el llamado de los Elfos de Eregion!'","Los Elfos de Eregion"},
[12086]={"Habla con Imyl de Rivendel.","Los Elfos de Rivendel","'¿Broderic te envió? ¿Para ayudarnos?\
\
'Es un hombre amable... pero dudo que puedas hacer mucho por nosotros, pues nuestras fronteras son puestas a prueba por la Sombra a cada momento. Aun así, si estás ${PLAYERNAME:decidido[m]|decidida[f]} a prestarnos ayuda, la aceptaré con gratitud.'","Broderic Saucedales, un hombre de Bree, te ha pedido que busques a Imyl en la Última Casa Acogedora de Rivendel y le ofrezcas ayuda si puedes.","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. ¿Has viajado ya a la hermosa Rivendel? He tenido negocios allí en alguna ocasión, pero últimamente una amiga mía llamada Imyl me envió un aviso para que no volviera a cruzar el Bosque de los Trolls, temiendo que pudiera caer víctima de grupos de montañeses errantes que han descendido del norte en el último año.\
\
'Me considero amigo de los nobles Elfos de Rivendel, y si las cosas han llegado a este punto, temo que puedan estar en peligro. Si encuentras el camino hacia Rivendel, busca a Imyl en la Última Morada y bríndale tu ayuda, si puedes. Te lo agradecería profundamente.'","'Debes hablar con Imyl en el refugio élfico de Rivendel.'"},
[12087]={"'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Con el emisario derrotado, los trasgos son ahora una amenaza mucho menor.'","Bhoghad está en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo dentro de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, al noreste del campamento de Glóin.\
\
Tralli parecía satisfecho con todo lo que has hecho por Glóin y te ofreció una recompensa por rastrear y derrotar al emisario uruk Bhoghad en la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","'Sin tu intervención, los trasgos habrían acabado uniéndose a los uruks de Angmar, ${PLAYER}. Te damos las gracias.'","Tralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, al suroeste de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Entraste en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo y encontraste a Bhoghad negociando con los trasgos. Derrotaste al uruk, y ahora debes regresar con Tralli Buscagemas para darle la noticia.","'Es mejor mantener bajo control a los trasgos de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, antes que permitir que se unan a Angmar. Derrota al emisario antes de que logre poner a los trasgos de las Montañas Nubladas bajo la influencia de Angmar.'","Habla con Tralli Buscagemas","'Has hecho un gran servicio para todos nosotros, ${PLAYER}. Glóin tiene razón... debes tener tu recompensa por tus esfuerzos, ahora y en el futuro.\
\
'Si encuentras al emisario Bhoghad en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo, derrótalo y vuelve conmigo con la noticia, y me aseguraré de que recibas tu recompensa.\
\
'De acuerdo con los relatos que he oído del propio Glóin, la sala del trono se encuentra al final de un largo túnel. Claro que también he oído que no se puede confiar en que los muros de la Ciudad de los Trasgos permanezcan abiertos... o cerrados.'","La información obtenida de las cartas en Lengua Negra que recuperaste llevó a Glóin a ofrecer recompensas por derrotar al emisario uruk enviado por Angmar.","'Glóin se alegrará al saber que has completado esta tarea.\
\
'Deseo darte las gracias, en nombre de los enanos, por tus esfuerzos, ${PLAYER}.'","El emisario","'Encuentra al uruk que Angmar envió para incitar a esos trasgos y ponle fin, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[12088]={"A shy librarian of Imloth Melui has gone missing, along with numerous invaluable medical texts from the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","The Encrypted Note","Talk to Therien","Merenir has asked you to speak with Chief Healer Brunil in Imloth Melui's Hall of the Gentle Hand.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! I heard you were quite instrumental in assisting with the defence against the Enemy. I wonder if I might press you into service for something less grandiose, yet just as important to me.\
\
'One of my staff has gone missing. Rendis oversaw the care of the medical texts here in the Hall. She always took her job very seriously, so I was quite surprised when she vanished one day, along with many important texts.\
\
'I took her for a traitor, but I recently found a note she left behind which might explain her disappearance. Unfortunately, it is written in a medical shorthand unfamiliar to me. Will you take the note to her old teacher? You can find him in the potions wing here in the Hall. He may be able to translate it for us. You will find the note on the table, just there.'","Talk to Atharon","Talk to Brunil","Upon reading the encrypted note, Atharon has suggested that you check the market to speak with merchants Rendis mentioned she was going to see.\
\
You should talk to the bag maker and the provisioner in the Imloth Melui market.","After speaking with Therien and Brenion, you gained some information about Rendis's actions the day she disappeared. You should let Atharon know what you've learned.\
\
Atharon is in the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","'Welcome to Imloth Melui. If you are here to help, I ask that you seek out Chief Healer Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand. She has been asking for help with something.'","Brunil has asked you to bring a note written in a medical shorthand to Atharon, who she thinks can decipher the script.\
\
Atharon is in the potions wing of the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","'You return! Tell me what you discovered. Is Rendis found?'","'Why hello. Yes, I am Atharon. You say you may have a clue to the whereabouts of Rendis? Well, give it here.'\
\
You hand over the encrypted note, which he squints at, nodding.\
\
'This is written by Rendis, but I am not sure it helps much. 'Tis merely a list of items she planned to purchase from the market! See here, she planned to speak with Therien and Brenion. Why don’t you seek them out and see what Rendis wanted? They may have some idea of her whereabouts.'","Return to Atharon","'Aye, Rendis came by. Haven’t seen her for some time though. She bought seeds and quite a few sacks of grains, breads, and dried meats... and vegetables enough for a feast! Carted it all away without even inviting me to whatever party she was throwing. Now that I think of it, perhaps she wasn’t the one throwing the party. You see, her living quarters were off that way, but she carted off that way!'\
\
The merchant points first towards the east and then to the west.","Brunil has asked you to pick up the encrypted note.\
\
The note is next to Brunil, in the Hall of the Gentle Hand.","Talk to Brenion","'Rendis? Why I haven’t seen 'er in weeks. A fortnight at least... maybe longer, maybe. She was looking for a sturdy bag. Brought a few books of different sizes along - trying 'em out for size, she was. Went with what I call the Big Brown Sack. Sturdy straps on that one. Good for hiking and over-nighting. And books too, apparently. Not sure why anyone would need so many books as all that.\
\
'Say - can I interest you in a bag? How's about a sack?'","Pick up the note"},
[12089]={"Anlaf el Despojado te ha pedido que lleves algunos suministros del exterior de la Posada Abandonada abajo, al almacén de la bodega.","Recoge una cesta de huevos en el exterior de la Posada Abandonada","'Mi proveedor ya debería haber llegado, y cuando tiene prisa suele dejar las cajas y cestas fuera, justo al lado de la posada.\
\
'¿Podrías recoger lo que puedas de los suministros que haya dejado y llevarlo abajo, al almacén? Está a la izquierda según bajas las escaleras, y es donde almaceno ahora las sillas viejas. Apreciaría mucho la ayuda.'","Anlaf el Despojado querrá saber que has bajado las provisiones al almacén.","Bingo está fastidiado por la aburrida conclusión de la caza del tesoro, y se pregunta si en realidad todo acaba aquí, o si es simplemente otro acertijo.","Sostén el pergamino frente al fuego en la Posada Abandonada","Habla con Teodoro Tojo fuera de la tienda en Ost Guruth","Dejas la caja de mercancías en el suelo","Teodoro Tojo está enfrente de la tienda de Haley Pradodulce en Ost Guruth.","'Estoy nervioso, ${PLAYER}. Tu amigo Bingo cree que el acertijo nos ha conducido a este lugar, ¡y que el verdadero maestro buscador de tesoros nos espera dentro! Estoy tan emocionado por conocerle, ¡ya que tengo tanto que aprender!\
\
'¡Escucha! ¡He oido algo de movimiento dentro! ¡Va a salir!'","Haley Pradodulce es la verdadera maestra buscadora de tesoros, y está lista para hablar contigo en Ost Guruth.","¿Es el final?","Encuentra el lugar mencionado en el pergamino de las tres palabras y reúnete con Bingo allí","'¿Deseas ayudar? Bien, no rechazaré tu oferta. Después de todo, nunca sé cuándo dejarán de llegarme estas ofertas, ¡y mi espalda no es tan fuerte como en mis tiempos de joven!\
\
'He tenido problemas con los carros de suministros de cuando en cuando. La posada está a un buen trecho de Bree, y el camino puede ser traicionero cuando hace mal tiempo. De hecho, mi proveedor ya debería haber llegado, y cuando tiene prisa suele dejar las cajas y cestas fuera, justo al lado de la posada.\
\
'¿Podrías recoger lo que puedas de los suministros que haya dejado y llevarlo abajo, al almacén? Está a la izquierda según bajas las escaleras, y es donde almaceno ahora las sillas viejas. Apreciaría mucho la ayuda.'","Habla con el maestro buscador de tesoros","'Nuestra búsqueda del tesoro ha terminado, ${PLAYER}, ¡y estoy satisfecho con su conclusión! Espero que Haley sepa en qué se ha metido, porque sospecho que Teodoro no es el más atento de los alumnos. ¿Podrá enseñarle Haley sus habilidades para el oficio? ¡Creo que ambos tienen mucho que aprender!\
\
'Lo que no ha acabado aquí es mi viaje... ¡no ha hecho más que comenzar, ${PLAYER}!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Una noche apacible' (Nivel recomendado: 34)</rgb>","'Todavía nada, ${PLAYER}. Quizá este papel diga la verdad, y es ciertamente el final de la caza del tesoro en la que nos hemos embarcado. Es frustrante, pero no debería darle más vueltas. ¿Anlaf apreció el trabajo que has hecho por él?'\
\
Le hablas a Bingo sobre los suministros que bajaste al almacén, y también sobre la cesta desaparecida de limones.\
\
'¿Limones que han desaparecido? Qué curioso. Me recuerda a un viejo truco que aprendí... cuando era niño... cuando era pequeño... y...'\
\
La voz de Bingo se apaga y mira fijamente al pergamino en su mano.\
\
'¡${PLAYER}! ¿Podrías llevar esto y sostenerlo cerca del fuego? No demasiado cerca, ten cuidado, pero lo suficientemente cerca para calentar el papel. Me pregunto...'","'¡Eso pensaba!'","'¡Lo sabía, ${PLAYER}! Cuando era un joven hobbit, mi padre me enseñó el truco de escribir mensajes invisibles usando el zumo de los limones. Cuando el papel se calienta, ¡las letras aparecen, claramente visibles!'\
\
Bingo estudia el pergamino durante un momento, y su cara se ilumina.\
\
'Sé dónde hay que ir, ${PLAYER}, ¡y creo que descubriremos la solución a nuestro valioso misterio en el lugar escrito en este pergamino! Estúdialo para ver si puedes averiguar adónde ir, ¡y me reuniré allí contigo! ¡Estoy tan contendo de saber que este papel no era el final!'","Al calentarse con el fuego, ¡aparecen letras en el pergamino!","Bingo te ha pedido que sujetes el pergamino de las tres palabras junto al fuego en la Posada Abandonada.","Anlaf el Despojado es el propietario de la Posada Abandonada, y se le puede encontrar tras el mostrador del establecimiento.\
\
Para Bingo, la caza del tesoro ha llegado a un fin decepcionante, y está convencido de que hay más por descubrir.","Habla con Bingo en la Posada Abandonada","'Seguiré estudiando las palabras en busca de pistas, ¡pero no quiero que nuestro anfitrión piense que somos unos desagradecidos! Dile a Anlaf si hay algo con lo que necesite ayuda, ¡y si averiguo algo útil sobre este decepcionante papel te lo haré saber!'","'¿Has llevado los suministros abajo, al almacén? Ah, muy bien. Estaba esperando en especial la cesta de limones.'\
\
Le cuentas a Anlaf que no había cesta de limones con los otros suministros, y que quizás llegará en otra entrega.\
\
'Mmm... qué peculiar. Los esperaba en este carro. Bueno, no importa. Son solo limones, aunque los esperaba con ansias.'","'¡Estoy impresionada de que hayas resuelto mis acertijos, porque dudaba que Teodoro lo lograra!'","'Todavía nada, ${PLAYER}. ¡Estoy empezando a preguntarme si esto no acaba aquí, como dice el pergamino!","Haley Pradodulce sale de la tienda","Recoge una caja de mercancías en el exterior de la Posada Abandonada","Teodoro Tojo ha venido a Ost Guruth con Bingo, y está emocionado por conocer a quien quiera que haya estado dejándoos estos acertijos.","'Gracias por tu ayuda. Aunque me pregunto qué habrá pasado con esos limones.'","Anlaf el Despojado te ha pedido que lleves algunos de los suministros del exterior de la Posada Abandonada abajo, al almacén.","Bingo te ha dicho que el pergamino con 'ES EL FINAL' escrito en él contenía la siguiente la localización, ¡y que se reuniría allí contigo cuando lo averiguases!","'¡Lleva ese pergamino y sostenlo junto al fuego, ${PLAYER}! No demasiado cerca, ten cuidado, pero lo suficientemente cerca para calentar el papel. Me pregunto...'","Bingo está en la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.","'¿En qué me he metido, ${PLAYER}?'","'¡Lo has averiguado, ${PLAYER}! ¡Sabía que podrías hacerlo!\
\
'Teodoro quería venir también. Está muy emocionado por conocer a la persona que nos ha ido dejando estas pistas y acertijos.'","'¡Lo has averiguado!'","Bingo está en la Posada Abandonada, peleándose con el significado de las tres palabras del pergamino que recuperaste.","'¿Haley era la verdadera maestra buscadora de tesoros todo este tiempo? No me lo creo, pero consiguió todos esos tesoros antes que yo, y dejó esos acertijos para que los desvelara... ¡cosa que nunca conseguí!\
\
Teodoro se queda cabizbajo durante un momento, y a continuación aprieta el puño.\
\
'Aprenderé de ella, ${PLAYER}, ¡si me acepta como pupilo! Con su entrenamiento, seré el maestro buscador de tesoros un día! ¡Lo juro por todos los tesoros escondidos de la Tierra Media! Un día, con Haley como tutora, ¡seré el mejor!'","Bingo sonríe ampliamente mientras te acercas. '¡Lo has averiguado! dice alegremente","Bingo te entrega el pergamino con las tres palabras, con una expresión de emoción en su rostro","'¡Bien!'","'Me has encontrado, ${PLAYER}. Tengo que admitirlo, ¡estoy impresionada! No sabía que serías capaz de resolver los acertijos que dejé. Teodoro no tenía oportunidad alguna, por supuesto. A veces fanfarroneaba sobre sus capacidades como buscador de tesoros, pero yo sabía la verdad. Uno de nosotros contaba las hazañas, ¡y el otro las llevaba a cabo!\
\
'Descubrí estos tesoros y dejé acertijos en los lugares donde estaban para que Teodoro los encontrara, pero nunca lo hizo. Hasta que Bingo y tú llegasteis, creía que no habría aspirantes a mi título. ¡Me equivocaba!'","'¿Has acordado llevar algunos de los suministros de Anlaf desde el exterior de la posada hasta el almacén de la bodega? ¡Perfecto, ${PLAYER}! Yo me quedaré aquí y estudiaré este viejo pergamino en busca de pruebas.'","'Bueno, aquí estamos. ¿Y ahora qué?'","'¡El maestro buscador de tesoros está a punto de salir!'","Habla con Bingo fuera de la tienda en Ost Guruth","Habla con Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada","Has descifrado la serie de letras en el pergamino y seguido la pista hasta Ost Guruth. Bingo está aquí también, y desea hablar contigo.","'He estado dándole vueltas a lo del pergamino que encontraste en la última caja fuerte, ${PLAYER}, en el que solamente dice 'Es el final'. No puede ser que sea el final de la caza del tesoro, ¿verdad? Tiene que haber algo más que no estamos viendo, ¡seguro!\
\
'Bueno, seguiré estudiando las palabras en busca de pistas, ¡pero no quiero que nuestro anfitrión piense que somos unos desagradecidos! Dile a Anlaf si hay algo con lo que necesite ayuda, ¡y si averiguo algo útil sobre este decepcionante papel te lo haré saber!","'Reúnete conmigo junto a la tienda en Ost Guruth, ${PLAYER}. ¡Hemos estado allí hace un momento!'","'¿Haley? ¿Es posible? ¡No puedo creerlo!'","'¡Estoy emocionado por conocer a quien nos ha ido dejando estos acertijos, ${PLAYER}!'","Bingo está en el exterior de la tienda de Haley Pradodulce en Ost Guruth.","Dejas la cesta de huevos en el suelo","'¡Enséñame a ser un buscador de tesoros, Haley! Contigo como maestra, ¡estoy seguro que un día seré el mejor!'"},
[12090]={"'Bueno, has hecho un buen trabajo con esos fuegos artificiales. Parece que el peligro ha pasado. Deberías ir a contarle a Hyacinth lo que has hecho, ya que estoy seguro de que le quitará un peso de encima.\
\
'Supongo que también deberías volver a Hobbiton y contárselo a Lobelia, aunque no te envidio esa conversación. ¡Siempre ha sido una hobbit dura y áspera!\
\
'Bueno, buena suerte y que tengas un buen día.'","'Espero que no hayas tenido demasiados problemas con la vieja Lobelia...'","Hyacinth Tuk está en su casa en Alforzaburgo, cerca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
El paladín Tuk te estaba agradecido por haber ayudado a destruir los fuegos artificiales robados. Te ha encargado que le cuentes la noticia a Hyacinth Tuk.","'¡Que... cómo es eso?!... ¡Incapaz! ¡Cómo te atreves a destruir mis fuegos artificiales!'","Ahora que los fuegos artificiales de Hyacinth han sido destruidos, no quedan para la fiesta de cumpleaños de Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón.","El fin de la cuestión","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]} ${PLAYER}! Esos fuegos artificiales ya no harán daño a nadie.'","'Deberías contarle a Hyacinth lo que pasó con los fuegos artificiales robados.'","'¡Oh, Lobelia Sacovilla-Bolsón debe estar furiosa!'","'¡Fuera de mi vista, ${PLAYERNAME:Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]} de pacotilla!'","'¡Qué alivio saber que esos fuegos artificiales no harán daño a nadie!'","'¡Vaya historia que me cuentas! ¡Me hubiera gustado estar allí para ver todos esos cohetes estallar a la vez!\
\
'En verdad, estaba preocupada por lo que pasó con esos fuegos artificiales robados, y estoy muy agradecida de que hayas podido destruirlos antes de que pudieran ser mal utilizados. ¡El hecho de que los fuegos artificiales de Lobelia no estén listos para su fiesta es solo la guinda del pastel, si me entiendes!\
\
'Ahora que estoy segura de que Lobelia cancelará su pedido, tengo algunos fuegos artificiales de sobra. ¿Por qué no los tomas? ¡Te deseo la alegría de hacerlos estallar!'"},
[12091]={"The men of the trader's outpost have noticed a large force of Uruk-hai establishing themselves within the region. These Uruks and their leader have broken away from the main Uruk-army to plan further assaults against Elthengels.","The Uruk-hai camp lies to far to the east and south beyond the river.\
\
The Guard-captain has asked you to infiltrate the Uruk-hai establishment and to overthrow the commander of the force.","Ofrith resides at the trader's outpost, along the road west of Elthengels.\
\
Ofrith awaits at the trader outpost for news of your endeavours within the Uruk-hai camp.","'Without a strong leader to guide them, the Uruk-hai force will be unable to execute an offensive against us for some time. I find myself indebted to you once again. Thank you, dear ${PLAYER}, for granting us this modest protection.'","Defeated Mauhúr","The Guard-captain of the trader's outpost can be found outside his tent, within the camp.\
\
Ofrith has asked you to discuss the Uruk-hai presence with the Guard-captain and to inquire as to what should be done.","'I consider Ofrith wise for his concern. We have tracked the organized Uruk-hai force for a significant length of time. It seems to have broken off from the much larger army that passed east over the plains not long ago. Why these few have returned with haste I cannot say, but they pose a threat to the people of Elthengels while they remain. \
\
'I must remain behind to protect the merchant-camp; therefore, I shall entrust this task to you. We have scouted a fortified wall topped with White Hand banners to the south-east; the leader of the Uruks is sure to dwell within. He must be dealt with before his plans can be carried out.'","Discover the leader of the Uruk-hai camp to the south-east","Return to Ofrith at the merchant-camp","The Enduring Menace","The Uruk-hai camp lies to far to the east and south beyond the river.\
\
The Guard-captain has asked you to infiltrate the Uruk-hai encampment and to overthrow the commander of the force.","'There is a serious matter that I would care to discuss with you. As you may be aware, several Uruks have been encountered to the south-east across the river. Their existence has been a dangerous strain for our merchant-camp and for the people of Elthengels.\
\
'These Uruks seem coordinated under some unknown leadership, yet I know not the purpose of their presence here. The captain of the camp-guards has been carefully tracking the manoeuvres of this force. I would ask you to speak with him and consider whether a solution to their harassment is possible.'","Talk to the Guard-captain in the merchant-camp","You have encountered the leader of the Uruk-hai camp","Defeat Mauhúr"},
[12092]={"Put weapons in the weapon cache","The enemies patrolling or holding the line were thinned out, and you helped re-stock Brockbridge's weapon supply by salvaging their weapons. This should help sway the battle in the defenders' favour.","The cache of weapons is near Herefara, on the southern side of Brockbridge.\
\
You should bring the weapons you collected to the weapons cache in Brockbridge.","Collect Dunlending Weapons (0/6)","Collect Dunlending weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","There are many Dunlending warriors along the perimeter around Brockbridge.\
\
You should defeat Dunlending warriors in the perimeter around Brockbridge and collect their weapons.","Everyone in Brockbridge has prepared for a long siege. Despite any amount of preparation, however, there is always a need for more weapons.","Weakening the perimeter gives the town a fighting chance to survive the siege, or at least maintain the stale-mate.","Put weapons into the Brockbridge weapon cache","The Enemies' Loss is Our Gain","Completado","Everyone in Brockbridge has prepared for a long siege. Despite any amount of preparation, however, there is always a need for more weapons. You should defeat Dunlending warriors in the perimeter around Brockbridge and collect their weapons.","Collected Dunlending weapons (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12093]={"Mate Isernore was once a mine owned by Gifemund, but it has been uverrun by a party of White Hand warriors from Madh-fushaum.","Two of the Uruk-hai leaders of the White Hand were seen lashing the Dunlendings in their party who work the mine. The largest Uruk-hai among them is overseeing the mine's operation.","Defeat White Hand overseers (0/2)\
Defeat the White Hand captain","Defeated White Hand overseers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat White Hand overseers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat the White Hand captain","The Enemy Has Taken Mate Isernore","The party of White Hand warriors from Madh-fushaum that crossed the Swiftwater River are led by formidable Uruk-hai.","The party of White Hand warriors that crossed the Swiftwater River and overran Mate Isernore is led by fierce Uruk-hai. One such creature is clearly the leader, while the other two appear to be acting as mine-overseers.","Defeating the Uruk-hai in charge of the mine will disrupt the operations of the mine.","Completado","Defeated the White Hand captain"},
[12094]={"'A small band of Corsairs managed to survive the battle to retake this city, and forms a blockade near the eastern river-gate. We don't want to destroy the ships since the debris would delay our advance towards Minas Tirith.\
\
'We need you to board these ships, and defeat any remaining Corsairs you might find. This is our only solution to clear that blockade, ${PLAYER}.'","Thandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani.\
\
You should speak with Thandor.","'Well done, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I've been told there are no more major groups of resistance left in the bay. With that, our great city should be free from the Corsair threat.\
\
'In the meantime we can moor their ships, and prepare for what is next.'","Defeat the Corsair Task-master","DNT Not Used","A band of surviving Corsairs has rallied in the bay of the Anduin, and Thandor has requested your help in dealing with them.","The Corsair ships can be reached using the boat to the south of the Gondorian Captain.\
\
You should board the ships and defeat the remaining Corsair forces.","Defeat the Corsair forces (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated the Corsair Task-master","The Enemy Line","Talk to Thandor","Defeated Corsair forces (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12095]={"Search for signs of the creature that passed through Fangorn (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","This tree was forcefully pulled from the ground and used as a crude club...","Quickbeam's Huorn suddenly slows to a halt behind you. Looking at the ground nearby, you notice it marred by enormous foot-prints littered with chipped stone.\
\
The foot-prints continue far into the distance, and despite the sudden sense of dread creeping over you, you decide to follow the trail.","DNT -- Players will not see","Talk to Quickbeam's Huorn","The Enemy That Was","Grim reminders of a long-departed beast litter the forest floor, terrifying the creatures nearby.","The creature was thought to have travelled through the western part of Fangorn Forest.\
\
You have discovered reminders of a creature that once wandered through Fangorn Forest. You should seek out more signs of its presence.","You have discovered all that you could find of this giant creature, and thankfully, it appears he has been away from the forest for some time. Quickbeam's Huorn does not seem to know what to make of these discoveries.\
\
A sense of familiarity with this mysterious figure claws at the back of your mind, but you decide to press on through the forest.","You have found all the evidence you could find of the mysterious creature that travelled through Fangorn Forest.","This footprint could only belong to a giant of significant size..."},
[12097]={"Los Malledhrim de Echad Sirion han descubierto la localización de otro campamento enemigo más.","'Welcome, ${PLAYER}, though I wish it were less disturbing circumstances. Something queer is afoot in this place, and we need your help learning exactly what that is.'","Mothelen is at Echad Mothelen, far to the north-east from Amon Angened.\
\
Dannaswen has suggested you speak with Mothelen regarding the recently discovered enemy encampment in the western Dourstocks.","Habla con Mothelen en Echad Mothelen","'${PLAYER}, I have received word from Falasgon at Echad Sirion: the second enemy encampment has been discovered. It appears, though, that this encampment is not nearly the threat that Ashúrz Maufulug had been.\
\
'You should travel to Echad Mothelen, far to the north-east from here, in the western part of the Dourstocks, and speak with the patrol captain, Mothelen. He will be able to tell you more.'","'Apresúrate hacia Echad Mothelen, ${PLAYER}. Mothelen necesita tu ayuda.'","El Enemigo al este"},
[12098]={"Dannaswen is at Amon Angened, atop Amon Angened to the north, above Echad Mothelen.\
\
Glamodúd has asked you to speak with Dannaswen regarding the Orc-camp near the Gostannon in the north.","'Yes, ${PLAYER}, it is true... another Orc-camp has been discovered. I fear we have our work cut out for us.'","'Speak with Dannaswen at once, ${PLAYER}! She is at our way-post atop Amon Angened above us.'","The Enemy is Upon Us!","The presence of goblin-spies in the Mirk-eaves also infers the presence of multiple enemy encampments somewhere in the vicinity of the Mirk-eaves.","'${PLAYER}, while you were out about your tasks, Falasgon sent word that another enemy encampment has been discovered near the Gostannon. You should speak at once with Dannaswen in our way-post atop Amon Angened above us to the north.'","Talk to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened"},
[12100]={"Recoge armas de las cajas de suministros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No puedo decir que sea un placer tocar hierro forjado por Uruks, pero lo fundiremos para hacer espadas y hachas como corresponde.'","Throst está en Gath Forthnír, al este de Carn Dûm.\
\
Deberías regresar con Throst y contarle sobre tu victoria.","'Se te pidió que trajeras armas, pero lo único que veo son manos vacías.'","'¡Excelente! Llevaré esto a la forja y comenzaremos a reabastecer nuestras reservas de armas.'","La resistencia en Gath Forthnír necesita equipo si quiere hacer frente a Carn Dûm.","Urugarth está en Carn Dûm, al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Throst ideó un plan astuto para robar suministros al Enemigo y usarlos para equipar a la resistencia en Gath Forthnír.","Lleva las armas a Throst","'Nuestras reservas de armas están bajas, y no tenemos los materiales para forjar más. Sin armas adecuadas, nuestra causa parece perdida. A menos que...\
\
'Hay una posibilidad. Podemos saquear los suministros del Enemigo en Carn Dûm y traerlos aquí para que sean refundidos. No solo aumentaremos nuestras reservas de armas, también las quitaremos de las manos del Enemigo.\
\
'Si estás ${PLAYERNAME:dispuesto[m]|dispuesta[f]}, viaja al oeste hacia Urugarth y roba sus cajas de armas. Cuando tengas las cajas, vuelve conmigo.'","Las Armas del Enemigo","Armas recogidas de cajas de suministros (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12101]={"Habla con Maedhril en Sírlond","'¿Pudiste ver Sírlond desde ese lugar? Eso es lo que temía, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Mi esposo Sirvellon siempre está pensando en espadas y hachas, y cosas que están cerca. Me corresponde a mí tener una visión más amplia.'","Esta es la torre que preocupa a Maedhril","El punto de observación del enemigo","La torre que preocupa a Maedhril está al poniente cruzando el puente desde Sírlond.","Maedhril está en Sírlond, al este de Caranost propiamente dicho.","'¿Cruzarás a Caranost propiamente dicho y encontrarás las escaleras que suben justo después del puente? Hay un fuego ardiendo en lo alto de una de las torres, y quiero saber si los arqueros orcos pueden atacar este campamento desde el parapeto. Ve allí y <rgb=#00FF00>mira</rgb> en nuestra dirección. Quiero saber qué se puede ver desde ese lugar.'","Maedhril está preocupada de que los orcos tengan una buena línea de visión al campamento de su esposo en Sírlond desde las alturas de Caranost.","Encuentra la torre que domina el puente con una buena vista de Sírlond","'Mi esposo es muy querido para mí, pero solo ve lo que está directamente frente a él. \\qDebemos acabar con los guerreros orcos, Maedhril,\\q me dice, \\qpues sus espadas son mortales y afiladas.\\q No se equivoca en esto, pero me preocupan más las flechas de sus exploradores, pues pueden alcanzarnos desde mucho más lejos.\
\
'¿Cruzarás a Caranost propiamente dicho y encontrarás las escaleras que suben justo después del puente? Hay un fuego ardiendo en lo alto de una de las torres, y quiero saber si los arqueros orcos pueden atacar este campamento desde el parapeto. Ve allí y <rgb=#00FF00>mira</rgb> en nuestra dirección. Quiero saber qué se puede ver desde ese lugar.'","Maedhril tiene razón. Los arqueros orcos pueden ver fácilmente Sírlond desde esta posición","<rgb=#00FF00>Mira</rgb> en dirección a Sírlond desde la torre sobre el puente de Caranost"},
[12102]={"As countless spiders flood into Cirith Ungol, it has become clear that the arrangement between the Orcs of Cirith Ungol and Shelob is at an end. If Cirith Ungol is to hold against Shelob's children, you must defeat many of the spiders that now skitter in the shadows of the fortress.","Defeat spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Enmity of Shelob","Defeated spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Spiders of Shelob's brood can be found throughout Cirith Ungol.\
\
You have encountered many spiders in Cirith Ungol. You should defeat them and allow the Orcs to regain control of Cirith Ungol.","You have defeated many spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol.","Completado","You have defeated many spiders of Shelob's brood in Cirith Ungol. Although her broods seem to flood into Cirith Ungol without end, you have done well to hinder them as they move to overtake the tower.","As countless spiders flood into Cirith Ungol, it has become clear that the arrangement between the Orcs of Cirith Ungol and Shelob is at an end."},
[12104]={"'Any tree kept standing is a volley of arrows that we do not have to endure. Are you ready to venture into the Entwalk?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","The Entwalk: Orcs in the Trees","Dernstan is at Eaworth.\
\
Dernstan will be pleased to hear that the Orcs within the Entwalk have been thinned.","Defeat Orcs in the Entwalk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Orcs can be found in the Entwalk.\
\
Dernstan has asked you to venture within the Entwalk and defeat the Orcs pillaging the forest.","'Many more Orcs will come to the Entwalk and will replace those defeated today, but for now you have afforded us a short respite.'","Talk to Dernstan at Eaworth","Defeated Orcs in the Entwalk (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Orcs are maurading through the Entwalk, cutting down the forest to create their encampments and siege-weapons.","'A large group of Orcs has been working within the Entwalk, a section of forest along the Eaves of Fangorn. Every tree the Orcs cut down is another volley of arrows, strut of a siege-weapon, or piece of palisade. We cannot allow them to have these resources unchecked.\
\
'Head into the forest and disrupt their activities by defeating any Orcs you find within the Entwalk.'"},
[12105]={"'¡Saludos! Veo que eres una persona que conoce bien las tierras salvajes, así que la oferta que tengo para ti seguro que te hará saltar de alegría. Represento a Adso Henoloma, un emprendedor de Los Gamos con una gran visión: construir una posada a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. Me envió a mí y a estos hombres en busca de gente dispuesta a ayudarle con su sueño.\
\
'Busco champiñones que crecen a lo largo de las orillas del Río Brandivino, hacia el norte, champiñones para llenar y satisfacer el estómago con un poco de hospitalidad de la Comarca. \
\
'Sin embargo, ten cuidado si vas, porque he oído hablar de babosas viscosas y alimañas desagradables en la zona. ¿Podrías recoger algunos champiñones para mí?'","La envidia de las Cuadernas","Adso Henoloma es un hobbit con una visión que necesita ayuda para montar una posada a lo largo del camino que va de la Comarca a Bree. Sus asistentes están buscando ayuda en Los Gamos.","Se pueden encontrar setas silvestres a lo largo de las orillas orientales del Brandivino, al norte de Gamoburgo.\
\
Trumric Agripalma te ha pedido que recojas setas silvestres en las orillas del Río Brandivino. Te ha informado de que las setas se utilizarán para ayudar a crear un menú digno de la Comarca en la posada de Adso Henoloma.","'¿Quieres ayudarme? Esos champiñones pueden crecer solos, pero no pueden recogerse solos. Puedes encontrarlos en las orillas del Brandivino, al norte de Los Gamos.'","Recoge setas silvestres (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Mira toda esta abundante comida! Sin duda has cumplido bien tu parte del trato, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, y yo haré lo mismo. \
\
'Los hornos de la posada olerán como los mejores hornos de toda la Comarca. Es un gran día.'","Setas silvestres recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las setas a Trumric Agripalma en Los Gamos"},
[12106]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Ocho","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año ocho en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","'Tengo una actualización sobre mi petición de ser relevado, si te interesa. El Comité de Organización de Fiestas de toda la Comarca ha escuchado mi caso y los Planificadores Jefes están considerando qué hacer al respecto.\
\
'Solo que, mientras se acarician la barbilla y reflexionan, ¡la cantidad de tarjetas allí arriba ha crecido a proporciones asombrosas! Las viejas se meten bajo los pies y las nuevas me dan dolor de cabeza. ¡Qué desastre!'","'El veredicto del Comité de Organización de Fiestas aún no ha sido emitido, me temo. Los asuntos importantes toman su tiempo, ¿sabes? Aquí tienes otra recompensa por tu paciencia en este importante asunto.\
\
'¡No te rías, es importante! ¡Mi posición y mi reputación están en juego aquí!'","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[12107]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","'¡Aquí estamos de nuevo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Debo ser sincero contigo; ¡he estado esperando esto durante todo el año! ¡Rápido, ve al árbol y mira qué nueva aventura te espera!'","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Once","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Once en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","'Vaya, vaya, ¡quizá esto se convierta en una nueva tradición! Me temo que no queda nada más por hacer que esperar hasta el próximo año y aguardar más de nuestro misterioso hacedor de festejos. ¿Me pregunto si algún día se revelarán?\
\
'¡Nos vemos pronto, y gracias otra vez por toda tu ayuda! Aquí tienes una recompensa final por ser tan buen amigo durante todo este alboroto. ¡Cuídate!'\
\
<rgb=#FFFF00>No habrá más tarjetas de Búsqueda del Tesoro este año, pero el evento permanecerá abierto durante un tiempo para que puedas completar las tarjetas restantes.</rgb>","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[12108]={"'Mi nueva sospecha recae en ese buscavidas aficionado a las aventuras, Bingo Boffin. Él está detrás de todo esto. ¡Claro que no tengo ni una pizca de evidencia, pero estoy seguro de que tengo razón!'","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Cinco","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Cinco en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","'Resulta que Bingo Boffin ha estado muy ocupado leyendo sobre cocina en la biblioteca de Alforzaburgo. Todos lo vieron allí. Bueno, ahora estoy totalmente desanimado y listo para tirar la toalla.'\
\
'Pero no, ¡debo perseverar! El Comité de Organización de Fiestas cuenta conmigo y, créeme, amigo, ¡no quieres decepcionar al Comité de Organización de Fiestas! Toma, aquí tienes otra recompensa por toda tu ayuda.'","Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro que puedes completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa."},
[12109]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Cuatro","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","'No supondrás que *TÚ* eres quien deja estas notas, ¿verdad? ¡Ja, ja! Solo una pequeña broma. No dejes de ayudarme a salir de este embrollo. A menos que FUERAS tú... No. Nunca pensé eso, te lo aseguro. Quien quiera que sea ha dejado más premios por aquí, así que sírvete.'","'¿Creerías que no pegué un ojo anoche, vigilando el árbol para atrapar a esos malhechores en el acto... y aun así los pasé por alto? Oh, cómo se burla de mí el Comité de Organización a mis espaldas. Sé que me creen culpable. ¿Y si lo soy? ¿Durante la noche, caminando dormido? ¡Bah! Qué tontería.\
\
'No me hagas caso. Solo estoy falto de sueño, eso es todo. Deberías tomar otra de esas listas del árbol y ver a dónde te lleva esta vez.'","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Cuatro en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!"},
[12110]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Nueve en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Nueve","'Estoy desconcertado. ¡No hay explicación posible! ¡El Comité aún no ha decidido mi caso! Me están torturando, eso es lo que ocurre. Son ELLOS quienes... quienes han perpetuado esta farsa. Oh, ${PLAYER}, ¿y si me desechan? ¿Y si ya no me invitan a tomar el té?\
\
'Yo... Tengo algo en el ojo. Ve, toma otra tarjeta. Recuperaré la compostura en un momento.'","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","'¡Me alegra que hayas vuelto, ${PLAYER}! Ha habido muchas discusiones y, en efecto, decisiones mientras estabas fuera y, como verás, ya tenemos un veredicto.\
\
'Nosotros —quiero decir, el Comité, por supuesto— hemos decidido que el inexplicable, no aprobado y enigmático trabajo de travesura que tienes delante será declarado oficialmente como la Búsqueda del Tesoro Anual del Aniversario. Incapaces de superarlos, les hemos abierto la puerta. A los desconocidos responsables del acto se les permitirá permanecer en el anonimato, siempre y cuando continúen proporcionando el funcionamiento del festival conforme a las regulaciones adecuadas de la Comarca cada año.\
\
'En cuanto a mí, conservaré mi puesto aquí, junto al Árbol de la Fiesta. Es una buena noticia, ya que la organización de fiestas alrededor del Árbol de la Fiesta es prácticamente lo único que he conocido, y me gustaría que así siguiera siendo.'"},
[12111]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","'¡Ah! ¿Has venido en respuesta a mi carta? Debo disculparme si estaba algo desordenada y divagaba aquí y allá. He estado en un estado terrible.\
\
'La cuestión es que... bueno, ¡mira el Árbol de la Fiesta! Durante la noche, algún malhechor travieso lo cubrió con todo eso... ¡todo ese LO-QUE-SEA que es!\
\
'Y como dije en mi carta —no me preguntes por qué—, el Comité de Organización de Fiestas ha decidido que debo tener algo que ver con ello, o que soy yo quien debe llegar al fondo del asunto. Solo que no tengo ni la menor idea de por dónde empezar. ¿Me ayudarás, mi buen ${RACE}?\
\
'Ve allí, toma una de esas cosas y... y mira si puedes entender algo. Yo desde luego no puedo. ¿Son listas? ¿O acertijos? Resuelve bien una de ellas y creo que empezaremos a avanzar.'","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Uno","'¿Has encontrado absolutamente todo lo que estaba escrito en el papel? Vaya, pues yo apenas sé qué son la mitad de esas cosas. Debes de ser alguien muy viajado, amigo ${CLASS}. ¡Seguro que has visto lugares lejanísimos como Archet o Bree, verdad?\
\
'Bueno, créaslo o no, estos malhechores también han dejado algunas recompensas. ¡Las deslizaron justo debajo de la mesa, aquí a mi lado! ¿Esperan que forme parte de este juego? Bah. Odio ver que un buen obsequio se desperdicie, así que... toma, acepta esto por ayudarme y por ser tan buen compañero en medio de todo este alboroto.'","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Uno en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[12112]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","'Ay, el Comité Local de Organización de Fiestas ha rechazado mi solicitud. Parece que tendré que defender mi caso en persona en nuestra próxima reunión mensual del Comité de Organización de Fiestas de toda la Comarca.'","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Siete","'Ya basta, ${PLAYER}. He soportado suficientes noches perturbadas por sueños de papeles colgando de cintas en los árboles, arrancándome los cabellos mientras intento descifrar listas y más listas y más listas, sabiendo —sí, sabiendo— cómo la gente debe burlarse de mí y de esta... esta... esta ridícula broma a mis espaldas.\
\
'He presentado una solicitud al Comité de Organización de Fiestas para que me releven de mi cargo. Quizás pueda aprender a ayudar con el armado de cometas o la preparación de pasteles. De verdad, cualquier cosa con tal de alejarme de este árbol.'","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Siete en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[12113]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","'Vaya lío... dejaron aún más recompensas. Aquí tienes.'","'¡Seis tarjetas, ${PLAYER}! Te confesaré que estaba seguro de que cinco serían el final del asunto. Ahora temo pensar a dónde nos llevará esto. ¿Habrá un final?\
\
'Entre tú y yo, me habría quedado sin ideas ya en la segunda tarjeta. ¿Y por qué no? Se me eriza el pelo al pensar en la mitad de las cosas escritas en esos papelitos. Elfos, olifantes y vaya uno a saber qué más. Pues tuve el buen juicio de quedarme en mi sitio y no abandonar nunca la Comarca... a diferencia de ALGUNOS que podría mencionar. ¡Ay, no! No me refería a ti. Tú no eres de aquí —y los habitantes de la Comarca estamos orgullosos de dar la bienvenida a los visitantes. Ay, cielos... ¡realmente he metido la pata esta vez!","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Seis","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Seis en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[12114]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Diez","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Diez en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","'Ah, bueno, parece que las tarjetas seguirán ahí un tiempo más, así que si te perdiste alguna que creas que podría valerte la pena, este sería un buen momento para completarla.'","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","'¿Lo creerías? Yo ciertamente no lo haría si no lo tuviera aquí mismo en la mano. Lo que quiero decir es que hoy recibí una carta. No colgada del árbol, ojo. Dejaron la carta en mi correo, como hacen los hobbits decentes, solo que parece ser de quienquiera que fuese responsable de, ya sabes, todo esto. Escribieron —y con bastante amabilidad, debo añadir— que estamos llegando al final de las nuevas tarjetas, aunque todos somos bienvenidos a seguir resolviéndolas por un tiempo más. Luego dicen que volverán el próximo año con aún más diversión.\
\
'Debo confesar que, entre tanto resoplar, quejarme y arrancarme los pelos, en realidad —y pese a mi mejor juicio— me he divertido. ¡Espero que tú también!'"},
[12115]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Tres","'Y aquí estamos. Otra lista revisada. Por supuesto, también dejaron otra recompensa. ¿Lo esperabas? Debo confesar que no me sorprendió. Disfrútala'","'¿Por qué, te pregunto, soy siquiera responsable de este misterio? Es cierto que estoy cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta más a menudo que casi cualquier otro hobbit de la Comarca. Pero no soy un condestable, te lo aseguro, ni tampoco un gran resolutor de acertijos.'","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Tres en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!"},
[12116]={"Hay tarjetas colgadas del Árbol de la Fiesta. Cada una contiene una búsqueda del tesoro para completar a tu propio ritmo. Cuando completes una búsqueda, lleva la tarjeta completada a Odilia Retumbo para recibir una recompensa.","'¿Cómo te fue con este? ¿Arrojó la lista alguna luz sobre los culpables de este jueguito? ¿Te pareció mínimamente coherente? Pues a mí no.\
\
'Sí, sí, en efecto hay otra recompensa. De algún modo me han convencido contra mi voluntad para participar en esta locura. ¡El Comité de Organización de Fiestas se enterará de esto!'","Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario en Eriador — Año Dos","¡Completa una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro del Año Dos en Eriador para recibir una recompensa!","'Seguro que pensaste: La perezosa de Odilia, ni siquiera ha intentado quitar esas cosas. Pues que sepas que sí lo he intentado. ¡Y quien sea que esté detrás de esta broma las vuelve a poner! ¡Es algo no autorizado, te lo aseguro! Por favor, toma otra de las tarjetas y ve qué puedes hacer.'","Habla con Odilia Retumbo","Puedes encontrar a Odilia Retumbo junto al Árbol de la Fiesta en la Comarca.\
\
Debes hablar con Odilia Retumbo para recibir tu recompensa por completar una tarjeta de búsqueda del tesoro.","Cada año, en primavera, tiene lugar la Búsqueda del Tesoro del Aniversario para celebrar una ocasión muy especial.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta versión de la misión incluye solo objetivos ubicados dentro de Eriador y está disponible para jugadores de todos los niveles.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[12117]={"Mochila de Lolo Wendingway recolectada","Recupera la mochila de Lolo Wendingway del oso que la robó","Lolo quiere reanudar el lucrativo comercio de Burl Beeman entre Combe y Entibo, pero un oso se llevó su mochila y la bolsa de monedas que había dentro.","La bolsa de monedas extraviada","'¡Mi mochila! ¡La encontraste, y con tiempo de sobra! Toma esto como muestra de mi agradecimiento, ${PLAYER}.'","'Mientras intentaba vender algunas de mis mercancías en las granjas al este de Entibo, ¡un oso se metió en mi carro y se llevó mi mochila! Supongo que la arrastró para comerse mi almuerzo.\
\
'El problema es que mi bolsa de monedas estaba en esa mochila, lo que significa que no puedo comprar hierba para pipa para comerciar con Burl. Peor aún, si no la recupero en los próximos quince minutos, ¡seguro que pierdo los buenos precios de la hierba para pipa en Entibo!\
\
'¡Tienes que encontrar al oso que robó mi mochila y traerla de vuelta en los próximos quince minutos, ${PLAYER}!'","¡Se te acabó el tiempo!","Lolo Wendingway está en el camino entre Combe y Entibo.\
\
El oso que se llevó la mochila de Lolo Wendingway la arrastró hasta el valle al este de él. Debes devolverle la mochila en quince minutos; de lo contrario, perderá los buenos precios de la hierba para pipa en Entibo.","'El oso que robó mi mochila debe estar en el valle al este de aquí. ¡Tendrás que darte prisa si quiero conseguir las mejores ofertas de hierba para pipa!'","Lleva la mochila a Lolo Wendingway"},
[12118]={"'Hello there stranger! What ails you, perhaps some Ethring ale?'\
\
You ask the barkeep if he knows anything about the body you recently found.\
\
'Well this is a sad day. Business has been a little slower recently with most of the town off to war and no merchants have come through in days. I can't afford to lose many more patrons. You say he washed up on the river? Hmm...\
\
'You know, I haven't seen many travellers as of late but there is one here right now. He's an odd fellow. No Gondorian I've ever seen but he pays well and seems friendly enough. Maybe you should speak with him. He just came into town from Lamedon and may have seen things on his travels. Best of luck my friend!'","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question a patron of the tavern.","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
Have a drink with Jajax.","'Unfortunately, I have more pressing matters to attend to than learning about the death of one of my people. These are difficult times.\
\
'Many of the townsfolk are gathered in our tavern. Perhaps speaking to them will clear up some of this mystery. I wish you luck and dearly hope that this man was not slain by someone in this town.'","Question the barkeep","'Ah, if it isn't my friend, ${PLAYER}! This is an unexpected surprise to see you again. After our last adventure together I needed a bit of a break. Did you as well? Some kind fellow in Calembel told me about the sleepy town of Ethring. The cities in Gondor are too big, this is truth. I like the woods and quiet.\
\
'But enough about me, what have you been up to? Let us drink together and share our adventures!'","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Jajax.","Question a patron","You ask the patron if he knows anything about the body you recently found.\
\
'I am a little confused. You think I know something? Look, I come here every evening to have a pint. That's all I know. You should speak with the barkeep. He's a good man. Keeps me from getting too thirsty. He knows the whole lot of the town. Everyone who comes through Ethring stops here. I wish I could help more, really.'","Though a little belligerent, you are fairly certain of the patron's innocence","Have a drink with Jajax","Speak with Jajax","Laerind wants Jajax to tell you what he knows of the body, for Jajax's freedom may be at stake","Laerind is located in Ethring village.\
\
You should speak with Laerind.","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question the barkeep.","Forgetting for a moment about the body, you start telling Jajax a story of your most recent adventure","Jajax seems to be deflecting your questions but perhaps he is just tired from his recent battles","Question Jajax","You are certain of the barkeep's innocence","Laerind has asked you to question the various locals and learn more about the mysterious death of one of the villagers.","'Ah friend, you have returned! Have another drink with me!'\
\
You explain to Jajax that he must tell you if he knows anything about the body by the river for Laerind will lock him up if he does not speak.\
\
'An idle threat but I do not want to cause trouble in this town for I like this place!'\
\
In a quieter voice, Jajax asks you to lean in closer so that he may speak to you.\
\
'I do not want to get involved in this but I will tell you what I know and no more. After the skies grew dark, I made my way to Ethring. The woods were made of blackness from the starless sky. Only torchlight guided my way. As I approached Ethring I saw a man in the woods. He was white as a ghost and not even moving.'","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question Jajax.","'Greetings again. What word have you on Ethring's mysterious death?\
\
'I see. No one speaks about it. You say a friend of yours is in the tavern and has not answered your questions. That does seem odd. Might you try reasoning with him to answer you? If he does not, I may need to have him seized until we solve this death.'","Ethring tavern is located in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should question Jajax again.","Speak with Laerind","The Examination","Remembering again your task at hand you ask Jajax if he knows anything about the body you recently found.\
\
'This does not sound like something that I am interested in, friend. Please do not bother me with these things. Talk about something more interesting such as sailing ships or climbing mountains.'","Question Jajax again"},
[12119]={"Crágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should travel to Crágan Bris.","'You have done as I asked, and the goats seem to find you acceptable. I will answer your question.\
\
'Why am I here you ask? Crágan Bris was once a great settlement of my people. It is all I have left. You do not know much about Câr Bronach, I see. Then I will explain. This is where my ancestors came from. We once had a great city where the Drearspire now stands. Our home was taken from us by Men and we were chased away. Hraubrek wanted to reclaim our land. That is why we have returned. I followed Hraubrek because I believed in his wisdom. Now I am lost, for Hraubrek allies with our enemy. All our alliances have ended in death. How will this one be any different?!\
\
'I have answered your question, now leave me be.'","A lone giant sits, surrounded by rams","The Exiled Giant","Added feed to the feed buckets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Crágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should feed the rams at Crágan Bris.","Talk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris","Mézto and be found at Grúmachath in central Câr Bronach.\
\
You should return to Mézto.","Talk to Skálgrund, the Exile at Crágan Bris","Crágan Bris can be found in the hills west of Hlídborg in Câr Bronach.\
\
You should talk to Skálgrund at Crágan Bris.","A lone stone-giant has been spotted sitting upon the old ruins of Crágan Bris.","Add the feed to the feed buckets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Travel to Crágan Bris","Return to Mézto with what you have learned","'Go away!\
\
'What?! You are still here?!\
\
'You can ask me all the questions you you want. It does not mean that I will answer them!\
\
'How could I even trust you? I can not even trust my own kind to make the right decisions. I can only trust these goats. If the goats trust you, then maybe I will answer a question for you.'","'${PLAYER}, have you returned! I was starting to wonder where you had gotten to!\
\
'So the Grímklettar ally with the Dourhands, but not the Angmarim? I find this confusing! We know the Angmarim and the Dourhands work together! There is more at hand in Câr Bronach then I thought! Someone is driving a wedge in this alliance.'","'A memory has come to me, ${PLAYER}. I did not think much of it at the time. Now, in light of what you have learned, I believe there is something else worth investigating before you return to Mézto. The day after the Angmarim visited the stone-giants, we saw our first and only movement from the encampment of Hlídborg. Two giants left the camp. One was Hraubrek, Chieftain of the Grímklettar, who marched off to the north with purpose. We were unable to follow. The second was a stone-giant who stomped away from the encampment in anger. He headed towards the old ruins of Crágan Bris.\
\
'Those old ruins might be worth investigating.'"},
[12121]={"Elrond está en su biblioteca en Rivendel.\
\
Sigrun te ha pedido que regreses ante Elrond con noticias sobre la magnitud de la amenaza que ahora acecha dentro de Helegrod.","Habla con Elrond en Rivendel","'Debe informarse a Elrond de lo que está ocurriendo en Helegrod, ${PLAYER}. ¡Dile que la situación es más grave de lo que pensábamos!'","La Magnitud de la Amenaza","'El señor Glóin nos envió a la Escalera Amarga para explorar Helegrod, pues temía que algún mal hubiese vuelto a asentarse allí, pero no creo que sospechara que la situación fuera tan grave. ¿El dragón Thorog renacido? ¡Ningún enano habría podido imaginar un terror semejante!\
\
'Debes regresar con Elrond de Rivendel y contarle el peligro que acecha ahora mismo en su propio umbral. Su hogar puede estar oculto a los ojos curiosos gracias a algún arte élfico, pero pocas cosas están a salvo del fuego de dragón, como bien podrían decirte los antepasados de los Hombres de Valle.\
\
'Ve ahora con presteza, ${PLAYER}. Greip y yo continuaremos nuestra vigilancia aquí, y los Elfos de Rivendel necesitarán tiempo para preparar un plan propio.'","'Has regresado, ${PLAYER}, y tus noticias son tal como esperaba, pues envié a algunos de mis propios exploradores a investigar mientras estabas fuera. Con este conocimiento, ya podemos planificar no solo nuestra defensa, sino también nuestro ataque.\
\
'El mal que se oculta tras los muros de Helegrod debe ser erradicado. Debes ayudar a los Elfos y a los enanos a cumplir con esta misión, ${PLAYER}.'","Sigrun y Greip descubrieron que el mal que ha tomado Helegrod es mucho peor de lo que Glóin había sospechado."},
[12122]={"Collected lush vetchling (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'In the wake of the great battle, the healers of Gondor and Rohan alike are strained and their stores will soon run low if we do not help replenish them.\
\
'Gondor has long been a source of various remedies and tinctures, and nearly all of them through the use of the flowers and herbs that grow in Ithilien. This task has not often fallen to the Rangers in recent years, but the need is great now, and we must all do our part to ease the ills of the wounded.\
\
'Among the most common of Ithilien's herbs and flowers are oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling. Each can be ground into a beneficial extract that can then be combined into powerful medicines by skilled healers.\
\
'Search nearby for the lushest of these plants and bring them to me. Once you have gathered them, return to me and we can speak on how to harvest their extracts.'","Collected lush oxlip (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect lush oxlip (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected lush horsetail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lush oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling can be found nearby Ereblen in north-western Ithilien.\
\
Ereblen has asked you to gather lush oxlip, horsetail, and vetchling, so that you might learn more of their uses.","Collect lush horsetail (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the bundles of horsetail, oxlip, and vetchling to Ereblen","Collect lush vetchling (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Extracts of Ithilien","'Excellent work, my friend. You have gathered them just as swiftly as I'd hoped! With a careful hand, you can grind these flowers into useful extracts. Here...'\
\
Ereblen takes the bundles from you, and begins to grind them in a small mortar.\
\
'There are many plants in the gardens of Ithilien, and some are much rarer than the rest. However, all of them are of great worth to healers of Gondor, so look closely and harvest as many as you can as you explore these lands.\
\
'Now then, there are a few among our number that have been tasked to make swift trips to the White City. If you give them the phials you have collected, they may be able to offer you something of use in return. Our swift-riders can be found at the Cross-roads to the south, in Henneth Annûn, and far to the north among our camps on the border of Dagorlad. Your aid could make a tremendous difference in the aftermath of the great battle, so I would urge you to bring those phials to them as soon as you are able.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Barter vendors for extract phials can be found at the Cross-roads, Henneth Annûn, and Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad.</rgb>","Ereblen can be found to the west of Henneth Annûn.\
\
You have harvested many of Ithilien's flowers and herbs, and you should now return to Ereblen.","The flowers and herbs of Ithilien have many potent medicinal uses, and gathering them would aid the Host of the West as well as the wounded of Gondor and Rohan."},
[12124]={"'I have one more task for you.\
\
'I have received word that Gorgar has deployed a number of his war-trolls to guard the approach to Mount Gundabad. However, I have reason to believe that they have also been sent to uncover our position. If Drenghól were to be discovered, it would deal a devastating blow to our offensive.\
\
'Slay them for the good of the Gabil'akkâ!\
\
'And, ${PLAYER}, these war-trolls do not travel alone — neither should you.'","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have defeated many of the roaming war-trolls of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru. You should return to Náin.","'I have no doubt Gorgar will soon send more of his trolls into the war-fell, but each one we defeat serves to guard our position.\
\
'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.'","Deployed to protect the gates of Mount Gundabad and uncover the hidden refuge of Drenghól, mighty trolls roam the war-fell of Azgh-buzru.","Talk to Náin at Drenghól","The Eyes of Gorgar","Gundabad war-trolls can be found at Azgh-buzru.\
\
Náin has asked you to defeat roaming war-trolls of Gundabad at Azgh-buzru.","Defeat Gundabad war-trolls at Azgh-buzru (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12125]={"The contents of the treasure were more troubling than valuable: an intact skull, and a metallic tooth like Kotheret's.\
\
You should return to her in Mâr Naphra and seek answers.","'A ${CLASS}, are you?' The woman grins widely, revealing a metallic tooth. 'The sort who seeks out grave danger in the spirit of adventure? I'd wager you'll want to hear what I have to say, then.\
\
'When you've stuck around Mâr Naphra for as long as I have, you pick up all sorts of... interesting stories. One story has fragmented into naught but rumours: a bloodthirsty Corsair captain, a cache of buried treasure...\
\
'Many an ambitious soul has ventured east to Bax Garâkh in search of this treasure. Whether they've been successful, I cannot say I know. Perhaps the treasure does not exist after all.\
\
'Ah, I've taken up enough of your time. Watch yourself, traveller. Not everyone here is as friendly as I.'","An unnatural chill sets in...","Open the treasure chest","Try as you might, you cannot find Kotheret anywhere","The shade fades into nothingness","Kotheret Glint-grin seems to have vanished from Mâr Naphra. You may have your suspicions about what you discovered, but it seems your questions will never be put to rest.","Trying to open the treasure chest caused an angry shade to attack you.\
\
Now that you've vanquished it, you should try to open the chest again.","Kotheret Glint-grin seems to have vanished from Mâr Naphra.","Try to open the treasure chest","You've discovered what appears to be the treasure Kotheret told you about.\
\
You should try to open it.","Search for the rumoured treasure in Bax Garâkh","Completado","You hit something solid and unearth it!","Rumours of a treasure cache that once belonged to a Corsair captain have reached your ears.","You have discovered the possible location of the treasure cache.\
\
You should dig into the sand mound.","The ground here bears signs of past treasure-seekers","The Fabled Fortune","Find Kotheret Glint-grin in Mâr Naphra","The amount of coins in the chest barely comes close to what you were expecting -- or rather, hoping for.\
\
What truly catches your attention, however, is the preserved skull that sits among the coins. It greets you with an eternal, lipless smile.\
\
Hidden among the shining coins is a metallic tooth, one that looks eerily similar to Kotheret Glint-grin's...","Kotheret Glint-grin told you about the rumoured treasure. Whether the treasure is real, she cannot say.\
\
It may have been buried somewhere in Bax Garâkh, east of Mâr Naphra.","Dig into the sand mound"},
[12126]={"'Greetings, young ${CLASS}.\
\
'So you have met Samítai during your travels. I am glad to hear that he is well.\
\
'Welcome. This is Laivárth. A grove of the Kintai and I am its tender. I work to protect it from the blight ravaging this land.'","Found Laivárth. Speak with Tálbiral","The Fading Grove","Speak with Tálbiral","Samítai has told you how to reach Laivárth in Adagím to the north-east. You are to speak with Tálbiral when you arrive at the grove.","You have found Laivárth in Adagím. Find and speak to Tálbiral and let him know that Samítai sent you.","Find Laivárth","Samítai has told you how to reach Laivárth in Adagím. You are to speak with Tálbiral when you arrive at the grove.","'Be wary, adventurer. If you go much further you will reach the borders of Adagím. The blight runs deep and the land has grown foul here.\
\
'The people here do not see many outsiders and may be wary, but if you wish to venture into the marsh I am confident you will find many who could use your help.\
\
'If you make your way through these marshes to the north-east, you will reach a grove known as Laivárth. When you arrive you can find Tálbiral and he can tell you more of what awaits in Adagím.'"},
[12127]={"The Fading of the Forests","'This is madness, ${PLAYER}. I am well enough for a little travel. I would like you to take me to this supposed Kinta Elf. I will talk to him and see what, exactly, is so important that he would shoot someone but not speak with them. Tell me when you are ready to leave.'","'I am a fool ${PLAYER}. I had no idea the whole of Ambarûl was once covered in a lush forest of such extraordinary trees. Worse yet, I am no better than my forebears who destroyed them. Like I did, they doubtless took for granted that it would always be there, no matter what.'\
\
Agalûnu sits in silent thought for several moments before she winces.\
\
'I spoke the truth when I told the Kinta I wanted to help, but I confess that perhaps my wound is not as healed as I thought. I do not think I will be capable of helping him anytime soon.'","Talk to Agalûnu","Upset that she has been asked to leave Arwáth, Agalûnu wishes to speak to Shanathar directly.","Agalûnu has asked you to take her to meet the warden of Arwáth. You should tell her when you are ready to go.","'Are you ready to go? I will talk to this ignorant Kinta and make him see reason.'","You escorted Agalûnu to meet with Shanthar. He explained why she should not clear-cut trees, especially in Ambarûl. You should talk to Agalûnu and find out what she is thinking.","Complete Instance: The Fading of the Forests"},
[12128]={"El cuerpo está frío al tacto, pero las heridas parecen recientes, aunque la falta de sangre alrededor del cadáver es inquietante. En su mano, el hombre sostiene una nota.\
\
Su posición y el rastro de tierra removida hacen parecer que atravesó la penumbra de las Quebradas de los Túmulos para llegar hasta aquí. La nota está mordisqueada y arrugada, y las únicas palabras legibles son: 'entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte. Envíen ayuda.'","'¿Tú, viniste aquí en lugar de buscar a Cebadilla y a los Vigilantes? Vaya lío.\
\
'No perdonaré pronto a Cebadilla por el cuento que le contó a mi Lalia. Si has venido a ayudarnos, me alegra verte. Solo me preocupa que quizá no seas capaz de sacarnos de este lugar terrible.'","Habla con Bob en el campamento de refugiados entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte","Encuentra el campamento de los supervivientes entre el Bosque Viejo y las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte","Te topaste con un pobre aventurero en las afueras de las Quebradas de los Túmulos del Norte. En la mano del cadáver encontraste una nota dirigida a Cebadilla Mantecona. Al parecer, su asistente Bob vino a los Túmulos para buscar a su hija y terminó en el oeste, entre las Quebradas de los Túmulos y la oscuridad implacable del Bosque Viejo.","Habla con uno de los supervivientes de la desafortunada expedición a las Quebradas de los Túmulos","Entrega fallida"},
[12129]={"The warrior does not agree with Aragorn's plan","Speak with Duinhir near Cair Andros","Aragorn learns of a group of the Enemy, camped inside the island fortress of Cair Andros.","Duinhir shows renewed strength in his role as a leader of these men","'Did you pass through Cormallen as the rest of us did? The beauty of the area certainly renewed the spirits in these faint-hearted men.\
\
'We are close to Cair Andros now. Would you mind scouting the entrance to see what these men are up against? Report back to Duinhir for I must return north-east. I hope that we shall see each other again soon. Good luck.'","Duinhir is still shattered after the loss of his sons","'Alas, my friend, I can not bring myself to look past the deaths of my sons. I know their recklessness saved us in battle. I know that if they had not learned how to take down the Mûmakil, we would not be standing here today. Still, it pains me so to see such potential lost for all time. I can not keep going, knowing that my death would certainly be the undoing of my dear Rosfin.'","Cair Andros is an island fortress in the Anduin River, bordering North Ithilien and Talath Anor.\
\
You should scout the entrance of Cair Andros.","'The entrance is heavily guarded. I suppose we shall need to be as stealthy as we can be before a full-on assault is possible.'","Speak with Aragorn at the Host of the West encampment","Habla con Duinhir","Scout the entrance of Cair Andros","'I see, these are young men with little time in battle, farmers who till the land, longing for their loved-ones, and those who still grieve amongst all the bloodshed they have witnessed.'\
\
Aragorn looks around the encampment with gazing eyes that are both commanding yet full of pity.\
\
'Men, listen to me. If you are not able to tread further, then go! I ask of you on this day, keep your honour and do not run! Instead, make way south-west for Cair Andros. It is still held by the Enemy. Lessen any shame, retake the island fortress, and hold it to the very last!'\
\
The men understand and nod. Aragorn turns back to you and speaks in a softer tone.\
\
'Many of these men who depart are not leaders, nor could I ever ask them to lead. Duinhir however, is a lord. You are Duinhir's friend. Speak with him and see if he is willing to lead these men to Cair Andros for me. You may assist him, if you wish, but I need you back here as soon as you are able.'","'Brave ${RACE}, I have only heard of Mordor in tales from my mother, to keep me out of trouble, when I was a young lad. I am not much older now, as you can see. I am frightened, to be honest.'","Aragorn can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak with Aragorn.","Speak with Damrod","The warrior is just a farmer and is too frightened to continue","The warrior injured his ankle and believes he will just slow everyone down","Speak to the uncertain warrior","The Faint-hearted","Duinhir can be found near Cair Andros.\
\
You should speak to Duinhir.","Speak to the injured warrior","Duinhir, though uncertain, accepts the leadership of the Faint-hearted","'${PLAYER}, might I speak with you one moment? As we have passed through Ithilien, I look at these men and I see a horror growing behind their eyes. As we rest upon the border of Dagorlad, I have heard whispers of those unable to carry on, of those unable to move or bear arms.\
\
'I ask of you, seek out these men, and speak with them. Find what it is that stricken them so. I fear the closeness of Mordor is enough to bring most men to a halt.'","'I am just a farmer from Lossarnach. I know the land, not war. If I pick up my sword, I will surely perish here.'","Duinhir can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak with Duinhir.","Damrod can be found to the north-east of Cair Andros at Caladuil.\
\
You should speak to Damrod.","Speak to a scared warrior","The entrance to the island is heavily guarded","'Aragorn asks of me to lead the assault on Cair Andros? You know that I would do as he asks, and I shall do this for him as well. I shall see to it that Cair Andros returns to Gondor. I will lead these men to see that they do not die, that they see their loved ones again. Blackroot Vale shall not be a place of shame, but a place of heroic memories, befitting for the likes of Duilin and Derufin.\
\
'If you are to join us, I shall arrange for the ranger Damrod to guide us through the lands south-west of here. Let us depart soon. You may want to speak with Damrod when we arrive near the island fortress.'","Speak to Duinhir at the Host of the West encampment","Duinhir and soldiers of Gondor can be found at the Host of the West encampment, on the border of North Ithilien and Dagorlad.\
\
You should speak to some of those who have expressed concern with marching to the Black Gate.","'The wind sweeping down the cliffs sounds of voices. I can not sleep for Mordor taunts me. The hand of death, ever reaching out towards me. My legs refuse to move out from Ithilien. Once we cross the border, my time of this world is at an end. I am sorry.'"},
[12130]={"'Ah, Hermáth. Is something on your mind?\
\
'Shall I remind you of the tale of Nafni the Unslain?'\
\
Dáin clears his throat and begins his story once again.\
\
'In the year 1980 of the Third Age, Durin's Bane was unearthed in the Foundations of Stone. Nafni was there on that day, protecting Durin VI while the king treated his Elf-guests to a tour of Khazad-dûm's splendid mines. Durin fell to the Balrog's fury, but he ordered Nafni to survive and protect his son, Náin. And so he did, for Nafni was fleet of foot and was able to escape the terrible creature! He saw that fiend in all of its fiery terror... and lived. Upon hearing Nafni's recounting, Náin was enraged, and vowed revenge for his father at all costs.\
\
'The brave soldiers of Khazad-dûm tried to push the Balrog and the Nameless horde in its train back to the depths, but slowly, more and more of the kingdom was to fall. A year later, Durin's son, now King Náin I, gathered his forces and launched one final, desperate attack against the Balrog, slayer of his father and target of his vengeance....'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: Completing 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty will advance this quest.</rgb>","Dáin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You should talk to Dáin.","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm'","Talk to Dáin at Amdân","The Fall of Khazad-dûm (Weekly)","After many long years, the fearsome Balrog known as Durin's Bane still lurks within the shadows of Khazad-dûm.","Dáin continues the story of Nafni, now near its ending.\
\
'And so Khazad-dûm was abandoned. Thráin I became king, barely older than I am now, and eventually he led our people to Erebor. Nafni earned his title \\qThe Unslain\\q for surviving his second encounter with the Balrog, and he would become a wise advisor and trusted friend to King Thráin. He was a great and noble dwarf of Durin's Folk.'\
\
Dáin appears even more pleased with his most recent recounting of the tale of Nafni the Unslain.\
\
'Khazad-dûm may have been abandoned, but the spirit of Durin's Folk has never dimmed!'","Complete 'The Fall of Khazad-dûm' on any difficulty.\
\
Use the Instance Finder to enter this instance."},
[12137]={"La caída de Moria","'Escucha con atención, ${PLAYER}, y te contaré la historia de la caída de Moria.'","Habla con Ráthwald","'Ya has prestado un gran servicio a nuestra expedición, ${PLAYER}, y no quiero que me hagan responsable si acabas de una... mala manera. La historia de Khazad-dûm es triste y sombría, y Bósi desea que toda persona que ayude a nuestra causa sepa qué podría aguardarle dentro de las minas.\
\
'Te contaré la historia de la caída de Moria, si quieres oírla, y te explicaré por qué los elfos llaman a Khazad-dûm \\qMoria\\q: \\qFoso Oscuro.\\q\
\
'Escucha bien, y si aun así quieres seguir a los enanos dentro de Moria, lo hablaremos.'","Como has ayudado enormemente a los enanos de la expedición de Bósi y Brogur, quieren asegurarse de que conoces la historia de la caída de Moria antes de seguir colaborando con ellos.","Ráthwald está junto al arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnann en Eregion.\
\
Ráthwald te ha contado la historia de la caída de Moria y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Ráthwald está junto al arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnann en Eregion.\
\
Has ayudado mucho a los enanos de la expedición y ahora deberías regresar con Ráthwald para oír la historia de la caída de Moria.","'Nos has ayudado enormemente, ${PLAYER}, y nos has apoyado en muchísimas tareas. Has hecho posible la exploración tanto de la Gruta de las Aguas Negras como de Filgogân en busca de amistades perdidas y tesoros ocultos, y has resistido con valentía las amenazas que había dentro.\
\
'Pero las salas y cavernas de Khazad-dûm pueden albergar un peligro aún mayor, y quiero que sepas en qué te metes antes de seguirnos más allá de las Puertas de Durin.\
\
'Regresa con Ráthwald, que hace guardia junto al campamento de Echad Dúnann, y pídele que te cuente la historia de la caída de Moria. Hablará de tiempos oscuros, pero debes conocer esa historia antes de adentrarte en la oscuridad, aunque te lleve a pensar mal de Khazad-dûm... aunque espero que no sea así.'","Habla con Ráthwald y escucha la historia de la caída de Moria","'Ya nos has prestado un gran servicio, camarada, pero hay algo que debes saber sobre las Minas antes de acompañar a la Guarnición de Hierro a las montañas. Habla conmigo si estás dispuesto a oír lo que tengo que decir.'","'Aunque Náin y los suyos se alzaron contra el gran mal que mató a Durin, no resistieron mucho: Náin murió a manos de la sombra al año siguiente y los enanos se vieron obligados a abandonar Khazad-dûm. Muchos de los elfos silvanos huyeron de Lothlórien aterrados por ese miedo innombrable, marchando hacia el sur y maldiciendo a los enanos a su paso.\
\
'De vez en cuando, se sabe de algún enano valiente que busca esas salas. El señor Balin es el caso más reciente, pero pese a algunos informes alentadores poco después de la llegada de su expedición, hace muchos años que no sabemos nada de él y empezamos a desesperar de volver a encontrarlo.\
\
'Bósi teme que haya perecido, pero podría ser que Balin siga con vida en alguna sala profunda. Es posible, pero mis pensamientos se parecen a los de Bósi. Gracias por escuchar la historia, camarada. Ahora ves cuán importante es esta expedición para mi pueblo.'","Ráthwald está junto al arco, cerca del campamento de Echad Dúnann en Eregion.\
\
Ráthwald ha aceptado contarte la historia de la caída de Moria.","'Nos has ayudado enormemente, ${PLAYER}, y nos has apoyado en muchísimas tareas. Nos has ayudado a explorar tanto la Gruta de las Aguas Negras como Filgogân en busca de amistades perdidas y tesoros ocultos, y te has mantenido firme ante las amenazas del interior.\
\
'Pero las salas y cavernas de Khazad-dûm pueden albergar un peligro aún mayor, y quiero que sepas en qué te metes antes de seguirnos más allá de las Puertas de Durin.\
\
'Regresa con Ráthwald, que hace guardia junto al campamento de Echad Dúnann, donde el camino pasa bajo el viejo arco élfico, y pídele que te cuente la historia de la caída de Moria. Fueron tiempos oscuros, pero debes conocer esa historia, aunque ya la hayas oído antes.'"},
[12138]={"'Te contaré la historia de la caída de Moria, si quieres escucharla. Quizás algún día tu papel en nuestra expedición para recuperar este lugar sea una narrativa importante para un nuevo relato, ¿eh?\
\
'Te advierto: es una historia triste. Solo ahora nos esforzamos por darle un final más feliz.'","'Aunque Náin y sus parientes se enfrentaron al gran mal que mató a Durin, no resistieron mucho tiempo: Náin fue asesinado por la sombra al año siguiente y los enanos se vieron obligados a abandonar Khazad-dûm. Muchos de los Elfos Silvanos abandonaron Lothlórien con ira y miedo, huyendo hacia el sur y maldiciendo a los enanos a su paso.\
\
'Gracias por escuchar la historia, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Ahora ves la importancia de esta expedición para mi pueblo.'","La caída de Moria","'Escucha con atención, ${PLAYER}, y te contaré la historia de la caída de Moria.'","Skygni desea contarte la historia de la caída de Moria para que puedas apreciar mejor lo que ha logrado la expedición.","Habla con Skygni y escucha la historia de la caída de Moria","Habla con Skygni","Skygni se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Skygni te ha contado la historia de la caída de Moria y está esperando para hablar contigo.","Skygni se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera de Moria.\
\
Skygni ha accedido a contarte la historia de la caída de Moria."},
[12139]={"'¿Por qué deseas hablar conmigo?'","'No hay muchos vivos que puedan afirmar haber visto un Balrog, y mucho menos haber derrotado a uno en combate. Conozco a solo uno en la Tierra Media que pueda afirmar lo último.'","Habla con Glorfindel","'Habla con Glorfindel y cuéntale sobre tu victoria contra el Balrog Thaurlach.'","Elrond se encuentra en la Última Morada en Rivendel, en el Bosque de los Trolls, lejos al sur de Angmar.\
\
Has derrotado al Balrog Thaurlach y deberías informar a Elrond Medio-Elfo de tus hazañas.","Has derrotado a Thaurlach y tienes en tu posesión un eslabón roto de la gran cadena que una vez mantuvo al Balrog en su prisión.","Glorfindel se encuentra afuera de la Última Morada, junto al Bruinen.\
\
Elrond te sugirió que hablaras con Glorfindel sobre la derrota de Thaurlach, ya que la historia le concierne mucho.","'Este gran eslabón roto formaba parte de la gran cadena que mantenía al Balrog Thaurlach prisionero. Te preguntas si quizás deberías llevarlo y las noticias de la derrota del Balrog al Maestro Elrond en Rivendel.'","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYER}! ¿Qué es esto que dices? ¿Has encontrado la prisión del Balrog Thaurlach?\
\
'Es bueno que lo hayas derrotado. Hace mucho tiempo fue encadenado, aunque debería haber sido destruido. No fue con sabiduría que se le perdonó.\
\
'Pero esa es una larga historia, llena de tristeza. Deberías hablar con Glorfindel, ya que esto le concierne mucho. Puedes encontrarlo afuera, junto al Bruinen, cerca de las cascadas.'","La caída de Thaurlach","'¡Te saludo y doy la bienvenida, ${PLAYER}! ¿Entiendo que deseas hablar conmigo?'"},
[12140]={"Tarandir se encuentra en las ruinas de una antigua torre de vigilancia en Caras Gelebren, en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Has encontrado a un solitario elfo vistiendo una ornamentada armadura, de pie entre las ruinas de Caras Gelebren. El elfo, Tarandir, se ha ofrecido a contarte la historia de la perdición de Caras Gelebren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar la Escaramuza: La perdición de Caras Gelebren. Si aún no has completado el tutorial de Escaramuza, debes visitar cualquier Campamento de Escaramuza y hablar con el Capitán de Escaramuza. Estos campamentos pueden encontrarse por toda la Tierra Media, en lugares como Bree, la Puerta de Thorin, Ost Guruth y Rivendel.</rgb>","Escucha la historia de Tarandir y completa 'La perdición de Caras Gelebren'","'Y ese es el final de la historia, ${PLAYER}. Aunque no le vi caer, Faeldor está perdido. Mi hermano contuvo al enemigo a las puertas de Caras Gelebren tanto como pudo... y desearía poder haber tenido tiempo de decirle lo orgulloso que estaba de él en ese momento. Pero nunca hay tiempo, ¿verdad? Incluso para los Eldar...\
\
'Aunque la guerra continuó durante años, tanto yo como los otros supervivientes de mi linaje encontramos refugio en Imladris. Con el tiempo, lo que éramos se desvaneció, como si los Mírdain no debieran ser nombrados como tales entre los Elfos. Como si la mancha del Enemigo no pudiera ser limpiada de nuestras manos.'\
\
Tarandir niega con la cabea.\
\
'¿Podría pedirte algo?\
\
'Viaja hasta la ciudad, ponte frente a las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain y escucha. Es todo lo que pido.''","Tarandir se encuentra en las ruinas de una antigua torre de vigilancia en Caras Gelebren, en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Has hecho lo que Tarandir te pidió, escuchando ante las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain. Debes volver con Tarndir.","Tarandir se encuentra en las ruinas de una antigua torre de vigilancia en Caras Gelebren, en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
Has escuchado el relato de Tarandir sobre la perdición de Caras Gelebren. Debes hablar con Tarandir.","Saludos, viajero. ¿Qué te ha traído a este lugar?'\
\
Te presentas y le hablas al elfo sobre tus aventuras en Ciénaga de los Cisnes.\
\
'Soy Tarandir, de los Mírdain, y he venido a Caras Gelebren en una última peregrinación antes de dejar la Tierra Media. ¿Conoces la historia de este lugar? Ha estado en paz durante muchos años, tanto antes como después de su destrucción, pero ahora los orcos caminan por ella de nuevo. Entristece mi corazón pensar que este mal pueda permanecer aquí después de mi partida.\
\
'Yo estuve aquí cuando cayó hace mucho tiempo, ${PLAYER}, y aunque es una historia triste me gustaría compartirla contigo.\
\
'¿La escucharás, amigo?'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar la Escaramuza: La perdición de Caras Gelebren. Si aún no has completado el tutorial de Escaramuza, debes visitar cualquier Campamento de Escaramuza y hablar con el Capitán de Escaramuza. Estos campamentos pueden encontrarse por toda la Tierra Media, en lugares como Bree, la Puerta de Thorin, Ost Guruth y Rivendel.</rgb>","Habla con Tarandir","'¿No has escuchado nada, verdad?\
\
Es una gran pena, una que no se vuelve menos dolorosa con el paso del tiempo. En su día habrías escuchado canciones de yunques y cinceles, de risa y amistad, pero ya no. Todo lo que queda de Caras Gelebren... de Tham Mírdain... de la vieja Mirobel son ruinas y recuerdos aciagos.\
\
'Cuando pronto me marche de este reino, ¿sanarán estas heridas? No puedo asegurarlo, mas temo la respuesta pues ninguna se antoja apropiada, ni como don ni como castigo.'\
\
Tarandir hace una pausa. Su mirada se posa sobre las ruinas del distrito inferior de Caras Gelebren. Después de un largo momento, se gira hacia ti.\
\
'Te doy las gracias por escuchar mi historia, ${PLAYER}. Ha hecho bien a mi espíritu contarla una vez más en la Tierra Media.\
\
'Ah, una cosa más... una advertencia, si te place escucharla. La mano del Enemigo, aunque mutilada, puede que busque aún dar forma a los días venideros en la Tierra Media.\
\
'Ten cuidado con los males de este mundo, amigo mío.''","Viaja a las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain","Las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain se encuentran en el punto más oriental de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Tarandir te ha pedido que te pongas frente a las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain y escuches para honrar la memoria de su gente. Debes encontrar las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain y escuchar para honrar la memoria de los Mírdain.","Hace mucho tiempo, los elfos de Tham Mírdain liderados por Celebrimbor crearon obras grandiosas, pero cuando fueron engañados por el Enemigo, la ruina cayó sobre ellos.","No escuchas nada salvo el viento y el gentil chapoteo cercano del agua...","Las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain se alzan frente a ti","La Caída de los Mírdain","<rgb=#00ff00>Escucha</rgb> en las ruinas de la Casa de los Mírdain"},
[12141]={"'Donde logramos detener su avance aquí, fracasamos en el norte. Esta es una noticia grave. Peor aún es saber que probablemente no evitamos que todos los orcos atravesaran las Tierras de Bree.\
\
'Temo por la vida de los Montaraces que vigilan los pasos y caminos en las regiones meridionales. Continuaré en mi puesto, pero debo pedirte más ayuda.\
\
'Por todos tus esfuerzos hasta ahora, sin embargo, te ofrezco mi agradecimiento y este pequeño símbolo de nuestra gratitud.'","'¡Rápido ahora! Saeradan debe ser informado de lo que hemos aprendido. Esto es de suma importancia.'","La caída de las Quebradas del Norte","Saeradan está en su cabaña, al sur del Viejo Fuerte del Camino Verde.\
\
Andreg te pidió que hablaras con Saeradan sobre la expansión de los orcos desde las Quebradas del Norte.","Habla con Saeradan en su cabaña","'Saeradan debe saber que, aunque nuestros esfuerzos aquí han tenido éxito, no podemos conocer la magnitud de la invasión hacia el sur. También debe saber que nuestros hermanos en el norte no han podido impedir la expansión de las tribus orcas.\
\
'Dirígete al sur por el Camino Verde hasta su cabaña y llévale estas noticias.'","Andreg está preocupado por los orcos que han vulnerado las fronteras de las Tierras de Bree desde las Quebradas del Norte."},
[12142]={"'Our tales say that the Rhi Helvarch came to these lands long ago, and that his power gradually claimed the forest, making it strange and dangerous to the unwary.\
\
'But he has never pursued or hounded us, and the spirits that are drawn to him have rarely disturbed us... but now they have become filled with anger and lash out at any who enter the forest.\
\
'These wild spirits have overrun the circle which lies nearest the Huntsman's hall. If they can be driven away, then perhaps we can beseech the Forest Lords to open the way within.'","'You have fought valiantly, but it does not seem that the spirits can be driven away by brute force. I feared as much.\
\
'We must open the way nevertheless for so we have been bidden.'","'Confront the wild spirits, if you dare, Duvodiad... though I doubt you will succeed.'","Tûm is at the grove atop Gwaed Brun in the Mournshaws, north of Oirnad Culch.\
\
You should return to Tûm with news of your success.","A maddened elhudan spirit has claimed Oirnad Culch, south of Gwaed Brun.\
\
Tûm has asked you to defeat the wild spirits that have overrun the grove the Derudh once called their own.","Talk to Tûm at Gwaed Brun","Defeat the maddened elhudan at Oirnad Culch","Defeated the maddened elhudan","The Derudh Tûm claims that the spirits of the forest have been angered and have driven away the rest of the Derudh. He hopes to reclaim their grove and perhaps help you find the way into the Huntsman's hall.","The Fallen Grove"},
[12143]={"'Look at that. It were as if the army of the Enemy never laid hands upon the statue! Please let Angbor know that we are nearly finished here and might march with the Host of the West when they depart. I thank you again for you help.'","The Fallen King Renewed","'These stones will do nicely. You have a keen eye. I will give them to the builders. If you would not mind, use some of that water you collected to clean the posts around the Cross-roads. Then use the remaining water to clean the scrawls from the statue itself.'","Collect suitable stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cleaned Gondorian post (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","With the Host of the West on the march, Angbor has been given orders to mend the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue finally shines after many years of neglect and vandalism","Suitable stone can be found in and around after-battle Osgiliath. Suitable water can be found along the Anduin nearby.\
\
You should collect some stone for mending the Statue of the Fallen King and water for washing away the scrawls and filth.","Collected suitable stone (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected clean water (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Angbor","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should clean the Gondorian posts around the Statue of the Fallen King.","Collect clean water (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'There is still much to be done before this statue is repaired. Our workers are in need of some good stone to fill the cracks. Would you retrieve some for us? You should be able to find suitable stones in Osgiliath, along the banks of the Anduin.\
\
'While you are at the river's edge, you might also take up some good water, with which to clean these foul scrawlings off the statue.'","Talk to Arandol","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should clean the Statue of the Fallen King.","You should talk to Arandol, who  can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.","You should talk to Angbor, who can be found at the Cross-roads.","'Ah, the statue has come along nicely. I am certain you were a great help and an example to the men.'","Clean the scrawls and filth from off the statue","Clean Gondorian posts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads."},
[12144]={"Talk to Arandol","You should talk to Arandol, who can be found by the statue at the after-battle Cross-roads.","'You completed all those tasks? One alone would have put us ahead of schedule! Perhaps we shall be allowed to march on from this place, thanks to you!'","'When you are able, speak with Arandol near the Statue of the Fallen King. He is in charge of the statue repairs and will be able to put you to work in assisting our efforts here.'","The Fallen King in Ruin","Retrieve the statue's original head","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should retrieve the original head of the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should place the original head upon the Statue of the Fallen King.","'Yes, I am Arandol. As you can see, the repairs are behind schedule. Orcs have defiled the statue, removed the head, and scrawled unintelligible markings all over it.\
\
'First those Orkish poles will need to be removed, then that vile head must come down. If you are able, the statue's original head should be retrieved and placed back atop its shoulders.","You should talk to Arandol, who can be found at the after-battle Cross-roads.","Place the original head upon the statue","Removed Orkish pole (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","With the Host of the West on the march, Angbor has been given orders to mend the Statue of the Fallen King.","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should break the defiled head upon the Statue of the Fallen King.","Remove Orkish poles (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The statue is at the after-battle Cross-roads.\
\
You should remove the Orkish poles placed around the Statue of the Fallen King.","Break the defiled statue head"},
[12148]={"The prince has retreated into the Palace of Ekal-nêbi. He must be pursed and defeated for Mizâdi to claim victory.","'I will lead a small force into the palace and present Góramul Sai with a choice: surrender... or die. I would like you to be a part of that force, ${PLAYER}. Gather your strongest allies, and meet me inside the threshold. We must face the prince, and learn the true identity of this... Thothril the Entangler.'","Góramul Sai has been defeated, and Thothril the Entangler has retreated.\
\
You should talk to Mizâdi.","Complete 'Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace' on any difficulty","Talk to Mizâdi","'We have won! The Sai lies dead, the Thardúth retreats, and Emax Dûl is finally ours! Now, I must turn my attention back to the hunt for that snake, Bârshud.\
\
'We would not have been victorious in our campaign in Idagâl without your help, ${PLAYER}. Hamât Renewed is once again in your debt.'","The Fallen Palace","Mizâdi has requested your help tracking down and defeating Góramul Sai inside the palace.\
\
You should complete 'Ekal-nêbi, the Fallen Palace' on any difficulty using the Instance Finder."},
[12149]={"Search for the lost Ranger inside the Dome of Stars","The Fallen Stars","The Ranger's body is battered and contorted as if he were dropped from a great height...","Golthor can be found outside the old Houses of Healing in north-eastern Osgiliath.\
\
You found the Ranger, but it was too late to save him. You should return to Golthor with these grim tidings.","The Dome of Stars can be found in central Osgiliath.\
\
Golthor has asked you to seek a Ranger who travelled toward the Dome of Stars. You should begin your search by the eastern bridge onto the island.","'I thought as much, ${PLAYER}. You need not say more...'\
\
Golthor shakes his head.\
\
'Those fell-beasts and their dark riders seem to delight in dropping the wounded from above - Man and Orc alike. Let us hope that no others must suffer this sorry fate.'","Talk to Golthor","You have found the bridge and should now search for the lost Ranger","Fearing for the life of his fellow, Golthor sends you to investigate the ruined Dome of Stars, a once-beautiful palace now twisted into a vile stronghold of the Enemy.","Search for the eastern bridge to the Dome of Stars","'${PLAYER}, one of my fellows is lost and I fear what may have befallen him. The Easterlings spotted him as we moved here, and our paths diverged as they gave chase.\
\
'When last I saw him, he made for the eastern bridge into the old Dome of Stars, but I hope his pursuers did not drive him there... for all manner of evil things have taken hold of it.\
\
'You are a hardy ${CLASS} and might be able to bear the dread that surrounds the Dome. Will you search for him there? I will not abandon him until I am assured of his fate, but death has not been a stranger to our men in these dark days.'","The Ranger is likely somewhere within the Dome of Stars.\
\
You did not find the Ranger outside the Dome of Stars, and should now carefully search within it."},
[12150]={"Defeated Corrupted Swordsmen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Corrupted Swordsmen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Corrupted Soldier (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Fallen Within","Defeated Corrupted Archers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Corrupted Gondorian Soliders can be found deep within Anglach: The Great Foundry.\
\
You should put these poor souls to rest.","Defeat Corrupted Soldier (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Corrupted Archers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A notice hangs from the board, stamped with the royal seal of Gondor:\
\
'It has been discovered that some of Captain Lachír's men remain in Anglach, corrupted beyond hope. It is with sadness we request an adventurer enter Anglach and put these poor souls to rest. Seek out Candúr at the Udûn Foothold for passage into Anglach.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Anglach: The Great Foundry to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gondorian soldiers have fallen to the corruption within Anglach. An adventurer is needed to brave the depths and put these poor souls to rest."},
[12151]={"You brought the deer to Raphûz. He bound his wound and said he would take the deer back to Iridír and secure medicine to heal the deer. He asked you to visit him in Iridír.","The deer lay before you, injured, but alive. You dealt with the serval. You should lift the fallow deer and deliver it to Raphûz.","Speak with Raphûz outside of the serval sire's den","Defeat the serval sire, Buzanbûri","Servals slain (${NUMBER}/8)","Raphûz is injured and asked you to rescue the deer","Defeat servals in their den north-west of Iridír (${NUMBER}/8)","The Fallow Deer","Speak with Raphûz at Iridír","'Do not worry after me. I will bind my wound and be ready to leave this place. Quickly, the beast and deer are up ahead. Defeat the serval and rescue the deer.'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I have earned some coins since arriving in Iridír. I will share them with you. I will also mark an entry in my records for the Phetekâri.'","The deer stirs and begins to follow you.\
\
Bring the deer to Raphûz.","'Do not worry about me, ${PLAYER}. My wound is minor. I need to bind it. The serval sire is nearby. Can you slay it? Then, rescue the deer and return it to me.'","'${PLAYER}, I overheard a remarkable story.\
\
'A merchant delivered his daughter's prized pet to a man here in Ambarûl. The merchant believed the spirit of his deceased wife inhabited the deer and an Ambarûli man pledged he would free the woman's spirit.\
\
'The Ambarûli man lies and instead plans to sacrifice the deer to a serval sire plaguing him. The daughter came to Ambarûl to collect her pet. The descriptions of the woman match the woman we saw near Telperiën's wall.\
\
'I found the serval pride's den. I need help rescuing the deer. The den is north-west of Iridír, east of Telperiën's wall. Will you meet me there and help me rescue the woman's pet?'","You delivered the deer to Raphûz","Raphûz recounts a tale he overheard while travelling to Iridír of a woman searching for her pet deer traded to a man meant to free her mother's spirit from the creature.","Buzanbûri, the serval sire, has been defeated","You fought your way through the servals. Find Raphûz outside of the den and speak with him.","Raphûz asked you to assist him in saving a deer from being sacrificed to a serval sire in a den north-west of Iridír. He will meet you near the den where the deer is kept.","Raphûz is injured and cannot assist with fighting the serval. He asked you to enter the den to defeat the serval and recover the deer.","Rescue the deer and bring it to Raphûz","'The deer was taken to a serval den north-west of Iridír. I will meet you there and we can rescue the deer together.'"},
[12152]={"Derrota a Igash","Avar se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Avar e informarle de que has dado muerte a Igash y a su Devoto.","'Podría haber otras formas de derrotar a Igash y a su Devoto. Sé que Thithrand ha dicho que cree que la Mano Blanca podría estar planeando un asalto contra los orcos de Moria. Aun así, sería conveniente debilitar al enemigo ahora, pues Igash extrae su poder de las fuerzas que le rinden tributo.\
\
'Todo esto me resulta muy extraño, ${PLAYER}.'","'Sé poco sobre Igash… solo que es seguido sin cuestionamiento alguno y que su Devoto no parece ser más que un orco corriente de voluntad débil. Entre ambos mantienen a muchas tribus bajo un puño de hierro, dando órdenes y tomando lo que desean sin oposición.\
\
'Igash dirige a sus fuerzas desde lo más alto, y el camino hasta él debería estar despejado. Cruza los viejos puentes y asciende hasta la plataforma más elevada. Allí, sospecho, se sentará vanidoso en su tosco trono. Pero ten cuidado… su Devoto vigilará el camino.\
\
'Avanza hacia el noreste, ${PLAYER}. Allí deberás internarte en la Gran Escalera y derrotar a Igash y a su Devoto. Pero mantente alerta, pues los peldaños se elevan a gran altura; un mal paso sería tu perdición. Solo quienes tengan paso firme deberían arriesgarse en esta empresa. Que los senderos de los enanos guíen bien tus pasos.'","Igash derrotado","Igash y su Devoto se encuentran en lo alto de la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Avar te ha pedido que avances y derrotes a Igash y a su Devoto.","Habla con Avar en la Guardia Orca","'Espero que este desafío no te haya resultado excesivamente difícil, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Igash obtiene su fuerza de quienes habitan la Gran Escalera, apropiándose de sus habilidades mientras aún viven. Sin duda eso lo convierte en un enemigo terrible al que enfrentarse, pero ¿cómo podríamos obtener el tributo que conserva si no es derrotándolo mientras los demás siguen con vida?\
\
'Por ahora, te estoy agradecido por haber vencido a este terrible enemigo.'","Derrota al Devoto","Los orcos de Moria controlan la Gran Escalera, liderados por Igash el Fanático y su Devoto esbirro. Junto a ellos se alza una hueste de temibles orcos procedentes de lo más profundo de Moria.","El Devoto derrotado","El Fanático y su Devoto"},
[12153]={"The hill once known as Ondoher's Folly has been fortified into a horrific shrine of the Enemy where Orcs torture and kill their prisoners.","Talk to Laeglaw at Tham Durlan","'What did the Ranger make of that missive, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You inform Laeglaw that Faltor-shík translates to \\qthe Fane of Screaming\\q and what Mincham takes that to mean. His face is aghast for a moment, but he is able to summon his words once more.\
\
'The Fane of Screaming... is this truly the name they have bestowed upon the site of our king's fall? If the Orcs sought to provoke us through insults, I shall let them consider this a victory... but it will be their last.\
\
'It has been long since we moved against the Orcs in the Wastes directly, and I believe it likely an assault would catch them by surprise. I no longer doubt your place among the Rangers, my friend, for you have done much to aid my company and I trust that you would do so again.\
\
'For the sake of our king's memory and for the fallen, ride to Ondoher's Folly and put an end to those Orcs!'","Defeated Orcs at Ondoher's Folly (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have done well, my friend.\
\
'With this accomplished, the Orcs at Ondoher's Folly should no longer pose a threat to the Host of the West or to any that still remain in their thrall.\
\
'Let us hope it was enough, ${PLAYER}.'","Laeglaw can be found due north of Haerondir at Tham Durlan.\
\
You have defeated many of the Orcs at Ondoher's Folly and should now return to Laeglaw.","'Once those Orcs are gone, I would much like to study the location of King Ondoher's fall.\
\
'Steward Denethor's dream has come to pass through the leader of this Host, but I wonder yet why Ondoher's banner came so clearly to his mind.'","Defeat Orcs at Ondoher's Folly (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Fane of Screaming","Orcs can be found throughout Ondoher's Folly in north-western Dagorlad.\
\
Laeglaw has asked you to assault the hill of Ondoher's Folly and defeat the Orcs who have claimed it."},
[12154]={"'Los Orcos pueden no venir si matas al líder de los Angmarim.'","Frith-vailë está en la parte noreste de Ram Dúath.\
\
El líder Tuokki, esperando desanimar a los Orcos y a los Angmarim, te ha pedido que derrotes al Capitán de los Angmarim en Ram Dúath.","El líder Tuokki está en el campamento Suuri-lehmä en Ram Dúath.\
\
Ahora que has derrotado al Capitán de la Corona de Hierro, regresa con el líder de los Hijos de la Tierra y cuéntale de tu hazaña.","El líder Tuokki está preocupado de que los Angmarim que comandan a los Orcos los envíen a luchar contra los Hijos de la Tierra.","La Mano que Alcanza Lejos","'¿El capitán de los Angmarim está muerto? ¡Bien! Quizás los Angmarim envíen otro líder, pero por ahora estamos a salvo.'","'Para ser tan ${PLAYERNAME:pequeño[m]|pequeña[f]}, eres muy ${PLAYERNAME:bueno[m]|buena[f]} matando Orcos. Los Orcos son muchos, pero creemos que cruzan Ram Dúath porque los Hombres les dicen que lo hagan. Hombres malvados del norte, de Angmar, han venido a Ram Dúath.\
\
'Uno de esos Hombres es el líder. Creemos que pronto enviará a los Orcos contra nosotros. No podemos luchar contra ellos en su campamento, son demasiado fuertes, pero tú también eres fuerte. Quizás puedas ayudarnos a luchar contra ese Hombre, ese Capitán de Angmar.\
\
'Los Angmarim tienen un campamento al norte y al este de aquí llamado Frith-vailë.'"},
[12155]={"Prepárate para viajar y disfrutar de la Feria de los Granjeros de este año. ¡Date prisa y únete a los festejos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Completar esta misión te permitirá viajar automáticamente al pueblo de Delagua en la Comarca.</rgb>","¡La Feria de los Granjeros está en Delagua por tiempo limitado!","¡{Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} a la Feria de los Granjeros!","Viaja a Delagua en la Comarca para participar en la celebración de la Feria de los Granjeros","Cada año, los Hobbits de Delagua celebran el final del verano y la abundancia de la cosecha anual organizando una espectacular Feria de los Granjeros en el centro del pueblo. ¡Ven a visitarla y únete a la diversión!","¡Ve con Caltha Tunelero, la Pregonera del Festival en Delagua, para conocer más sobre la Feria anual de los Granjeros! Los Hobbits de Delagua celebran la abundancia del verano con banquetes, pesca y búsqueda de huevos y hongos en las granjas cercanas.","¡Ve con Caltha Tunelero, la Pregonera del Festival en Delagua, para conocer más sobre la Feria anual de los Granjeros! Los Hobbits de la Comarca celebran la abundancia del verano con banquetes, pesca y búsqueda de huevos y hongos en las granjas cercanas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Tras aceptar esta misión, puedes completarla para viajar automáticamente al pueblo de Delagua en la Comarca.</rgb>","¡La Feria de los Granjeros ha llegado!","El mercado rebosa de actividad y el sol calienta. ¡La feria está en todo su esplendor!","Viaja a Delagua"},
[12156]={"Defeated mounted Orcs in the farms of the Norcrofts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'It does not matter how many arrows or swords we have, or how solid and secure our defences, if we do not have food. If the Enemy can starve us, then the battle is lost long before it has even begun. Orcs are bringing this threat to bear upon us even as we speak.\
\
'Head to the farms of Norcrofts and defeat the Orcs who are riding through the fields.'","'A battle well-fought and well-won, but not yet over. They will return... I have no doubt.'","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Hwitnyd is at Cliving.\
\
Hwitnyd will be pleased to hear that you have driven the Orcs from the farms of the Norcrofts.","Defeat mounted Orcs in the farms of the Norcrofts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mounted Orcs are razing the farms of the Norcrofts.","Talk to Hwitnyd","'Are you prepared to battle the Orcs upon the farms of the Norcrofts?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","Mounted Orcs can be found in the farms of the Norcrofts.\
\
Hwitnyd asked you to ride out into the farms of the Norcrofts and defeat the mounted Orcs rampaging through the fields.","The Farms of the Norcrofts"},
[12157]={"Daggaric is at Snowbourn.\
\
Daggaric will be pleased to hear that many of the Warg-riders have been driven from the farms of the Sutcrofts.","'Dinner has been saved.\
\
'I know not what tomorrow will bring but I know that we will greet it with full stomachs.'","'Most of our food comes from the farms just to the north of here, but that supply is being gravely threatened. A pack of Warg-riders has been rampaging through the fields, destroying our crops and threatening our much-needed food.\
\
'Head out into the farms of the Sutcrofts and drive these goblins and their Wargs from our fields.'","'Are you ready to join the battle with the Enemy at the farms of the Sutcrofts?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","The Farms of the Sutcrofts","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Warg-riders can be found at the farms of the Sutcrofts.\
\
Daggaric asked you to head to the farms of the Sutcrofts and defeat the Warg-riders rampaging through the fields.","Defeated Warg-riders at the farms of the Sutcrofts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Goblin-riders are riding through the farms of the Sutcrofts, destroying needed food and crops.","Defeat Warg-riders at the farms of the Sutcrofts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Daggaric"},
[12158]={"'Hola, ¿puedo ayudarte en algo?'","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","'Vaya, me sorprende que hayas venido a recoger el paquete que te dejó la Reina de la Moda. ¡Pocas personas son capaces de soportar la vergüenza que provoca su mal gusto! Sin embargo, por tu aspecto, se nota que no eres de los que se preocupan mucho por lo que los demás piensen de ellos.\
\
'Quizás, después de llevarte lo que te dejó la Reina de la Moda, ¿podrías echarle un vistazo a mi tienda? ¡Seguro que no te vendría mal!'","En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien juzgó tu apariencia y la encontró deficiente.","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. El texto continúa diciendo que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda"},
[12159]={"En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien evaluó tu apariencia y te encontró deslumbrante, ¡un verdadero parangón de la moda!","'Hola, ¿puedo ayudarte en algo?'","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. También señala que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Ceoeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","'¡Cielos, estás muy bien ${PLAYER:vestido[m]|vestida[f]}! Ahora entiendo por qué la Reina de la Moda te juzgó tan favorablemente. Poco puedo ofrecer para mejorar tu apariencia, más allá del reconocimiento que tan merecidamente recibes por tu extraordinario buen gusto.\
\
'Gracias, ${PLAYER}, por honrarme con tu presencia. Me has mostrado todo lo que es posible lograr con una apariencia cuidadosamente elegida.'","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre"},
[12160]={"Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda","'¡Oh, hola! ¿Has recibido uno de los pergaminos de la Reina de la Moda, eh? Bueno, ahora entiendo por qué juzgó que tu apariencia era... digamos, deficiente. Sin embargo, aún hay esperanza para ti, así que elige uno de los regalos que la Reina dejó para ti. Quizá la próxima vez tenga una mejor opinión de ti, ¿no?'","En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien juzgó tu apariencia y la encontró deficiente.","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. El texto continúa diciendo que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","'Sí, ¿puedo ayudarte en algo?'","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre"},
[12161]={"Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre para intercambiarlo por el paquete que la Reina dejó para ti. Puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","El Pergamino de la Reina de la Moda","'¡Oh, hola! ¿Has recibido uno de los pergaminos de la Reina de la Moda, eh? Bueno, ahora entiendo por qué juzgó que tu apariencia era... digamos, deficiente. Sin embargo, aún hay esperanza para ti, así que elige uno de los regalos que la Reina dejó para ti. Quizá la próxima vez tenga una mejor opinión de ti, ¿no?'","En algún momento llamaste la atención de la Reina de la Moda, quien juzgó tu apariencia y la encontró deficiente.","Este pergamino, redactado con gran elegancia, te indica que lo lleves a un sastre, quien lo intercambiará por un paquete que la Reina de la Moda dejó para ti. El texto continúa diciendo que puedes encontrar sastres en Celondim, Cepeda, Puente de Caballetes, Othrikar, Rivendel, la Mansión de Thorin, Cavada Grande y Bree.","'Sí, ¿puedo ayudarte en algo?'","Lleva el pergamino de la Reina de la Moda a un sastre"},
[12162]={"Return to Mulnír at the Foothold","You have found Captain Lachír. He, in turn, has found ingots of metal he believes are imbued with great power, and ordered his men to gather all they could find.","The Fatal Prize","Return to Mulnír","Talk to Captain Lachír","'We found quite a store of these, tucked away. I knew the moment I laid sight on them what they were. They are heavy. I have set my men to bearing them here. They have made many trips already. When we have all of it, we will rig a pulley to get it up.\
\
'You see? I have it all worked out. At last, everything is falling into place.'","You tell Mulnír all that took place in Anglach, of Lachír's growing fixation and of his frenzied end. \
\
After a long moment, Mulnír nods.\
\
'It is worse than I feared. Worse by far. But I will tell you this, ${CLASS}: I believe that flaw was always in the Captain's character. Udûn was but the flood that showed us the weakness in the flood-wall.\
\
'You did all you could - more than most men would be capable of. We are in a hostile land and peril is ever at a soldier's heels. Only this - this was an awful sort of peril, was it not?'","'My men should be here any moment with more ingots. Wait with me. You will see!'","You should talk to Captain Lachír in Anglach, in Udûn, to learn what will happen next."},
[12163]={"Patrol the gate of Durthang in Lhingris","You have discovered the terrible aftermath of a battle between the warriors of Durthang and the spiders of Lhingris...","The Fate of Durthang","'Come to gloat, have you? Well, you won't have long....'\
\
The Uruk coughs hard and dark blood runs from his mouth.","Talk to the dying Uruk at Durthang","After realising that Orcs were fleeing Durthang into Lhingris, Legolas desires to learn what happened at the gate of the fortress.","'This is troubling, ${PLAYER}. What could have driven some of the Orcs from Durthang?\
\
'If it were merely the spiders of Lhingris, Ugrukhôr would have sealed the gate and thought no more of it. No, it had to be something unexpected! But what?\
\
'${PLAYER}, patrol the road to the gate of Durthang and learn what you can of what has happened. I think there is more to this than it seems....\
\
'Go swiftly! I shall keep watch on the road!'","The gate of Durthang can be found on the road in Lhingris to the north of the ruined encampment.\
\
Legolas has asked you to patrol Durthang and learn what has transpired between the Orcs and spiders there.","The dying Uruk can be found near the gate of Durthang in Lhingris.\
\
You have arrived to find the aftermath of a bloody battle between the warriors of Durthang and the spiders of Lhingris. An Uruk nearby with grave wounds may be able to explain what happened."},
[12164]={"'Oh no, that is Honey-bell's bell! Where did you find it? In a warg-den? Tragedy indeed, ${PLAYER}! She was such a good girl, faithful bovine companion, supplier of milk and cheese! We will mourn, not just for the products with which she supplied us but also for her dear loving and sweet demeanour. Poor Honey-bell, to perish in this way!'\
\
Sterkist squints into the distance, looking at the far gate.\
\
'One moment. Is that Haldis I see? And who is that with her?'","'I have run into something of a snag with one of my tasks, and I tell you it may be a sign of something much worse! I have been keeping to the safety of the Beorninghús ever since the recent troubles, and feeding the cows seemed enough to keep me here. All of the animals have now been fed, save one, for Honey-bell is gone! Ha. It may be time to save one, indeed.\
\
'Honey-bell may just have wandered off, but if she has, she has gone further than I would like to be searching. Help me find her!'","Haldis can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Haldis about where she found Honey-bell.","'You are a friend of Sterkist? I see that you found Honey-bell's bell! I took her out for a walk in the sunshine earlier today, for she seemed quite agitated about something and I thought a walk might do her some good. Her bell must have fallen off sometime while we were away and I did not notice it was missing until we returned.\
\
'You found her bell in a warg den? I must say I am grateful you found the bell only, with no cow attached, and that Honey-bell was safe with me, and I with her! I am surprised Sterkist did not see us. We must have just missed one another.'","Find some sign of Honey-bell in the Beorning-lands","Honey-bell can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should give Honey-bell a good pat.","Sterkist can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Sterkist.","The Fate of Honey-bell","What a friendly cow!","'Haldis took Honey-bell for a walk? It seems I sent you chasing for wild goose and worried myself for nothing! I am sorry, but the darkness that has settled upon the vales has me all on edge. I shall focus on my next task, which must surely cause me no alarm. How worrisome could mushrooms possibly be?'","Talk to Haldis","This bell belonged to Honey-bell, but its presence belies her absence","Give Honey-bell a good <rgb=#00FF00>pat</rgb>","Honey-bell is probably somewhere in the Beorning-lands, beyond Sterkist's sight.\
\
You should find some sign of Honey-bell's wanderings.","Talk to Sterkist","Sterkist has been tasked with feeding the cows, but he has run into a bit of a snag: one of them is missing.","Bring Honey-bell's bell to Sterkist","Sterkist can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should show Sterkist the bell you found."},
[12165]={"Nimithil can be found in Ost Anglebed in north-central Lebennin.\
\
You have searched Lornost thoroughly and discovered the cause for its fall. You should return to Nimithil and tell her what you have learned.","The note, crafted by the people of Lornost, contains a determined refusal to surrender","The Fate of Lornost","Travel to Lornost to the south-east of Ost Anglebed","The note is speared into a man's chest in the north-western corner of Lornost in Lebennin.\
\
You have not found any survivors, but you have discovered a note on a fallen man. You should examine it before returning to Ost Anglebed.","This paper is singed beyond recognition...","Lornost can be found to the south-east of Ost Anglebed in Lebennin.\
\
You have not found any sign of survivors or the Enemy outside of a paper from the Scourge. You should continue your search deeper in Lornost.","You have arrived at Lornost and should investigate the sacked settlement","'The fate that befell Lornost is deeply troubling, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'They were attacked in the night by the Haradrim, but none of us knew how brutal the assault had been until the morning. I wish to learn more of what occurred in Lornost, but the Steward has sent no men into the field. He claims that the Haradrim are too numerous, but they shall only gain might the longer we delay. And what of the folk that were slain... shall they lie where they fell?\
\
'Travel to the east, and see if you can discover more about what drove the Haradrim to Lornost.'","You discover a slain man with a note speared to his chest...","'The Heirs are unafraid to deliver on their threats - that much is clear.\
\
'If they come to Ost Anglebed, words shall not be enough... we must be ready for battle! The Steward must be told of this!'","Collect the note from the fallen man of Lornost","Deliver the news of Lornost to Nimithil in Ost Anglebed","Search deeper in Lornost","Brought to ruin by a combined force of Corsairs and Haradrim, Lornost was once a beautiful settlement of Lebennin.","Collect singed papers in Lornost (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Lornost can be found to the south-east of Anglebed across the river Sarni.\
\
Nimithil has asked you to search the sacked settlement of Lornost for any sign of survivors or the Enemy.","Singed papers can be found throughout Lornost in Lebennin.\
\
You have not found any survivors, but singed papers swirl through the air nearby. You should see if they contain any useful information.","This paper details an offer of peace if the people of Lornost surrender their lands"},
[12166]={"'Dios mío, puede que me haya adelantado. Bueno, me alegra que la anciana esté a salvo. Siento mucho haberte molestado por esto. Toma estas monedas, y te agradecería que no se lo comentaras a nadie.'","El destino de Prunella Boffin","'Mi tía Prunella es una dama tan respetable como cualquiera podría esperar conocer, pero me preocupa que haya hecho algo un poco imprudente y que ahora pueda estar en graves problemas. ¡Había estado escuchando a esa chica Tunelero, y antes de que pudieras decir \\qtrasgos-en-la-Comarca?\\q, se había ido a ver las criaturas por sí misma!\
\
'No sé qué haría si mi querida tía realmente se encontrara con trasgos. ¿Podrías ir a buscarla? Rumores dicen que hay trasgos en el noroeste de los Campos Verdes.\
\
'Tante Prunella tenía un bonito paraguas que llevaba a todas partes, incluso los días soleados, así que si ves a un trasgo con un paraguas, bueno....'","Fosco Boffin está en Scary, cerca del centro del pueblo.\
\
Fosco se mostró inquieto cuando recuperaste el paraguas de su tía Prunella; sin embargo, una vecina le informó que en realidad la había estado visitando todo el día y que Prunella había perdido su paraguas horas antes. Fosco hace señas para que te acerques.","Puede haber trasgos en el noroeste de los Campos Verdes. Si uno de ellos se llevó el paraguas de la tía Prunella, podría estar en alguno de sus campamentos.\
\
Prometiste a Fosco Boffin que buscarías el paraguas de su tía Prunella. Él teme que ella se haya topado con trasgos.","'¿Ya encontraste el paraguas de la tía Prunella?'","'¡Oh no! ¡Has encontrado el paraguas de la tía Prunella! Temía que fuera así.\
\
'¡Mi pobre y vieja tía! Era una mujer dura, pero yo solía visitarla todo el tiempo, al menos una vez cada pocos meses. ¡La extrañaremos todos, estoy seguro! ¡Scary es más pobre por su pérdida!'","Recoge el paraguas de Prunella","'Si encuentras el paraguas de la tía Prunella en poder de alguno de los trasgos que se colaron en la Comarca por los Campos Verdes... bueno, eso no es nada bueno.'","Encuentra el paraguas de la tía Prunella","'Supongo que no conviene ser demasiado precipitado. Lección aprendida, ¿de acuerdo?'","Entrega el paraguas de Prunella a Fosco Boffin","'Los trasgos son asunto peligroso, aunque en esta ocasión en particular la tía Prunella no estuvo en peligro.'","Fosco Boffin está en Scary, cerca del centro del pueblo.\
\
Prometiste a Fosco Boffin que buscarías el paraguas de su tía Prunella. Él teme que ella se haya encontrado con trasgos.","Fosco Boffin, en Scary, está preocupado por su tía, una hobbit respetable llamada Prunella."},
[12168]={"El destino del Ectheldur","Has llegado a las Agujas de la Linde y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Viaja a las Agujas de la Linde","Viaja a Men Erain","Saqueadores de tumbas derrotados en Rantost (8/8)","'¿Notaste algo interesante durante tu inspección, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
Le cuentas a Tarneth que, según tu inspección, algunas de las marcas en el mapa de Naegir parecen corresponder a islas del Lago Evendim. Sin embargo, los lugares señalados parecen indicar islas y otras tierras que desde entonces han sido cubiertas por las aguas del Lago Evendim. Tarneth toma el mapa y lo estudia una vez más.\
\
'¡Espera un momento, si esa marca es correcta, creo que podemos haber encontrado los restos del Ectheldur! No hay tiempo para explicarlo, ${PLAYER}. ¡Hay una isla cerca de una de estas marcas, y sospecho que allí encontraremos lo que buscamos!'","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde Tyl Ruinen","Los Montaraces del Norte en Evendim han buscado durante mucho tiempo los restos del Ectheldur, el antiguo navío-insignia de Annúminas, pero sus esfuerzos no han pasado desapercibidos por un grupo de saqueadores de tumbas del sur.","Tarneth se encuentra en Tinnudir, a orillas del Lago Evendim.","Deberías examinar el mapa de Naegir y ver si notas algo más que Tarneth haya pasado por alto.","Habla con Tarneth","En efecto, el Lago Evendim parece haber subido, pero estas marcas apuntan a Annúminas","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde las Agujas de la Linde","Viaja a Tyl Ruinen","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde Tinnudir","'Según lo que hemos aprendido, los saqueadores de tumbas se han reunido en Rantost. Si los restos del Ectheldur estuvieran allí, los habríamos encontrado hace mucho tiempo, así que deben tener otro propósito en las ruinas.\
\
Llegar a Rantost no es un viaje sencillo, pero eres ${PLAYERNAME:un Marinero experimentado[m]|una Marinera experimentada[f]}, ¿no es así? El Lago Evendim es vasto, sin duda, pero es solo una gota en el Gran Mar.\
\
Expulsa a los saqueadores de tumbas de Rantost y fíjate si alguno lleva algo de importancia. ¡Parece que debemos recordarles una vez más que no tienen ningún derecho sobre las ruinas de Arnor!'","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde Men Erain","Has llegado a Tinnudir y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Tarneth te ha pedido inspeccionar el Lago Evendim desde varios lugares usando su catalejo.\
\
Debes viajar a Tinnudir, las Agujas de la Linde, Men Erain y la isla de Tyl Ruinen para inspeccionar el Lago Evendim. Puedes inspeccionar el lago cerca de los maestros de muelle en cada uno de estos lugares.","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde Tyl Ruinen","¡Este saqueador de tumbas parecía llevar un extraño mapa!","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde las Agujas de la Linde","Derrota a saqueadores de tumbas en Rantost (${NUMBER}/8)","'¡Vamos! ¡Debemos llegar al Ectheldur antes de que los saqueadores de tumbas lo descubran por sí mismos!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión en solitario y no puede completarse con una Comunidad.</rgb>","'A duras penas puedo creer que encontramos el Ectheldur, y que incluso recuperamos el bastón forestal de Alwedion, pero debemos mantener en secreto lo que hemos aprendido hoy, ${PLAYERNAME:mi amigo[m]|mi amiga[f]}. La Dama Azul ha sido amiga de los Dúnedain durante mucho tiempo, y debemos devolver su bondad. Solo espero que algún día Gwindeth considere que es seguro bajar las aguas del Lago Evendim y que Annúminas pueda ver restaurada su antigua belleza.\
\
Has prestado un gran servicio a los Dúnedain, , y tus acciones no serán olvidadas pronto. ${PLAYERNAME:Un Marinero[m]|Una Marinera[f]} de tu habilidad y experiencia será ${PLAYERNAME:un gran aliado[m]|una gran aliada[f]} en los días por venir, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. ¡Espero que volvamos a llamarte pronto!'","Examina el mapa de Naegir","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Un mapa? ¿Algún tipo de plano?\
\
Por lo que puedo ver, parece que hubo algún gran diluvio hace mucho tiempo y que el lago nunca retrocedió. ¿Pero cómo puede ser? ¿Por qué no lo examinas más de cerca?'","Entrega el extraño mapa a Tarneth en Tinnudir","Habla con Tarneth y busca los restos del Ectheldur","Saqueadores de tumbas derrotados en Rantost (${NUMBER}/8)","'No estoy seguro de qué pensar sobre esto, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Te pediría que recorras los bordes del Lago Evendim para inspeccionar sus aguas y tomar nota de lo que encuentres. ¡Hay algo inusual en esta marea!\
\
Creo que deberás inspeccionar Annúminas desde varios lugares para entender estas marcas. Debes comenzar tu inspección aquí en Tinnudir, y luego continuar en las Agujas de la Linde, Men Erain y la isla de Tyl Ruinen. ¡Eso debería bastar! Toma prestado mi catalejo para ayudarte, pero cuida de él. ¡Es muy valioso para mí!\
\
No eres ${PLAYERNAME:ajeno[m]|ajena[f]} a este tipo de trabajo, ¿cierto? Muy bien. ¡Esperaré tu regreso, !'","Habla con Tarneth en Tinnudir","Has llegado a Tyl Ruinen y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Inspecciona el Lago Evendim desde Men Erain","Has inspeccionado el Lago Evendim desde Tinnudir","Has llegado a Men Erain y ahora puedes inspeccionar el Lago Evendim","Los saqueadores de tumbas se encuentran en Rantost, en las islas del norte del Lago Evendim.\
\
Tarneth te ha pedido derrotar a los saqueadores de tumbas en Rantost y averiguar por qué han comenzado a buscar en las viejas ruinas."},
[12169]={"Radagast can be found in the Gladden Fields.\
\
After learning of several concerning matters, Radagast has asked you to meet him in the Gladden Fields.","The Fate of the Gladden Fields","Talk to Radagast in the Gladden Fields","Concerned by new threats and unfamiliar names come to the Vales of Anduin, Radagast has enlisted your aid to help mend the hurts done to the Gladden Fields.","'I am glad you have come, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'It has been too long since last I looked upon the Gladden Fields, but seeing them in such a state weighs heavily on my heart.'","Meet Radagast at the Gladden Fields","'Ah, yes! The reason I've come to find you, ${PLAYER}....'\
\
Radagast produces a small diary from his robes. He opens it, and you notice that most of the pages have been torn out. Appearing unconcerned by this, Radagast continues.\
\
'Yes, yes! I have written it all down. It's just not here is all. You would do the same if you lost your writing to a bunch of Orcs! But I digress... I have heard a number of troubling tales about what has happened to the Gladden Fields in my absence.\
\
'You have been of great aid to me in the past, ${PLAYER}, so I would ask that you ride far to the south and meet me on the eastern banks of the Anduin.\
\
'Let us hope whatever hurts have been done to the Gladden Fields might still be mended.'","Radagast gazes solemnly into the distance","Radagast can be found in the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have found Radagast standing on a small bluff on the marshy banks of the Anduin."},
[12171]={"Mílgamel can be found at Haerondir.\
\
You have planted the various mushrooms and herbs in the soil you gathered and should now speak to Mílgamel.","Habla con Mílgamel","Mílgamel can be found at Haerondir.\
\
The slag-water ruptured the planting box and dripped into the soil at Haerondir. You should speak to Mílgamel.","The slag-water begins seeping out of newly-formed cracks in the planting box!","'That's right, ${PLAYER}... we are going to try to cross-breed the plants of the Wastes with those of Ithilien.\
\
'Even if the Wastes never recover, we can save their unique plants and grow them within Ithilien if they are of need to us.\
\
'I have set three planting boxes around this chamber, and I would first have you fill half of them with soil you gathered from the battle plain. I have already filled one half of each with soil from Ithilien. Next, you should plant my samples of Oxlip, Vetchling, and Horsetail alongside these hardy mushrooms you discovered.\
\
'This way we shall see if they can live alongside one another in each variety of soil.\
\
'I may still have a use for the slag-water you brought me, but that can wait...'","Plant Mílgamel's plants and the mushroom samples in the soil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wait with Mílgamel","'Ah, perhaps a minute was too long! Look, the slag-water has eaten right through the planting box...\
\
'The others do not appear to have had such a reaction, though, and that is heartening.\
\
'I do not know if the Wastes can ever truly be healed, but I am certain they cannot while the Enemy still looms ahead. Go, rejoin your company. I shall tend to these and see them safely transported away from these lands.\
\
'If you ever find yourself in Minas Tirith again after this war, I am certain I shall have much to tell you!'","The planting boxes can be found near Mílgamel in Haerondir.\
\
Mílgamel has asked you to plant the flowers and herbs she carried from Ithilien in the soil of Dagorlad you brought to Haerondir. She also wishes for you to re-plant the mushrooms in the soil.","Planted Mílgamel's plants and the mushroom samples in the soil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Although the Wastes have long laid desolate, Mílgamel holds hope that these barren lands can again be restored to their long-vanished beauty.","Mílgamel is at Haerondir.\
\
Mílgamel has added a splash of the slag-water to one of the planting boxes, and has asked you to wait with her and observe the results.","The Fate of the Wastes","Talk to Mílgamel at Haerondir","'Ah, wonderful!\
\
'Now then, I'll add a splash of this sickly water you brought to one of them and we can observe the results.'\
\
Mílgamel walks to the central planting box and upends the phial of slag-water.\
\
'There! Now let us see what happens...'"},
[12172]={"Dernaith can be found at the foot of the statue of Sauron near the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
Megoril has asked you to speak to Dernaith about the fates of the dwarf-rings and their bearers.","'I... am still recovering from my encounter with one of the Enemy's fell spirits... and my will is exhausted. Allow me a moment, ${RACE}, and we shall speak.'\
\
Dernaith takes a moment to steady himself.\
\
'If Megoril had not wished us to speak, you would not stand where you are now. What is it you want?'\
\
You tell Dernaith that Megoril mentioned the fell spirit that inhabited the watching-stone, and that she and Dernaith had come in search of an Elf called Thelaron. You also mention the dwarf-rings and ask if Dernaith knows any of their history beyond when they were first granted to the dwarf-kingdoms by Sauron.\
\
'Indeed, we have come in search of our companion, Thelaron. This is a quest of our own, and one given to us long ago by the High King of my people before he was slain by Sauron.\
\
'As for the fell spirit... the one that rose from the statue looked a shade of Sauron himself, but weaker and less wicked in form. It was an echo of Sauron's sorcery, an echo of the Dark Lord - a glamour! This glamour told me of the Mordath, a Black Pit, beneath Barad-dûr where the damned are imprisoned, and it also told me to leave these lands or I would join the forgotten in the depths of the Black Pits and never again find my way from Mordor.\
\
'I do not heed the warnings of such spirits, but these tidings are both good and ill. If Thelaron lives, he may have been taken into the Black Pits. Thus, we would have never found him when last we destroyed Barad-dûr. He was hidden away, far beneath the scorched lands of Mordor, left to pass an Age in silence and darkness... and bearing whatever tortures the Dark Lord devised for him.\
\
'To answer your questions of the dwarf-rings... I have heard a few tales and rumours of them, but little else. As I have heard it told, they did not work as Sauron had planned. The dwarf-rings granted might and luck as well as some manner of concealment, but they did not corrupt the dwarves into servants of the Dark Lord as the Rings of Men did. Instead, the dwarf-rings brought forth a powerful and insatiable greed from deep within the minds of the dwarf-kings - a greed that bred in them a compulsion to seek wealth by any means and to hoard it in their vast halls. Ah, but other creatures were as fond of gold as the dwarves... and so for some of the dwarf-kingdoms, the Rings brought them to ruin.\
\
'I am afraid that is all I know of them. And so, I believe it is time that Megoril and I resume our search... and seek out the Mordath.\
\
'Your allies here seem to have great need of you. If our paths cross again, Megoril and I shall stand at your side!'","Gimli appears to be muttering to himself as you approach. You gently place your hand on his shoulder, but his gaze remains fixed on the Spire.\
\
'I have made more than a few great mistakes in my time, ${PLAYER}, but as any fine dwarf would... and as I always have, I put them to rights.\
\
'The tortures Sauron brought upon Váskmun might not be undone, but there is still a goodness in these dwarves - a fair few of them, anyway!\
\
'To sulk here wishing of a different fate for the Stout-axes - that is not the way of a dwarf!\
\
'The Ring he seeks, this Manthríf, it shall not free him from his delusion and greed! I say Váskmun must be convinced of his folly, or he must be brought low!'","Gimli can be found outside the Oath-taker's Horn in Dor Amarth.\
\
Dernaith has told you of a confrontation he had with an echo of the Dark Lord, a glamour, bound to the statue of Sauron. The glamour spoke cryptically, but told of the damned in the Mordath - the Black Pits of Mordor. You should return to Gimli and see if he has come to a decision about what is to be done about the Firehorns and King Váskmun Greytooth.","'Did you not hear? I said speak! Why have you come here?'\
\
You introduce yourself to Megoril and tell her of your journeys with the Host of the West and of your efforts to ensure the success of the Ring-bearer's quest and the downfall of Sauron the Enemy. You also tell Megoril of the Dwarves of Mordor and of their efforts to find the lost dwarf-rings in Sauron's hoards.\
\
'Very well, ${PLAYER}. I am Megoril of Lindon, and my companion is Dernaith. We are among the last remnants of the great Alliance in this realm, and it brought us joy and relief to learn that Sauron had truly fallen. Death has always eluded the Dark Lord, but I have heard that his Ring is gone and his essence diminished to naught. I know not why any would seek the dwarf-rings or any other artifact that was wrought through Sauron's corruption, for now the evils he has done to the peoples of Middle-earth might now begin to heal at last....\
\
'I never thought I would look upon the plains of Gorgoroth again, but fate has brought me hither once more. You see, Dernaith and I have returned to this land in search of our lost friend and kin, Thelaron.\
\
'During what is now called The War of the Last Alliance, our friend was taken by the Enemy and borne into Mordor on the back of one of his winged fell beasts. Our efforts to rescue Thelaron before he was taken beyond the Morannon failed, and in so doing, we nearly lost another of Gil-galad's favoured warriors to the corruption of Morgul-steel.\
\
'Even after Sauron fell at the end of the Second Age, we could not find Thelaron in Mordor. He was hidden somewhere beyond our sight, and the Enemy's forces still remained to harry us - as few as they were after the War. Thus, our search begins anew. If Thelaron lives still, we shall find him!\
\
'Dernaith has been attempting to learn what the spirits residing in these watching-stones have seen that they might unwittingly aid us, but none have answered our challenges... other than this one. Dernaith beheld a terrible form rise from this statue of Sauron, and it spoke to him, warning he would share the fates of the damned in the Mordath.\
\
'I have never known such a place in Mordor, but in the language of the Elves, it means Black Pit. Indeed, this has given us much to consider....\
\
'Perhaps Dernaith might know the fates of the dwarf-rings you spoke of....'","Talk to Gimli outside the Oath-taker's Horn","The Fates of the Damned","Talk to Dernaith outside the Oath-taker's Horn","Upon the plains of Dor Amarth, you have found two Elves, Dernaith and Megoril, who have come to Mordor in search of their long-lost companion."},
[12173]={"Fastred wishes to speak to you in private at the site of his father's grave. He has expressed a desire to explain his father's legacy and his hopes for the future of his people.","Talk to Fastred","The Father of the Sutcrofts","Fastred can be found inside the mead hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Having spoken to Fastred at his father's grave, and fended off a strange, powerful foe, you should speak to Fastred in Snowbourn.","'Let us depart... there is much to speak of.'","'${PLAYER}, something terrible our way comes. I fear it not, though.\
\
'The Sutcrofts have stood strong through all trials that have faced us, and one man's arrival in our midst will not change that.\
\
'I thank you for hearing my words in the field, and for your action when the time came. You will be of great aid to my people, of this I am sure.'","Fastred can be found in the mead hall of Snowbourn.\
\
Fastred has asked you to accompany him to the site of his father's grave, where he wishes to speak to you in private.","'${PLAYER}, you have done many a service for me and my people. While there is still more to be done, I wish to speak with you about a most personal matter.\
\
'My father, Dagred, was the Reeve until quite recently. He died at the hands of those wretched Orcs on the field, and I will not rest until every last one of their ilk are slain and adorn the walls of Snowbourn.\
\
'I wish you to travel with me to my father's grave - he was a great, great man, and many lessons can be learned from him even with his passing.\
\
'When you are prepared, we shall depart.'"},
[12174]={"Regin está en Othrikar.\
\
Encontraste una formación rocosa que coincide con la descripción que Regin compiló a partir del mapa y los antiguos registros. Deberías llevar la muestra de mineral que tomaste del sitio de vuelta a Regin.","Lleva la muestra de mineral a Regin.","'¡Veamos esa roca! Creo que...\
\
'¡Sí! ¡Esto es! Mineral de alta calidad con contenido de oro. Aún tenemos que lidiar con esos malditos Duramano, y hay todo tipo de otros peligros que atender también, pero si lo logramos, ¡todos seremos ricos!\
\
'¡No puedo agradecerte lo suficiente, amigo! Sin duda mereces una recompensa por tu trabajo aquí, y aunque sea poca cosa, que sepas que siempre serás un huésped bienvenido en las minas de Othrikar.'","'¡El filón principal nos hará ricos!'","'¡Ja! ¡Ahora por fin podemos encontrar el filón principal!\
\
'Hm. Espera un momento. Estas instrucciones no son exactamente lo que esperaba:\
  Encuentra al padre en la roca virgen\
  El filón yace entre altas colinas\
  Halcones feroces surcan los cielos y\
  Linces salvajes custodian los desfiladeros\
  Brilla la plata, reluce el oro\
  Los riscos del acantilado guardan el secreto\
  \
'Tenían un giro poético en los viejos tiempos. Pero ojalá fueran más precisos...\
\
'Bueno, creo que al menos tenemos una idea de cómo proceder. El mapa y esas instrucciones juntas me hablan claramente de un acantilado al noroeste de Othrikar. Todo lo que tienes que hacer es encontrar una formación rocosa adecuada que sea rica en mineral. Si lo haces, toma una muestra y veremos si es el verdadero filón principal.'","El filón principal está en algún lugar al noroeste de Othrikar.  Encuentra al padre en la roca virgen\
  El filón yace entre altas colinas\
  Halcones feroces surcan los cielos y\
  Linces salvajes custodian los desfiladeros\
  Brilla la plata, reluce el oro\
  Los riscos del acantilado guardan el secreto\
\
Los antiguos registros combinados con el mapa minero sugirieron a Regin la ubicación del filón principal, pero las instrucciones estaban lejos de ser precisas. Regin te ha pedido que encuentres una formación rocosa adecuada y tomes una muestra de mineral.","Con el mapa que recuperaste del Capataz Nyrad y las runas de los antiguos registros, Regin puede haber determinado la ubicación general del filón principal.","'Ojalá pudiera darte mejores instrucciones. Pero por favor, ve allí y busca ese filón perdido.'","'¿No pudiste encontrar el filón principal?'","Has tomado una muestra de mineral.","Ubica el filón principal y toma una muestra de mineral.","'¡Ahora lo único que necesitamos es expulsar a esos malditos Duramano!'","El filón principal"},
[12175]={"Pick up wheat from Gadir, the farmer. He can be found along the road to the Elder Hall.","'Come on, come on! Down to the Elder Hall! Everything's been laid out, time to try the best food Khûtra has to offer.'","'Here, take this wheat for the feast. You collected it anyway. It is only right that it goes to the feast. Sincerely, thank you for everything you've done.'","Pick up jugs of khôrob from Ziriha, the merchant","'Here, take all the khôrob I have left. You've earned it.'","'Here we are. The first healthy fish we've caught in a month. Take them, with our thanks. You'll want to bring the ingredients to Ekhmun, the cook - he's just over there, talking to Ziriha.'","Return to Elder Roshat in the centre of Khûtra.","Talk to Elder Roshat about the feast","Give jugs of khôrob to Ekhmun","Give fish to Ekhmun","Pick up jugs of khôrob from Ziriha, the merchant. She can be found by the fishing pier.","'I am astounded. I misjudged you, and perhaps I misjudged the other travellers venturing through here. You are a boon to Khûtra, and I wish I had seen it sooner.\
\
'You must let this foolish old man set accounts right. Come! We will prepare a feast in your honour!\
\
'The only thing I ask of you is to help us with the preparations! Would you mind collecting some of the food? Gadir, down the road, has some wheat as a start.'","The Feast","You have healed Khûtra. Now Roshat is throwing a feast, and you are the guest of honour. Don't be late!","Deliver ingredients to Ekhmun, the cook. He can be found near Ziriha.","Pick up sheaf of wheat from Gadir, the farmer","Pick up fish from Umaris, the fisher. She can be found by the fishing pier.","'That's a welcome sight. More food than I've seen in a fair few nights. Thanks for gathering all this! Leave it to me - I'll have everything ready before you can spit.'","Give all the gathered ingredients to Ekhmun, the cook","Give sheaf of wheat to Ekhmun","Pick up fish from Umaris, the fisher"},
[12177]={"'Are you ready for the festival? Come, ${PLAYER} -- to me, you are an honoured friend and guest.'","Talk to Elder Riagán","The Feast of the Running Stag","'I fear for what may have taken place in the herd-lands after that crow returned last night. A farmer lives there with his son, and a farmhand as well. I must ponder what to do....'","'You have done enough for the day, my friend. More than enough! Now it is time to take up your seat as an honoured guest of the Caru-lûth.\
\
'Our annual festival is almost upon us. I hope it will not be so bad as the impetuous young fawns have led you to believe... ha!\
\
'Speak with me again when you are ready.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Elder Riagán is in Lhan Tarren.\
\
You should speak with Elder Riagán.","Talk to Riagán to attend the Feast of the Running Stag","The time is nigh for the annual Feast of the Running Stag. You have been asked to be present for the rites as an honoured guest of Lhan Tarren.","You should speak with Elder Riagán in Lhan Tarren.\
\
The Elder of the Stag-clan has looked forward to inviting you to the festival."},
[12178]={"¡Completa para recibir un mapa para celebrar el Solsticio de Verano en Minas Tirith!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para el Festival del Solsticio. Se ha corrido la voz de que habrá una gran celebración en Minas Tirith y que todos están invitados.\
\
¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Luego de aceptar esta misión, recibirás un mapa. Utilízalo para viajar a Minas Tirith y unirte a la celebración del Solsticio de Verano. También hay festejos más pequeños en Ered Luin, las Tierras de Bree, la Comarca e Isla Remota.</rgb>","¡La mayor de las celebraciones del solsticio de verano se encuentra en Minas Tirith!\
\
A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!","¡Por orden del rey Elessar, las puertas de Minas Tirith están abiertas para dar la bienvenida a todos aquellos que deseen celebrar el solsticio de verano! ¡Ven y únete al jolgorio!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Luego de aceptar esta misión, recibirás un mapa. Utilízalo para viajar a Minas Tirith y unirte a la celebración del Solsticio de Verano. También hay festejos más pequeños en Ered Luin, las Tierras de Bree, la Comarca e Isla Remota. Hay transporte a Isla Remota en Minas Tirith, así como en otras ubicaciones del festival.</rgb>","¡El Festival del Solsticio de Verano ha llegado!","A medida que se acerca el día del solsticio de verano, los pueblos de la Tierra Media se reúnen para celebrar el gran Festival del Solsticio. ¡Disfruta del baile, la alegría y el amor con tu familia y amigos!"},
[12179]={"'As you can see,  Underharrow is playing host to far too many.\
\
Worse still, little has been done to ensure our safety since the men rode west. As I see it, to house so many here with no means to defend them is lacking in even the most basic strategy. Éowyn will not hear it... the foolish girl. Being thrust into leadership means not that you are a wise leader!\
\
'Ah, but you wish to listen to my concerns? Very well... we have not much time, but let us talk.'","'Well, now you know all you need to know about us. We have little more time to idly speak.\
\
'The burdens of Edoras have fallen on Underharrow, and if you would aid us, I would be grateful.'","Lady Fremedon of Underharrow finds herself at odds with Éowyn as she makes ready for the impending migration to Dunharrow.","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow.\
\
You have spoken to Ellen Fremedon of her family and Underharrow. You should now speak to her of other matters.","'Let us speak, ${PLAYER}.'","Talk to Ellen Fremedon","The Fiddle and the Drum","DNT -- Players will not see","Ellen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall in Underharrow.\
\
You have arrived at Underharrow and met with Ellen Fremedon, the settlement's acting leader. You should now speak to Ellen to learn more of her and her burdens."},
[12180]={"'¡Maravilloso! ¡Esta es la última de las piezas perdidas! Todo debería encajar ahora... eso espero...'","'Este maldito engranaje no encaja. Supongo que el quinto va aquí, y el cuarto encima. ¡Maldición! Tal arte se ha perdido, ¡y aun así debo hacerlo funcionar! En fin, te estoy quitando tiempo con mis quejas.\
\
'El quinto engranaje perdido fue colocado en un cofre escondido en los bosques del este de Haudh Lin, al norte y al este de Kheledûl. Sin embargo, una camada de arañas feroces ha hecho de ese lugar su guarida.\
\
'Será un desafío encontrar el cofre sin toparse con esas criaturas viles.'","Lleva el quinto engranaje a Bávor","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has recuperado el quinto y último engranaje.","El Quinto Engranaje","Quinto engranaje perdido encontrado","Encuentra el quinto engranaje perdido","El quinto engranaje está en un cofre en una guarida de arañas al norte y al este de Kheledûl, en el este de Haudh Lin.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que recuperes el quinto y último engranaje de una terrible guarida de arañas.","'El quinto engranaje perdido fue colocado en un cofre escondido en los bosques del este de Haudh Lin, al norte y al este de Kheledûl. Sin embargo, una camada de arañas feroces ha hecho de ese lugar su guarida.\
\
'Será un desafío encontrar el cofre sin toparse con esas criaturas viles.'","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña.","'Busca la guarida de arañas al norte y al este de Kheledûl para encontrar el quinto y último engranaje.'"},
[12181]={"Help Sorkamâl with 'Implements of Evil'","Help Numûru with 'Barging into the Barracks'","Help Numûru with 'Cleaning the Streets'","Help Sorkamâl with 'Return to the Royal Quarter'","The Fight Goes On","Help Razâl with 'Orkish Allies'","'While the Shâra prepares to enter the palace and confront Góramul Sai, there is still much for us to do to gain control of the city. I suggest we return to our camp at Nashûbu and hear what our council believes we must do to win this battle for good.'","You have done much to win the battle at Emax Dûl.\
\
You should return to Numûru in Nashûbu.","'Ah, there you are. Your work has paid off, and the remaining enemy forces have retreated into a handful of fortified areas. Sorkamâl, Razâl, and I each have a mission to complete, but we will need your help.\
\
'The battle is almost won!'","Help Razâl with 'Consuming Madness'","'You have returned victorious! All that is left is to defeat Góramul Sai in the palace and Emax Dûl will be ours!\
\
'We could not have done this without your help, ${PLAYER}. The people of Hamât Renewed... no, the people of all Shagâna will tell tales of your heroism for years to come!'","Help Hanâbu with 'The Boon of Aradûn'","Your allies at Nashûbu have requests to complete to further the war effort.\
\
You should complete quests to help win the battle in Emax Dûl.","Talk to Numûru","You have done much to further the war effort in Emax Dûl.\
\
You should return to Numûru in Nashûbu for instructions.","(Optional) Use the Hamâti War-horse to quickly travel back to camp","Numûru believes you should return to camp to assess what actions can best win the battle in Emax Dûl.\
\
You can return to Nashûbu quickly using the nearby Hamâti War-horse.","There is still more to do to win the battle in Emax Dûl.","Return to Nashûbu"},
[12182]={"Muirál se encuentra en Bail Avarc, en Angmar.\
\
Has hecho mucho para ayudar a los que se oponen a la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm. Debes hablar con Muirál.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Bail Avarc no es accesible inicialmente, solo a través de rutas de maestros de establo. Bail Avarc se puede alcanzar a través de los maestros de establos en Esteldín, Gath Forthnír y los establos de Rivendel.</rgb>","Completa 'Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Envenenados', 'Thaurisgar, el boticario infame', 'Sagroth, la Guarida de las Alimañas' o 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'","La lucha por Carn Dûm (Diaria)","'¡Salve, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'¿Estás aquí para unirte a la lucha contra la Corona de Hierro? Hay cosas viles en marcha en Sant Lhoer, Thaurisgar, Sagroth y dentro de los salones de Gwathrenost.\
\
'Si nos ayudas a obstaculizar los esfuerzos de la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm, agradeceríamos tu ayuda.'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar una de las siguientes en cualquier tamaño de grupo o nivel de dificultad: 'Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Envenenados', 'Thaurisgar, el boticario infame', 'Sagroth, la Guarida de las Alimañas' o 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>","Los montañeses de Angmar y sus aliados trabajan para oponerse a los restos de la Corona de Hierro que vuelven a habitar dentro de los muros de Carn Dûm.","Debes ayudar a los Montañeses de Angmar y trabajar para oponerte a la Corona de Hierro en Carn Dûm.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Para avanzar en esta misión, debes completar una de las siguientes en cualquier tamaño de grupo o nivel de dificultad: 'Sant Lhoer, los Jardines Envenenados', 'Thaurisgar, el boticario infame', 'Sagroth, la Guarida de las Alimañas' o 'Gwathrenost, la Ciudadela del Rey Brujo'.</rgb>","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Si seguimos luchando contra la Corona de Hierro, no pasará mucho tiempo antes de que los derrotemos!'","Habla con Muirál en Bail Avarc"},
[12183]={"Defeat the enemies assaulting the barricades and ballistae protecting the Hornburg. Aragorn will aid in the defence, but if he or the blockade fall, the Hornburg will surely be lost to your foes.","Do not let the final barricades become destroyed (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Final Blockade","The enemy has sent a group of Orcs and trolls to destroy the ballistae on the tower above the gate-house and to breach the last fortifications along the walkway to the Hornburg. The ballistae and barricades have served to aid in the defence of the fortress and will be a heavy loss if destroyed by the enemy.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Ballista structurally damaged\
- Barricade structurally damaged\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Minor Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- Rohirrim guard defeated","Defeat the waves of attackers (${VALUE}/8)"},
[12184]={"Shumug can be found roaming the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should find and defeat the Orc captain Shumug.","Habla con Éomer","Defeat Shumug","The Final Captain","'We fought and we died on this field, the men of Rohan and Gondor. We fought and by some great miracle seized the day from the arms of an overwhelming foe. \
\
'But the battle is finished and it is a new dawn, so how is it that some foes linger yet upon the Pelennor? I have received word of one Orc captain who seems bent on fighting to the last, taking as many of our men as he can with him. I am weary of death, ${PLAYER}. Will you find this captain and put an end to him?'","Defeated Shumug, the bane of the Rohirrim","You should talk to Éomer, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","'This is good news you bring. No more battle-weary men shall die by the hands of Shumug. I commend you, brave ${CLASS}.'","An Orc captain remains on the Pelennor, determined to fight to the last and bring as many Men down with him as he can."},
[12185]={"El desafío final","'Seguimos en deuda contigo, ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}.'","'¡Por favor! ¡Debes derrotar al jefe Walraig!'","'Has hecho una noble acción por nosotros, sureño. Algo que debimos hacer por nosotros mismos. ¿Estamos condenados a esperar siempre que otros nos guíen?\
\
No importa. Te estamos en deuda. Siempre encontrarás una cálida bienvenida en nuestras tiendas.'","El jefe Walraig está con los suyos en Tór Gailvin, un campamento al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que asaltes el fuerte de los montañeses al noreste. Si logras derrotar al jefe Walraig, podrías evitar una guerra entre los clanes.","Enfurecido por sus repetidas derrotas en duelos, el jefe Walraig de los montañeses hostiles ha declarado una enemistad contra los hombres de Aughaire.","'Tus victorias no han llegado sin costo. Walraig, jefe del clan de nuestros enemigos, ha perdido la razón tras tu derrota de sus campeones y ha declarado una enemistad sangrienta contra nosotros. Esto podría convertirlo en un paria si fracasa, pero si no lo detenemos, liderará a todo su clan contra nosotros aquí en Aughaire.\
\
Nuestra única esperanza es detener esta enemistad antes de que comience. Si asaltamos su campamento en Tór Gailvin al noreste, cerca de Fail-á-Khro, y derrotamos al jefe Walraig en persona, habremos cumplido la ley y nuestros enemigos no podrán actuar contra nosotros.\
\
Pero nuestro líder, Crannog, se niega a liderar tal asalto sin la presencia de Golodir para guiarlo. Debo pedirte que hagas lo que nosotros no podemos y derrotes al jefe Walraig antes de que nos sobrepasen.'","'Has demostrado gran honor, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} .'","Arzhur está en Aughaire, al suroeste del campamento del jefe Walraig.\
\
Debes regresar con Arzhur para informarle de tu victoria sobre el jefe Walraig."},
[12186]={"'You will find the Haradrim sorcerer I speak of within the confines of the encampment to the south-west of Jax Phanâl. He will be smart enough not to just wander the camp without a guard of some sort. The last reports mentioned that he sleeps in a different tent each night in order to avoid detection.'","Sûbodal is slain","You are to travel south and west into the Haradrim camp of Grijâti once again. This time, however, you are seeking the sorcerer Sûbodal, one of the Haradrim leaders. You are to eliminate him and return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl when the effort is complete.","Return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl","'As grim as you may find this, we must remove the leader of these Haradrim before they can reorganize. The longer we keep them in disarray, the better.\
\
'My counterpart Stúkha, an emissary of Rothog the Storm, works to defeat the strongest of the Haradrim; if you have not spoken with him – you should before you head out there.\
\
'Are you willing to assist me again?'","The Final Cut","Girgish informs you that a Haradrim leader has been identified at Grijâti, the camp to the south-west. She directed you to eliminate the sorcerer, Sûbodal, and also to speak with Rothog's emissary to ensure that you eliminate all of the Haradrim leadership.","Defeat Sûbodal, the Haradrim sorcerer at Grijâti","The sorcerer is slain. You should return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl and tell her of your success.","'You have done what was needed. I commend you, ${PLAYER} and thank you for your assistance. The death of the sorcerer was necessary to protect the lives of the folk who live in this outpost.\
\
'Here is a reward for your efforts on our behalf.'"},
[12187]={"Reach the battlefield Shubârza described","Shubârza has asked that you find the sword once wielded by her brother, Iregâr, who fell in battle nearby in an Ekhamâti assault.","Find Zigûli","'${CLASS}, I have a request to ask of you.'\
\
Shubârza sits up slightly and groans from her healing wounds.\
\
'In a recent attack led by the Ekhamâti my brother, Iregâr, fell. We were able to recover the bodies and give them proper funerals, but the ones who brought them back did not recover their weapons.\
\
'My brother wielded a sword known as Zigûli which has been passed down in our family. I wished to wield it to honour him and continue the tradition, but I was recently injured and can not go recover it myself. I fear some brigand or worse, an Ekhamâti soldier, will take it.\
\
'It should be to the north-east at the top of the waterfall and across a wooden bridge where they recovered his body. You can identify it by the gold engravings on the blade.'","This sword does not match Shubârza's description","Return to Shubârza in Amalíbi's camp near Iridír with her brother's sword.","'You... you found it.'\
\
Tears well up in Shubârza eyes as she holds the sword tight.\
\
'I can not thank you enough for this kindness. I miss my brother deeply, but now, thanks to you, I can at least fight on in his honour. Please take this. It is less than you deserve, but it is all I can offer.'","You found a sword matching Shubârza's description. This must be Zigûli","You see many dropped weapons. One must be Zigûli","The Final Keepsake","Return to Shubârza with Zigûli","You have reached the battle-ground about which Shubârza told you. There are many weapons scattered around. One of these must be the sword once wielded by her brother, Iregâr, who fell in battle nearby in an Ekhamâti assault."},
[12188]={"La Ofensiva Final","'Ahora que la pista ha sido destruida, tendremos poco que temer de los jinetes de huargos. Mi hacha acabará con cualquiera que no sea el mejor... y gracias a ti, ya no tenemos que temer eso.'","Puertas destruidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Los huargos han sido derrotados, privando a los trasgos de nuevas monturas. Los trasgos han sido derrotados, privando a los huargos de nuevos jinetes. Ahora, ha llegado el momento de destruir la pista de entrenamiento y privarlos por completo de futuros jinetes de huargos.\
\
'Regresa a Athmadhul, al sureste, y destruye las cercas que enmarcan la pista. Sin ellas, los futuros jinetes de huargos no tendrán la destreza para manejar un combate cuerpo a cuerpo exitoso.\
\
'Es un pequeño paso, sin duda, pero no insignificante.'","Los huargos y los jinetes de Athmadhul han sido derrotados. Ahora es el momento de destruir el campamento de entrenamiento en sí.","'Todo nuestro trabajo será en vano si no destruimos esa pista.'","Ótam se encuentra en Mekhem-bizru, al noroeste de Athmadhul.\
\
Ótam estará encantado de saber que la pista de entrenamiento ha sido destruida.","La pista se encuentra en Athmadhul, al sureste de Mekhem-bizru.\
\
Ótam quiere que regreses a Athmadhul, pero esta vez desea que desmanteles las cercas de la pista que los jinetes de huargos usan para entrenar.","Habla con Ótam en Mekhem-bizru","Destruye las puertas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Cuantos menos jinetes de huargos asciendan en las filas de los trasgos, mejor.'"},
[12190]={"Lleva el escudo roto a Nef","Escudo de Nef encontrado","Nef ha perdido su escudo mientras escapaba de una peligrosa criatura en la tundra de Forochel.","Nef cree que perdió su escudo en Jä-rannit, en una encrucijada en el camino a Itä-mâ.\
\
Nef te ha pedido busques el escudo que ha perdido y se lo lleves de vuelta.","Encuentra el escudo de Nef","'¿Has recuperado mi escudo? Debería estar al sur de Sûri-kylä en el camino a Itä-mâ, aunque deberías tener cuidado con la terrible bestia de la que escapé.'","'¿Roto? ¡Peor si mi escudo era el mejor que podía encontrarse!'","'¡Saludos! ¿Qué te trae a estas gélidas tierras? Puedo decir con seguridad que no eres de por aquí. Sin embargo, quizá podrías decir lo mismo de mí.\
\
'Estaba viajando con algunos compañeros cuando uno de ellos, un necio distraído, hizo que nuestro grupo se perdiera. Pasé días vagando por la tundra y seguro habría perecido si no hubiera sido porque encontré una de esas balizas que los Lossoth colocan en lo alto de las colinas.\
\
'Mientras estaba perdido tuve un encuentro de lo más terrible con una de las criaturas locales. La bestia saltó sobre mí con una velocidad asombrosa. ¡Necesité de toda mi astucia y fuerza para escar de ella! Sin embargo, en lo apresurado de mi huida, perdí mi escudo. ¿Podrías ayudarme a recuperarlo? Es difícil concretar dónde, pero creo que lo perdí en el camino al sur de aquí, por la senda hacia Itä-mâ.'","Nef está en Sûri-kylä, al norte de Itä-mâ, en la bahía de hielo de Forochel.\
\
Deberías devolver cuanto antes a Nef su escudo.","'¿Roto? ¡No puede ser! Mi escudo era el mejor que podía encontrarse, según lo que me dijo ese tipo que me lo vendió, Bill Helechal.'","El mejor escudo de todos","'¿Vuelves con mi escudo?'"},
[12191]={"'Los Ghâsh-hai avanzaron desde las Profundidades Llameantes de Khazad-dûm, donde el fuego brota sin cesar y la tierra huele a brasas. Ahora han venido aquí para rendir homenaje a los usurpadores de Moria. Completa las tareas que te he encomendado y te ganarás mi favor.'","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te ha encomendado ayudarlo contra los trolls y los Ghâsh-hai de la Gran Escalera.","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur, en la Guardia Orca, e informarle de que las tareas relativas a los Ghâsh-hai han sido completadas.","Ocúpate del líder de los Ghâsh-hai en la Gran Escalera","'Has ganado mucho respeto al cumplir estas peticiones, ${PLAYER}. Ahora sé que llevaremos este esfuerzo hasta su culminación y que los elfos no tendrán necesidad de saber de la gran amenaza que afrontaron por parte de los orcos de Khazad-dûm.'","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En el apogeo de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha quedado bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para llevarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu pugna por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","Ocúpate de la hueste de guerra de los Ghâsh-hai en la Gran Escalera","Los moradores del fuego","'Mis responsabilidades incluyen ocuparme de los Ghâsh-hai y de los trolls de las profundidades. Al vigilarlos como hago, debo pedirte que completes las tareas que se te han encomendado en relación con cada uno de ellos.\
\
'Los orcos de fuego alimentan las forjas en las profundidades, cerca de Anazârmekhem, pero su presencia aquí confirma que están pagando tributo al líder de los orcos de Moria, Mazog. Tengo dos tareas que deben cumplirse para asegurar que su hueste de guerra quede mermada y su número reducido en este lugar.\
\
'Completa estas tareas en la Gran Escalera y te ganarás una parte de mi respeto.'"},
[12192]={"Derrota al Sombrío que alimenta el horno de los Orientales antes de que explote","No permitas que demasiado humo llene las cuevas","¡La batalla ha comenzado!","Las cuevas se han llenado de humo nocivo","Los Orientales han construido una vil máquina para llenar los túneles y cuevas de la Montaña Solitaria con humo y vapores nocivos y mortales.","El Sombrío ha sido vencido y la Colina del Cuervo está segura","Los fuegos de Smaug","El sombrío ha explotado y llenado las cavernas","Acércate al Sombrío y comienza la batalla."},
[12193]={"Derrota al Sombrío que alimenta el horno de los Orientales antes de que explote","No permitas que demasiado humo llene las cuevas","¡La batalla ha comenzado!","Las cuevas se han llenado de humo nocivo","Los Orientales han construido una vil máquina para llenar los túneles y cuevas de la Montaña Solitaria con humo y vapores nocivos y mortales.","El Sombrío ha sido vencido y la Colina del Cuervo está segura","Los fuegos de Smaug","El sombrío ha explotado y llenado las cavernas","Acércate al Sombrío y comienza la batalla."},
[12195]={"Gísling has decided that Snowbourn must be protected from the looming threat of Crúmgam, regardless of Fastred's orders.","Gísling can be found in northern Snowbourn.\
\
Gísling is frustrated by Fastred's distraction from the danger at hand, even with the disappearance of his son. He wants you to travel to Walstow with haste to aid Winsig and her people.","Winsig can be found inside the Mead Hall of Walstow.\
\
The Orc-force has been repelled, and Walstow is safe for the moment. You should speak with Winsig in the aftermath of the battle.","The First Assault","'Fastred's grief has consumed him, yet a rider of Walstow lays dead off the road near Snowbourn from what you have said.\
\
'I feel for him, I truly do, but he risks the lives of all of his people by forgetting what foes come for us. Walstow is in grave danger -- the fallen rider tells me that much.\
\
'We cannot wait for Fastred to act: you must ride to Walstow and aid Winsig and her folk.'","Talk to Winsig","Talk to Gísling","'You fought well, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The Orcs fell upon us with such fervour, but their retreat fills me with grave concern. One of their strongest was slain, aye, but the advantage was still theirs.\
\
'I must ponder this for a moment.'","'Walstow is in great peril... have you made ready to ride?'"},
[12197]={"'I see you've managed to retrieve the drake's scales. These creatures that we hunt threaten the Gabil'akkâ, but parts of them may also be useful.\
\
'Hm? What did you think I was sending you off to fight? I simply name my targets after folks I don't like... I named that cold-drake after a former friend with a very cold personality. Appropriate, no? It's incredible that we befriended each other in the first place!\
\
'But enough about that. Should you still be interested in this line of work, I have more bounties to share.'","Kaupur defeated","The First Bounty","Elta is waiting in Aslíf for your return with the \\qarmour.\\q","'Ah, a ${CLASS}, aren't you? Would you like to help an old hunter?\
\
'I came to Deepscrave to help the Gabil'akkâ with a few bounties. I'm no longer as quick as I used to be, but I refuse to retire! To complete my final jobs within Gundabad itself... I would be happy enough to retire afterwards.\
\
'If you'd like to split the bounties with me, you'll have to carry out the actual hunting. I've done my part of the job already -- tracked the targets down across Deepscrave myself. There are a few names to cross off my list, starting with the first target, Kaupur.\
\
'Go south-west and down a level from the middle tier to Kordh Gúrat. Use this steak to catch Kaupur's attention. Oh, and bring back his armour, would you? I'm sure the Gabil'akkâ would be interested.'","Lure out and defeat Kaupur","Though she can no longer hunt alone, Elta still wishes to claim her final bounties in Gundabad.","Elta has offered to split the bounty for defeating Kaupur at Kordh Gúrat.\
\
Kordh Gúrat lies on the level below the middle tier, to the south-west of Aslíf.","Talk to Elta in Aslíf"},
[12198]={"Habla con Aidan cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para luchar a su lado.","'Bien. Pensé que nadie vendría con ese huevo. ¿Pero vas a luchar a mi lado? No lo sé....\
\
'Bueno, es necesario. ¡Espero que seas más fuerte de lo que pareces, sureño!'","Has salido victorioso","'¿Por qué vienes a este lugar, sureño?'","El cantor de historias Arzhur está satisfecho de que el huevo de dragonzuelo que le llevaste servirá como prueba de honor para el desafío del clan rival.","Aidan espera en Fail-á-Khro al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
El cantor de historias Arzhur te ha pedido que lleves el huevo de dragonzuelo a Aidan y luego luches a su lado contra los retadores de los clanes leales a Angmar.","El Primer Desafío","'Ahora debemos llevar el huevo que encontraste a Aidan, el campeón de nuestro clan, que lo espera en Fail-á-Khro al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
'Me temo que debemos pedirte otro favor, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} del sur. Aidan es un luchador fuerte, pero es el último de los que nuestro clan puede presumir. Tenemos muchos cazadores valientes, hábiles guardianes del hogar y quizás algunos sabios cantores de historias, pero pocos guerreros; nuestros enemigos han ido mermando nuestra fuerza poco a poco.\
\
'El desafío que Aidan debe enfrentar no es un combate singular. Te pido que luches a su lado, por el honor de nuestro clan y por su supervivencia.'","'Ahora es tiempo de luchar. ¡Veamos quién se enfrenta a nosotros!'","'Has hecho bien, sureño. Pero los clanes rivales nos traerán más problemas.'","Llevar el huevo de dragonzuelo a Aidan","'Lleva el huevo a Aidan y lucha a su lado contra los retadores de los otros clanes.'","Arzhur está en Aughaire, al suroeste de Fail-á-Khro.\
\
Debes regresar con Arzhur e informarle de tu victoria en el primer desafío.","Aidan está en Fail-á-Khro al noreste de Aughaire.\
\
Lucha junto a Aidan contra los retadores de un clan hostil leal a Angmar."},
[12200]={"Encuentra el primer engranaje","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el primer engranaje.","Primer engranaje encontrado","El Primer Engranaje","'¡Saludos! Me pregunto si podrías echarme una mano. He estado intentando reparar este mecanismo, que abre el acceso a la antigua Bóveda de la Montaña, pero algunas piezas clave — engranajes antiguos — fueron retiradas y dispersadas hace mucho tiempo para evitar que los Duramano pusieran sus sucias manos sobre el tesoro de la bóveda.\
\
'Ahora que por fin hemos expulsado a los Duramano de la Mansión de Thorin, es hora de abrir la Bóveda, pero primero este mecanismo debe ser reparado. El viejo Sindri Winchmaster, el mecánico que lo construyó, tenía una habilidad muy superior a la mía, así que necesitaré las piezas originales que se perdieron para tener alguna esperanza de hacerlo funcionar.\
\
'Dicen que el primer engranaje perdido fue escondido en una antigua cueva en la Cumbre Invernal, siguiendo el sendero al sureste desde la Mansión de Thorin. Probablemente lo encuentres en un cofre dentro de la cueva. Por cierto, hay un truco para abrir el cofre: tienes que presionar en las esquinas...'","Lleva el engranaje a Bávor","El primer engranaje perdido está en una cueva en la Cumbre Invernal, al sureste de la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que ayudes a reconstruir el mecanismo enano que abre la Bóveda.","'Dicen que el primer engranaje perdido fue escondido en una antigua cueva en la Cumbre Invernal, al sureste de la Mansión de Thorin. Probablemente lo encuentres en un cofre dentro de la cueva. Por cierto, hay un truco para abrir el cofre: tienes que presionar en las esquinas...'","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña.","'¡Ja! ¡Este parece ser el engranaje! Va aquí... o quizás aquí...\
\
'No importa. Lo resolveré con tiempo, estoy seguro de ello.'","'Por favor, encuentra el engranaje que está escondido en la mina abandonada al oeste de aquí. Está en un cofre dentro de la cueva. ¡Cuidado con los rascacuevas!'"},
[12202]={"Medwyn dice que te revelará el secreto de la pesca exitosa si tienes paciencia.","El Secreto del pescador","'¿El secreto para ser un pescador exitoso? Te lo diré, si tienes la paciencia.'","Medwyn sacude la cabeza, decepcionado. 'Solo tenías que ser paciente', dice","¡Medwyn dijo que tengas paciencia!","Medwyn está complacido con tu paciencia.","Medwyn tiene un secreto: un secreto sobre la pesca.","Ten paciencia y aprende el secreto de Medwyn","Parecía que el momento nunca llegaría... pero Medwyn está listo para revelar su secreto","Habla con Medwyn en la Pradera de Juncos","'¿El secreto? ¡Ya has demostrado que lo conoces, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}!\
\
'¡El secreto es la paciencia! Cuando se trata de pescar, hay mucha espera. Y has demostrado que puedes hacerlo, ¡lo cual no es algo que todos puedan hacer! ¡Buen trabajo y feliz pesca!'"},
[12203]={"'¿Todo listo? Gracias. Y perdón por lo de antes. Ha sido un momento difícil para mí... para todos nosotros.\
\
'Ya has hecho tanto por nosotros, pero si piensas quedarte un poco más, significaría mucho para mí que siguieras cuidando de Eluna y de sus estudiantes. Son buena gente.'","'Los cajones de pescado que se están secando están detrás de mí, en el muelle. Lanza la sal que te di sobre ellos. Solo hace falta una capa ligera.'","'Bien, amigo. Como puedes ver por los cajones llenos de pescado allí atrás, Madog y yo hemos estado ocupados. No teníamos suficiente sal para nuestras capturas más recientes, así que han estado secándose al aire. La buena gente de Musgovilla nos trajo algo de sal, pero no hemos tenido oportunidad de aplicarla al pescado. ¿Podrías hacerlo por nosotros? Los cinco cajones más cercanos son los que lo necesitan.\
\
'Y eh...........'\
\
Se inclina para susurrar.\
\
'No te preocupes por el anciano. Yo le haré compañía.'","Sala un cajón de pescado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Escuché que tú y los exploradores se encontraron con algunos problemas. Cuéntame qué ocurrió.'\
\
Resumes tus experiencias recientes. Madog suspira profundamente y continúa hablando, aunque no a ti ni aparentemente a nadie en particular.\
\
'Parte de la razón por la que quise ayudar a establecer este lugar, nuestro Lhan Garan, fue la esperanza de ver a nuestros jóvenes crecer lejos de la tragedia que nuestra tierra natal está sufriendo ahora. Supongo que nos siguió hasta aquí. Tal vez fue siempre una esperanza de necio.'\
\
El silencio se prolonga hasta que Teilo, en silencio, te hace una seña para que te acerques.","Cajón de pescado salada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has terminado de salar el pescado como se te pidió.\
\
Regresa con Madog al muelle en Lhan Garan.","Teilo Gwyniad está sentado en el muelle en Lhan Garan.\
\
Teilo Gwyniad te hace una seña para que hables con él.","Hay cajones de pescado secándose en el muelle en Lhan Garan.\
\
Teilo Gwyniad te pidió que salaras los cajones de pescado en el muelle.","Los Pescadores Otra Vez","Habla con Teilo Gwyniad","Madog te ha pedido que conserves algo de pescado salándolo."},
[12205]={"'I'll pack up what I can, but most of this gear'll not travel well to Forlaw. I should hate to see it get into them hands of them Orcs.\
\
'Will ye bury some of our goods for us, friend? I'd like to think that we'll be back before long. Back at the house, if you would. We'll find 'em again.'","The Fishermen: Burying For Another Day","Smala has asked you to bury supplies in the hope that they may return when the plains are safe from Núrzum's threat.","Smala can be found at the fishermen's encampment in the north-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should tell Smala that you have buried his supplies where he wished.","'A very good deed ye did, ${RACE}! We'll be off at once.'","Buried supplies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bury supplies in adequate locations (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The fishermen's home can be found south-west of their encampment on the lake.\
\
You should bring the supplies to the homestead and bury them, in hopes that they will be useful in the future.","Collect supplies (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The fishermen's supplies can be gathered around their camp in the north-eastern Whitshaws.\
\
You should gather the supplies.","Collected supplies (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Return to Smala"},
[12206]={"The Fishermen: Drawing the Nets","The man nods his gratitude and takes the fish you pulled in from the shore.\
\
'Aye, this will do. Now we shall have food for our packs, if we can get Morcar to heed yer advice.'","'Morcar is a stubborn one, but perhaps we should leave. The Whitshaws has never been so cold, nor so deadly.\
\
'I do not fancy the thought of wasting our catch, though. 'Twould be a favour if ye check the nets we have along the bank.'","Gathered fish for the journey (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The fishermen can be found at the north-eastern edge of the Whitshaws on the edge of the Isingmere.\
\
You should bring the fish to the fishermen so that they will have food for their journey to Forlaw.","The fish of today's catch can be found in nets along the northern edge of the Isingmere in the Whitshaws, near the fishermen's encampment.\
\
You should draw in the nets to gather fish for the two men's journey to Forlaw, for they will need fuel for their trek.","Bring the fish to Smala","Collect fish from nets (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Today's fishing catch should be drawn in and packed so that the fishermen may swiftly evacuate to Forlaw."},
[12210]={"Atrapa tantos peces como puedas en diez minutos","¡Los hobbits están celebrando el Festival del Lithe! Te han dado permiso para pescar en el estanque recién abastecido.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","El rincón de pesca","'¡No pierdas el tiempo hablando conmigo! El tiempo ya se te está agotando. ¡Buena suerte, ${PLAYER}!'","'¡El Festival del Lithe está en marcha! Gracias a ti, tenemos pescado de sobra para los concursos y para los más pequeños. Este va a ser un Festival del Lithe maravilloso, lo siento en los huesos.\
\
'Como nos ayudaste a llenar el estanque, eres bienvenido a probar suerte y pescar en él. ¡Este año hay magníficas recompensas para los mejores pescadores!'","El estanque se encuentra al norte de Delagua.\
\
Neddie Cavada te ha invitado a pescar en el estanque del Festival del Lithe. Todos los peces capturados volverán al agua, pero cuanto más pesques, mayores serán tus recompensas."},
[12211]={"The troll Shataz was last seen by an Elvish scout on the slopes east of Orod Laden in the Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to find the troll Shataz and defeat him.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Shataz' defeat.","'The Elves of Rivendell have spoken to me recently of a particular problem which they had thought long ago dealt with.\
\
'It seems there was once a troll in the lower regions of Bruinen, of particular strength and cunning, who strove to stir the trolls of the Trollshaws to band together in war against Rivendell. The Elves learned of this and hunted Shataz down, eventually driving him up into the Misty Mountains -- but they were unable to capture or kill him.\
\
'Now it seems that Shataz lives up there still, and a scout discovered him once again attempting to raise a band of trolls to raid Rivendell itself from the region of Orod Laden. This is a distraction that Elrond can ill-afford at this time, and so I would have you take a small band of skilled warriors up into the Misty Mountains to do away with this troublesome creature. You should take allies with you if you plan to find this creature.'","'I have received a message from the Wardens telling me of your heroic efforts in support of their cause. I thank you for taking such risks on their behalf and ours.'","Defeated Shataz","The Rangers of Esteldín have told you of a troll named Shataz, who is attempting to raise a raid against Rivendell.","Talk to Handarod","The Fist of Ice","Defeat Shataz"},
[12213]={"Find the second missing stone","Another vision appears before you: the Secret Stone placed on one of the five pedestals in the chamber. As you contemplate the vision, you realize you can feel the stone vibrating in its satchel. You lift the stone from King Thorin's satchel and feel the pleasing warmth of it in your hand. Can this be possible? Is this the stone's purpose, to return to this chamber with the other four of its missing brethren? They must be found and reunited.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck! </rgb>","The first missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","The Shadowed King has been released from his prison.\
\
You must tell King Thorin what has happened!","The third missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","The Five Stones","Their purpose remains unknown, but the path before you is clear.\
\
You must find the four missing stones.","Return the Secret Stone to its pedestal","The only thing left to do is return the Secret Stone itself to its pedestal. Do what you must.","Find the third missing stone","The second missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","It has become clear that the Secret Stone is one of five stones with unknown purposes, but it seems clear it was intended to return to the Crown Chamber.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This difficult treasure hunt will require community teamwork and resources outside of the game itself. Good luck!</rgb>","Only one stone remains. The Secret Stone.\
\
Do what you must.","Talk to King Thorin","The fourth missing stone has been restored to its pedestal","Find the fourth missing stone","'${PLAYER}, what has happened? Explain yourself at once!'\
\
You quickly explain that your pursuit of the Secret Stone's origin released the Shadowed King, a Nameless entity who takes the form of Durin the Deathless and seeks to release Throkhâr, an even greater horror. You tell him too that Frethi was injured during the escape.\
\
King Thorin turns away, anger simmering within him. He takes a moment to calm himself before addressing you again.\
\
'This is a disaster! I should have known that pursuing this mystery could lead to such a dangerous outcome! We have to act quickly if we are to undo this mistake before tragedy befalls!'","Find the first missing stone"},
[12214]={"Habla con Finnoth Filoviento","Purchase the Flame of Ancalamír from one of the High-enchanters","The Flame of Ancalamír","Purchased the Flame of Ancalamír","'Did you feel the change in the wind upon crossing the Black Gate, ${PLAYER}? Everything in this accursed land is tainted. The earth, the water, even the air.\
\
'Allow me to introduce myself. I am Narthavron, master smith of the Noldor. I was present when the Last Alliance broke into this valley and defeated Sauron's army. I was filled with sorrow and anger seeing the atrocities they had committed here, and have made it my life's work to find a way to purge the corruption. I now believe I have the right tool to achieve this.\
\
'I have recovered one of the adamants of old, the Flame of Ancalamír. It will unravel many items throughout Middle-earth into different components that I have named \\qEmbers of Enchantment\\q, \\qFigments of Splendour\\q, and \\qMotes of Enchantment\\q. What do you think? I thought those names might help bring a little more light into this dark place. Anyway, after I break the objects down, I am then able to use some of those components to fashion extraordinary equipment. I have a feeling you will be instrumental in the Conquest of Gorgoroth, and as such will be encountering many of these special items in your travels. I have a proposition for you.\
\
'I will allow you use of the Flame. My assistants, the High-enchanters, will help you. You need only touch one of these objects to the Flame and it will be reduced to one of these components.  I believe that dwarf over there has been scavenging through the Orcs' forges. Perhaps he is willing to let go of something for this purpose. Find a piece of equipment, touch it to the Flame, and then return to me.'","'The Flame of Ancalamír has performed as expected, then? Excellent.\
\
'In your travels, should you find equipment for which you have no use, I ask that you destroy it with the Flame and give the results to one of my assistants. They will reward you with powerful items of my own making, free from the foulness of this land.\
\
'Good luck, and safe travels, friend.'","The dagger crumbles before your eyes","Narthavron, master smith of the Noldor, has a proposition for you. For your help in purging the corruption of this land, he will craft powerful equipment for you.","Use the Flame of Ancalamír to disenchant the Morgul-steel Dagger","'Aye, the Elf's right. I am seeking anything of value that might have been left behind. The Orcs were churning out thousands of blades and armour pieces from these forges, but most of them are foul Morgul-steel. Nothing I want anything to do with!\
\
'Here, take this dagger I found. It's worthless to me! And tell that Elf he's better off leaving this sort of thing to the dwarves!'","Narthavron can be found in the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Narthavron.","High-enchanters can be found in many camps around Gorgoroth, including the Udûn Foothold.\
\
Purchase the Flame of Ancalamír from one of the High-enchanters.","Finnoth Sharp-wind can be found at the Udûn Foothold.\
\
You should talk to Finnoth Sharp-wind.","You can purchase the Flame of Ancalamír from one of the High Enchanters.\
\
Use the Flame of Ancalamír to reduce the Morgul-steel Dagger to Motes of Enchantment.","Talk to Narthavron"},
[12216]={"Estandartes de Ordâkh quemados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Potók Dólo","Tiendas de los Ordâkhai quemadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Quema tiendas ordâkhai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las llamas de la resistencia","Has incendiado las tiendas y los estandartes enemigos en Onabóha y has atraído a su capitán, Potók Dólo. Debes derrotarlo.","Has venido a Onabóha para incendiar las tiendas de los Ordâkhai y las estandartes de Ordâkh con la esperanza de que la destrucción los motive a mover su campamento a otro lugar.","Potók Dólo derrotado","Los Temámir de Jiret-menêsh quieren deshacerse del campamento ordâkhai en Onabóha.","Quema estandartes de Ordâkh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Ja ja! ¡Hicimos saber a esos tiranos que no hay lugar para ellos en An Shêru!\
\
'Te estaba ayudando, solo que no lo viste.\
\
'En fin, ¿regresamos a Jiret-menêsh?'"},
[12217]={"'Los Ghâsh-hai son criaturas terribles criadas para dominar y disfrutar el contacto con las llamas. Al menos, eso es lo que puedo deducir de estos orcos.\
\
'Brillan como antorchas contra los silenciosos muros oscuros de Khazad-dûm, y he visto a muchos de estos temibles enemigos entrar en la Gran Escalera. Debemos hacer todo lo posible por reducir su número y destruir su dominio en las profundidades.\
\
'Entra en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca, y da caza a sus huestes.'","En lo más profundo de las salas de Moria, las llamas brotan de charcos aceitosos. Aquí es donde los Ghâsh-hai tienen su hogar. Una facción de ellos está aliada con Mazog, el señor de Moria, y ha acudido a la Gran Escalera para pagar tributo a su líder.","Derrota a agitadores Ghâsh-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las Profundidades Ardientes","'Ten cuidado, pues parece que la carne de estos orcos puede quemar a cualquiera que se acerque a ellos.'","'Excelentes noticias, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Este es un paso hacia la destrucción de la hueste reunida en la Gran Escalera.\
\
'Me complace saberlo.'","Habla con Ossur en la Guardia Orca","Derrota a los invocadores de ira Ghâsh-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los orcos Ghâsh-hai pueden encontrarse en la Gran Escalera, al noreste de la Guardia Orca.\
\
Ossur te envió a enfrentarte a las fuerzas orcas de las profundidades ígneas de Moria, que acudieron a la Gran Escalera para pagar tributo a Igash, un orco devoto de Mazog.","Ossur se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Ossur e informarle de que has derrotado a muchos de los Ghâsh-hai.","Agitadores Ghâsh-hai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Invocadores de ira Ghâsh-hai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12220]={"'¡Eso sí que es lúpulo de rana! ¡Espero que los sapos no te hayan mordido! Claro, no tienen dientes, pero pueden darte un buen golpe con la boca.'","'¿Cómo, que no hay lúpulo? ¡Sin lúpulo no hay cerveza, ya sabes!'","Recoge lúpulo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ponto Hopsbloom, posadero de la Posada del Tronco Flotante en los Ranales, participa en la Fiesta de la Cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","Lleva el lúpulo a Ponto Hopsbloom","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida[f]} a la Posada del Tronco Flotante! Seguro que querrás probar mi cerveza Lengua de Sapo, ¿verdad? Oye, ¿eres tú quien ha estado ayudando a la gente por aquí, no? Quizá puedas ayudarme a mí también.\
\
Verás, se acerca la Fiesta de la Cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas y ¡quiero ganar este año! Así que voy a necesitar un poco de nuestro famoso lúpulo de los pantanos, lo llamamos Lúpulo de Rana.\
\
Bueno, estos lúpulos crecen en el Pantano de la Rana, justo al norte de aquí. No sé por qué, pero esos viejos sapos se ponen agresivos cuando recoges el lúpulo. Yo no soy de los que quieren verrugas, así que me preguntaba si podrías recogerme un poco de Lúpulo de Rana. Te lo agradecería mucho...'","Posada del Tronco Flotante","El lúpulo de rana crece en el pantano al norte de los Ranales. La Posada del Tronco Flotante está en los Ranales, al sur del Pantano de la Rana.\
\
Ponto Hopsbloom te ha pedido que recojas algo de lúpulo de rana para su famosa cerveza.","Lúpulo recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12221]={"The Flow of Battle","'How are we to defeat the Dead? Neither man nor beast can raise arms against them and Garvir knows this well. They simply vanish from sight when we think them wounded and reappear not long after - it is a fruitless endeavour! The only hope we have is that they pass over the Gilrain and leave us be!\
\
'I say we hold as best we can against the Corsairs and Haradrim. At least a blade might wound them!'","'Why have you come to me, ${CLASS}?\
\
'Have you come to dismiss me like Comeldir and his sons so often do? The people of Lebennin do not so callously ignore their history, but I digress....\
\
'Ah, no... I see in your face that this concerns matters most grim.'","Talk to Durnir","Tancestel can be found near the river's edge in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Garvir has bid you speak to Tancestel, an old and superstitious man of Dor-en-Ernil, in the hope that he may have insight on these dire times.","Glanion can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Durnir can be found overlooking the Gilrain in Linhir.\
\
Garvir has asked you to speak to two of his captains, Glanion and Durnir, about the encroaching ruthless Dead and how Linhir might best defend itself.","Garvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Glanion and Durnir had but a few ideas of what can be done and seem demoralized. You should speak to Garvir.","DNT -- will not be seen","Talk to Glanion","'I do not see what can be done....\
\
'Look to the sky, ${PLAYER}... hope is in short supply here, and most of our men have gone east to face down the growing darkness.\
\
'We have no heroes here, no one left to protect the people... except for us. Who are we to stand against such numbers? The return of the Dead is just one last cruel jest....'","Talk to Tancestel","'This bodes ill for us, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The Dead only serve to add to our troubles, and I now fear that any hope of an advantage has gone. I have thought much about what can be done to stop them, but nothing has proved worthwhile.\
\
'Speak to my men, Glanion and Durnir. They are my only two remaining captains... perhaps they may see something where I have not.'","'I guessed as much, ${PLAYER}. It is hard to keep the men from despair in these dark days. I do not know what can be done... nothing outside of the Sisters in the stories of old could aid us now, but they are just that... stories.\
\
'There is a man named Tancestel here who would speak otherwise, but he is old and foolish. Naught but children and the maddened dare pay him any heed.\
\
'I do not wish you disrespect, but I would like to be alone in my thoughts for a time.'","After learning that the ruthless Dead have infiltrated Dor-en-Ernil and plan to sweep eastward to Mordor, Garvir hopes to find some means of slowing their advance.","Talk to Garvir"},
[12222]={"'¿No podrías registrar la Atalaya de los Bandidos en busca de los bienes robados a las granjas locales y a los caminos que rodean Bree?'","Lleva los bienes al Vigilante Rosecane","'Esto vendrá de maravilla. Bree necesita con urgencia nuevas provisiones, y esto ayudará mucho a satisfacer a la población.\
\
'Sin esto, quién sabe qué terrible desesperación habría caído sobre la gente de Bree. Aquí estamos profundamente agradecidos por tu ayuda.'","El flujo de mercancías","'Si planeas internarte en el corazón del campamento de los bandidos aquí, en las Tierras de Bree, ¿podrías buscar los bienes que han robado de las granjas cercanas y de los cargamentos que transitaban los caminos? Aunque Bree no sufre demasiado en este momento, solo es cuestión de tiempo antes de que se agoten las provisiones actuales.\
\
'Si los bandidos continúan con sus asaltos, no quedará comida, cerveza ni nada con lo que apaciguar a la gente de Bree, y entonces tendremos preocupaciones mucho mayores.\
\
'¿Podrías buscar los bienes robados mientras estés en su campamento?'","Recolecta bienes robados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los bandidos que atacan las granjas y los caminos de las Tierras de Bree se han llevado muchos de los bienes necesarios para mantener abastecida a la aldea.","Los bienes robados están siendo guardados por los bandidos en la Atalaya de los Bandidos.\
\
El vigilante Rosecane te pidió que registraras la Vigía de los Bandidos en busca de bienes robados de los caminos y las granjas de las Tierras de Bree.","Bienes robados recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12223]={"'¿Se ha restablecido el flujo de agua? Yo diría que no. Es apenas un hilo, cuando debería ser un torrente.'","'¿Aún no has ido a Noglond?'","El Flujo hacia Noglond","'He recibido algunas quejas desde Noglond, allá en el Valle de Thráin al sur, de que el canal no ha estado fluyendo como debería. Espero que esa reparación que hiciste a la fuga haya solucionado el problema también.\
\
'¿Podrías ir a Noglond y hablar con Geitir sobre el problema? Él podrá decirte si el canal ha vuelto a la normalidad. Solo sigue el camino hacia el sur mientras se curva por el Valle de Thráin, y eventualmente llegarás a Noglond.\
\
'Con los Duramano causando problemas, estamos muy escasos de manos para trabajar.'","Geitir está en Noglond, al sur por el camino desde la Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Tindr te ha pedido que hables con Geitir en Noglond para saber si el flujo de agua en el canal ha vuelto a la normalidad.","Tindr espera que las reparaciones al canal en la Mansión de Thorin hayan restablecido el flujo de agua hacia Noglond, la estación de paso en el Valle de Thráin."},
[12227]={"Talk to Gonodil in Barad Rill","Gonodil wants to keep the building efforts organized around Barad Rill.","Tools collected (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Folly of the Frightened","You should tell Gonodil that you have collected all the tools.\
\
Gonodil can be found in Barad Rill.","Collect worker's tools (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'What a mess. Ever since the workers were scared off by the hauntings in Gaerlond, their tools have been left scattered about.\
\
'This has put a severe strain on our work schedule. Could you perhaps take an account of the worker's tools left abandoned in Barad Rill? Should the workers return, we will need all the tools we can get.\
\
'Hopefully, none are lost.'","'That takes care of that. Now I can be free of all that clutter. Hopefully the workers return yet to see work on the lighthouse completed.'","Gonodil has asked you to collect all the worker's tools that have been left abandoned."},
[12228]={"'What is this? A letter for me? I was not expecting anything of the sort.\
\
'Very well, let me see what this mysterious message is about....'","'Have you delivered my letter to Andiriniel yet? Please do hurry.'","'Perchance could you do me a discreet favour, ${PLAYER}. There is a woman I was supposed to meet by the Lady's Rest, just a short ways south-west of the gates of Caras Galadhon, but I do not think I will be able to make it. I was hoping you could take this letter to her for me.\
\
'Please forgive me for pressing this upon you... I would never do so were the situation not so urgent!\
\
'I... I have work to do now....'","Hadhelen has written a letter to Andiriniel, whom he was supposed to meet at the Lady's Rest.","The Fool's Letter","Andiriniel is at the Lady's Rest, south-west of the gates of Caras Galadhon.\
\
Hadhelen asked you to deliver his letter to Andiriniel.","Deliver the sealed letter to Andiriniel at the Lady's Rest"},
[12229]={"Recoge flechas orcas","Numerosas flechas orcas cubren el suelo de la Sala Vigesimoprimera cerca del arco que conduce hacia el este.\
\
Deberías recoger las flechas orcas y mostrárselas a Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera como prueba de que los enemigos pasaron por aquí no hace mucho.","Flechas orcas cubren el suelo de la Sala Vigesimoprimera cerca del arco este.","Recoge flechas orcas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has guardado muchas flechas orcas para mostrárselas a Mögr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías regresar con Mögr con las flechas que has recogido.","'¡Hum! Estas flechas podrían ser de cualquier época... ¡de hace un año o de hace cien! No veo qué significa tu hallazgo, pero aun así te agradezco tus esfuerzos.'","Lleva las flechas orcas al capataz Mögr","Has recogido una flecha orca (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las huellas de los enemigos","Puedes encontrar flechas orcas cerca del arco este de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Deberías recoger flechas orcas para mostrárselas a los enanos de la Sala Vigesimoprimera."},
[12230]={"'Do you wish to hear more, ${PLAYER}?'","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
You have listened to Anborn's tale and should now ask if he knows more of the Halflings.","'Do you wish to hear more of my tale?\
\
'We returned from the battle with the Haradrim, and Faramir spoke long with the Halflings. He seemed convinced by their tale, and agreed to invite them into the sanctuary of Henneth Annûn. They spoke quietly as we walked through the woods, beyond our hearing, and more yet once we reached the cave.\
\
'It was my duty to scout the way, and it was then that I saw the gangrel-creature. I took it to be some wretched squirrel or shadow-creature out of Mirkwood, but I did not shoot it, for Faramir does not permit the needless slaying of beasts.\
\
'I told Faramir what I saw, and the Halflings listened with interest. Then I went out to guard.'","'I led the creature back to Henneth Annûn, but kept him under guard as Lord Faramir commanded.\
\
'We did not yet know the Halflings' purpose in Ithilien, but the gangrel-creature had committed a serious offence in the eyes of the Rangers, and he had to answer for it.\
\
'I have but a small bit more to tell, ${PLAYER}. When you wish it, I shall share the ending of the tale with you.'","Anborn can be found at Henneth Annûn in North Ithilien.\
\
Anborn has offered to tell you more of the Halflings that passed through Ithilien.","Listen to Anborn's tale","Anborn recalls the tense exchange when the gangrel-creature came unbidden to the Forbidden Pool beneath Henneth Annûn.","The Forbidden Pool","Talk to Anborn in Henneth Annûn"},
[12231]={"'El vado sigue siendo nuestro y Rivendel estará libre de cualquier ataque, al menos por ahora. Ha sido una buena victoria, el enemigo tardará en recuperarse.'","Habla con Elrohir en el Vado de Bruinen","<rgb=#00FF00>Habéis repelido el segundo asalto. Disponéis de unos breves instantes para recobrar el aliento antes del siguiente.</rgb>","El segundo asalto ha comenzado. El Enemigo no flaquea.","El asalto final ha comenzado y el líder de las fuerzas enemigas entra en batalla. Acabad con él para detener la invasión.","Elrohir debe sobrevivir","El primer asalto ha comenzado. Debéis proteger el vado y a los hijos de Elrond.","<rgb=#00FF00>El tercer asalto ha sido rechazado. La batalla se inclina a vuestro favor.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El primer asalto ha sido rechazado. Tenéis unos instantes de respiro antes del próximo ataque.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>El cuarto asalto ha sido repelido. La batalla final comienza.</rgb>","El Vado de Bruinen es el último baluarte que conduce al valle oculto de Rivendel. Los orcos al servicio de Angmar asedian el vado, buscando quebrantar las defensas de Imladris.","Rechaza el asalto final","Elrohir y Elladan, los hijos de Elrond, están listos para enfrentarse al ejército que intenta cruzar el Bruinen. Elrohir espera vuestra llegada.","Repele el segundo asalto","Repele el cuarto asalto","El Vado del Bruinen","'«Los tambores han callado, ${PLAYER}. El asalto comenzará en cualquier momento. Preparaos».'","El tercer asalto ha comenzado. La moral del enemigo parece flaquear y sus fuerzas se reducen.","Repele el tercer asalto","<rgb=#FF0000>Uno de los hijos de Elrond ha caído.</rgb>","El asalto final comienza mientras el líder de las fuerzas del Enemigo entra en combate. Derrotadlo y la invasión fracasará.","Elladan debe sobrevivir","Repele el primer asalto"},
[12232]={"The Ford: An Army from the East","Wulfin can be found in Harwick.\
\
Wulfin will be pleased to hear you disrupted the Easterling-camp at the Ford.","'They will regroup, but a few days' respite is all we need to recover and heal our wounds.'","The Easterlings can be found at the Ford.\
\
Wulfin has asked you to venture to the Ford and defeat the Easterlings encamped there.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","Defeated Easterlings at the Ford (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Easterlings have set up a massive encampment along the eastern shore of the Anduin.","'Are you ready to cross the Anduin and enter the Ford?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","Defeat Easterlings at the Ford (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Wulfin","'The Easterlings trouble me, ${PLAYER}. They have set up a large encampment along the eastern shores of the Anduin, to the north near our guard-towers. I fear a large incursion is coming soon, and we may be ill-prepared to handle it.\
\
'I wish you to strike first. Enter this camp and bring the battle to the Easterlings. Let us not give them the opportunity to fight upon our shore.'"},
[12233]={"Destroyed Cargûl-runes at the Ford (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wulfin is in Harwick.\
\
Wulfin will be pleased to hear that you destroyed several runes before they were able to defile the land.","'The land of the Ford was once green and lush, but it has been perverted and destroyed. Not by the Easterlings, but their foul masters, the Cargûl. As they wander the camp, they drop runes which burn their way into the spirit, filling it with malice and hate.\
\
'If the rune is destroyed, its power fades and the land can be preserved. Do not get too close to the Cargûl, for they can destroy any ${RACE} with a single attack, but follow them closely. When you see a rune, destroy it.'","The runes that the Cargûl drop seep into the land and defile it.","Destroy Cargûl-runes at the Ford (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","'Are you prepared to face the Cargûl of the Ford?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is an instanced public questing area.</rgb>","'One day, either the Cargûl will leave, or we will force them out. For now, I feel content that the land itself is safe.'","Talk to Wulfin","Runes can be found on the paths the Cargûl of the Ford walk.\
\
Wulfin asked you to destroy the runes the Cargûl drop before they defile the land.","The Ford: Defiled Runes"},
[12234]={"'Mae govannen, friend. I see my dear sister still chafes at her imagined bonds.'\
\
Sadorwen chuckles lightly.\
\
'Golodhril is merely a few centuries old. She has not yet experienced all that ones such as ourselves have. I promised her that we could visit the places she reads about before we set sail for the West. However, I did not agree to allow her to become drake food.\
\
'With your experience and skills, you could easily help her with some of the tasks she has set for herself. I am sure you are busy; however, you will no doubt pass by the weeds and vines she seeks. If you are interested, why not offer to go in her place for now.'","'Oh, hello! You are that hero of the realm, ${PLAYER}, correct? My, it must be wonderful to be free to wander Middle-earth in search of adventure and glory.\
\
'I am Golodhril. My sister Sadorwen and I have come to see the fabled Forest Beneath the Mountain!'\
\
She sighs and slumps.\
\
'Sadly, we have seen barely anything save rocks and weeds. I am a prisoner of my tyrannical sister! Perhaps you could speak with her, and tell her that Clovengap is nowhere near as dangerous as she fears.'","The Forest Beneath the Mountain","Sadorwen is located in Bazanmanar.\
\
Golodhril has asked you to speak to her sister Sadorwen on her behalf.","A pair of Elven sisters are on a journey to tour Middle-earth before leaving for the West.","Talk to Sadorwen","Return to Golodhril","'She continues to treat me like a child, I see. Very well, I suppose I will accept your service.'","Golodhril is sulking in Bazanmanar.\
\
Sadorwen has suggested that you help Golodhril."},
[12236]={"Many of the Beornings' supplies were lost in the woods.\
\
You should help Sterkist gather his supplies by completing \\qScattered in the Forest.\\q","Talk to Thranduil","Langhár and Sterkist have gone to The Forest Gate, at the western end of Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should talk to Langhár and Sterkist.","'I think we have spent enough time in the darkness of this forest, friend. We are headed west, to The Forest Gate. Before we go, I believe Sterkist could use your help recovering our lost items.'","'I am certainly glad to be out of the darkness of Mirkwood! Hopefully the next time we come to trade with the Elves, our journey will be less eventful!'","The Forest Gate","The Beornings are safely on their way, and the Taurogrim have been exposed.\
\
You should report these events to King Thranduil.","Help Sterkist gather his supplies","You tell Thranduil of the events that have transpired and the Taurogrim's return.\
\
'In the spiders' absence, an ancient foe returns. This is troubling news, indeed. Thank you for assisting Thorlind in this matter. I will think on our next steps, but I assure you, our reaction to this new threat will be... aggressive.'","Talk to Sterkist","'This is where we part. I must thank you for what you have done for us, ${PLAYER}. Know you are a friend to the Beornings and may call upon us should you need us. Farewell!'","The reunited Beornings must head back towards The Forest Gate and then their home in the Vales of Anduin.","Habla con Langhár"},
[12237]={"Málacál has asked that you travel to the east of Sul Madásh and help her and her hunters thin the number of blighted Huorns that can be found.","Huorns defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Huorns east of Sul Madásh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Málacál near Sul Madásh and report your success of defeating Huorns in eastern Adagím.","Return to Málacál","'Welcome back, ${CLASS}.\
\
'Other hunters speak of your success in defeating Huorns found in the east! Well done.\
\
'You have made the guild proud with your efforts. If you wish to hunt more of them, return when you have the desire.'","'The Pale Blight here continues to corrupt and twist the trees. The Huorns are becoming more of a problem, so they are targets of our hunts.\
\
'To the east they have become consumed with fungal growths. Be wary during your travels there. Be sure to defeat them should you encounter them.\
\
'The hunter's guild would be grateful.'","The Forest Turns Against Us"},
[12238]={"Saruman is devising his own legendary items to supply his war-efforts. His forges must be shut down.","'Word has come to us that Saruman has taken an interest in legendary weapons for his own armies and has built a great forge full of Orc-slaves for the creation of this dangerous supply.\
\
'He must be stopped! Will you sneak into the forges and defeat his smiths and slave-drivers?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This is a solo quest and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","'Ah! I am glad to see you whole, ${PLAYER}. Saruman is dangerous enough by himself... but I shudder to think what he would be like towering above a great army of strong Orcs and uruks, each wielding a weapon of superior make.'","Investigate the Forges of Isengard","'Are you ready to travel to the forges of Saruman? It will be dangerous, but I know that you are a great warrior.'","Bron is in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Bron to tell her of your success against Saruman's attempts to forge legendary weapons.","Bron is in Galtrev.\
\
You should speak with Bron to travel to the Forges of Isengard.","Return to Bron in Galtrev","The Forges of Isengard"},
[12239]={"Mochila recuperada","Oddvarr te espera al sur de las ruinas.\
\
Encontraste la mochila de Oddvarr en las antiguas ruinas al norte.","'Mi nombre es Oddvarr de las Montañas Azules, y estoy aquí en las tierras de Bree por asuntos muy importantes. El único problema es que perdí mi mochila.\
\
'Debo investigar las antiguas ruinas enanas que, según los rumores, existen por aquí. Estoy seguro de que hay descubrimientos importantes por hacer, ¡y yo soy el indicado para hacerlos! Soy un explorador famoso, ¿ves?\
\
'¡Pero me desvío! Si pudieras ayudarme a encontrar esa mochila, te estaría muy agradecido. Tú empieza buscando allá al norte, y yo revisaré esta zona y hacia el sur. Si encuentras algo, ¡reúnete conmigo aquí!'","Oddvarr te pidió que buscaras en las ruinas al norte.\
\
Oddvarr dejó su mochila en algún lugar de la zona y no parece recordar dónde.","Oddvarr está junto a los montones de heno al sur de las ruinas donde encontraste la mochila.\
\
Encontraste la mochila de Oddvarr con sus provisiones tan necesarias.","'¿Aún no has encontrado nada? Yo tampoco. Sigamos buscando.'","Recupera la mochila de Oddvarr","Devuelve las provisiones de Oddvarr","El Enano Olvidadizo","Ves una mochila.","Busca la mochila de Oddvarr en las ruinas","Conociste a un viejo enano llamado Oddvarr, que parece algo distraído. Es un explorador de cierto renombre... o al menos eso dice él.","'¡Ah, ahí está mi vieja mochila! Muchas gracias por devolvérmela. Estaría en serios problemas si mis notas...\
\
'¿Qué? ¡Mis notas no están! ¡Malditos orcos! Deben haber pensado que eran valiosas.'"},
[12240]={"Though the quarry has been abandoned by Men for generations, there are signs of recent activity","The Forgotten Quarry","Nardol Quarry is located in south-western Taur Drúadan.\
\
You should investigate Nardol Quarry.","'You found unnatural hole in mountain? Very very bad place. I feel darkness choking the trees here.'","Enemies and the source of these Dheghûn can be found at Nardol Quarry.\
\
You should defeat foes and explore Nardol Quarry.","Investigate Nardol Quarry","Find the area where the Dheghûn are coming from","A chilling draft escapes from the crevasse. Strange sounds can be heard from within","'I fear Dheghûn comes not from afar, but from below. I tell you a story now.\
\
'The ground shook before Ghûrdhos fell ill. The shaking frightened many. Those on north side of  Drû Bhûta felt more shaking. North of Drû Bhûta is old cave of Men where they dug into mountain. Drúedain not happy with Men for attacking nature but Drúedain not here to fight Men, we are from same blood.\
\
'Go to old place of Men in Drúadan Forest. There, might find answers. I follow when ready. First, need to think more.'","Defeat foes at Nardol Quarry (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rhûd-pulo-Drât can be found in Nardol Quarry.\
\
You should speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât.","Rhûd-pulo-Drât has figured out where the Dheghûn are coming from and wants to investigate.","Enemigos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Rhûd-pulo-Drât at Nardol Quarry"},
[12241]={"Collect food for the prisoner in the Snowbourn prison","Talk to Fastred","Fastred can be found in the mead-hall of Snowbourn.","The Forgotten Son","Deliver the food to the prisoner","'Of course, he would claim loyalty... what traitor would not?\
\
'We shall see if his claim holds up in time - I have heard rumblings of a coming conflict outside Snowbourn, but I am unsure when the hammer will fall.\
\
'I must make ready my own men before dealing with one so far removed from the favour of Rohan.'","Fastred wants you to speak to a recently apprehended prisoner in Snowbourn. The prisoner has been without food for some time now, so Fastred wants you to bring food to the cell as well.","You have found a dingy plate of food, provided by the Rohirrim guards of Snowbourn","'As I said, the traitor has been sent to the prison. He will be hungry by now, so you should feed him rations through the wall of his cell. Perhaps by the time he has eaten, I will be willing to look him in the face again.\
\
'Go, before starvation grants him the freedom he so little deserves.'","The prisoner can be found in the prison-house just outside the mead-hall in Snowbourn.","Fastred wants you to bring a plate of food to a prisoner of Snowbourn.  The food can be found in the prison, near the prisoner's cell.","'By the King, I never thought I would see you again, ${PLAYER}...\
\
'After you departed for Walstow, Fastred's men dragged me here. I know he worries for the safety of his people and family, but surely, he cannot believe that I would work against him!\
\
'Fastred will not hear my words, of this I am certain. You must warn him! Before I was sent here, I noticed trees outside Snowbourn being marked by the Enemy. I fear they intend to attack Snowbourn directly, and soon! Go now!'"},
[12242]={"Falgir se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo de Moria.\
\
Garthar te contó un poco de la historia de las cámaras acorazadas en Moria, lo que contenían y cómo teme que una de ellas haya sido violada. Ahora desea que le cuentes a Falgir lo que has aprendido.","Habla con Garthar en el Descenso Profundo","Garthar se encuentra en el Descenso Profundo de Moria.\
\
Falgir te confió sobre el descubrimiento de cristales que se creían perdidos hace mucho tiempo, pero que ahora aparecen por toda Moria. Te ha pedido que hables con Garthar para ver si puede arrojar algo de luz sobre el asunto.","Habla con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","'No tengo más que contarte. Vuelve con Falgir; seguro que ya lo has visto antes. Está aquí, en el Descenso Profundo.'","Has hablado con Garthar","Tesoro Olvidado: Una reliquia de tiempos pasados","'Sí, estos cristales llevan la marca del gran tesoro de los enanos, olvidado hace mucho tiempo bajo este lugar. El mithril puede haber sido la verdadera riqueza de Moria, pero no era la única riqueza que conocíamos aquí. Había muchas riquezas para cosechar de estas minas.\
\
'Todo lo que no era mithril se llevaba a las cámaras acorazadas de toda Moria y se almacenaba allí para su custodia. Complejos acertijos protegían el tesoro allí dentro, y ahora están bien escondidos por la ingeniosidad de los enanos.\
\
'También sé que una de nuestras cámaras acorazadas fue recientemente violada por nuestros enemigos. Nuestras órdenes nos obligan a quedarnos aquí, seguramente por nuestra propia seguridad, pero tengo la intención de desobedecer. Lamentablemente, no tengo más noticias que compartir, pero siéntete libre de contarle a Falgir todo lo que te he dicho.'","'¿Garthar cree que la cámara ha sido violada, eh? Bueno, eso hace que las decisiones sean más obvias, si me preguntas.\
\
'¿Sigues buscando un poco de trabajo?'","'Un momento de tu tiempo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.\
\
'Cuando entramos aquí por primera vez, no teníamos la intención de avanzar tan rápido. Ahora que hemos llegado tan lejos en las profundidades y vemos el horror de lo que sucedió aquí, hay algunos descubrimientos que nos hacen sentir incómodos a muchos de nosotros.\
\
'Es bastante malo saber que hay orcos y trasgos por todas partes, pero pensar que han profanado algunos de nuestros refugios más sagrados y secretos... da una razón para levantar un martillo y romper algunos cráneos de trasgo. Aún así, tenemos órdenes y debemos cumplirlas, no sea que pongamos en peligro todo lo que intentamos aquí.\
\
'Mis amigos Garthar y Hafberg están preocupados por algunos descubrimientos que hemos estado viendo últimamente. Cristales, opacos y","'Garthar es un tipo conocedor. Tendrá más que contarte sobre estos cristales.'","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, lo que ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos que ahora desean excavar el lugar y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores dentro de Moria."},
[12243]={"Tesoro Olvidado: Conoce a tu enemigo","Lleva los objetos a Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","Recoge retazos de tela (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El Tesoro Olvidado se encuentra al sur y sureste del Descenso Profundo.\
\
Falgir te pidió que eliminaras a los orcos y trasgos entre el Descenso Profundo y el Tesoro Olvidado para prepararte para la tarea de liberar la cámara. También te pidió que recogieras retazos de tela de los orcos y trasgos.","'¡Buen trabajo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Estas ciertamente vinieron de orcos fuertes, lo que significa que debes estar ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para la lucha que te espera. Te contaré todo lo que sé, luego te enviaré a hablar con Garthar y Hafberg, porque ellos, como yo, tienen tareas dentro de la cámara.'","'¿Aún no has derrotado a los orcos como te pedí? ¿Estás ${PLAYERNAME:seguro[m]|segura[f]} de que estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para la tarea más grande que te espera?'","Retazos de tela recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se han descubierto cristales en Moria que portan las marcas del Tesoro Olvidado, una cámara sellada que oculta una considerable cantidad de riquezas. Este hallazgo ha despertado el interés de algunos enanos, que ahora desean descubrir la cámara y salvar su contenido de los orcos saqueadores.","'Si vas a entrar en la cámara del Tesoro Olvidado, debemos prepararte para lo que vas a enfrentar. Se encuentra al sur y al este de aquí, aunque más al sur que al este.\
\
'Entre nuestro refugio y tu destino hay muchos orcos. Estos orcos probablemente sean una raza más pequeña y estúpida que los que encontrarás dentro del Tesoro, porque se necesitarían enemigos astutos para entrar en un lugar tan protegido.\
\
'Te haría bien cazar a los orcos menores durante un corto tiempo; esto me dará tiempo para prepararte para la aventura. Dirígete al sureste y al sur de aquí y recoge un montón de restos de estos orcos, luego regresa a mí cuando tengas suficiente.'"},
[12247]={"Aid Náth with 'A Costly Journey'","The Forsaken of Mordor","Ambassador Spakorth can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
You have aided many of the Stout-axes in settling into their new home, and you should now return to Spakorth.","Talk to Ambassador Spakorth","Aid Spakorth with 'Forged in Flames'","Aid Spakorth with 'Carving Out A Home'","Spakorth, Náth, and Dréri can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain.\
\
Gimli has asked you to aid the Stout-axes in joining with Durin's Folk in Erebor. You should speak to Ambassador Spakorth and his warriors, Náth and Dréri.","Aid Dréri with 'Hunting the North'","'It is difficult to believe how swiftly our fortunes have changed, ${PLAYER}....\
\
'It was not so long ago that we toiled endlessly for Mordor... for nothing. If only King Greytooth had known what awaited us....\
\
'Alas, the past is set in stone. We must leave it behind to look to a new Age!'","'I must admit, ${PLAYER}, I had begun to worry that King Thorin would not see the need for Durin's Folk to welcome the Stout-axes. I am pleased that he has proven to be as merciful and wise as King Dáin.\
\
'Ambassador Spakorth and the rest of his folk have travelled far to stand in the shadow of the Lonely Mountain, and in time, I am certain they will come to see it as the Longbeards do. \
\
'Aid Ambassador Spakorth and his folk in earning their place in Erebor - it is the least we can do for them after what they have lost.'","Through King Thorin's mercy, the Stout-axes of Mordor have found a new home in the North, but first, they must find their place in Erebor."},
[12248]={"Mincham te espera en su campamento.\
\
Mincham se alegrará al saber que el espíritu maligno Olnathron ha sido enviado de vuelta al abismo.","El caballo de Mincham te llevará de regreso","'Ah, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}. Sé que has sido ${PLAYERNAME:victorioso[m]|victoriosa[f]}. Una sombra que oscurecía mis pensamientos ha desaparecido.\
\
'Tienes la gratitud de los Montaraces.''","'Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Nunca olvidaré el servicio que me has hecho a mí y a la memoria de mi esposa.'","Enfrenta al espíritu maligno Olnathron","'Los Dúnedain no pueden resistir el poder de los muertos, y tú tampoco. Todos morirán y esta tierra será cubierta por nuestras sombrías sombras.'","Tham Lorn, en los Campos occidentales de Fornost, se puede alcanzar tomando el caballo del Campamento de Mincham.\
\
Deberías viajar a Tham Lorn para enfrentar a Olnathron de una vez por todas.","Toma el caballo del campamento de Mincham hacia Tham Lorn","La fortaleza de Olnathron","Has llegado a Tham Lorn; Olnathron debe estar cerca.","'Que estos espíritus caídos atormenten abiertamente el mundo mortal es prueba de la maldad de estos tiempos.'","Olnathron puede encontrarse al oeste de las tumbas de su esposa e hijo.\
\
Temiendo por la fortaleza de su voluntad, Mincham te ha pedido que encuentres y enfrentes al espíritu maligno que ha tomado la apariencia de su esposa.","'Creo que Olnathron está en Tham Lorn, unas ruinas en los campos occidentales. He oído oscuros rumores sobre ese lugar últimamente, y bien podría ser la fuente de los males que se agitan en Fornost.\
\
'Mi caballo te llevará allí si deseas ir. Debes tener cuidado. Eres ${PLAYERNAME:un guerrero[m]|una guerrera[f]} experimentado, pero este lugar es verdaderamente maligno.''","Regresa con Mincham","Mincham cree que Olnathron puede encontrarse en unas ruinas antiguas en los Campos occidentales de Fornost.","Has derrotado a Olnathron"},
[12252]={"Belco Tejonera se encuentra al norte del centro de Alforzaburgo, en lo alto de la colina y a la derecha del camino.\
\
A su pesar, Adelard Tuk reveló que no tiene el Texto fundacional. Un granjero local, Belco Tejonera, es quien encontró el Texto fundacional, pero se niega a entregárselo a Adelard hasta que alguien le ayude con su granja.","'Sí, tengo ese trozo de pergamino que quiere Adelard. Lo encontré entre las cosas de mi madre, y no me importa que vaya a la Casa de los Mathoms; prefiero que vaya allí a que acabe en la colección de ese Adelard, pero hay algunos problemas con los que necesito ayuda.\
\
'Verás, mis cercas necesitan reparaciones, mi cerda se ha escapado y necesito algo de comida de Hobbiton. Si me ayudas con esas tareas, te daré el Texto fundacional. ¿Trato hecho?'","'Belco Tejonera es quien tiene el Texto fundacional. Ve a hablar con él, en lo alto de la colina al norte... ¡pero prepárate para ayudarle con su granja!'","'Por favor, date prisa en conseguir esa copia del Escrito Fundacional. ¡Estoy ansioso por echarle un vistazo a ese hallazgo! Ve a ver a Adelard Tuk en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo... ¡es él quien me ha informado de esto!'","'¡Oh, cielos! ¿Vienes por el Texto fundacional? Por favor, no se lo digas a Paladin, ¡pero yo no lo tengo!\
\
'Un granjero local, Belco Tejonera, lo tiene y no quiere dárselo. Su casa está al norte de aquí, en lo alto de la colina y a la derecha del camino, y dice que no entregará el Texto fundacional hasta que alguien le ayude con sus cultivos. ¡Habrase visto! ¡A mi edad, no puedo ayudar con las labores agrícolas!\
\
'Lamento decirte que si quieres el Texto fundacional, tendrás que hablar con él y quizá echarle una mano. ¡Qué cara tienen algunos hobbits!'","El Texto fundacional","Adelard Tuk ha informado de que se ha descubierto una copia del Texto fundacional, el documento que estableció los límites de la Comarca. El documento original fue entregado a los hermanos Albo, Marcho y Blanco, por el viejo rey.","'Ah, sí, buenos días. Me preguntaba si podrías hacerme un favor.\
\
'Acabo de recibir noticias de que Adelard Tuk ha encontrado una copia del Texto fundacional original redactado por el viejo rey. Este texto otorgó a los hermanos Albo, Marcho y Blanco, las tierras que se convirtieron en la Comarca. ¡Es un hallazgo excepcional! Es cierto que ya tengo una copia del documento, pero está en muy mal estado. Si esta copia está en mejor estado, ¡sería una adición maravillosa a la Casa de los Mathoms!\
\
'¿Podrías ir a las Tierras de los Tuk y hablar con Adelard sobre este hallazgo? Creo que puedes encontrarlo en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.'","Adelard Tuk se encuentra en los Grandes Smials de Alforzaburgo.\
\
Brombard Colazorro, el conservador de la Casa de los Mathoms, ha oído hablar del hallazgo de Adelard Tuk y te ha pedido que intentes conseguir la copia del Texto fundacional de Adelard."},
[12255]={"The Fountain of the Lady","'Pick up a pitcher from the terrace here and bring it to a parched Elf, then return here for another pitcher.\
\
'There are three locations to which I would have you bring pitchers of water: parched Elves beneath Telain Neduil, at the base of the ladder that climbs up to the House of Celeborn, and at a gathering of musicians north of here.'","Pick up a pitcher for the gathering of musicians","Pick up a pitcher for the House of Celeborn","'Very good, ${PLAYER}! The cool water of the fountain will refresh the parched throats of my kinsmen.\
\
'Take this with my thanks.'","'The cool water of Celúrlin is most refreshing!'","Pitchers can be found on the terrace near Nembes, and there are three locations to which she would have you bring pitchers of water: parched Elves beneath Telain Neduil, at the base of the ladder that climbs up to the House of Celeborn, and at a gathering of musicians north of Celúrlin.\
\
Nembes has asked you to deliver pitchers of cool water to parched Elves.","'I must take a sip of the waters of Celúrlin again soon!'","Pick up a pitcher for Telain Neduil","Nembes watches over the fountain of the Lady Galadriel.","Talk to Nembes at Celúrlin","'The cool water of the fountain will refresh and invigorate you.'","'The waters of Celúrlin are cool and refreshing.'","Nembes is at Celúrlin, Galadriel's fountain in the centre of Caras Galadhon.\
\
You have delivered pitchers of cool water to parched Elves throughout the city and should return now to Nembes.","'Mae govannen, ${PLAYER}. If you are willing to help me with a simple task, I would be most grateful.\
\
'This fountain is Celúrlin, and its water is both refreshing and invigorating. I have filled pitchers with its cool water and would appreciate your help delivering the pitchers to parched Elves throughout Caras Galadhon. Just pick one up from the terrace here and bring it to a parched Elf. Then return here for another pitcher.\
\
'There are three locations to which I would have you bring pitchers of water: parched Elves beneath Telain Neduil, at the base of the ladder that climbs up to the House of Celeborn, and at a gathering of musicians north of here.'","'Thank you for delivering the pitchers of water to my parched kinsmen.'"},
[12256]={"Cuarto engranaje perdido encontrado","'Por lo que tengo entendido, el cuarto engranaje está en un cofre en Kheledûl, el último asentamiento que los Duramano aún controlan. Kheledûl está junto al río, al este de Gondamon.'","Encuentra el cuarto engranaje perdido","'El cuarto engranaje perdido va a ser... un pequeño problema. Verás, se guardaba aquí en la Mansión de Thorin, y los malditos Duramano se lo llevaron cuando se marcharon, ya que siempre estaban intentando acceder a la bóveda mientras estuvieron aquí.\
\
'Por lo que tengo entendido, el cuarto engranaje está en un cofre en Kheledûl, el último asentamiento que los Duramano aún controlan. Kheledûl está junto al río, al este de Gondamon.\
\
'No estoy seguro de dónde exactamente encontrarás el engranaje, pero no me sorprendería que estuviera bien custodiado, ya que los Duramano saben muy bien que es esencial para acceder a la Bóveda.'","'¡Bien hecho! Lo colocaré en un momento. ¡Vamos, encaja! ¡Maldición! ¡Mi pulgar!\
\
'Bueno, lo tendré listo pronto. Solo queda un engranaje más.'","'Estoy seguro de que el cuarto engranaje está en algún cofre en Kheledûl.'","El cuarto engranaje","Bávor está en la Mansión de Thorin, lejos al noroeste de Kheledûl.\
\
Bávor estará complacido de ver que has conseguido el cuarto engranaje.","Bávor es un mecánico encargado de reparar el gran mecanismo que da acceso a la legendaria Bóveda de la Montaña.","El cuarto engranaje está en un cofre en el puerto duramano de Kheledûl, al este de Gondamon.\
\
Bávor te ha pedido que recuperes el cuarto engranaje perdido de los Duramano en Kheledûl.","Lleva el cuarto engranaje a Bávor"},
[12257]={"Give Márus the required items","The missing stone is out there somewhere, waiting to be found.","With the protection rune-stone and the original chisel, you can now dismantle the trap.\
\
You should return the chamber in the Paths of the Dead and remove the rune-stone trap.","You have found a hidden chamber in the Paths of the Dead.\
\
You should investigate the chamber.","The Fourth Stone","Take the fourth stone","'Did you find the chisel?'\
\
You show him the ancient chisel and hand over the rest of the items on his list. His eyes light up.\
\
'By Durin's Beard! This truly is a chisel of the First Age! Just look at the craftsmanship! If nothing else, thank you for sharing this with me, ${PLAYER}. Ah, if only it were not so urgently needed. I will get started on your rune-stone now.'\
\
He gets to work on the rune-stone. A short time later, it is complete.\
\
'Here you are. This will protect you, and allow you to dismantle the rune-stone. Ah, to do that, all you need to do is hold the chisel directly in the middle of the stone, and hit it with something. A hammer, the base of a sword, anything heavy will do. It should be that simple!'","An ancient chisel was left on a monument here. Could it be the chisel you are looking for?","Find someone to help you remove the rune-stone","Márus has asked you for several ingredients to make a protective rune-stone.\
\
His list included these items: powerful fire-enchanted chisel, copper and obsidian rune-stone base, polished dwarrowgleam.","Investigate the chamber","Open the door","The fourth stone is yours!\
\
You should return it to its rightful place in the Crown Chamber.","You hear the echo of stones shifting somewhere in the cavern","Find the fourth stone","A rune-stone trap stands in your way of the fourth stone.\
\
You should find someone who may be able to help.","Márus hands you the completed rune-stone","With the rune-stone removed, you can now safely open the door.\
\
You should open the door in the chamber.","Inspect the illusion of the fourth stone","The chisel pierces the rune-stone. It clatters to the floor in pieces","Remove the rune-stone trap","The fourth stone is yours!","You have found the key to this chamber's lock, but judging by the charred bones and blast marks, you should not attempt to use it right away. Below the lock, a rune-stone adorns the door, its carvings glowing an ominous red. If you are going to safely open the door, you will need to find some way to remove the rune-stone.","You have found a hidden chamber in the White Mountains.\
\
You should investigate the chamber.","The vision shows you an oval stone on this pedestal. This fourth stone must be out there somewhere, waiting for you to find it. You swear you can hear faint whispers, bidding you to look closer at the illusion.","The fourth stone is yours for the taking!\
\
You should take the fourth stone.","Márus has told you that you must find the original chisel to have any hopes of dismantling the rune-stone trap.\
\
You should find the original chisel.","Return the stone to its pedestal","Find the original chisel","'Hello, ${PLAYER}. What brings you all the way down here?'\
\
You ask Márus if he knows anything about removing rune-stones set up as traps on doors and describe the state of the chamber you found.\
\
'Oh ho, that's quite clever! You know, I have heard of some of our forefathers using rune-stones to protect their vaults from intruders. Aye, let me try to remember the specifics.'\
\
He spends a few minutes mumbling to himself, lost in thought.\
\
'Right! I remember now! I should be able to help you, but it will be tricky! To dismantle the trap, you will need a powerful rune-stone of your own to protect yourself from the searing flames. I can craft that for you with the right reagents, but, you will also need to track down the original chisel used to carve the rune-stone! Aye, the ancient dwarf-craft is not easily undone. Here, let me write this down for you. Good luck in your search. I fear a chisel that old may be gone forever!'\
\
He quickly jots down a list on a piece of paper and hands it to you:\
\
To Make Rune-stone:\
- Powerful fire-enchanted chisel\
- Copper and obsidian rune-stone base\
- Polished dwarrowgleam\
\
- Don't forget the original chisel!","The stones must be returned to their rightful places in the Crown Chamber."},
[12258]={"'¿Un granjero preocupado? ¿Un zorro en el gallinero? Suena a truco, si me preguntas. Ten cuidado con lo que aceptas hacer... pero creo saber de qué se trata. Si realmente quieres continuar con esto, dímelo.'","El Zorro en el Gallinero","Entrega la carta a un pregonero y escucha lo que tenga que decir sobre el granjero preocupado.\
\
Has recibido una carta de un granjero preocupado.","Habla de nuevo con el pregonero","Un granjero preocupado te ha enviado una nota pidiendo tu ayuda y solicitándote que busques a un pregonero.","'Esta carta va dirigida a cualquiera que desee ayudarme con un terrible problema. Un zorro se ha colado en mi gallinero y ha espantado a todas mis gallinas. Necesito ayuda para recuperar mis preciadas aves.\
\
'Habla con cualquier pregonero para que te informe de los posibles peligros que podrías enfrentar.'","Entrega la carta a un pregonero","'No estoy muy seguro de esto, pero si insistes.'","Los pregoneros advierten en contra de ello, pero sí tienen una tarea que puede realizarse en nombre del granjero preocupado."},
[12259]={"'¿Un granjero preocupado? ¿Temeroso de un zorro en el gallinero? Me suena a ardid. Deberías tener cuidado con lo que pides... pero creo que sé lo que significa. Si de verdad quieres continuar con esto, dímelo.'","'¿Recuerdas cuando me diste esta carta de un granjero cualquiera y luego te ocurrió algo muy extraño?\
\
'Fue gracioso. Encontré la carta.'\
\
Te entregan la carta.\
\
'Encontré la carta. ¿Quieres intentarlo otra vez?'","El Zorro en el Gallinero... Otra Vez","Entrega la carta a un pregonero y escucha lo que tenga que decir sobre el granjero preocupado.\
\
Has recibido una carta de un granjero preocupado.","Sabes que ya leíste esto antes. Un granjero preocupado. Necesita ayuda. Habla con un Pregonero. Ya leíste esto antes, ¿cierto?","Los pregoneros lo desaconsejan, pero tienen una tarea que puede realizarse para un granjero preocupado.","Entrega la carta a un Pregonero","'No estoy muy seguro de esto, pero si insistes.'","Habla de nuevo con el Pregonero"},
[12260]={"En Moria se pueden encontrar muchos cristales, pero este parece diferente a los demás. Oscurecido por el paso del tiempo y con aspecto de estar quemado, quizá haya algo que aprender de este cristal que se le cayó a un orco de Moria.","Falgir está en el Descenso Profundo.\
\
Deberías llevar el cristal que encontraste a un enano que quizá sepa algo al respecto.","'Me temo que ese cristal es un hallazgo inquietante'","Habla con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo","El cristal fracturado","Este cristal, hallado en uno de los orcos de Moria, parece ser diferente a cualquier otro cristal encontrado en Moria. Deberías llevárselo a alguien que pueda saber algo sobre su origen.\
\
Quizá podrías hablar con Falgir en el Descenso Profundo. Es posible que él tenga alguna información sobre un cristal de este tipo.","'Sin duda, un hallazgo digno de mención. Aunque no tengo claro de dónde procede, sé por lo que se cuenta que había muchos cristales de este tipo guardados en un tesoro que estamos decididos a encontrar.\
\
'Pero... no puede tratarse de ese tesoro, ya que la cámara está olvidada desde hace mucho tiempo y está bien escondida. Es poco probable que los orcos hayan podido encontrar la entrada. Sin embargo, ¿y si lo han hecho?\
\
'Me temo que este descubrimiento es más grave de lo que pensaba, ${PLAYER}.'"},
[12261]={"El líder Crannog te ha enviado con el Cantor de Historias Arzhur para aprender algo sobre la Gente Libre de Angmar.","La Gente Libre","'Habla con Arzhur. No tengo aliento que perder.'","'Así que otro sureño viene a molestarnos. Bueno, no somos como los que se arrastran ante la Corona de Hierro, y aún respetamos la ley de hospitalidad. Así que... sé ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]}.\
\
No encontrarás mucho afecto entre nosotros para los de tu clase, forastero. Escuchamos al sureño Golodir y nos enfrentamos a la Corona de Hierro, pero ahora que nos ha abandonado, estamos en las últimas. Los otros clanes se han unido contra nosotros, y solo los últimos frágiles vestigios del Tratado de las Colinas nos protegen de la guerra. Pronto caeremos, de una forma u otra.\
\
¿Quieres oír más de nuestras penas? No tengo aliento para repetir la historia triste. Pregunta al Cantor de Historias, Arzhur, si quieres saber la larga y triste historia. Está cerca de las tiendas al norte.'","'Ah, otro ${PLAYERNAME:forastero[m]|forastera[f]}. ¿Crannog te ha enviado, eh? Escucha bien entonces. Hace algunos años, cuando los hombres malvados de Angmar estaban ocupados corrompiendo y subyugando a los hombres de las colinas, un sureño llamado Golodir vino a nosotros. Era un hombre noble y un guerrero fuerte, y podíamos ver que decía la verdad en todo.\
\
Golodir nos advirtió que no siguiéramos a la Corona de Hierro y nos mostró los secretos malignos de Angmar. Nos llevó a enfrentar a nuestros hermanos de los otros clanes y a expulsar a los emisarios Angmarim que susurraban a los oídos de nuestros ancianos.\
\
Pero luego Golodir desapareció. Algunos dicen que fue asesinado, otros que ha regresado al sur, abandonándonos a nuestro destino. Ahora la mayoría de los hombres de Aughaire aún se oponen a Angmar y sus clanes esclavos, pero hemos perdido la esperanza para el futuro.'","Arzhur está en Aughaire, al noreste del líder Crannog.\
\
El líder Crannog te ha enviado a hablar con el Cantor de Historias Arzhur para escuchar la historia de su clan.","'Déjame, sureño, me cansa tu presencia.'"},
[12263]={"Defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield.","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart. You must defeat any of the Frost-horde that you come across upon the battlefield to secure victory for the Gabilakkâ.","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart.","The Frost-horde","Defeat the Frost-horde upon the battlefield (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","The Frost-horde can be found upon the battlefield.\
\
You should defeat any of the Frost-horde you find upon the battlefield.","Defeated the Frost-horde upon the battlefield (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield and have done a great service to the war efforts."},
[12264]={"Defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield.","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart. You must defeat any of the Frost-horde that you come across upon the battlefield to secure victory for the Gabilakkâ.","You have defeated many of the Frost-horde upon the battlefield, and have done a great service to the war efforts.","The Frost-horde (Final)","The Frost-horde has sworn their lives to the wills and ideals of Hrímil Frost-heart.","Defeat the Frost-horde upon the battlefield (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","The Frost-horde can be found upon the battlefield.\
\
You should defeat any of the Frost-horde you find upon the battlefield.","Defeated the Frost-horde upon the battlefield (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12265]={"The Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun!\
\
You should defeat drakes in Uzdarulzahar.","Defeated drakes in Uzdarulzahar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat drakes in Uzdarulzahar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Frost-horde has come to assist the hobgoblins in the Battle of Uzdarulzahar.","Completado","The drakes of the Frost-horde have arrived to assist the hobgoblins in the Battle of Uzdarulzahar. You should defeat them to ensure victory for the Gabil'akkâ!","The Battle of Uzdarulzahar proceeds!","The Frost-horde Attacks","You have defeated many drakes of the Frost-horde in Uzdarulzahar, turning the tide of battle in favour of the Gabil'akkâ!"},
[12266]={"Talk to the Announcer","'Hullo there, you're in Frostbluff for the Yule Festival, aren't you? That's splendid! This is my first visit to Winter-home, quaint little village, isn't it? I work for Mr. Shakesburrow...he's the owner of the Green Lilly Inn you know! He's also the director of the G.L.O.B.E.\
\
'What is the G.L.O.B.E.? Of course! I can't be forgetting my manners, expecting everyone to know everything...the G.L.O.B.E. is the Green Lilly Orators, Bards, and Entertainers. Mr. Shakesburrow put together an acting company to amuse his customers, and people liked it so much he's taken it on the road!\
\
'Mr. Shakesburrow has asked me to find folks willing to review the show. There are two Shire-critics who've come along with us...but they've been...well, you'll see for yourself.\
\
'We've got a special showing of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk' scheduled for this evening...you won't want to miss it!'","Attended a performance","'You saw one of our performances! What did you think of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk?'\
\
'Oh, I see. Yes, some of the actors have been having...difficulties. \
\
'Perhaps you would come back tomorrow, I'm sure we will be back on schedule by then.'","El Teatro de Barranca Escarchada","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre.","'Have you attended one of the performances yet?'","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre","Speak with the hobbit outside the Frostbluff Theatre in Winter-home.\
\
You should tell the hobbit about the performance you saw.","A hobbit working for the G.L.O.B.E. has asked you to attend a showing of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk' and return with your thoughts.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>"},
[12267]={"Talk to the Announcer","Attended a performance","'You saw one of our performances! What did you think of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk?'\
\
'Oh, I see. Yes, some of the actors have been having...difficulties. \
\
'Perhaps you would come back tomorrow, I'm sure we will be back on schedule by then.'","El Teatro de Barranca Escarchada","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre.","'Have you attended one of the performances yet?'","Attend a performance in the Frostbluff Theatre","Speak with the hobbit outside the Frostbluff Theatre in Winter-home.\
\
You should tell the hobbit about the performance you saw.","A hobbit working for the G.L.O.B.E. has asked you to attend a showing of 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk' and return with your thoughts.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","'Ah, you've returned!\
\
'Perhaps today you will have better luck seeing 'An Ode to Old Bloodtusk.' I look forward to hearing what you have to say about it!.'"},
[12268]={"'¿Ya has destruido los marcadores de los Susi-väki?'","Destruye los marcadores de territorio gauradan (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La guerra congelada","'Durante muchos largos inviernos hemos disputado con los Susi-väki el dominio de estas tierras implacables, pero ni nuestros padres ni siquiera nuestros abuelos recuerdan haber librado una guerra verdadera contra ellos. Ahora la guerra cae sobre nosotros, inesperada y no deseada. Los ataques de los Susi-väki se han vuelto más frecuentes y más crueles, y oscuros aliados se han unido a ellos: los Kivi‑väki del sur, que se hacen llamar Duramanos, así como los Angmarim del este.\
\
'En los últimos tiempos también han llegado hasta nosotros más hombres y enanos del sur, buscando forjar una alianza con nosotros. Aceptar sus ofrecimientos nos arrastraría sin remedio a la guerra, pero rechazarlos bien podría dejarnos a merced de enemigos ancestrales. Por ello te pregunto lo siguiente: ¿demostrarás tu fuerza en la guerra y golpearás a los Susi-väki, que son nuestros enemigos? Si así lo haces, te pediré que ataques las propias fronteras de su territorio ancestral, lejos hacia el oeste, al otro lado de la Bahía Helada.\
\
'En el borde meridional del gran glaciar donde ambos pueblos han cazado y combatido durante generaciones, los Susi-väki mantienen desde hace tiempo una línea de protecciones que marca el límite de sus tierras. Quema dichos marcadores y, al hacerlo, haz saber a los Susi-väki que los Lumi-väki y sus aliados les librarán una guerra auténtica —y teñirán de sangre cada copo de nieve, si es necesario— si persisten en su agresión.'","Los Lossoth de Forochel se han visto arrastrados por la creciente marea de la guerra en su reino septentrional, pues los Angmarim han avivado el antiguo odio entre los Lossoth y los Gauradan. Con la esperanza de forjar una alianza con los Lossoth, representantes de hombres y enanos del sur han llegado a Forochel para ofrecer su ayuda.","'Bien hecho. Este acto dejará claro a los Susi-väki que su agresión no quedará sin respuesta.'","Habla con Vämmä en Sûri-kylä","Dile a Vämmä que los marcadores de territorio de los Gauradan han sido destruidos. Se encuentra en Sûri-kylä.","Los marcadores gauradan se extienden en una línea al norte del campamento gauradan de Barad Gaurhoth, cerca de Zigilgund. Estas protecciones se hallan muy al otro lado de la bahía, al suroeste de Sûri-kylä.\
\
Vämmä te ha pedido que lleves a cabo un ataque simbólico contra las protecciones que definen las fronteras del territorio ancestral de los Gauradan.","Marcadores de territorio destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12269]={"'Apricots? I do wish I had some of those to sell you, but sadly I do not.\
\
'These are not the same taste, but I recommend you purchase some of my millet, rice, or chickpeas. They will form the basis of a delicious meal, and if you do happen to find apricots here in the Waterway Market, the fruits will be a welcome addition... but not the main course.'","Zuhûr asked you to speak with merchants at the Waterway Market and find out if anyone has any apricots for her to purchase.","'I never have apricots for sale. I am sorry.\
\
'The reason for that is simple: any that come into my possession are eaten immediately! I love the taste of them, you know, and buy them for myself at every opportunity. I tend to clear out the full supply of the fruits here at the Waterway Market most weeks.\
\
'I apologize.'","Zuhûr gives you a small pouch containing her \\qapricot money\\q","Zuhûr is at the Waterway Market, looking for apricots.","'No apricots for sale anywhere?\
\
'I am not ready to give up. Can you check at the Dawn Market, outside the city? It is located outside the eastern wall of Umbar Baharbêl, but it is too far for me to walk in these shoes. Will you take this money and purchase apricots for me if there are any to be found there?\
\
'I need to find someplace to sit down while you do this. My feet are killing me.'","Bring her apricots to Zuhûr in the Lower Ward","'I am looking to buy apricots, which is usually a very easy task here in the Waterway Market. But I have not had any luck so far today! Will you help me find a market stall with the fruits for sale?'","'Apricots? No.\
\
'Dates, figs, and grapes, however? Yes and yes and yes! Why not purchase some of those instead? They are just as good, I assure you!'","Talked to merchants at the Waterway Market (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The Dawn Market is located east of the city walls.","Talk to merchants at the Waterway Market about apricots (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Zuhûr just wants apricots. Is that too much to ask?","Find someone at the Dawn Market who will sell you apricots for Zuhûr","'Apricots? Sadly, while I usually carry these items, I am completely out of them today. Can I interest you in some oysters, or some of my delicious beans? They were picked just this morning, you know.'","'I am not ready to give up. Can you check at the Dawn Market, outside the city? It is located outside the eastern wall of Umbar Baharbêl, but it is too far for me to walk in these shoes. Will you take this money and purchase apricots for me if there are any to be found there?'","'Apricots? Of course! What sort of merchant would I be if I did not have such things? They were not picked today, so I hope you can excuse some light bruising, but they were plucked from their trees just yesterday. I still have them because not everyone with a taste for apricots always wants to make the journey outside the city to the Dawn Market. There is a vendor in the Waterway Market who visits my stall every few days... you are fortunate she has not yet appeared today!'","Zuhûr will be delighted that you found her some apricots","The Fruits of Your Labour","'You found me some apricots at the Dawn Market? I am pleased, really. Do not mistake me! But I have done so much walking around today, and I am so very tired. I do not really want the apricots anymore. Now what I want is new shoes!\
\
'But no, the money I might have spent on shoes went to apricots. I might as well enjoy them. Thank you for your help, my friend. I think I will just sit here and enjoy the fruits of your labour.'","Zuhûr is on a bench by the Waterway Market in the Lower Ward.","Talk to Zuhûr at the Waterway Market","'Will you help me find a market stall with the fruits for sale?'","'May those apricots bring you joy... and may they bring you back to me to buy more of them when they are gone!'"},
[12270]={"'This is a day I hoped I would never see. I am burying so many of my kin today; Edsig, Gárferth, Thrymm and Gársig. Thrymm wasn't of my blood, but he was closer to me than any of my kin. He was my foster-son, and more importantly, was beloved by the people of Wildermore. Today we bury the men we lost in Scylfig and at the gate here in Forlaw.\
\
'I need a moment to myself after everything that has happened, and will come to the graveyard when the gathering begins. Cyneberg is gracious enough to handle organizing the funeral for me. I believe it is about to begin. She is being strong for me, but please give her company today.'","Go to the funeral with Cyneberg","Speak with Cyneberg","'I'd rather fight a thousand Orcs at once than do something like that again. I still cannot believe he is gone. Is this not just a bad dream?'","'I had to lend a hand and organize this funeral for Gárwig. He has lost so many of his sons and grandsons. It is as if the enemy hunts his family as a cruel act of torture. I lost both my father and my love in Scylfig, but that is nothing compared to what he has lost. It is only right that I help with the arrangements.\
\
'I am not sure if I am ready to say good-bye to both my father, Cynegar, and the man I love... loved, Thyrmm. But, whether I am ready or not, this is an important day. We can head down to the graveyard whenever you are ready.'","Many were lost in the recent battles at Scylfig and Forlaw. Gárwig has lost many of his sons, but none were more important to the people of Wildermore than their hero Thrymm Red-beard. A funeral is being planned by Gárwig and Cyneberg so that the people of Forlaw can pay their respects and say good-bye to those who lost their lives.","Cyneberg is back in Thrymm's home near the southern gate of Forlaw.\
\
Thrymm and the others are now buried, and the time has come for the people of Forlaw to try to move on from their passing.","The Funeral in Forlaw","Cyneberg is keeping close to Gárwig in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw.\
\
Funeral preparations are being made and the townspeople are getting ready to gather at the graveyard."},
[12271]={"Zarza derrotado","El hongo entre nosotros","'¿Has olvidado a dónde te diriges? Dalgum-ru es donde encontrarás al líder de esos Orcos Globsnaga.'","'Quemar las estructuras infestadas de hongos puede ser una ayuda lenta, pero me temo que no es suficiente. Para acabar con la infección, creo que tendremos que cortar la cabeza del serpiente, por así decirlo.\
\
'El líder de los Orcos de la tribu de los Globsnaga se encuentra al sur, en Dalgum-ru. Creo que su existencia ha sido tolerada durante demasiado tiempo.\
\
'Cuando el trabajo esté hecho, vuelve a verme.'","Aunque el fuego parecía destruir las estructuras fúngicas, Tyki cree que se debería poner fin al líder de los Orcos Globsnaga.","'¿Zarza ya no existe? Maravillosa noticia.\
\
'En verdad, ${PLAYER}, has demostrado ser un defensor valiente y firme de Khazad-dûm y de todos sus habitantes legítimos.'","Derrota a Zarza","Tyki se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al norte de Dalgum-ru.\
\
Debes regresar a Tyki para informarle de la muerte de Zarza, el líder de los Orcos.","Habla con Tyki en el Refugio Sombrío","El líder de los Globsnaga se encuentra en Dalgum-ru, al sur del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Tyki quiere que encuentres al líder de los Orcos en Dalgum-ru y pongas fin a su existencia ofensiva."},
[12272]={"El hongo entre nosotros","'En la Sala Decimosexta acechan muchos males; pensábamos que los orcos eran el mayor de ellos. Sin embargo, hace poco vi desde mi puesto de vigilancia unos brotes de hongos dispersos por toda la sala.\
\
'Vengo del bosque, y los líquenes no suelen darme miedo, pero estos hongos sí lo hicieron. De hecho, se me pone la piel de gallina cuando los recuerdo. Había algo terrible en esos hongos.\
\
'Deseaba volver y estudiar esas cosas, pero hay tantas otras cosas que hacer antes de que tenga tiempo, y no deseo posponer esto. Te pido que vayas a la Sala Decimosexta en mi lugar. Ve al noreste del Refugio Sombrío y recoge muestras de este hongo para mí. Cuando las traigas de vuelta, debería poder determinar qué males puede provocar este nuevo enemigo silencioso.'","Pedazos de hongo nocivo recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Regresa con Glorelloth en el Refugio Sombrío","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","Recolecta pedazos de hongo nocivo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Tendrás que buscar el hongo del que te hablé en la Sala Decimosexta. La encontrarás al noreste del campamento en el Refugio Sombrío.'","'No conozco esta especie. No se parece en nada a ningún hongo que haya visto en todos mis largos años de vida.\
\
'Tendré que dedicarle más tiempo a estudiarla, pero considero que cumpliste con tu cometido, pues has hecho exactamente lo que te pedí. Te doy las gracias.'","El hongo del que te habló Glorelloth se encuentra al noreste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Glorelloth quiere que recojas el hongo para poder examinarlo más de cerca y determinar su naturaleza."},
[12275]={"Talk to Thâng or Khirgi","'You have done much to lessen the foothold of these lawless men gathered in Mordor. They will indeed not pose a threat in the future. We all celebrate you for your efforts.'","Reach a Neutral standing with Fushaum Bal South","The Fushaum Resolution","'${PLAYER}, I am furious! I expected little resistance from those holding out in the southern end of Fushaum. Instead they prove most difficult and are impeding my rise to power! My reclamation of Fushaum Tum is slipping from my grasp!\
\
'Now, Thâng and Mâlatuk seek a meeting with me. This may be an opportunity to finally sever their hold. Come with me to the meeting. You may prove most useful.'","Reach an Enemy standing with Fushaum Bal North","Talk to Thurindol","'${PLAYER}, the situation here has worsened. You have done much to assist us. We have only one option left. We must meet with Khirgi and reason with him. Perhaps you could act as our mediator. Join us on the bridge.'","You should talk to Thâng or Khirgi.","In order to turn the various factions in Fushaum Bal against each other, you will need to earn their favour first.","In order to turn the various factions in Fushaum Bal against each other, you will need to disrupt both their efforts.","The camp of Fushaum Bal is a lawless home to evil men once under the command of Sauron.","Reach an Enemy standing with Fushaum Bal South","Thurindol can be found on the border of Talath Úrui and Dor Amarth.\
\
You should speak with Thurindol.","'Will you assist my conquest of Fushaum Bal so that I may retake Fushaum Tum?'\
\
You devise a plan to help both sides of the Fushaum conflict so that they stay divided and focus on each other instead of joining against the forces of Gondor.","'Mâlatuk and I could use some assistance in retrieving our rightful spoils. Then we can return to the east.'\
\
You devise a plan to help both sides of the Fushaum conflict so that they stay divided and focus on each other instead of joining against the forces of Gondor.","Reach a Neutral standing with Fushaum Bal North"},
[12276]={"Assisted Náth","(Optional) Use the battle horn to summon the scout trio","Hórin needs your assistance defeating Hárkyrta the Frigid in Uzdarulzahar.\
\
This will be a difficult fight! Use the battle horn at the gate of Uzdarulzahar to summon the scout trio if they have left your side.","The drake has been slain! You should talk to Hórin.\
\
Use the battle horn at the gate of Uzdarulzahar to summon the scout trio if they have left your side.","The hobgoblin forces have not yet been found, so they must be at the very peak of the mountain. The time for battle is soon at hand.","Find and assist Dréri with his opponent","Defeated Hárkyrta the Frigid","Klúso will fight at your side","Hórin has gathered the dwarf reinforcements and is waiting for you at the stairs to the ruins of Uzdarulzahar.\
\
You should meet Hórin and complete 'Instance: The Warlord's Gambit'.","'Your work cleaning up Fellgát truly paid off, my long-suffering but never-complaining friend! I am glad to have a proper camp to return to after a fierce battle.\
\
'You fought bravely, ${PLAYER}, and though the day is won, I cannot help but dread what must next be done: Hrímil Frost-heart must be defeated. Gorgar and Dushtalbúk are but pawns to the Dragon, and now fully under her control! If anything, the Orcs and hobgoblins are even more dangerous now, for they work in unison rather than tearing at each others' throats. However, our campaign in Gundabad has had no small effect, and I suspect Hrímil will now pull back her forces to protect her lair. For all her haughtiness, she must be feeling rather cornered.\
\
'The unknown factor in all of this is Loknashra. Hrímil was unable to control her, due to whatever dark magic the Angmarim instilled in her, and she spoke of revenge. I have a feeling she will soon make some move, and we must be ready for it... whatever form it takes.\
\
'But enough of doom and gloom! We will face those foes another day. For now, rest, and drink with me! A cheer, for ${PLAYER}! For the Gabil'akkâ!'","Find and assist Náth with his opponent","'Right on time, ${PLAYER}! The battle is won! Our forces can deal with the rest of these hobgoblins. It is time we returned to Fellgát.'","The battle has been won!\
\
You should return to Fellgát and talk to Hórin.","Molkha will fight at your side","Climb the Father's Path and meet up with Hórin by the steps leading to the ruins of Uzdarulzahar","(Optional) Talk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar to quickly travel to Fellgát","Hórin is waiting for you at the gate of Uzdarulzahar.\
\
You should talk to Hórin.","'That was not how I expected this battle to begin, but the tide has turned in our favour! The others have already joined the fight. Find them, and join me up ahead. I will need everyone's help to defeat the elder drake! For the Zhélruka!'","Assist Hórin by defeating Hárkyrta the Frigid","The Gambit at the Highest House","Talk to Hórin at Uzdarulzahar","Complete 'Hobgoblins at the Highest House' for Hórin","'As we have yet to come across them in our travels up the mountainside, the hobgoblin forces can only be in one place: at the end of the Father's Path, the ruins of Uzdarulzahar at the very peak. I will return to the Thing-fold and send for our reinforcements. They will have arrived at Fellgát by now. Dréri, Náth, Molkha and Klúso will escort them. Kyrstig and I will then travel to just outside the ruins. Meet us there when you are prepared to battle Warlord Dushtalbúk!'","Talk to Hórin in Fellgát","Find and assist Kyrstig with her opponent","The Battle of Uzdarulzahar has begun!\
\
You should complete objectives in Uzdarulzahar and find and assist your dwarf allies.","Find and assist Klúso with his opponent","Complete 'Dwarves in Arms' for Hórin","'Everyone is gathered and the reinforcements have arrived. Are you ready for battle, ${PLAYER}?'","Kyrstig will fight at your side","Assisted Dréri","'Come, ${PLAYER}, let us return to Fellgát. I desire the warmth of a camp-fire and the taste of an ale-flagon!'","Find and assist Molkha with her opponent"},
[12277]={"The Gap, Mapped","Deliver the map to Thyfli","Thyfli is in a small camp north of Bazanmanar.\
\
Gerja has asked you to bring a copy of the completed map to Thyfli.","The map is on a table beside Gerja in Bazanmanar.\
\
You should pick up the map.","Pick up the map of Clovengap","'Well met, friend! You bring me a copy of the completed map? Most excellent! Gerja told me to let you know that you may acquire a copy of your own from any quartermaster, should you like.'","With your assistance, Gerja has created a detailed map of Clovengap. The war will go more smoothly now, thanks to your scouting.","'My friend, thank you so very much! Your tireless assistance has assured our victory! With your help, our map of Clovengap is complete! I made a copy of the map for Thyfli. Will you please bring it to him in the camp north of here? You will find the map on the table beside me.\
\
'Should you desire of copy of your own, they will be available from any of Gundabad's quartermasters.'"},
[12278]={"'¡Hola, hola! Qué alegría verte, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} . Quieres ver el nuevo jardín de Duillond? He oído que es digno de ver, pero no sé si es exactamente como los elfos querían.\
\
'¡Solo he oído rumores sobre lo que les aqueja, pero suena bastante mal! Las Tierras de Bree tienen sin duda el mejor Festival de Primavera.\
\
'Aun así, no querría que te perdieras la diversión, si es que hay diversión alguna. Deberías hablar con Maengamiel en Duillond, pues creo que ella gestiona el jardín.'","Habla con Maengamiel en el jardín de Duillond","El jardín de las plagas","'El jardín de Duillond se encuentra cerca de la zona del festival de allí, pues los elfos celebran Ethuilwereth. ¡Me pregunto qué encontrarás!'","El Festival de Primavera ha terminado por este año","'¡Vaya, hola, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! ¿Acabas de llegar? Pues voy a enviarte de nuevo de viaje, porque hoy hay muchas celebraciones por toda la Tierra Media.\
\
'Me interesa especialmente el nuevo jardín de Duillond. Por lo que tengo entendido, los elfos de allí están teniendo algunos problemillas para que sus cultivos prosperen.\
\
'Si tuvieran un jardinero hobbit cuidando sus tierras, seguro que no tendrían problemas de este tipo. Aun así, me gustaría verlo. Si te pasas por allí, deberías buscar a Maengamiel.'","'¡Te doy la bienvenida, ${PLAYERNAME:viajero[m]|viajera[f]}! Espero de corazón que hayas venido a ver el jardín de Ethuilwereth. Da la casualidad de que nos vendría bien tu ayuda. Tenemos un problema, verás...'","'¡Saludos! ¿Estás aquí para celebrar la primavera? Es una época excelente para muchas festividades, en mi humilde opinión.\
\
'He oído que los elfos de Duillond han fundado un nuevo jardín como parte de su propio Festival de Primavera, y que la gente viaja de muy lejos para verlo. También he oído que no es todo lo que prometía ser y que está plagado de problemas.\
\
'Deberías verlo tú mismo, ${PLAYER}, ¡y decidir si los elfos pueden dar una fiesta tan digna como una reunión de enanos!'","'El elfo que buscas se encuentra en el jardín de Duillond, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} . ¡He oído que es todo un espectáculo!'","Los elfos de Duillond han creado un nuevo jardín, pero no esperaban verse tan acosados por las plagas. Son tiempos oscuros de veras, en los que criaturas entrometidas interfieren en las festividades de primavera de la celebración de Ethuilwereth.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual. </rgb>","Maengamiel está en el Jardín del Festival en Duillond, cerca de la zona del festival de allí.\
\
Deberías hablar con Maengamiel para introducirte a los eventos de primavera que tienen lugar en Ered Luin este año.","'¿Te diriges a Duillond ahora, ${PLAYER}? Espero que Ethuilwereth sea digno de ver.'"},
[12279]={"Garsfeld guppies can be found in the river just north of Garsfeld. The fish is elusive though and rarely stays in the same location for very long.\
\
Héalac asked you to catch several Garsfeld guppies.","Caught Garsfeld guppies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the Garsfeld guppies to Héalac","Héalac is at Snowbourn.\
\
Héalac will be eager to begin de-boning the Garsfeld guppies you caught.","'While the Entwash has many fish, so do the streams that pour into it. Just north of Garsfeld is a small stream that comes up from undergound. In between the mouth and the first waterfall, a kind of guppy can be found.\
\
'The Garsfeld guppy is unique because its bones are tough but pliable. There are no better needles for stitching and closing wounds. The fish is elusive though and rarely stays in the same location for very long.\
\
'Head to the waters north of Garsfeld and catch several Garsfeld guppies, then bring them back here.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>The Fishing Hobby is required to complete this quest</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","The stream just north of Garsfeld is the breeding ground for a type of guppy unique to Rohan. The rib-bones of this fish are strong yet pliable, making for perfect needles for stitching wounds.","Catch Garsfeld guppies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'These look like nice fat fish...I might be able to get a bit of meat out of them in addition to the rib-bones.'","The Garsfeld Guppy"},
[12280]={"Talk to Dagoras at his camp near Isengard","Dagoras is at his camp near Isengard.\
\
Dagoras asked you to accompany the Grimbold's emissary to the gates of Isengard. You should speak with Dagoras when you are ready to meet the emissary.","Dagoras is at his camp near Isengard.\
\
You should tell Dagoras what transpired at the meeting between Ordwaer and Saruman before the gates of Isengard.","Talk to Dagoras to accompany Grimbold's emissary","'You should head off quickly... Grimbold's man will be here at any moment.'","The Gates of Isengard","'Grimbold's emissary will arrive shortly. You must escort him to the gates of Isengard and ensure that no ill befalls him there. Perhaps we shall have some answers as to the full extent of Saruman's treachery at last.\
\
'Speak with me when you are ready to meet the emissary.'","Grimbold's emissary has come north to speak with Saruman and demand to know why Orcs and goblins have been seen gathering in numbers near Isengard, and why the Wizard is meddling in the affairs of the Dunlendings and Rohirrim.","'Such is the influence of Saruman's voice upon the unwary. Even now, I find myself wishing to believe the truth of what he said, though I need but look around myself to see his dark intent.\
\
'I do not know what words Ordwaer will return with, but I fear it will only serve to confuse matters further for Théodred and Grimbold as they weigh their next choice.'"},
[12281]={"Akhrûn looks out across the span towards Orodir.\
\
'I was taken here with my brethren in cages. We were told that we did not uphold the great laws that Sauron has put in place over Mordor. Our punishment was to be bound by chains.\
\
'Orodir has many of the Orcs of fire, known as Ghâsh-hai. I hear that they came to Naerband soon after the tower fell. I do not know why though.\
\
'We must rescue as many Nurnhoth as we can and stop Naerband from abducting those who deserve their freedom.'","Enter Orodir","Defeat Ghâsh-hai Gate-wardens (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Akhrûn","Orodir is located next to Naerband.\
\
You should complete quests within this encampment.","Orodir is located next to Naerband.\
\
You should enter the encampment.","Akhrûn is not able to turn her back on her fellow Nurnhoth still imprisoned by servants of Naerband, and asks for your help in freeing them.","Complete Breaking the Chains","Akhrûn can be found just outside of Orodir, next to Naerband.\
\
You should speak with Akhrûn.","Defeated Gate-wardens (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Gates of Naerband","'We are together again! We shall depart and take a long and secretive footpath over the mountains to Nurn. You have done much and I thank you. No longer do you need to risk your life to help me though. We can manage from here.'","Complete Freeing the Nurnhoth","This place seems to be a staging area for bringing captured prisoners into Naerband","Complete For the Oppressed"},
[12282]={"Rothog has requested your presence for a petition of one of his nobles.","Speak to Rothog about the audience.","Following the audience, Rothog would like a word regarding the petition.","Members of the Kindred of the Coins take petitions from nobles throughout Umbar. Rothog has summoned you to his chambers to hear one specific complaint.","'Are you ready? Let us get this over with.'","The Gathering Storm, Part 1: An Audience with the Storm","'It is good to see you again. Your work throughout these lands has spread far and wide. I have a request to make of you. Would you bear witness to a complaint that might involve one of my gladiators?'","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","'${PLAYER}, It is good of you to come to me. I may have a bit of a issue with one of my gladiators. I have received a petition from a rather bothersome noble by the name of Zarzíra Dawn-star.\
\
'I fear this may become an issue, and I may need someone of your abilities to assist. Will you come and bear witness to the proceedings?'","Travel with Rothog to the audience","'It was interesting to hear her need of justice in this case. However, it does seem to jog my memory of a conversation with Shaidal and his claims of innocence. Something to think on.'"},
[12283]={"'This brazen attack within Dahâl Huliz is most troubling to me. His tale seems to indicate that there might be more to his case.\
\
'I will call him here, keep him within sight, and perhaps you can speak to him and gather more proof of what is really going on.'","'Time for you to meet Shaidal, yes?'","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","'Given the petition that we just heard from Zarzíra Dawn-star, I feel that it might be a good time to speak to Shaidal and hear what he might have to say regarding it. You see, he was in the employ of Zarzíra, when one of her competitors was slain. He was brought here to face justice for the act, but has always proclaimed his innocence. She had advocated for his death, but instead he was sentenced to fight in the sands. She again calls for his head very quickly.\
\
'This makes me think that there may be fire behind the smoke, eh?\
\
'He is in the residences for our formidable fighters within halls of the Dahâl Huliz. Go find him and speak to him, find out what information you can learn, and then report back to me.'","'${PLAYER}, it is time to travel into the residences of the gladiators in Dahâl Huliz. Please speak to Shaidal, and report your findings.'","The Gathering Storm, Part 2: Hunter Hunted","Speak to Rothog regarding the petition from Zarzíra Dawn-star.","After your conversation with Shaidal and the surprising ambush, speak to Rothog regarding the encounter.","Rothog has asked that you travel to within Dahâl Huliz, inside the the gladiator residences and speak to Shaidal about the situation.","Within the halls of Dahâl Huliz, the gladiators make their home. Rothog has asked that you question Shaidal."},
[12284]={"Located Makhil's passage near Hulzidâr. The path heads to the west","'As I mentioned, Zarzíra Dawn-star has been attempting to frame me for some of her misdeeds. Several weeks ago, I was able to contact and hire a burglar named Makhil, who promised to recover information needed for my release.\
\
'He mentioned that he would flee to Kamrabezûr in the catacombs. You may wish to start looking in Hulzidâr, a small encampment beneath the arena.\
\
'Can you go into Kamrabezûr, located underneath Dahâl Huliz and look for signs of his passage?'","Makhil's footsteps seem to lead northward towards Jâx Ugikh","Makhil's tracks head east near Kên Taghlim","Talk to Makhil east of Kên Taghlim","Search Hulzidâr, a small encampment beneath the arena, for Makhil's path.","Continue your search for Makhil's path, west of Hulzidâr.","Locate Makhil's passage north of the cross-roads","Locate Makhil's passage near Hulzidâr","Speak to Makhil's about the information that he recovered from Zarzíra Dawn-star's estate.","The Gathering Storm, Part 3: Steps Closer","Locate Makhil's passage west of Hulzidâr","Makhil's tracks head northwards towards Kên Taghlim","Continue your search for Makhil's path, north of the cross-roads, west of Hulzidâr.","Shaidal has requested that you seek out Makhil who has fled into Kamrabezûr to escape Zarzíra Dawn-star and her Khadeji.","'You have at last caught me, unless... are you a friend of Shaidal's? Oh most joyous news.\
\
'I fear that the Khadeji continue to search for me, and the information that I gathered.\
\
'Before you arrived, I hid the information that was recovered elsewhere in a place which might be dangerous to others, but thank you for finding me.'","Continue your search for Makhil's path, near Kên Taghlim in Kamrabezûr.","Locate Makhil's passage near Kên Taghlim"},
[12285]={"Makhil has requested that you recover a series of evidence parcels hidden throughout Ghâr Mejet, an ancient crypt teeming with Wights in Kamrabezûr.","The Gathering Storm, Part 4: The Wight Evidence","'So that you are aware, the documents that I recovered on behalf of Shaidal uncovered both correspondence between Rothog's enemies and also a series of ledgers that have suspicious financial information that Shaidal was trying to expose before his capture.\
\
'Unfortunately, with the Khadeji hunting for me, I chose to hide it in a fairly dangerous place.\
 \
'The parcels of information are hidden within Ghâr Mejet, an ancient crypt infested with Wights. Could you recover these and return them to Shaidal in Dâr Laja?'","'You are back so soon? I hope you bring good news.\
\
'Thank you for gathering this information, these parcels should prove most useful when The Storm next holds his court. It is frightening to think that this woman goes to such lengths to bring ruin upon me, and betray Rothog as well.\
\
'Thank you, I hope this will be enough to set me free.'","Return to Dâr Laja and speak to Shaidal","Locate parcels in Ghâr Mejet (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Located parcels in Ghâr Mejet (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Dâr Laja and speak to Shaidal about the evidence that you recovered."},
[12286]={"'${PLAYER}, it is good of you to come to me. This petition has been most bothersome, and I seek to discover the heart of the matter.\
\
'Would you be kind enough to find your way to my audience chamber, so I could join you shortly?'","'You may think me cruel for sending Shaidal on such a difficult journey, but his agents did violate the home of one of my nobles, and I could not simply allow that to happen. That being said, the information gathered allowed me to give him the chance to free himself.\
\
'However, this Zarzíra's treachery does give me pause and require some thought, I may ask you to attend when I kindly suggest that she make a mandatory appearance in my presence.'","Rothog has requested that you present the evidence that you have gathered regarding Shaidal's actions.","Travel with Rothog to the audience chamber","Rothog the Storm asks you to approach with your findings.","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","The Gathering Storm, Part 5: The Storm Abated","Following the audience, Rothog would like a word.","'Please go ahead, I will join you rather shortly.'","'It seems to be time for our conversation regarding Shaidal and Zarzíra's actions. Your work in this matter has been excellent and I am most thankful for your thoroughness in this matter.\
\
'Will you meet me in my audience chamber so we can discuss this delicate matter more quietly?'","Armed with proof of Shaidal's innocence, you approach Rothog the Storm with your findings."},
[12287]={"Defeated gladiators (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather Rothog's food stuffs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect metal chains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You present the recovered goods to Rothog the Storm.\
\
'I see that my trust in you was not misplaced. My hope was that those who betrayed us may have learned an important lesson. Perhaps they will. Once again your work is exemplary, and your hand in my spectacle will not be forgotten by me.\
\
'Thank you for your help!'","Defeat gladiators (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rothog the Storm has requested that travel into the catacombs to Harkhaphâr and do several tasks. He requests that you thin the number of gladiators there, gather their metal chains, and recover food stuffs from the camp.","Rothog awaits you in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall","The Gathering Storm, Part 6: A Line Crossed","Rothog the Storm has requested that you travel into the catacombs below Dahâl Huliz and recover a precious shipment that was important to him.","Collected metal chains (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'${PLAYER}! While I await for Zarzíra to arrive, I have a task that I would welcome your assistance.  You see, your friend Shaidal has gone to fetch something that is precious to me. However, the beast requires certain items that are needed to assist us on the creature's arrival.\
\
'The problem is that there are those who dwell in the catacombs below the arena who wish to do me harm, and they had the audacity to steal my shipment.\
\
'Could you travel to Harkhaphâr, south of Hulzidâr below, and assist me with this problem?'","Gathered Rothog's food stuffs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rothog awaits you in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall.\
\
Return with the stolen objects and inform him of your victory."},
[12288]={"Sâkhariz provides a container with expertly crafted bolts.","Travel to Kheb Hanût and speak to Sâkhariz there to gather reinforced bolts to secure the creature.","Return to Rothog and meet him in the Dâr Laja Meeting Hall.","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja Meeting Hall","'Some of my messengers have had most unpleasant difficulties when attempting to gather items that I need quite urgently. These items are rare and can be somewhat sought after.\
\
'Could you find your way to Kheb Hanût and speak to my contact Sâkhariz there? I need you to gather reinforced bolts to secure the creature, and then travel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima and retrieve supplies that our apothecaries require most urgently.'","The Gathering Storm, Part 7: Steps Closer","'I understand that your patron has requested very special goods. Luckily, I was able to obtain them with some great challenges to myself. Please let your benefactor know that these goods should perform to expectations.'","'Oh, you are here. I believe I have the package that was requested by your patron. I do warn you that the objects inside appear to have been jostled, but I assure you of the quality of the product.\
\
'I wish you all the best of luck with its use.'","Travel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima","Rothog the Storm has requested your aid in travelling to retrieve needed supplies for his next spectacle. Travel to Kheb Hanût and The Dûlkar, speak to Rothog's contacts, and return.","Travel to The Dûlkar and speak to Nadima and retrieve apothecary supplies.","There appears to be some slight damage to the wrapping of the package, but it is otherwise intact","Speak to Sâkhariz regarding the requested goods","'While I know the traversal of the catacombs below can be problematic, I appreciate your discretion and willingness to go to that place.\
\
'I hope that these objects will make my grand unveiling something truly to behold.\
\
'Thank you for your work again. I can see why your name has become known within this hall.'"},
[12289]={"'${PLAYER}, it seems as if it is time to get to the heart of the matter. I believe that we should be able to resolve this peacefully, of course.'","Speak to Rothog the Storm about the situation","Travel with Rothog to the audience chamber","The Gathering Storm, Part 8: Rothog's Fury","Following Zarzíra's actions in his chambers, Rothog asks to speak to you.","'It is time to deal with this problem. Please join me.'","'It seems that Zarzíra has decided it was time to grace us with her presence. Amongst the difficulties is that I feel that she may have a patron or someone who sought to weaken my position amongst the Kindred. Such an idea is laughable of course.\
\
'Now I would request your presence so that you can see what is done to those who seek to fool me or betray me for no reason. Please remember that this woman had wrongfully imprisoned Shaidal and caused pain to his family.'","Talk to Rothog in Dâr Laja","Talk to Rothog","Rothog has requested your attendance in his questioning of Zarzíra Dawn-star.","Now with proof of her treachery, Rothog calls forth Zarzíra Dawn-star for questioning.","'It would seem that Zarzíra's treachery was deeper rooted that I might have estimated. I appreciate your willingness to combat her and her men on my behalf. I would have stepped forward, but I did not feel they were worth bloodying my blades.\
\
'Oh, I have heard word that Shaidal has managed to capture my prize and has survived the ordeal. Your good work in this has secured his freedom upon the creature's unveiling.'"},
[12290]={"'¡Has vuelto! Dime, ¿pudiste vencerlos?'\
\
Le informas que sí.\
\
'Oh, gracias. ¡Gracias! Quizás pueda dormir por fin.'","Medi te ha pedido que derrotes a los hombres demacrados en Dol Ernil.\
\
Dol Ernil está en el norte de Cardolan.","'Me alegro de verte, ${PLAYERNAME:viajero[m]|viajera[f]}. Cuando intentamos pasar por debajo de Dol Ernil, fuimos atacados en el camino por un mal de lo más vil. Debo admitir que estoy aterrada y no he dormido ni un momento desde aquella noche. Los veo cuando cierro los ojos: hombres demacrados con sus horripilantes semblantes.\
\
'¡Por favor, envíalos de vuelta a la tumba para que pueda dormir de nuevo!'","Invocadores de plaga derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deberías informar a Medi de que hay muchos menos hombres demacrados que acechan sus sueños.\
\
Medi está en el convoy de Gerwyn.","Derrota a los sacerdotes de la plaga (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Belicistas derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entre las ruinas de Dol Ernil, los muertos inquietos deambulan por la piedra derruida.","Derrota a los belicistas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los hombres demacrados de Dol Ernil","Regresa con Medi","Sacerdotes de la plaga derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los invocadores de plaga (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12291]={"'Nat ha sido vengado, pero nunca volverá a cazar en los bosques que amaba.'","'No sé qué hizo a los Gauredain elegir la vida que siguen, si fue fascinación por la forma del lobo u otra razón, pero no sé lo que los ha envilecido por completo. Estos hombres llevan capas de piel de lobo y se engalanan con ornamentos fabricados con colmillos y garras ensangrentados. Se dice que se mueven a una velocidad increíble y atacan con fuerza superior a la de un hombre normal.\
\
'Nat debe ser vengado, ${PLAYER}, para enseñar a los Gauredain que no deben atacar a la gente que vive cerca del lago. Ve hacia el noroeste a Emyn Uial y derrota a algunos de estos hombres malvados. Tráeme de vuelta algunas de sus armas, para que pueda destruirlas.'","'Los Gauredain son todavía hombres, a pesar de sus costumbres crueles y la afinidad que tienen con el mal.'","Robin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, en la región de Tyrn Fornech de Evendim, al sureste de Emyn Uial.\
\
Has derrotado a un buen número de los Gauredain que mataron a Nat Rapkins y has recogido algunas de sus inusuales armas. Robin Dunkley querrá oír el relato de lo ocurrido.","'Estas garras me aterrorizan, ${PLAYER}. Los Gauredain son de veras crueles al dar caza a sus semejantes con ellas, pues somos sus semejantes aunque lleven pieles de bestia y tengan esa sed de sangre. Espero que Nat haya encontrado la paz, y te agradezco que hayas honrado su memoria.\
\
'Casi he terminado de reconstruir la estatua de Elendil con los fragmentos que me trajiste, ${PLAYER}. No tengo todas las piezas que faltan, pero otros aventureros me están ayudando a buscarlos en los campamentos de los saqueadores de tumbas.\
\
'Pero eso no es de lo que quería hablar contigo. ¡Tengo noticias de Calenglad! ¡Ha vuelto de su encuentro con la Dama Azul de Nenuial!'","Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que derrotes a los Gauredain de Emyn Uial y vuelvas con sus armas.","'Los Guaredain acechan en las colinas y bosques de Emyn Uial, al noroeste. Derrota a estos hombres malvados en memoria de Nat Rapkins y tráeme las inusuales armas que portan.'","Los Gauredain de Emyn Uial","'¿No tienes las armas que te pedí de los Gauredain? ¿Qué has estado haciendo, ${PLAYER}?'","Los Guaredain acechan en las colinas y bosques de Emyn Uial, al noroeste.\
\
Robin Sotopardo desea venganza por la muerte de Nat Rapkins y quiere que derrotes a estos malvados hombres que lo mataron. También te ha pedido que le lleves algunas de las inusuales armas de los Gauredain.","Llega las garras rudimentarias a Robin Sotopardo"},
[12292]={"Examina el cadáver del trasgo","Entrega las reservas de Montaraces a Anthandir en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Has descubierto los restos de un trasgo en el exterior de las ruinas abandonas del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","Anthandir se encuentra en el Salón de los Cazadores, en Bâr Faroth.\
\
Tras entrar en el Salón de los Cazadores, has descubierto a un Montaraz del Norte, Anthandir, y a su fiel compañero viviendo en las viejas ruinas. Habla con Anthandir y averigua su propósito en Bâr Faroth.","Un viento helado sopla a través de una grieta en las puertas del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","'Debo admitir que dudaba de tu determinación, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Pensaba que Halros era un necio cuando se congració con los medianos. Era nuestro deber proteger esas tierras, no trabar amistad con su gente. Quizá he malinterpretado mi misión...'\
\
Anthandir hace una pausa y durante un breve momento, una expresión de dolor cruza su rostro.\
\
'Cuando llegue el momento, me revelaré a los medianos en el pueblo que llaman Quiebra Larga. Por demasiado tiempo solo han alcanzado a vernos fugazmente a Thorvellon y a mí. Creen que mi compañero es una especie de terrible Desgarrador, una bestia nocturna, pero hemos protegido estas tierras vigilantes y sin ser vistos. Aun así, hay una sombra que se alza en el este, y se hace más fuerte cada hora que pasa. Si no nos mantenemos juntos, moriremos solos. Quizá ahora es mejor que me conozcan, para que puedan llamarme en tiempos de necesidad.\
\
'Ve, camarada, y ayuda a quienes puedas. Solo te pideo una cosa: no hables de mí a Halros. Es mejor que las viejas heridas sean olvidadas.'","Mientras explorabas Bâr Faroth, has descubierto los restos de un trasgo asesinado frente a las ruinas del antiguo Salón de los Cazadores. Parece que pocos trasgos se han atrevido a acercarse demasiado a sus puertas, pero no está claro por qué se han vuelto tan temerosos de acercarse.\
\
Debes entrar en las ruinas del Salón de los Cazadores e intentar descubrir quién ha estado actuando contra los trasgos de Bâr Faroth.","Los lugares idóneos para colocar trampas se encuentran por todo Bâr Faroth. Anthandir ha marcado en tu mapa la ubicación de varias reservas de Montaraces en Bâr Faroth.\
\
Anthandir te ha pedido ayuda para colocar trampas para los trasgos que invaden Bâr Faroth. Además, te ha encargado recuperar varias reservas de Montaraces de las ruinas antes de que sean descubiertas por los trasgos.","El Fantasma de Bâr Faroth","Reservas de Montaraces recuperadas en Bâr Faroth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Coloca trampas para trasgos en Bâr Faroth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thorvellon agita la cola alegremente","Mientras los trasgos continúan su avance sobre Bâr Faroth, un aliado inesperado aparece en la lucha para expulsarlos de la Comarca Allende.","Explora el campamento en el interior del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Habla con Anthandir en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Recupera reservas de Montaraces en Bâr Faroth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Te he oído llegar, ${RACE}. Si no hubiera amistad entre nosotros, no estarías frente a mí.\
\
'Dime, ¿te ha enviado Halros? Te diré lo mismo que les dije a los otros que envió. Los Dúnedain no deben intervenir en los asuntos de los medianos. ¿Quién eres y qué asuntos tienes en la Comarca?'\
\
Te presentas e informas a Anthandir que hay muchas amenazas que han llegado a la Comarca Allende.\
\
'Es cierto que he montado guardia durante muchos años y que los peligros que enfrenta la Comarca pocas veces han sido tan graves, pero es mi deber proteger estas tierras. ¿Por qué me debería involucrar cuando los medianos actúan contra sí mismos? ¿Cuando hombres de dudosa moral vienen a estas tierras sin ser invitados, buscando fortunas robadas? ¿No deberían los medianos demostrar resolución?'\
\
Le dices a Anthandir que los hobbits podrían afrontar sus propios desafíos, pero la presencia de los trasgos es una amenaza aparte.\
\
'Sin duda, han complicado mi larga vigila en Bâr Faroth. Los he repelido lo mejor que he pedido, pero temo que pronto tenga que buscar un nuevo refugio.\
\
'Si insistes en ayudarme, te pediría que coloques trampas en Bâr Faroth y recuperes mis reservas. Los trasgos han llegado tan rápido que no he podido recuperarlas antes de que construyeran su campamento sobre ellas. Ten, las marcaré en tu mapa.\
\
'Me has dado mucho que pensar. Haz lo que te pido, y escucharé tus palabras.'","El Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth se encuentra en los confines del norte de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Tras descubrir un cadáver de trasgo en el exterior del Salón de los Cazadores, sospechas que alguien está actuando contra los trasgos de Bâr Faroth. Debes investigar el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","El Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth se encuentra en los confines del norte de la Comarca Allende.\
\
Tras entrar en el Salón de los Cazadores, has descubierto la luz de una hoguera. Debes investigar la hoguera del campamento dentro del Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","Entra en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth","Anthandir se encuentra en el Salón de los Cazadores, en Bâr Faroth.\
\
Has colocado trampas para trasgos y recuperado varias reservas de Montaraces como Anthandir te pidió. Debes entregar las reservas a Anthandir en el Salón de los Cazadores en Bâr Faroth.","En lo profundo de las ruinas invadidas por la vegetación del Salón de los Cazadores, percibes la luz de una hoguera de campamento","Un Montaraz del Norte y su fiel compañero parecen habitar en el Salón de los Cazadores","Trampas para trasgos colocadas en Bâr Faroth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12293]={"Search barrels and crates for the ghost","The Ghost of Old Mad Ubb","Odulf can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should show the squirrel to Odulf.","The crate is empty","<rgb=#00FF00>Scold</rgb> Vulmar","'Why look who you found! I have been searching for this one everywhere. Thank you ${PLAYER}. My friend needs to be a little more careful, I would say.'","Vulmar feels bad about what he did","According to Odulf, the ghost of Old Mad Ubb is somewhere in Blómgard.\
\
You should search the barrels and crates to make Odulf feel better.","Nothing in there","Radagast can be found in Laerlad.\
\
You should bring the squirrel to Radagast.","The squirrel can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should pick up the squirrel.","Bring the squirrel to Radagast","A ghost seems to be terrorizing the children of Blómgard.","Vulmar can be found in Blómgard.\
\
You should <rgb=#00FF00>scold</rgb> Vulmar.","'Oh, that Vulmar! I'd wager he caught that squirrel and put it in there to make me think Old Mad Ubb was on the loose! Vulmar is always trying to trick me!'\
\
Odulf starts to cry, but then he wipes his eyes and the sniffles stop.\
\
'Do you know something? I think I have seen that squirrel before. He is friends with that funny man in brown who lives around here. You should bring him the squirrel! He probably misses his friend. I know I would! I wouldn't miss Vulmar, though, not at all! Let him find new friends if he seeks to keep tricking the ones he already has! I think you should scold Vulmar first, and then find the man in brown!'","'Why, look who you found! What good fortune! I have been searching for this little one everywhere. Well, not everywhere, I suppose, for I found him not. Together, perhaps, we searched everywhere!\
\
'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I would say my friend here needs to be a little more careful. Indeed, I will say it! You should be more careful where you scamper off to, little one!'","Something is in there! Is that a squirrel?","Show the squirrel to Odulf","Pick up the squirrel","'Oh my, a ${CLASS}! That is what you are, is it not? My name is Odulf and I need your help! My brother Vulmar says there is a ghost in Blómgard. Not just any old ghost though, no! It is the ghost of Old Mad Ubb! I saw it, I saw it! Well, I saw a barrel or a crate move, I did! Please catch the ghost, ${CLASS}! Please, oh please, will you?'","The squirrel is surprisingly friendly"},
[12294]={"'¿No has sido capaz de potenciar la piedra? Sin un zafiro potenciado, no puedo ayudarte.'","La forja fantasma","Encontrarás a Fastarr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Fastarr te ha pedido que hables con él cuando estés dispuesto a buscar la forja, aunque advierte que una fuerza sobrenatural parece haberse apoderado de ella.","'Antes de empezar, tendrás que traerme un zafiro infundido.'","Lleva un zafiro infundido a Fastarr","'¡Ah! Veo que has encontrado un zafiro imbuido. Esta piedra servirá, pero una vez que la haya preparado, tendrás que llevarla a la forja acnetrasl para completar el proceso.\
\
'Avísame cuando estés listo y te indicaré el camino...'","Fastarr sabe de una forja donde puedes crear el núcleo de las cualidades que buscas, pero los enanos temen que esté infestada de espectros malignos.","'Te agradezco que hayas limpiado esa forja maldita. Me pregunto qué esperaban fabricar los espectros de Mordor en esas salas.'","Encontrarás a Fastarr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con él para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Habla con Fastarr para viajar a la Forja de los Espectros","'Conozco una forja que podría servir para moldear los cimientos de las cualidades que buscar otorgar a tu arma. Sin embargo, algo maligno y maldito se ha infiltrado en ese lugar ancestral, es demasiado peligroso ir allí.\
\
'Sin embargo, necesitas un zafiro infundido. Una piedra así es indispensable para canalizar el poder necesario para imbuir tu acero. Si logras hacerte con uno, te indicaré el camino hacia la forja...'","'Ve con cuidado, ${PLAYER}. No sé qué habita en las forjas de nuestros antepasados, pero todo aquel que ha osado acercarse a sus puertas habla de una inquietante sensación de pavor que emana de su interior. ¡Si estás listo, arma tu corazón de valor y ponte en marcha!\
\
'<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión en solitario y no se puede completar en una hermandad.</rgb>","'¡Bien luchado, ${PLAYER}! No sé que pretenden los esclavos espectrales de Mordor al reclamar las forjas de nuestros antepasados para sus artes oscuras, pero menos mal que su cometido ha fracasado.\
\
'Ahora, entrégame ese zafiro potenciado y veré qué queda por hacer para otorgar las cualidades que buscas.'","Fastarr te ha pedido que le lleves un zafiguro infundido, indispensable para otorgar a tu arma las cualidades que deseas.","Lleva el zafiro potenciado a Fastarr","¡La Forja de los Espectros sigue maldita!"},
[12295]={"Expoliadores de reliquias derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los expoliadores de reliquias (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Buscadores de reliquias derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Mi hijo cuenta que las ruinas están llenas de tesoros! Reliquias perdidas de reyes y reinas que lucharon aquí y cayeron, escupiendo maldiciones tan potentes que nadie se atrevió a despojarlos de sus bienes. Simplemente los dejaron donde cayeron, y los pájaros y los lobos se encargaron de los cuerpos'.\
\
Garan se estremece.\
\
'No creo en las maldiciones, pero creo que seguiremos nuestro camino de todos modos'.","Sigue el camino","Derrota al capitán buscador de reliquias","Vuelve con la pareja de ancianos","'¡Vaya, mira quién está aquí! ¡Mi  ${PLAYERNAME:favorito[m]|favorita[f]}! Tu llegada es de lo más fortuita una vez más. Otro de esos espíritus miserables está molestando a la buena gente como nosotros. ¡Me aparté del camino apenas un instante y se abalanzó sobre mí de forma espantosa!\
\
'Estaba recobrando fuerzas y preparándome para mandarlo a paseo, pero ahora que estás aquí... bueno, la juventud por delante. Te estaríamos muy agradecidos si pudieras encargarte tú'.","Los buscadores y expoliadores de reliquias se encuentran en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías derrotar a los buscadores y expoliadores de reliquias.","El montón de tierra está cerca del camino al sur de Eitheldir.\
\
Deberías investigar el montón de tierra.","La tierra ha sido removida aquí","Waltney y Garan Alboespino se encuentran en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías avisar a Waltney y Garan de que el bandido que fingía ser un fantasma ha sido derrotado.","¡Un camino se adentra en las rocas!","¡Una lata de pintura blanca como la tiza! Ideal para fingir ser un fantasma","Examina la tierra removida","'¡Mi hijo cuenta que las ruinas del Ángulo están llenas de tesoros! ¡Tesoros malditos, dice! ¡Yo no creo en las maldiciones!'\
\
Da un respingo cuando su caballo da una patada en el suelo. Aclarándose la garganta, continúa, frunciendo el ceño hacia Garan, que está partiéndose de risa.\
\
'Sin embargo, esperaremos aquí hasta que nos avises de que el camino está despejado'.","¿Un Hombre fingiendo ser un fantasma? ¿Qué estaba ocultando?","El camino se encuentra en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
El bandido vigilaba un pequeño camino. Deberías investigarlo.","El afloramiento rocoso está en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Has derrotado a un hombre que se hacía pasar por un fantasma y has encontrado una bolsa con una lata de pintura blanca. Sigue buscando pistas en el afloramiento rocoso para descubrir por qué intentaba asustar a la gente para que se alejara de esta zona.","Sigue buscando pistas","Busca a la figura fantasmal","El avance de Waltney y Garan Alboespino se ve detenido una vez más por un espectro fantasmal.","Los caminos fantasmales siguen y siguen","¡Ladrones y saqueadores de tumbas!","El afloramiento rocoso está en la parte suroeste del Ángulo.\
\
Has derrotado a un Hombre que se hacía pasar por un fantasma. Busca pistas en la zona del afloramiento rocoso por donde merodeaba para descubrir por qué intentaba asustar a la gente para que se alejara de esta zona.","Busca en el afloramiento rocoso","'¡Has vuelto! ¿Has derrotado al fantasma?'\
\
Le hablas sobre los buscadores de reliquias.\
\
'¿Así que ese miserable intentaba asustar a la gente para alejarla de donde estaban cavando fingiendo ser un fantasma? ¡Pues a mí me engañó por completo!\
\
'¡Tienes mi agradecimiento, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Yo mismo me habría encargado de no ser porque me sobran unas cuantas décadas. ¡Te estamos muy agradecidos! No tenemos mucho, pero acepta esto por las molestias, por favor. ¡Nos pondremos en camino a Tornhad una vez más, todo gracias a ti!'","Derrota a los buscadores de reliquias (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La figura fantasmal se encuentra cerca del camino al sur de Eitheldir, en la parte occidental del Ángulo.\
\
Deberías buscar a la figura fantasmal."},
[12298]={"Los gigantes han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas y se han reunido en un valle al este del Páramo Alto, quebrantando los tratados que tenían con los Elfos de Rivendel.","El Valle de los Gigantes","Hay gigantes reuniéndose en un valle al este del Páramo Alto, en el Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras estés en el valle de los gigantes, deberías intentar ahuyentar a los gigantes que han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas.","Derrota gigantes en el valle de los gigantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gigantes derrotados en el valle de los gigantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12299]={"Ravaedron ha visto algo que le ha disgustado","Recoge hierbas silvestres para Idhrien (4/5)","Maddoc Astaciervo se encuentra fuera de su casa, contemplando el regalo.","'¿Podría pedirte que busques a la montaraz Idhrien y te disculpes por mi prisa, y quizá que derrotes a cualquier bestia peligrosa que encuentres por allí?'","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. ¿Ravaedron te ha enviado para ayudarme? Tiene muchas cosas en la cabeza, ¡y no hace falta que me pida disculpas! Pero le diría esto, si se tomara el tiempo de escuchar mis palabras: \\q¡No es tu responsabilidad resolver todos los problemas de la Tierra Media! Deja esta tierra lo mejor que puedas, y trata a los que se quedan con toda la amabilidad que puedas ofrecer. Si lo haces, ¡zarparás hacia el Oeste con un corazón tranquilo y serás merecedor de la paz que te has ganado!\\q\
\
'Eso es lo que creo, en cualquier caso. Quizá los Dúnedain no estemos en posición de decir tales cosas, pues nuestro deber parece no tener fin. Pero creo que estas palabras ayudarán a Ravaedron, aunque me cueste aplicarlas a mí misma.\
\
'Pero si me ayudas a recoger las hierbas que necesito, ¡mi trabajo de hoy irá el doble de rápido! Búscalas cuando hayas terminado tus asuntos actuales. ¡No quiero que te topes con ninguna bestia mientras tienes los ojos clavados en el suelo!'\
\
Idhrien describe las briznas parecidas a hierba que está buscando y te dice que aún no ha mirado hacia el este.","Hierbas silvestres recogidas para Idhrien (${NUMBER}/5)","Ravaedron ha visto algo junto a la cabaña que le ha inquietado bastante.","'Ah, ¿esas son las hierbas que necesita Idhrien? Estaba recogiendo un tipo totalmente equivocado. Bueno, ahora que sé las que busca, tendré más... más...'\
\
Ravaedron se calla, con la mirada perdida hacia el este.","Recogiste hierbas silvestres para Idhrien (5/5), y ves que Ravaedron está muy cerca","Habla con Ravaedron en la Cabaña del Helechal","Incapaz de contener su entusiasmo, Ravaedron ya ha entregado su regalo","Reúnete con la montaraz Idhrien fuera de Glynafon","Descubre qué ha disgustado a Ravaedron","'Aún no he mirado hacia el este, ${PLAYER}, si no te importa buscar en esa dirección.'","'Espero que me perdones por no esperarte, ${PLAYER}, pero tenía muchas ganas de entregarles mi regalo.\
\
'De hecho, tenía tanta prisa que apenas saludé a la montaraz Idhrien, a quien me crucé de camino hacia aquí. Estaba recogiendo hierbas para los Dúnedain, y le prometí que la ayudaría con esa tarea una vez que hubiera terminado la mía. ¿Podría pedirte que la busques y te disculpes por mi prisa, y quizá que derrotes a cualquier bestia peligrosa que encuentres por allí?'","Derrota bestias del Ángulo cerca de la Cabaña del Helechal y cerca de Glynafon (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La recolección de hierbas te ha llevado muy cerca de Ravaedron. Le alegrará llevarle el fruto de tu trabajo a Idhrien.","Ravaedron ha terminado el cuadro para Maddoc y Glenys Astaciervo, y está deseando dárselo.","'Yo... no lo entiendo, ${PLAYER}. ¿Por qué los Astaciervo han desechado mi cuadro? ¿No les ha gustado el regalo que les he hecho? ¡Esto es... muy hiriente! Me disgustó nuestra disputa, pero esto duele diez veces más y me hace cuestionar toda nuestra amistad. ¿No entienden que debo abandonar esta tierra, y que, a pesar de mi certeza en esa decisión, partir sigue siendo difícil?\
\
'Pero... ¿cómo iban a saberlo? No han vivido las experiencias de los Eldar ni se han enfrentado a las cosas que he vivido yo. Sus penas pueden ser más efímeras que las mías, pero... no por ello las sienten menos profundamente.\
\
'Creo que me he dado cuenta de algo, ${PLAYER}. Mi regalo estaba lleno de buenas intenciones, pero no abordaba en absoluto lo definitivo de mi decisión, ni aliviaba la herida que podía causar. Yo buscaba un remedio fácil, pero ese remedio no existe, ni ha existido nunca.'","La montaraz Idhrien sugirió que podrías ayudarla a recoger algunas de las hierbas silvestres que necesita para hacer cataplasmas y otros remedios curativos para los Dúnedain.","Ravaedron guarda silencio, con la mirada perdida hacia el este.","El regalo","Habla con Ravaedron junto a la Cabaña del Helechal","'Sí, esto seguro que disipa el recuerdo de nuestra disputa. Además, con la promesa de los Dúnedain de que seguirán protegiendo estas tierras, puedo partir hacia los Puertos Grises con el corazón ligero. Pero primero, ¡debo entregar mi regalo! ¡Te veré en la Cabaña del Helechal!'","'Sí, podré partir hacia los Puertos Grises con el corazón ligero. Pero primero, ¡debo entregar mi regalo! ¡Te veré en la Cabaña del Helechal!'","Reúnete con Ravaedron fuera de la Cabaña del Helechal","Habla con Maddoc Astaciervo fuera de su casa","Ravaedron está en la Cabaña del Helechal, radiante de felicidad.","Ravaedron está junto a la cabaña de sus amigos, dolido por el rechazo de su regalo.","Llévale las hierbas silvestres que recogiste a Ravaedron","Ravaedron te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en la Cabaña del Helechal, donde le dará el cuadro a sus amigos.","El regalo que pintó Ravaedron ha sido desechado sin contemplaciones junto a la cabaña","'Sí, esto es... muy bonito. Le he dado las gracias a Ravaedron por ello.'\
\
Maddoc te mira de reojo, pero no dice nada.","Ravaedron se encontró con la montaraz Idhrien de camino a la Cabaña del Helechal y cree que deberías ayudarla si puedes.","Bestias del Ángulo derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge hierbas silvestres para Idhrien (${NUMBER}/5)"},
[12300]={"While waiting for Grimbeorn's answer, Legolas recalls a recent story told to him by King Thranduil.","Talk to Legolas at the Beorninghús","'Since we have some time, let me tell you the story that my father Thranduil told to me.'","Legolas can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","The Gift of Greenleaves","'We have some time before Grimbeorn sends his reply, ${PLAYER}. While we wait, perhaps I can tell you a story of something that happened recently, but that you missed? You were kept busy with other events of some importance, as I am sure you will recall, but great deeds were performed here among the Vales of Anduin. My father Thranduil told me of his recent visit here, after the war, and I can speak of it to you, if you like.'","Habla con Legolas.","'Grimbeorn is possessed of a gruff demeanour, but he cares much for the Vales of Anduin and the people who live there. If he sees that we care for them as well he may be more willing to reopen the trade route with Felegoth.'"},
[12305]={"Erianir can be found in Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
You have lit many lanterns to aid in illuminating the Dawnless Day and comforted those too young to understand the trials of Gondor. You should speak to Erianir.","Calmed children of Sarnhad (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'You have my thanks, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I do not wish for my children to grow older filled with fears of darkness and war. Let us hope that when this war comes to an end, a better world shall be left behind for those that remain.'","Sarnhad can be found due east of Linhir in Lebennin.\
\
Erchar has asked you to travel into Lebennin and provide aid where you are able.","Children of Sarnhad can be found throughout Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
Erianir has asked you to bring hope to the children of Sarnhad before they fall into despair.","The Gloom in the East","Lanterns can be found throughout Sarnhad in western Lebennin.\
\
Erianir has asked you to light the lanterns in Sarnhad.","Greatly troubled by the recent attack in Linhir and the loss of his brother, Erchar hopes to secure Lebennin before seeking vengeance against the Heirs of Castamir.","Lit lanterns in Sarnhad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Light lanterns in Sarnhad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Erianir in Sarnhad","Calm children of Sarnhad (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Talk to someone in Sarnhad about the troubles of Lebennin","DNT -- will not be seen","'We hold Linhir because of you, ${PLAYER}, but we lost far too much in the fight to hold it. I have sent my remaining guards to search for Garvir... but I hold little hope that he will be found. Either the current has taken him out to the bay, or his plate armour drew him down to the river-bed.\
\
'I blame myself for his loss, and I curse myself for not seeing the folly of rushing out into the fields of battle with so few in my command. The war rages on in Lebennin... this much is clear to me now.\
\
'Travel to the settlement of Sarnhad due east of the south-gate of Linhir, and see if you can aid the people there. Herion and I shall renew Linhir's defences while you aid the folk of Lebennin.\
\
'And ${PLAYER}... should you find the scarlet-garbed man who slew Garvir in Lebennin, I shall not be denied the chance to run him through.'","'You come to us in troubling times, traveller.\
\
'The people of Lebennin are beset from the coast, and soon I fear that all of our land shall fall to the Corsairs. We have fallen beneath their notice for the moment, but I do not think it long until their attention turns to my people.\
\
'The darkening of the sky has left my people baffled and frightened... and we left our lanterns cold when we heard the passing of a great force nearby lest they discover our homes.\
\
'Now, we must cut through this gloom and bring hope to our people, especially the young. One as well-travelled as yourself would be of great help in that regard!'"},
[12307]={"'You have earned great honour in the eyes of the Malledhrim and of all the Galadhrim.\
\
'I fear, however, that this may not be the last time we will need to make such a show of strength.'","The Glory of the Malledhrim","Defend the banner of the Malledhrim","'${PLAYER}, it would behoove us to be certain that the Orcs at the Gostannon do not regain their courage and inconvenience our forces moving through the area. To that end, I have a task for you.\
\
'Take this banner and plant it upon a prominent place within the ruins of the Orcs' encampment. This will likely enrage the Enemy into attacking you, but should you defend the banner for long enough, they will become disheartened, for you will have proven the glory of the Malledhrim.\
\
'Return to me with the tale of your battle. I will be very pleased to know whether you have succeeded or not. Do not leave the banner unattended, or I will consider your task a failure. Defend it!'","Dannaswen is at the Elf-waypost atop Amon Angened, south of the Gostannon.\
\
You should return to Dasswen with news of your victory.","You have been defeated","'I wonder if you have the mettle it would take to truly show the glory of the Malledhrim?'","Plant the banner at the Gostannon","Talk to Dannaswen atop Amon Angened","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not fall before the Enemy</rgb>","Planted the banner at the Gostannon","Defended the banner of the Malledhrim","You have left the banner undefended","'You have earned great honour among my people, ${PLAYER}.'","'Remember: once you have planted our banner, do not leave it undefended until the required time has passed, or I will consider your task a failure!'","The Elves of the Golden Host are concerned with the continuing presence of Orcs in the Mirk-eaves and in procuring supplies for the Malledhrim in the east.","The Gostannon lies to the north of Amon Angened.\
\
Dannaswen asked you to defend the banner you planted in the enemy encampment at the Gostannon.","The pile of stones is atop a small rise in the Orc-camp at the Gostannon, north-east of Amon Angeled.\
\
Dannaswen has asked you to plant the banner of the Malledhrim at the Orc-camp near the Gostannon and defend it against the Orcs.","<rgb=#FF0000>Do not leave the banner undefended</rgb>"},
[12308]={"'The foul things that lurk in the Morgul Vale are creeping into Ithilien. At night I can see a strange glow coming from the ruins just across the Morgulduin River. My eyes do not play tricks on me, for others have witnessed the ghastly lights too. I am concerned about whatever is causing this sorcery. Will you look into it for me?'","Collected water sample (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rolanthir can be found just south of Faramir's Look-out in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should investigate Rolanthir. Arodor has seen strange and ghastly lights coming from these ruins.","Collect water samples from the Morgulduin (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Glow from Rolanthir","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with Arodor at Faramir's Look-out.","Defeated Darkwaters (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return the water sample to Arodor","Investigate the ruins of Rolanthir","Rolanthir can be found just south of Faramir's Look-out in Southern Ithilien.\
\
You should defeat Darkwaters and collect samples of water from the Morgulduin River.","It appears that foul spirits bound to the Morgulduin congregate in the ruins","Arodor has asked you to investigate strange lights coming from ruins on the other side of the Morgulduin River.","'What's this? Water from the Morgulduin? It looks foul and defiled, perhaps from the army and beasts stationed in Minas Morgul. The spirits of these waters must have been corrupted and their will bent to serve the Dark Lord. What might happen if a man or an Orc were immersed in these waters? I shall not think such thoughts.'","Defeat Darkwaters along the Morgulduin River (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12309]={"'Hail, ${CLASS}, and welcome. I am the leader of this company, though I fear I do poorly with the safekeeping of our goals. Perhaps I am rather too lenient with the whims of my good people, for I gave Nífdir leave to investigate the whisperings, and now it has been many days since his return.\
\
'The whisperings, yes. Have you not heard them? We all perceived the shudderings and discontent amongst the trees as we travelled through the drowned lands. Good Nífdir wished to remain and hear them, for he is more concerned with the trees than with the Orcs and wraiths. He loves all forests, however bleak and black they seem. I had not the heart to forbid him.\
\
'Did I do wrong to leave him behind? It has been many days since we parted ways to the west of here, in the heart of the swamp. I yearn to know if he has come to harm, but I do not wish to send others into danger for my foolishness, for we are precious few, and our mission is clear. I have already compromised our plans. Will you seek Nífdir?'","'Nífdir was last seen to the west of here, deep within the swamp, but that was many days ago. I hope that he is safe....'","Nenedhel parted ways with Nífdir to the west of Estolad Mernael.\
\
Nenedhel, leader of the Malledhrim in the Drownholt, has asked you to seek Nífdir in the swamp-lands.","Busca a Nífir en el Bosque Ahogado","Habla con Nenedhel en Estolad Mernael","Nenedhel is at Estolad Mernael, east of Nífdir's small camp.\
\
You should speak with Nenedhel and assure him that Nífdir is safe, but not yet ready to rejoin his companions.","The Elves of the Drownholt are missing one of their own -- a curious Elf who fancied he heard the sorrow of the trees as they made their way through the swamplands. He has not returned, and his companions yearn for news of him.","Los árboles sombríos del Bosque Ahogado","'You are very good to have sought me for Nenedhel's peace of mind! Please assure him that I am well enough.'","'Nífdir lives! You lift a great burden from my shoulders with this news, ${PLAYER}; I thank you. You have been very helpful.\
\
'I do wish he would hasten with his work, however. Perhaps you can help him to speed this along, for I fear that further delay will compromise our aims.'","'Mae govannen, mellon. Nenedhel sent you to find me, did he? I am sorry to have given him anxiety on my behalf, and I hope that he will forgive me. I fear I am not ready to leave just yet. Can you perceive the wrath and fury of the trees all around us? I must know what angers them so.\
\
'Please return to Nenedhel with my apologies and word that I am whole and well. Tell him that I will return when I can, but not before I attempt to discern what ails the trees of this swamp. I do not think they are evil! Alas, my heart is saddened by their pain.'"},
[12310]={"Trasgos derrotados en la granja Hove (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El trasgo granjero","¡Lukglob ha sido derrotado!","¡Los trasgos han expulsado a la familia Hove the su granja y se han hecho con ella!","Bethan Hove te ha pedido que acabes con los trasgos que se han hecho con la granja de su familia.\
\
La granja de la familia Hove está en el norte de Cardolan.","Acaba con trasgos en la granja Hove (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Saludos. Soy Bethan Hove. ¿Has venido del oeste? Me pregunto si has estado también en nuestra granja. Los Scurloc han sido muy amables con nosotros. ¡Nos acogieron cuando una maldita banda de trasgos nos expulsó de nuestra tierra! Los desalmados mataron a nuestras vacas y se comieron toda nuestra comida. Pobre Nelly. ¡Era una gran vaca!\
\
'No tenemos mucho, pero si vuelves en esa dirección, dales a esos trasgos a probar de su propia medicina. ¡Te lo agradecería mucho! Encontrarás nuestra granja al oeste de aquí.'","Acaba con Lukglob"},
[12311]={"'Los héroes vienen de lugares inesperados. Lo hiciste muy bien, ${PLAYER}. Si fuera más valiente, habría entrado entre esos trasgos por mi cuenta.\
\
'Aunque hayamos asestado un golpe a los trasgos aquí en el oeste, es poco probable que la tribu se disperse. Están muy organizados para ser trasgos, casi como si hubiera un propósito en sus acciones. Algo me dice que las Tierras Solitarias se enfrentan a tiempos difíciles....... bueno, peores de lo habitual.\
\
'Sobreviviremos, siempre lo hacemos, y gracias a ti quizá podamos manejar a los trasgos cerca de nuestra posada. Te prometí un regalo. Esto era mío cuando aún era lo bastante joven para us...r...o... ahora te lo entrego. Que te sirva tan bien como me sirvió a mí.'","'Los trasgos llegaron desde el norte y tomaron las ruinas del sur, luego fueron forzados a servir a los extraños orcos del norte. Su líder, un astuto enano llamado Nishrûk, se oculta en las ruinas al oeste de este campamento, en las zonas más oscuras de Minas Eriol.\
\
'Bram me envió aquí para asegurarme de que el líder fuera destruido y que estas buenas personas estuvieran bien vigiladas. Ahora, sé que el campamento está más allá de las ruinas al oeste, en un área que parece realmente infestada de trasgos.\
\
'Ve a esa sección de las ruinas de Minas Eriol y mata a Nishrûk. Tendré una recompensa para ti cuando el trabajo esté hecho.'","'Estos trasgos son un problema, pero me atrevo a decir que serán más fáciles de manejar ahora que has matado a Nishrûk.'","El líder de los trasgos, Nishrûk, vive en una fortaleza de trasgos construida entre las ruinas al sureste de la Posada Abandonada.\
\
El ayudante Osmann te pidió que mataras a Nishrûk, el líder de los trasgos que causan problemas en la Posada Abandonada.","'Nishrûk no volverá a molestar a nadie....... buen trabajo, ${PLAYER}.'","Derrota a Nishrûk","'Bram confió demasiado en mí, me temo. No soy un guerrero lo bastante fuerte para abrirme paso entre la cantidad de trasgos apostados al oeste. Mejor dejar eso a gente como tú. Gente resistente y sana que ansía la aventura.'","El líder de los trasgos","Nishrûk derrotado","Habla con el ayudante Osmann","Los trasgos de Minas Eriol están liderados por una criatura terrible llamada Nishrûk.","El ayudante Osmann te espera al otro lado del puente, en el extremo oriental de las ruinas de Minas Eriol.\
\
Entraste en las ruinas y derrotaste a Nishrûk, tal como pidió el ayudante Osmann. Deberías volver con él para darle la noticia de tu éxito."},
[12312]={"'We may be waiting a while. Get comfortable.'","Langhár can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in northern Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Langhár.","The stage is set for a battle between the goblin forces.\
\
You should complete 'Instance: Revenge of the Great Goblin.'","Battle is about to erupt outside of Vegbár. The Beornings can only hope the goblins will do enough damage that the small force of Beornings can overwhelm the survivors.","'There is nothing more to do but wait for the Great Goblin to attack Goblin-town with the force he has mustered. When he does, we will be watching, ready to pounce on the winner and lay him low!'","'We did it, ${PLAYER}! Did you see the look on that fat goblin's face when the Eagle appeared? Hah!\
\
'Goblin-town is no longer a threat, and Gundabad has lost control of the goblin host. We have dealt a great blow to our enemies! Eventually a new Great Goblin will rise to the top. They always do, in time. But for now we celebrate our victory!\
\
'Thank you for your help, ${PLAYER}. You have done a great service for the Beornings and the other folk of the Vales. We are in your debt!'","Talk to Skalla and ready the ambush","The Goblins at War","Habla con Langhár"},
[12313]={"Hay arañas en los Páramos del Norte, al sur de Dwaling.\
\
Bob Hojasverdes te pidió que salieras y mataras arañas, con la esperanza de que los trasgos se vayan.","Habla con Bob Hojasverdes en Dwaling","Bob Hojasverdes está en Dwaling, al norte de los Páramos del Norte.\
\
Deberías regresar a Bob Hojasverdes con las noticias de tu éxito.","Derrota a las cazadoras telasilvanas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Bien, has vuelto, y veo que te has encargado de algunas de esas arañas.\
\
'Bueno, se me ha ocurrido una idea sobre lo que traman esos trasgos con las entrañas de las arañas... ¡y no es un pensamiento agradable!'","Cazadoras telasilvanas derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La fuente de los trasgos","'Qué quieren esos trasgos con las entrañas de las arañas es un misterio, sin duda, pero hay una cosa que sé con certeza: ¡no traman nada bueno!\
\
'¿Tal vez los trasgos se irán si acabas con las arañas? Hay más de las que cualquiera podría manejar al este de aquí. Los Páramos del Norte están plagados de ellas.\
\
'Desde luego, a ninguno de nosotros le dará pena ver muertas a esas bestias. Pero ten cuidado.'","Tejedoras telasilvanas derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No sé qué traman esos trasgos, pero tal vez desistan cuando ya no haya más arañas que cazar.'","Bob Hojasverdes está confundido por tus descubrimientos en los campamentos de trasgos.","Derrota a las tejedoras telasilvanas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12314]={"'Sé que vosotros, gente pequeña, apreciáis mucho las piedras brillantes. Nosotros no valoramos la mayoría de estas piedras, pero atesoramos las que llamamos Ojos de la Tierra. Creo que en vuestra lengua las llamáis ojos de gato y piedras lunares.\
\
Parece que los trasgos que sirven a los Angmarim en su fortaleza al noreste de Ram Dûath han robado muchas de estas piedras, incluidos ojos de la tierra de nuestro pueblo.\
\
Os pediría que fuerais a esa fortaleza y recuperéis los tesoros de los trasgos. Deberían estar guardados en cofres llenos de gemas. Nosotros tomaremos los Ojos de la Tierra, y el resto será vuestro, con nuestro agradecimiento.'","Recoge gemas de trasgo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has recuperado varias gemas semipreciosas robadas a los Suuri-lehmä por los trasgos de Ram Dûath.\
\
Debes devolverlas a Aslak en Lehmä-koti.","El tesoro de los trasgos","Lleva las gemas de los trasgos de vuelta a Aslak en Lehmä-koti","Aslak de los Suuri-lehmä te dijo que los trasgos han reunido montones de gemas en la fortaleza que comparten con los Angmarim en el paso noreste de Ram Dûath.","'¿Los trasgos guardan bien sus cofres de piedras brillantes, verdad? ¡Cuidado también con sus amos Angmarim!'","Los trasgos de Ram Dûath han robado varios tesoros de los Suuri-lehmä.\
\
Aslak te ha dicho que las gemas pueden encontrarse en cofres dentro de la fortaleza Angmarim al noreste.","Gemas de trasgo recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Ah, sí, lo has logrado! Aquí... Separaré los Ojos de la Tierra, y el resto será tuyo!'"},
[12315]={"You spoke with the guard","You spoke with the innkeeper","Speak with Ledger-keeper Zarai at the courtyard in Jax Phanâl","You spoke with the dock-master","'It is good you have come to me. First, I will require a name for the ledger so that the people will come to know you for all that you do in these lands.'\
\
She awaits your response and then scribbles some notes in a writing style you do not recognize. She then continues.\
\
'Very well, that is all I require of you for now. If you wish to know more, I can spare a few moments to explain the purpose of the ledger-keepers.'","Speak with the innkeeper at the central outer courtyard","Return to Girgish at Jax Phanâl","'I am pleased to make your acquaintance and hope that you are finding our outpost as welcoming as we wish to make it, friend. This is a land reborn and her people celebrate the casting off of the yoke that restrained them.\
\
'Tyranny is ended. We wake to a dream from a nightmare that lasted too long. The Kindred breathe life and liberty into the lands, and we are free to roam once again. Our roads are safer and travel and trade quicken their pace. Natural dangers remain, however: passage around the Cape is not always easy, and you may still prefer to visit the stables should you wish to journey to the fort at Rakhatâb, to the south! But you have my welcome all the same, should you have need of my service.'","Speak with Gadnith in the easternmost outer courtyard","You spoke with the auctioneer","Girgish represents Khôltekh, a leader of the Kindred of the Coins. She has requested that you make yourself known to some of the citizens in Jax Phanâl.","'Come closer, friend, and look upon the wares that I oversee. All manner of goods, weapons, armour, and other such delights await you.\
\
'A brisk trade returns to Jax Phanâl now that the tyranny of the past is ended. I will do my part to see that these items are safe-guarded. Once they are purchased, I return the profits to those who entrusted their goods to my care... for a modest fee, of course. I treat the goods under my care as I would my own children.\
\
'That is, if I had any children!'\
\
The barker laughs and returns to calling out auction details.","Speak with the auctioneer","'A new face. I hope that it will remain a friendly one.'\
\
She offers a wry smile.\
\
'Time will tell, of course. I assume that you met the magistrate; this is good. He will steer you in the right direction until you get your bearings. Until recently, our shores were less... hospitable to outsiders.\
\
'I am Girgish, an emissary here at the behest of Khôltekh, a leader of the Kindred of the Coins who now rules in Umbar. I would have you introduce yourself to others in this outpost, If you are willing.\
\
'I think you should meet our barber, innkeeper, stable-master, auctioneer, and ledger-keeper.\
\
'Return to me once you have made their acquaintances.'","Speak with the dock-master on the shore west of the outpost","Having spoken with important members of the town, you should return to Khôltekh's emissary and let her know that you now have introduced yourself to those she recommended you meet.","'The emissary did well to send you to me, friend. Do you have need of a bed? Wine? Ale? Or perhaps a meal cooked in the style of the lands from which you hail? You need but ask and if it is within my power or the purview of this inn, I shall make it so. We are pleased that our land is more hospitable to those from abroad now that the Kindred watch over our people. We hope that this will bring about even greater commerce to our land, in time.'","'Welcome back, ${PLAYER}.  \
\
'I am pleased that you were able to make introductions around town. Now there are some matters that could use both your attention and your discretion.'","Girgish directed you to make your way around the outpost of Jax Phanâl to familiarize yourself with the citizens dwelling here. She then bids you return to her after meeting all the important folk in the outpost.","'You are not familiar to me. Perhaps that is a good thing. Ending up on the wrong side of the guards leads to poor marks by the ledger-keepers.\
\
'By the look of you, you have been at sea. You should get some rest. Tend to your injuries and find a nice meal to eat.\
\
'I am here to serve and watch. Please, leave me to my duty.'","The Golden Dwarf"},
[12316]={"Visita el barrio de Erebor.","Visita la Casa de Provisiones y Artesanía de Erebor","Ves una pequeña morada que, con las decoraciones adecuadas, podría resultar muy acogedora","Habla con Gárthi Guardallaves","Visita el mirador central","Visita una casa lujosa a lo largo de la Vía de Escudo de Roble o el Camino de Pie de Hierro","Visita una casa modesta a lo largo del Puente del Tesoro de Sierpe","Debes regresar a la entrada del barrio y hablar con Gárthi Guardallaves.","Ves una casa imponente con múltiples patios","Pasas junto a un jardín inusual y ves una casa aún más inusual","El Salón Dorado de Erebor","Visita la Geoda del Camino de Pie de Hierro","Este pasillo serpenteante alberga varios servicios de la ciudad","Visita el salón de hermandad","El gran salón se alza ante ti, refulgente en verde y oro.","Descubres una finca magnífica, llena de posibilidades","Grandes calzadas se extienden hacia el norte, llevando al salón de hermandad","'¡Saludos, ${RACE}! ¿Has oído la noticia? Mis hermanos en Erebor han reclamado el último de los tesoros dorados que dejó Smaug el Terrible. ¡Tras mucho esfuerzo, este gran salón ha sido restaurado a su antigua gloria!\
\
'En honor a este momento tan solemne, el rey Thorin III ha ordenado que abramos sus puertas para que todos puedan contemplar su belleza. Aunque los mayores de sus tesoros han sido retirados para resguardarlos, el oro permanece como recordatorio de nuestro pasado.'","Las puertas del último tesoro dorado de Smaug están abiertas, y los Enanos de Erebor buscan habitar una vez más este gran salón.","La entrada al tesoro dorado se encuentra junto a los muros occidentales de Tumnu-dûm, los Salones-Vivienda de Erebor.\
\
Deberías visitar y explorar el salón recién restaurado.","'¡Bienvenido de nuevo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}! ¿Acaso no es un prodigio este salón? Seguramente hubo una o dos moradas que captaron tu mirada como una gema reluciente.'"},
[12317]={"'Ah, supongo que era mucho esperar que encontraras ese pequeño paquete de levadura en un lugar tan grande.'","Lleva la levadura a Gunderic Cavada","Gunderic Cavada, posadero de la Perca Dorada, participa en la Feria de la Cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","Consigue la levadura","La Perca Dorada","Levadura obtenida","'¡Bienvenido a la Perca Dorada! Prueba una jarra de Viejo Tornasauce. Ha ganado la Feria de la Cerveza de las Cuatro Cuadernas tres años seguidos, pero me temo que este año no ganaré, ¡pues no me queda mucho de la reserva antigua! De alguna manera, mi masa de levadura se ha echado a perder, y algún despistado dejó que el moho llegara a mi almacén seco. Sucede, pero mi levadura es especial. ¡Es lo que hace que el Viejo Tornasauce sea tan bueno! Así que tuve que conseguir más. Pensé en probar lo mejor que ofrece las Tierras de Bree, así que pedí a Cebadilla Mantecona que me enviara un paquete desde el Poney Pisador.\
\
El caso es que... parece que el paquete nunca llegó. Ni el carretero tampoco. Creo que esos malditos bandidos acampados al oeste de la Marjala se han hecho con el carro. El campamento está en las colinas al sur de Casa del Bosque, más o menos a mitad de camino entre Alforzaburgo y la granja del viejo Maggot.\
\
Dicen que eres capaz de lidiar con problemas como esos bandidos. ¿Qué te parece ir hasta allí y ver si encuentras mi levadura entre sus bienes robados?'","'¡Ah, parece que es la levadura! ¡Y no se ha echado a perder! ¡Buen trabajo! ¡Gracias!'","El campamento de los bandidos está en las colinas al sur de Casa del Bosque, más o menos a mitad de camino entre Alforzaburgo y la granja de Maggot. La posada de la Perca Dorada está en Cepeda, al este de Casa del Bosque.\
\
Gunderic Cavada te ha enviado a buscar en un campamento de bandidos su paquete de levadura perdido."},
[12318]={"Jabalíes enfermos agresivos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra al explorador cerca de la entrada de Shakhdag.","Suginzi, el jabalí de la plaga te ha encontrado","'¡Eso es todo un botín de jabalí! Deberíamos regresar a Udlanu en Urmâkh con este premio.'","Lonchas sanas de jabalí obtenidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue lonchas sanas de jabalí y elimina a los jabalíes enfermos de la manada.","Derrota a Suginzi, el jabalí podrido","Elimina a los jabalíes enfermos agresivos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Consigue lonchas sanas de jabalí para que un cocinero las convierta en su famosa receta de tocino para la hambrienta gente de Urmâkh.","Jabalíes iracundos enfermos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Elimina a los jabalíes enfermos salvajes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Encuentra al explorador cerca de la entrada de Shakhdag","El buen tocino","Derrota a Suginzi, el jabalí podrido.","Consigue lonchas sanas de jabalí (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12319]={"'I am relieved beyond all of my expectations that you have done so well in your task, ${PLAYER}. But do not wander away just yet -- there is someone I would have you seek.\
\
'Please stay a moment more and hear what I have to say.'","'Time is pressing, ${PLAYER}. Make haste! Hrólfur is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Moria. I only hope that you will find him more friendly than our first messenger did. The letter explains all -- if he is rational, he will heed our words.'","Haldir awaits news of your good deeds towards the dwarves upon his flet near the River Nimrodel, on the western border of Lothlórien.\
\
You should seek Haldir and inform him of all that passed while you assisted the dwarves.","Habla con Haldir en Talan Haldir","'Is there anything you want? I am a busy dwarf, traveller.'","Hrólfur is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in Durin's Way.\
\
You should speak with Hrólfur and accept his two charges: the conquering of Nalâ-dûm, where the water-wheels are, and Lumul-nar, the Hall of Mirrors.","Help the dwarves regain control of Nalâ-dûm","'We do not often welcome strangers within our borders, ${PLAYER}, but here we shall make an exception for you. Lady Galadriel is aware that you are recently come from Moria, where you have done much to help secure the dwarves' footing there. She bade me not to hinder your crossing of the Nimrodel. You are welcome to take refuge in our talan and share of our provisions, for I must speak with you at length on a serious matter.\
\
'You may have noticed that Orcs are pressing closer and closer to Lothlórien, fairest of Elven-homes, and that there are plots and stirrings in Moria to set all the Free Peoples in this area ill at ease. It is therefore crucial that the dwarves hold fast in their newly reclaimed home; their coming was an unforeseen blessing at a most fortuitous time! Our enemies' eyes are divided with stout warriors and builders shaking the walls of their dark haven.\
\
'But the dwarves are not secure. They need our help. In the Chamber of the Cross-roads, you will find an important dwarf who goes by the name of Hrólfur. He oversees much of what the expedition endeavours to accomplish. He did not wish to speak to our messenger, but you have reputation as a hero among the Iron Garrison. He will listen to you! Hasten to him if you will, and bring him this note. I want you to help the dwarves as a token of good will from the Galadhrim.'","Hrólfur, an important overseer, can likely be found in the Chamber of the Cross-roads in Moria, in Durin's Way.\
\
Haldir has pressed you to bring an important message from Celeborn to Hrólfur after a previous attempt to make contact was spurned by the proud dwarf.","Bring Celeborn's letter to Hrólfur","'So you come from the land of the meddling Elves, do you? I am sorry you took the trouble of coming all this way for naught! I know what they seek: for their backs to be shielded by the blood of the dwarves while they wander ever in peace in their haunted eaves.'\
\
'I will read this message, but... what? Indeed, I am a great fool. Lord Celeborn speaks of Moria flooded with rays of light and the creaking of the water-wheels. Such ideas were lost to us when Durin fell.\
\
'I now have two great tasks to achieve. Lumul-nar and Nalâ-dûm, as Celeborn describes from his long memory, were great halls from whence the light and water flooded Khazad-dûm. They now lie dormant, surely under the sway of evil, as we find with all the once-fair halls of our great kingdom. Can you help us to restore them, ${PLAYER}? Please find some information on how this can be done!'","The Good Will of the Galadhrim","Help the dwarves regain control of Lumul-nar","The Galadhrim of Lothlórien feel the pressing of danger upon their borders from many sides, but never so violently as the recent attacks from Moria since the arrival of a secret company in the Golden Wood. Haldir, a marchwarden of the Nimrodel, wishes to secure a friendship with the dwarves of Khazad-dûm so that the evils of Moria may be kept at bay, for the safety of both lands."},
[12320]={"No mates al Devoto","Gothgaash ha sido derrotado por ${PLAYER}","Glothrok ha sido derrotado por ${PLAYER}","No mates a Gothgaash","No mates a la Bestia","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","'Igash es uno de los capitanes más temibles de Mazog... ¡Hay que derrotarlo cuanto antes!'","El Devoto ha sido derrotado por ${PLAYER}","El enano Sigurd se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Has derrotado a Igash sin matar a ningún otro miembro de las tribus de orcos de Moria. Sigurd espera noticias de tu incursión.","'Se rumorea que eres más fuerte que la mayoría, . Admito que pareces lo bastante valiente, y tienes una mirada más feroz que la de muchos que he visto. Quizás podrías hacer frente a un enemigo muy difícil que amenaza nuestra causa.\
\
'Sabemos que Igash se encuentra en lo alto de la Gran Escalera, recaudando tributos de las demás tribus de orcos de Moria. No obstante, los orcos de la Mano Blanca no parecen mostrarle lealtad alguna.\
\
'Y, sin embargo, el mero hecho de pelear contra Igash no será más que una nimiedad para ${PLAYERNAME:un poderoso[m]|una poderosa[f]}  como tú. Si consigues acabar con él sin hacerles daño a los demás líderes orcos, salvo a los de la Mano Blanca, te ganarás de verdad mi respeto. Y tampoco puedes matar al Devoto. Te aconsejo que lleves a esta aventura a amigos en quienes puedas confiar.'","La Bestia ha sido derrotada por ${PLAYER}","'¡Estoy tremendamente impresionado! Has hecho honor a tu fama, un gran honor, sin duda. Pero hay algo que aún me preocupa. Según tu descripción de este enemigo, parece que el mal no se mantendrá a raya por mucho tiempo en la Gran Escalera.\
\
'¿Crees que Igash se ha ido para siempre? Sé que lo viste sucumbir, pero mi corazón me dice que volverá en poco tiempo. Una criatura tan retorcida y malvada no suele caer tras una sola derrota. Recuerda lo que te digo: pronto habrá problemas de nuevo...'","Muchas tribus de orcos merodean por la Gran Escalera, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Geirr te ha pedido que derrotes a Igash en la Gran Escalera sin matar a ningún otro miembro de las tribus de orcos de Moria. Al hacerlo, contribuirás a los esfuerzos por recuperar esa encrucijada para los enanos y demostrarás tu gran valía a Sigurd.","La Gran Escalera - Igash Desatado","Regresa con Sigurd en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","No mates a Glothrok"},
[12321]={"Igash puede encontrarse en lo alto de la Gran Escalera, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, donde Eilífr ocupa su puesto.\
\
Eilífr te ha pedido que derrotes a Igash y recojas su látigo para ayudar en los esfuerzos por recuperar ese cruce de caminos para los enanos. Desea ver el látigo como prueba de tus actos.","'Has hecho un buen trabajo al conseguir este látigo, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, y estoy muy impresionado. ¡No creí que tuvieras el temple necesario para enfrentarte a Igash! Pero me preocupa… aunque los orcos caen, siempre regresan con todas sus fuerzas. Espero que Igash haya desaparecido para siempre…'","Látigo de Igash obtenido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Ya has viajado a la Gran Escalera? ¡Deseo ver el látigo de Igash y saber que ha sido derrotado!'","Devuelve el látigo a Eilíefr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","Recoge el látigo de Igash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","'¡Así que tú eres ${CLASS:el poderoso[m]|la poderosa[f]}  del que todo el mundo habla tan bien! Los rumores de tu valor y coraje han llegado a mis oídos, pero como soy de naturaleza escéptica, deseo comprobar si estás a la altura para el tipo de desafío que tengo para ofrecerte.\
\
'Si de verdad eres todo lo que dicen, tengo una prueba para ti: Igash debe ser derrotado en su trono en la Gran Escalera, ¡y quiero ver pruebas de tus actos! Quiero que lo venzas en combate y regreses aquí con su látigo, para que pueda ver lo que has logrado.\
\
'No será una tarea sencilla, pero tampoco es imposible. Demuestra tu valía en este desafío que te propongo y recibirás una generosa recompensa. Ah, y… no hay ninguna deshonra en llevar amigos contigo en esta empresa.'","La Gran Escalera - El látigo de Igash"},
[12322]={"Recoge la marca de Gothgaash (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Marca del Devoto obtenida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Así que tú eres ${CLASS:el poderoso[m]|la poderosa[f]}  del que todo el mundo habla tan bien! Los rumores de tu valor y coraje han llegado a mis oídos, pero como soy de naturaleza escéptica, deseo comprobar si estás a la altura del desafío que tengo para ofrecerte.\
\
'Si de verdad eres todo lo que dicen, tengo una prueba para ti: puede que Igash controle la Gran Escalera, pero los demás líderes también son una cuadrilla temible. Quiero que entres en la Gran Escalera y recojas las marcas que porta cada uno de estos líderes, como prueba de que han sido derrotados.\
\
'No será una tarea sencilla, pero tampoco es imposible. Demuestra tu valía en este desafío y recibirás una generosa recompensa. Ah, y… no hay ninguna deshonra en llevar amigos contigo en esta empresa.'","Recoge la marca de Glothrok (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La Gran Escalera - Marca del Maestro","Recoge la marca de la Bestia (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Marca de Gothgaash obtenida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado su líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","Devuelve las marcas a Eilífr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","'¡Una excelente cosecha! Me alegra saber que esos líderes han sido abatidos. Espero que podamos disfrutar de algo de paz antes de que sus filas vuelvan a crecer. Gracias por tus esfuerzos, ${PLAYER}.'","'¿Ya has viajado a la Gran Escalera? ¡Deseo ver las marcas de tu victoria!'","Muchas tribus de orcos merodean por la Gran Escalera, junto a sus líderes, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Eilífr te ha pedido que derrotes a los líderes orcos de la Gran Escalera para ayudar en los esfuerzos por recuperar ese cruce de caminos para los enanos. Desea ver sus marcas como prueba de tu hazaña.","Marca de la Bestia obtenida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Marca de Glothrok obtenida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoge la marca del Devoto (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12323]={"Regresa con Geirr en la Sala Vigesimoprimera","'¡Los orcos de Moria deben ser derrotados! ¡Dirígete a la Gran Escalera y expúlsalos!'","Muchas tribus de orcos merodean por la Gran Escalera, al sureste de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.\
\
Geirr te ha pedido que derrotes a muchos orcos en la Gran Escalera para ayudar a los enanos a recuperar el cruce de caminos.","Geirr se encuentra en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, al noroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Geirr querrá saber de tu victoria contra los orcos en la que una vez fue una hermosa encrucijada de los enanos.","Enemigos muertos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Antaño uno de los cruces de caminos más grandes y hermosos de Moria, la Gran Escalera es ahora un vil refugio para muchas de las tribus orcas congregadas allí. Igash, considerado líder por todos esos grupos diversos, recauda tributos de cada tribu para entregárselos a Mazog, el más poderoso y temible de los orcos de Khazad-dûm. Los enanos desean expulsar a los orcos de Igash de la Gran Escalera y evitar que Mazog reciba esos valiosos y perversos obsequios.","Mata enemigos en la Gran Escalera (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Seré honesto contigo: no estaba seguro de que estuvieras a la altura de este desafío. ¡Pero me alegro de haberme equivocado esta vez! Perdóname por no haber confiado más en ti, ${PLAYER}, pues los rumores sobre tu valentía eran más que ciertos.\
\
'Aquí tienes una muestra de mi agradecimiento. Espero verte más a menudo en los próximos días, puesto que eres de gran ayuda para nuestra causa.'","'Tu fama se ha extendido por estos largos túneles, . Sí, deja de lado la modestia; puedo ver en tu ojos la mirada brillante de ${PLAYERNAME:un aventurero[m]|una aventurera[f]} valiente. Reconocería a los de tu clase incluso sin que los rumores me lo confirmaran.\
\
'¿Te apuntas a un pequeño reto? Al sureste de esta sala se encuentra la Gran Escalera, que en su día fue un concurrido cruce de caminos para los enanos, y que ahora no es más que un fétido pozo de orcos. Siempre nos esforzamos por expulsar a los orcos de ese lugar para poder recuperarlo otra vez.\
\
'${PLAYERNAME:Un aventurero[m]|Una aventurera[f]} como tú no dudaría en aceptar un simple desafío como el que te voy a proponer: ve a la Gran Escalera y mata a muchos enemigos. Cuantos más orcos derrotes, mejor será para toda la buena gente de Moria y más allá.'","La Gran Escalera - Limpiando las escaleras"},
[12324]={"'You have done my people a great service, ${PLAYER}. Would that I could take up arms as you do against the Enemy, but my hand is untrained in combat.\
\
'I am glad that vile creature no longer draws breath, even if reclaiming Tingobel remains beyond our grasp.'","'I was working in the mine when I heard the screams, ${PLAYER}. They had a strange echo to them at first, but once I was outside, there was no mistaking what was happening to us. \
\
'When I found my family amidst the chaos, we fled at once. The last thing I saw before leaving Tingobel was an armoured Orc of enormous size entering the mine after picking through ore we recently mined.\
\
'I do not care what interest he had in ore or gemstones, I just want him dead for what he did to our village and families.'","The Grasp of the Dead","Orodir can be found in Lancrath, to the south of Tingobel in Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have defeated the Orc-leader, Ulkfrúm, in the Tingobel mine. You should return to Orodir and tell him of the Orc's defeat.","Travel to the Tingobel mine","Ulkfrúm has been defeated","Ulkfrúm must be deeper in the mine, so perhaps finding something valuable will draw him forth","The Tingobel mine can be found in the rear of Tingobel to the north of Lancrath.\
\
Orodir has asked that you slay the leader of the Orc forces encamped in Tingobel.","Talk to Orodir","Search for something valuable to draw forth Ulkfrúm and defeat him","The leader of the Rashat-hai Orcs can be found somewhere in the Tingobel mine.\
\
You have entered the Tingobel mine, but have not yet found the Orc. You should search for something valuable to draw his attention.","DNT -- will not be seen","The leader of the Rashat-hai Orcs in Tingobel has taken control of the mine and now seeks to exploit the vale's resources on behalf of the Enemy."},
[12326]={"Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir lanzas agrietadas.","Se busca: lanzas agrietadas, en memoria de la Gran Alianza.","Se busca: lanzas agrietadas, en memoria de la Gran Alianza. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para los coleccionistas.","La Tarea de la Gran Alianza: Lanzas agrietadas","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger lanzas agrietadas, en memoria de la Gran Alianza. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoger lanzas agrietadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las lanzas agrietadas en un buzón de recogida","Lanzas agrietadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12327]={"Tasgall ha asado las larvas que le trajiste. Puedes volver con él para conocer el siguiente paso de su plan para derrotar a la Madre de las Bestias.","¡Tasgall ha sobrevivido al asalto del Señor de las Bestias!","Las extrañas bestias de las colinas se han convertido en un problema serio últimamente. Parece que están gobernadas por una matriarca secreta que sirve a los dragonzuelos. Si puede ser derrotada, quizá la amenaza de las bestias de las colinas desaparezca.","Has reunido carne de larva (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has colocado la carne de larva asada","Has derrotado al vengativo Señor de las Bestias y salvado la vida de Tasgall. Habla con él.","Reúne carne de larva (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Estas larvas han sido asadas hasta quedar en un estado... algo.\
\
'En cualquier caso, lleva esta cosa repugnante a las bestias de las colinas. Encontrarás la antigua puerta hacia el valle ocupada por las bestias de las colinas y los dragonzuelos. Un poco más adentro en estos valles hallarás una pequeña cueva donde se cree que la Madre de las Bestias tiene su guarida.\
\
'Coloca las larvas asadas sobre la gran roca justo dentro de la entrada para atraer a la criatura. ¡Entonces deberás atacar!'","'Tráeme la carne de larvas para que pueda prepararla para la Madre de las Bestias.'","'Estoy muy agradecido por tu intervención. Había oído rumores de los cazadores de que podría haber una pareja apareada de esas horribles criaturas en las colinas, pero los descarté como tonterías.\
\
'Por desgracia, fue mi propia necedad la que atrajo la ira de su pareja sobre nosotros y casi nos costó la vida a todos. Por favor, acepta mis más sinceras disculpas y estos obsequios en agradecimiento por salvarme la vida.'","'Estas bestias de las colinas se vuelven cada vez más peligrosas. Hemos oído que su líder es una matriarca de su especie, secreta y astuta, que a su vez sirve a los dragonzuelos. Si logramos atraer a esta Madre de las Bestias y derrotarla, las demás bestias podrían amedrentarse o huir.\
\
'Sabemos que estas bestias valoran mucho la carne de larva asada. Te pediría primero que caces larvas en la zona, traigas su carne para que la ase, y luego lleves la carne a las guaridas de las bestias de las colinas para atraer a esta madre de las bestias.\
\
'Pero ten cuidado: aunque las larvas no son gran amenaza, la matriarca puede ser un enemigo más allá del poder de cualquier guerrero solitario para vencer.'","'¡Ja! ¡Bien hecho, sureño! Supongo que aquellos rumores sobre el Señor de las Bestias eran falsos; esperaba que te enfrentaras a una pareja apareada de esas horribles criaturas.\
\
'Espera... ¿oyes algo?'","Atrae y derrota a la Madre de las Bestias","La Gran Bestia","Lleva la carne de larva a Tasgall","Las larvas se pueden encontrar en la zona general, no muy al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Caza larvas para obtener su carne y tráela a Tasgall para que la ase.","La roca en la guarida de las bestias de las colinas está en la entrada del valle, no muy al norte de Aughaire.\
\
Tasgall te ha dado carne de larva asada, que debes llevar a cierta roca en las guaridas de las bestias de las colinas.","'¡Debes matar a la Madre de las Bestias!'","'Asqueroso, ¿verdad? Pero ten en cuenta que, si no tienes nada más, puedes sobrevivir con esto. De todos modos, asado es incluso peor que crudo, pero parece que a las bestias de las colinas les gusta.\
\
'Espera unos minutos mientras cocino este lote.'","Tras derrotar con éxito a la Madre de las Bestias, debes regresar al campamento de Tasgall y hablar con él.","Habla con Tasgall"},
[12328]={"Add the honey to the mixture","A mortar and pestle can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should crush the wheat and seeds that you have collected.","The Great Beorning Signature","Gathered wheat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The oven can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should put your cake in the oven.","All that is left to do is to wait and watch it bake","Semillas conseguidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Show Hállkell your perfect honey cake","'We have both been through a lot lately, and I think a rest might be well-deserved. Do you know what I find most relaxing? The ancient Beorning art of baking, of course! Would you like to help me bake a honey cake? This will not be just any old cake, I assure you. This will be of the very type that Beorn of old used to bake himself! There are easier recipes to follow, but this is not a day for easy. I rest best when I am tested! Does that make any sense?\
\
'Come see me if you have questions about the process.'","Wait and watch your cake","The oven can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should take your cake out of the oven.","Wild wheat and seeds can be found north and east of the Beorninghús.\
\
You should collect wheat and seeds for your honey cake.","Bake your batter in the oven","Consigue las semillas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The mortar and pestle can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should add the honey to the mixture you have made.","'Now that honey cake looks simply perfect, and it smells even better! Well done, my friend! This is your very first honey cake? I would almost not believe it! You will find this honey cake recipe bakes differently for everyone who tries to make one. Truly a signature of the baker, if you will.\
\
'Did you find the process as restful and relaxing as I did? I hope so!'","Hállkell can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should show your perfect honey cake to Hállkell.","It does look quite good!","A cake stand can be found inside Grimbeorn's lodge.\
\
You should present your cake on the stand.","The oven can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should wait by the oven for your cake to bake.","Gather honey (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather wheat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The batter now has a good consistency","Hállkell has decided to enlist you in making the perfect honey cake.","Take your honey cake out of the oven","That is a nice looking cake!","Gathered honey (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Time to take out your cake!","Use the mortar and pestle at the Beorninghús to crush the wheat and seeds","Present your perfect honey cake inside Grimbeorn's lodge","'The recipe? Yes, of course! You will need to gather wild wheat, seeds, and honey, all from the Beorning-lands. Then the wheat and seeds must be ground very well. Next you add the wild honey to the mixture. Honey from the farm will not do for this step! No, that honey is far too domesticated, and Beorn's original recipe calls for wild honey!\
\
'Once the mixture is properly mixed, it is time to bake it, but don't let it cook for too long! The best honey cake is moist and not too dry!'"},
[12329]={"Glóin está justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Con tu ayuda, Aeglas y Glorwen escaparon a un lugar seguro. Oghûk demostró ser tan traicionero como cualquier trasgo. Debes informar de tu éxito a Glóin.","Después de recuperar la llave maestra del torturador trasgo, Aeglas decidió que era hora de abandonar la Ciudad de los Trasgos.","'Protégeme mientras libero a los demás. Mantente cerca.'","Habla con Glóin en su campamento fuera de la Ciudad de los Trasgos","La Gran Fuga","Debes proteger a Aeglas mientras intenta conducir a Glorwen y Oghûk a un lugar seguro. Depende de ti defenderlo en el trayecto.","'Mi plan no ha funcionado. Los trasgos estaban preparados, aunque no sé cómo. Pero eso ya no importa. Ahora que tenemos una llave, ha llegado la hora de marcharnos de este lugar, ${PLAYER}. Debemos ser cautelosos. Glorwen debe ser sacada de aquí, y pondremos a prueba la veracidad de las palabras de Oghûk.\
\
'Dime cuando estés preparado, y comenzaremos nuestra huida.'","'¿Aeglas ha sido liberado y ha regresado al campo de batalla, dices? Has hecho un gran trabajo, ${PLAYER}.'","Aeglas y Glorwen han encontrado el camino a la libertad","Habla con Aeglas"},
[12330]={"Habla con Dómárr","El Gran Salón de Durin","'Espero que Mögr sea lo bastante sensato como para escuchar a Reinn esta vez. Mientras tanto, he estado pensando en qué hacer sobre los orcos Durub de Gazatu-ru...'","Dómárr ha encontrado muchas situaciones desagradables durante sus viajes por Zelem-melek.","Escucha la historia de Dómárr","'Escuchemos el relato de Dómárr, ${PLAYER}. Quizá tenga información que pueda llevar de vuelta a la Sala Vigesimoprimera.'","Dómárr se encuentra en el Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Dómárr.","Reinn se encuentra en el Gran Salón de Durin.\
\
Deberías hablar con Reinn.","'Me gustaría oír más de lo que Dónnar ha encontrado en Zelem-melek. Quizá un relato más detallado abrirá los ojos a Mögr.\
\
'Me gustaría volver con algo de información útil, por poca que sea.'"},
[12331]={"'Snnff. ¿Q-quién podrías ser? Me puse una capa negra para merodear y asustar a mis amigos, pero me temo que estoy perdido. ¿Me mostrarás el camino de salida?'","'¡Gracias a Dios, todos están vivos! Estaba tan preocupada. Tal vez me aventure de nuevo algún día. Me encantaría echar un vistazo al tesoro escondido del viejo Bilbo.'","El gran rescate de los hobbits","'¡Oh, estoy tan asustada! ¡Por favor, dime si todos mis amigos están a salvo!'","'¡Un fantasma! ¡Vi un fantasma! ¿Crees que era el Viejo Tuk? ¡Estoy tan asustada! Una noche, él estaba enojado conmigo porque me comí su cena mientras no miraba... ¿crees que ha vuelto para perseguirme? ¡Ayuda, por favor no te enojes conmigo! No quise hacer daño...'","'¡Eek! ¡Vete! ¡No me asustas!'","Encuentra a los hobbits dispersos en el Agujero Embrujado (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Hobbits perdidos encontrados (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","May Gamyi se separó de sus amigos dentro del Agujero Embrujado, ya que desaparecieron de su lado uno por uno.\
\
Deberías buscar a los amigos de May y empujarlos hacia la puerta.","'¿Hola? ¡Sí, estaba aquí con May! Y no intentes echarme. Me fui de la fiesta porque vi un brillo al final de un pasillo y pensé que podría ser un tesoro. ¡También era una moneda bonita!\
\
'Ahora déjame en paz. No me iré hasta que haya encontrado un gran tesoro!'","'Hmm. Estaba seguro de que esta era la salida. Era a la izquierda, luego a la derecha, luego a la izquierda, luego otra vez a la izquierda, luego otra vez a la izquierda... y luego otra vez a la izquierda, creo. ¡Chist! ¡Me estás interrumpiendo! Estoy tratando de recordar el camino de salida. Ahora, por favor, déjame en paz.'","May Gamyi está fuera del Agujero Embrujado, cerca del Árbol de la Fiesta.\
\
Deberías regresar con May Gamyi para informarle que todos sus amigos están bien.","Regresa con May Gamyi para informarle sobre sus amigos","Pobre pequeña May Gamyie se encontró completamente sola después de entrar al Agujero Embrujado con un gran grupo de amigos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>","'¿Hmm? Lo siento, solo estaba echando un vistazo a algunas de las viejas notas de Bilbo Bolsón. ¡Qué imaginación tan curiosa tenía! ¿No sería terriblemente emocionante si sus historias salvajes fueran reales?'","'¡Ayuda, ayuda! Mis amigos y yo pensamos que íbamos a tener una aventura juntos y buscar el tesoro del viejo Bilbo. ¡Pero uno por uno, desaparecieron, y de repente me quedé completamente sola!\
\
'Logré salir lo suficientemente segura, pero ellos todavía están dentro. ¡Solo puedo imaginar la horrible pesadilla que deben estar viviendo en ese agujero!\
\
'¿Me ayudarás a encontrarlos y llevarlos de vuelta a salvo, ${PLAYER}? ¡Estaría realmente agradecida!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Solo se puede tener una misión del Agujero Embrujado en curso a la vez.</rgb>"},
[12332]={"Los hobbits de la Comarca han creado un evento especial de limpieza del hogar en el que los mathoms viejos se arrojan al lago y pueden pescarse para quedarse con ellos.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el festival actual.</rgb>","El estanque está al norte de Delagua.\
\
Billard Pott te ha hablado de una oportunidad increíble para pescar mathoms en el estanque de Delagua.","La Gran Pesca de Mathoms","Pesca tantos mathoms como puedas antes de que se acabe el tiempo","'¿Estás ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]} para empezar? ¡Oh, qué emocionante! Hay tantos mathoms que intercambiar. Me pregunto cuáles pescarás.\
\
'¡Asegúrate de tener tu caña de pescar a mano!'","¡Es hora de pescar mathoms!","'¡Rápido, rápido! ¡Toma tu caña de pescar y corre al estanque! Tienes que darte prisa, antes de que se lleven las mejores piezas.\
\
'¿No te enteraste? Han invitado a los hobbits de la Comarca a deshacerse de sus mathoms viejos, arrojarlos al estanque de Delagua y reunirse durante el Festival de Verano para pescar otros nuevos, ¡si es que pueden! Es una oportunidad única para intercambiar estos objetos invaluables. ¡Qué acontecimiento!'","'¡Date prisa! Ya se te está acabando el tiempo. ¡Buena suerte!'","Habla con Melia Pott para comenzar"},
[12333]={"Examined the statue of The Third Great Moot","Kyrstig can be found just outside Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should talk to Kyrstig.","Examined the statue of The Seventh Great Moot","Talk to Kyrstig","Seven statues representing the Great Moots can be found in Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold.\
\
You should examine the statues.","'Did you explore the Thing-fold? Magnificent, isn't it? I'm curious about that seventh statue. Was a seventh moot foretold, but has yet to happen? Hmmm. Well, perhaps it will happen in our lifetime, and I can be here to see it in person!'","The Great Moots of the Thing-fold","Examine the statue of The Fifth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Seventh Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Second Great Moot","Examine the statue of The First Great Moot","Examined the statue of The Fourth Great Moot","The Thing-fold is a landmark of great historic significance for the dwarf-clans. It is a location where dwarf-kings have met to discuss matters of grave importance for thousands of years.","Examined the statue of The Sixth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Sixth Great Moot","Examined the statue of The Second Great Moot","Examined the statue of The First Great Moot","Examined the statue of The Fifth Great Moot","'This grand structure behind me is Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. This is where the kings of all the dwarf-clans met to discuss matters of grave importance throughout all the long history of the dwarves. There have been six Great Moots held at the Thing-fold, and we can learn about each of them by studying the monuments here.'","Examine the statue of The Fourth Great Moot","Examine the statue of The Third Great Moot"},
[12334]={"Orcs can be found throughout Azanulbizar.\
\
King Thráin has asked you to slay Orcs at Azanulbizar.","'Hah! In time, the Orcs shall learn to fear our battle-cries as greatly as our axes!\
\
'Baruk Khazâd! Khazâd ai-mênu!'","The Haban'akkâ of Thráin struck fear into the hearts of the Orcs across Middle-earth.","Defeat Orcs at Azanulbizar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Orcs at Azanulbizar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'It is not merely Azog who must be punished for the defilement of my father, Thrór. Every single Orc must be hunted down and driven from our lands of old.\
\
'Slay every Orc that you find, my friend, for each one that falls before us in battle brings this war closer to its end!'","The Great Orc-hunt","King Thráin can be found at Amdân.\
\
You have slain many of the Orcs at Azanulbizar. You should talk to King Thráin.","Talk to King Thráin at Amdân"},
[12335]={"Viaja a Minas Tirith","El Gran Mundo Abierto","¡Has aterrizado con una suavidad sorprendente!","El Granjero Arenilla no está mirando. Ahora es tu oportunidad de escapar.","Este puede ser un momento maravilloso para explorar la Tierra Media.","Minas Tirith es un lugar encantador.","Alza el vuelo desde la proa de Minas Tirith","¡Aterriza!"},
[12337]={"Defeat gredbyg in Torech Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Many gredbyg have responded to the call of Shelob and taken up residence in her lair.\
\
You should defeat gredbyg inside Torech Ungol.","The other children of Shelob, the Gredbyg, have also taken up residence in Torech Ungol.","'Beyond the spiders, it seems that various gredbyg have also responded to the call of Shelob and taken up residence in Torech Ungol. Do not let your guard down; they are also dangerous in great numbers.'","Legolas is standing by outside Torech Ungol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","'Did you defeat the gredbyg? Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. I know not how many more there are, or how deep they live inside. They may be Ungwetári's children, but they are unlike the spiders in many ways, and pose different threats.'","Habla con Legolas.","The Gredbyg of Torech Ungol","Defeated gredbyg in Torech Ungol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12338]={"Handarod is in Esteldín, north of Dol Nendir.\
\
You should return to Handarod and tell him of Gurmagath's defeat.","The Greed of Trolls","Defeated Gurmagath","Talk to Handarod","'It is well known that Stone-trolls are a greedy, selfish breed, but it seems that a troll of particularly loathsome habits has settled camp not far to the south and has begun raiding the remaining settlements of the Elves of Lin Giliath.\
\
'They have asked us for aid, and so I am looking for a group of warriors to go root out this particular villain and ensure that he harrasses the Elves no longer. This Stone-troll is known by the name Gurmagath and is the chieftain of a band encamped in the forests and hills somewhere south-east of the ruins of Dol Nendír.\
\
'Gather your allies and see that he is dispatched or driven off. Without him, the Stone-trolls will be dismayed.'","The Stone-troll chieftain Gurmagath is in the forests south-east of Dol Nendír.\
\
Handarod has asked you to find Gurmagath and defeat him. He suggested that you take allies with you.","'So, Gurmagath the stone-troll has been dispatched? Good, good. Hopefully his ilk will never hinder the Elves again.'","Handarod told you that the Stone-troll chieftain known as Gurmagath has been boldly raiding nearby Elvish settlements in order to amass enough wealth and food to sate his enormous greed and appetite. The Elves have asked for the aid of the Rangers of Esteldín in stopping his thievery.","Defeat Gurmagath"},
[12339]={"¡Has encontrado la salida del laberinto! Impresionante.","El Desafío Verde","¿Estás ${PLAYERNAME:seguro[m]|segura[f]} de que eso fue una buena idea?","La salida del laberinto parece estar a leguas y leguas de donde te encuentras ahora.\
\
Si puedes caminar sin caerte, deberías intentar alcanzar la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión fallará al cerrar sesión.</rgb>","'Uf. Hola. Hoy no me siento nada bien.\
\
'Ni siquiera sé... cómo llegué aquí. ¿Eres miembro de la Liga de las Posadas? ¿Lo soy yo?\
\
'No sé si creerte. Estás dando vueltas... o quizá soy yo... ¡Oh, hola! ¿También eres parte de la Liga de las Posadas?'","Tob aRENAS está fuera del laberinto de setos en los Campos de Caballos, en Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Tob para averiguar exactamente por qué entraste al laberinto en primer lugar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión fallará al cerrar sesión.</rgb>","El laberinto de setos está en los Campos de Caballos, al norte de Bree.\
\
Parece que Tob Arenas te dio un desafío, aunque no está del todo claro cuál era. Deberías explorar el centro del laberinto para encontrar alguna pista que aclare qué ha planeado este miembro de la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión fallará si cierras sesión antes de completarla y entregarla.</rgb>","Busca un objeto de la Liga de las Posadas dentro del laberinto","Encuentra la salida antes de que se acabe el tiempo","¡Se te acabó el tiempo!","La Liga de las Posadas siempre procura hacer la vida en la Tierra Media más agradable para quienes disfrutan de los buenos tragos. El desafío de Tob Arenas de la Liga de las Posadas hará que tu recorrido entre la vegetación sea aún mejor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'¡La la! La la la la la.'","Habla con Tob Arenas","'Hola. Yo... ¿te conozco?\
\
'A la salud de Brandobas el Vengador... Vengador... y de su... su fina... fina cerveza. ¡Hurra!'"},
[12340]={"El barril perdido está en algún lugar al noroeste de Sobrecolina. La posada El Dragón Verde está en Delagua, al sureste de Sobrecolina.\
\
Barmy Nudoraíz, el ayudante de posadero en El Dragón Verde, te ha enviado a buscar un barril de brandy perdido.","Barril enano recogido","Recoge el barril enano","'¿No pudiste encontrar el barril enano?'","'Bueno, supongo que te gustaría una jarra de nuestra famosa cerveza Aliento del Dragón Verde, ¿verdad? ¡Pues tenemos de sobra! Pero oye, he oído hablar de ti por la Comarca. ¡Dicen que eres ${PLAYERNAME:bueno[m]|buena[f]} resolviendo problemas! Pues tengo un pequeño problema propio.\
\
'Se acerca la reunión anual de cerveceros de las Cuatro Cuadernas, y el viejo Gerd quiere presentar nuestra reserva especial en el concurso. Pero para la especial, Gerd usa viejos barriles de Ered Luin que los enanos usaban para el brandy. Cada año, un mercader enano que conoce le entrega un barril. Este año, sin embargo, parece que el pobre fue atacado por enormes arañas cerca de Sobrecolina, y en su prisa por escapar, perdió el barril de su carro.\
\
'Me pregunto si puedes ir a Sobrecolina y buscar el barril al noroeste del pueblo. ¡Sería muy importante para Gerd participar en el concurso con su mejor cerveza!'","Lleva el barril de vuelta a Barmy Nudoraíz","'¡Sí! ¡Eso es! ¡Este año Gerd ganará seguro! ¡Por favor, acepta una jarra de la casa!'","Gerd Pieblanco, posadero de El Dragón Verde en Delagua, participará en la reunión de cerveceros de las Cuatro Cuadernas.","El Dragón Verde"},
[12342]={"Asaltantes del Camino Verde derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los bandidos que están en el camino de Andrath están asaltando a los viajeros.","'¡Has vuelto! ¡Excelente! Sé que estos caminos no están tan concurridos como antaño, pero a lo mejor hemos salvado algunas vidas hoy, y agradezco que no tengamos que preocuparnos de que nos sigan.'","Vuelve con Gerwyn","Los bandidos del Camino Verde","Acaba con arqueros del Camino Verde (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Acaba con granujas del Camino Verde (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gerwyn te ha pedido que acabes con los bandidos que les persiguieron fuera de Andrath.\
\
Los bandidos están al sur de Andrath, en el norte de Cardolan.","Acaba con asaltantes del Camino Verde","'Saludos. Veo que tampoco eres de por aquí. Vinimos por el Camino Verde desde Bree, y debería haber sabido que habíamos tenido demasiada suerte como para que durase. Fuimos atacados por bandidos en Andrath, y cuando huíamos, se rompió una rueda del carro. Hemos acampado aquí para repararla, pero me preocupa que los bandidos nos sigan, o ataquen a otra gente en el camino.\
\
'Pareces capaz. Si acabas con ellos, te recompensaremos.'","Deberías decirle a Gerwyn que has acabado con varios bandidos del Camino Verde.\
\
Gerwyn está en el círculo de caravanas, en el norte de Cardolan."},
[12343]={"The Grey King","'We would be most grateful if ye could do something about the Grey King!'","Iolo Brochtû is at Maur Tulhau, north-east of the Grey King's lair.\
\
You should return to Iolo Brochtû with news of the Grey King's defeat.","Talk to Iolo Brochtû at Maur Tulhau","'So, ${PLAYER}, now that you've done so much for us, perhaps there is one more thing ye could help us with. I daresay it will be dangerous, though!\
\
'There is a great beast -- some kind of troll or ogre, I don't know -- that haunts the bluffs and passes hereabouts, crushing folk with great boulders as they pass near. Occasionally it comes down out of the hills and roams the forest, they say, though I've never seen it.\
\
'The Grey King we call it, for it's king of this wood, to be sure. Perhaps ye could rid us of this fearsome beast? You've proven a great friend so far, so how about it? Our hunters say the entrance to the Grey King's lair lies in a gully to the south-west. By the way, ye might want to look to that gift Rhus Cornchúthur gave you a while back....'","The entrance to the Grey King's lair lies in a gully to the south-west of Maur Tulhau.\
\
Iolo Brochtû has asked you to rid his village of the threat of the Grey King.","Iolo Brochtû has told you of a legendary creature they call the Grey King who haunts the bluffs of the Gloomglens, crushing passers-by with great stones.","'Hooray! The Grey King has been defeated! No duvodiad are ye to us for certain, ${PLAYER}. Ye are a friend and kinsman to us all!\
\
'Take this reward with our gratitude.'","Find and defeat the Grey King"},
[12344]={"<rgb=#FF00FF>Look</rgb> into the Grey Wrack from Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","'After all these years, it is unchanged....\
\
'When Vethúg Wintermind froze the Steel Keep and made it his lair, the lands surrounding Thikil-gundu were shrouded in winter. Grárik, the Grey Realm, was ended. All that remained was the Grey Wrack. I had thought in time these lands would heal, but it is not so.'\
\
Dori looks sorrowfully at the bones scattered before Stánbalk.\
\
'Stánbalk was once the greatest defence of Thikil-gundu, and now... it stands watch over the dead.\
\
'I think it unwise to press on without scouting Stánbalk. There may be more unseen dangers lurking ahead!\
\
'Scale the remains of Stánbalk, ${PLAYER}, and look into the lands of the Grey Wrack.\
\
'If you deem it safe, we shall make camp atop it!'","Thikil-gundu can be found beyond the Grey Wrack.\
\
You have made your way to Thikil-gundu and should now search for some sign of Nori and his expedition.","Burned the remains of dwarf-wights (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Dori atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","Deliver Nori's axe to Dori atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","'Hmmph! There is no comfort to be found in this place, but it will have to do. At least we are sheltered from the wind!\
\
'Alas, there was little room for the goats atop Stánbalk, so Náth has stabled them below as best he can. If this snowstorm does not soon relent, they ought to try growing their winter coats!\
\
'Let me see if my eyes do not fail me...'\
\
Dori gazes into the Grey Wrack, squinting as flakes of snow become entangled in his eyebrows and beard.\
\
'I see the blurred shapes you described, ${PLAYER}, but I cannot say who or what they might be. You are a hardy ${CLASS}, my friend. Will you descend into the Grey Wrack and find out?\
\
'If they are dwarves, they might belong to Nori's expedition. If they are not, well... it is better to know what lies before us, I think!'","The Grey Wrack","Burn the remains of dwarf-wights (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ingór, son of Vékun can be found in the Grey Wrack.\
\
You have found Ingór, son of Vékun while searching the Grey Wrack, but he appears to be wounded. You should speak to Ingór, son of Vékun.","Search for Nori before the gates of Thikil-gundu","Stánbalk, the Stone Wall can be found to the south of Thikil-gundu.\
\
Dori has asked you to scale Stánbalk, the Stone Wall and scout for nearby foes.","'${PLAYER}! I feared you would not return!\
\
'When Ingór returned in your stead, he spoke of... wights that clawed and hewed his company. That is not the work of dragons! What devilry is afoot in Thikil-gundu?'\
\
You tell Dori that none of the newly-slain Longbeards or Zhélruka remained to be found in the Grey Wrack.\
\
'Where have they gone? Where has my brother gone?'\
\
You hand Nori's axe to Dori, and his face sinks.\
\
'No... no!'","Slain dwarves and dwarf-wights can be found throughout the Grey Wrack.\
\
Fearing that none of their bodies can be recovered, Ingór, son of Vékun has asked you to burn the remains of his fallen companions as well as the remains of the terrible dwarf-wights that wander the Grey Wrack.","Before Thikil-gundu lies the Grey Wrack, a waste-land of ice and death wrought by Vethúg Wintermind and Hrímil Frost-heart.","'Malek... Vozdo... all of them... dead! Why... why have you come here, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You tell Ingór that Dori's brother, Nori, made for Thikil-gundu. Ingór laughs weakly and grimaces. You notice several fresh gashes in his armour.\
\
'So that... was the Longbeards' plan... eh? They can have it! Dómekh... is cursed! The Steel Keep is lost! It is not the drakes you should fear, ${CLASS}... for the Dead walk again! They have slain all in their path... Zhélruka... Longbeards... none have escaped but me! \
\
'What am I to do now? Return to my people... as a coward? Beg the mercy of my own brother?'\
\
You do not answer Ingór's questions, but you tell him that Dori and Company have made camp atop Stánbalk.\
\
'Perhaps I will go to them, but... I beg you... do as I ask. Many Longbeards and Zhélruka lie slain before the Steel Keep... but that is no resting place for a dwarf! When the dwarves fought as one at Azanulbizar long ago, so many were the slain that they could not be borne away to the tombs of our peoples. And so, they were... burned... to spare them any indignity in death.\
\
'Will you do this for my people, ${PLAYER}? Will you do this for the Longbeards? If the Dead seek to stop you, let them join the others as burned dwarves!'\
\
'Go!'","Scale the ruins of Stánbalk, the Stone Wall","You have not found any of the slain Longbeards or Zhélruka that Ingór described!","Talk to Ingór, son of Vékun in the Grey Wrack","The Grey Wrack lies between Stánbalk, the Stone Wall and Thikil-gundu.\
\
Dori has asked you to search the Grey Wrack for signs of Nori and his expedition.","Flakes of rust fall from the blade of Nori's axe, but it remains unblemished...","'What did you spy from Stánbalk, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You tell Dori that you did not encounter any foes near to the wall, but you noticed blurred shapes moving in the distance.\
\
'It is strange that we have seen so few drakes this near to Thikil-gundu. If the Steel Keep remained the lair of Vethúg Wintermind since the time of Dáin, I would have expected more of his brood to lurk in the foothills of the Wrathhorn. Ah, but who am I to question a moment of good fortune? Perhaps my brother was right after all!\
\
'I think we should make camp atop Stánbalk. Even if we are fortunate enough to encounter none of Vethúg's brood, the path to Thikil-gundu is still treacherous.\
\
'Come, ${PLAYER}!'\
\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: You will swiftly travel to the top of Stánbalk when you continue this quest.</rgb>","Search the Grey Wrack for signs of Nori's expedition","Blurred shapes move in the distance, but Stánbalk appears to be free of foes...","You have discovered Nori's axe amid a pile of rust before the gates of Thikil-gundu!","You have found no sign of Nori's expedition, but you spot a familiar dwarf amid the Wrack...","Talk to Dori on the road to Thikil-gundu","Burn slain Longbeards and Zhélruka in the Grey Wrack (${NUMBER}/12)","Reclaim Nori's axe before the gates of Thikil-gundu","Dori can be found on a hilltop overlooking Stánbalk, the Stone Wall of Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have scaled Stánbalk, the Stone Wall, and you have found it empty of foes. You should now speak to Dori.","Dori can be found atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
Dori and Company have made camp atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall. You should now speak to Dori.","Dori can be found atop Stánbalk, the Stone Wall.\
\
You have found Nori's axe amid a pile of Karazgar's rust. You should return to Dori at once.","You have reached the location Dori described!","Nori's axe can be found outside the gates of Thikil-gundu.\
\
You have discovered Nori's axe amid a pile of Karazgar's rust. You should collect Nori's axe."},
[12346]={"Orc sentries and corpses can be found in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should defeat Orc sentries and examine any Orc corpses that you find.","'Kergrim, you say? I have heard only tales of these beasts, but they sound vicious and unpleasant. I am thankful that you were able to fend them off, but that is not the end of it. Now we must devise some course of action to deal with the kergrim! The safety of our outpost is at stake.'","The Grim Vale","Footprints can be found leading away from the Orc corpse.\
\
You should follow the footprints.","The trail leads to a group of gruesome kergrim devouring bodies","Seek out another Orc corpse in Rath Dúath","Defeated Morgul sentries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Footprints lead away from this recently-slain Orc","This Orc has been freshly mauled by some sort of beast","Thurindol can be found at Echad Uial in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should talk to Thurindol.","Thurindol requires assistance in discovering what is killing nearby Orc sentries of Minas Morgul.","Defeat Morgul sentries (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Thurindol at Echad Uial","Another Orc corpse can be found closer to Echad Uial in Rath Dúath.\
\
You should seek out another Orc corpse to examine.","The trail leads further into the shadowy hills","Find the creature that is attacking Orcs","Examine the Orc corpse on the road to Minas Morgul","'I should be glad to see a dead Orc lying upon the road, yet instead I am concerned. The Orc was not killed by one of our own. It would seem that someone hunts Orcs in the Morgul Vale. Another Orc? A mysterious friend? More investigation is required to determine if the killer poses a threat to us. Examine the body and search for more sentries of Minas Morgul. We must get to the bottom of this.'"},
[12347]={"You have defeated many of the Enemy's forces in North Ithilien and made clear the way for the Host of the West.\
\
While their numbers will likely return in time, you have routed them for the moment.","In the absence of the Rangers of Ithilien during the Battle of the Pelennor Fields, North Ithilien has been overrun with the forces of the Enemy.","Orcs and Easterlings can be found throughout North Ithilien.\
\
Orcs and Easterlings pose a grave threat to the Rangers of Ithilien and the Host of the West. You should defeat them to aid in the protection of Gondor's lands.","Defeated Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","While adventuring in North Ithilien, you have come upon many of the Enemy's forces in the old ruins of North Ithilien and in the foot-hills of the Ephel Dúath.\
\
The Enemy's forces suffered a setback in Gondor, but the Dark Lord is far from bested.\
\
You should defeat the Enemy's forces in North Ithilien and make clear the way for the Host of the West.","The Grip of Mordor","You have defeated many Orcs and Easterlings in North Ithilien.","Completado"},
[12348]={"Derrota guerreros Uruk-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Has regresado! ¿Cómo te fue?'\
\
Relatas tus hazañas.\
\
'¡Cielos, eso es impresionante! ¡Vaya, creo que quizá acabes de salvar nuestra aldea! ¡Tienes mi agradecimiento eterno!'","Capitanes Uruk-hai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deberías avisarle a Eirlys Dringarth que has derrotado a muchos enemigos en Sharmokal.\
\
Eirlys está en Lintrev","Los Uruk-hai de Sharmokal se vuelven más audaces cada día. A medida que su número aumenta, también lo hace su inclinación hacia la violencia.","Guerreros Uruk-hai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Regresa con la Alcaldesa Dringarth","Los Peligros Crecientes de Sharmokal","La alcaldesa Eirlys Dringarth te ha pedido que derrotes enemigos en Sharmokal.\
\
Sharmokal se encuentra en el sur de la Ciénaga de los Cisnes.","Arqueros Uruk-hai derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota arqueros Uruk-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota capitanes Uruk-hai (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Oh, hola! Mi nombre es Eirlys Dringarth, alcaldesa de Lintrev. Bueno, sí, no somos más que una pequeña aldea. Aun así, me tomo mis deberes muy en serio, ¡y hay un peligro muy serio en ciernes!\
\
'Desde mi torre de vigilancia puedo ver a kilómetros y kilómetros de distancia. Al este, un enemigo temible se ha atrincherado en los acantilados, construyendo fortalezas y enormes murallas erizadas de picos. Últimamente el aire se ha llenado de humo en esa dirección. ¡Sus hogueras son tantas que temo por nuestra pequeña aldea! No deseo alarmar a mis vecinos, pero quizá podrías hacer algo al respecto. ¡Están prácticamente a nuestras puertas!'"},
[12349]={"There is conflict to the south and the hills faintly tremble","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the lands to the east","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can see all that transpires in the Vales of Anduin.","'Did you not say we would meet again after we departed in the Wailing Hills? It is pleasing to me that it has turned out to be true.\
\
'But not all is good along the banks of the Anduin, for trouble brews to the north. I speak to you of the fortress called Gundabad, which has become home to many Orcs and winged drakes. It is a refuge of evil, but that evil does not stay there; it roams far afield and is a danger even to these lands.'","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. I have not forgotten the assistance you provided to me in the Wailing Hills that lay near to the Great River.\
\
'I have seen goblins and many ill-hearted beasts on this side of the Misty Mountains. Some of them creep out of the Goblin-town, but from where the others hail I cannot say with certainty.'","The Eyrie can be reached from the Carrock in the Beorning-lands.\
\
You should look out over the Eyrie at the lands below.","'The several conflicts that embroil the lands hereabout are clear even to those who do not possess the eyes of my kind, ${PLAYER}. Neither the woods nor the mountains are safe, and the people who dwell in the vales between will suffer if nothing is done.\
\
'I cannot overextend my reach or exceed my wingspan in this, ${PLAYER}. But I will keep an ever-watchful eye upon these lands. If I see aught that threatens, I will warn those below of the danger with a call that will echo in the valleys. That way much harm may be avoided.'","Gwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Gwaihir.","Meneldor can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Meneldor.","Meneldor can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should be polite to Meneldor.","All is peaceful in the Beorning-lands","Talk to Gwaihir the Wind-lord","Cordially <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> to Meneldor","This is a good place to survey the lands to the east","Landroval can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should talk to Landroval.","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the lands to the north","Silent wisps of smoke from distant machines billow above the foothills","'You speak of Grimbeorn, and not out of hand, for you know I hold him in high regard. So too did I respect his sire Beorn. The tale of his great deeds carries on, though he is dead these past few years. His people mourn him, but more than that they protect the lands that were his, and that is memorial enough. He would have thought so too, I deem.\
\
'Now the Beornings have sent you to me, ${RACE}. I will hear your request and perhaps favour this pact, but speak first to Landroval and to Meneldor. They will judge you accordingly.'","Talk to Meneldor","Landroval can be found at the Eyrie.\
\
You should be polite to Landroval.","Talk to Landroval","Cordially <rgb=#00FF00>bow</rgb> to Landroval","This is a good place to survey the lands to the north","<rgb=#00FF00>Look</rgb> at the lands to the south","The Growing Might of Gundabad","This is a good place to survey the lands to the south"},
[12350]={"You should observe Gríma reprimanding the leaders of Madh-fushaum for what appears to be failures on their part. You may be able to learn what involvement he has in the situation in the Stonedeans.","The Gríma Influence","What you observed of Gríma Wormtongue's business with the leaders of Madh-fushaum and the role he has played in the Stonedean's turmoil would be wise to share with Herubrand.","Talk with Herubrand","You once again encounter Gríma Wormtongue, this time reprimanding the leaders of Madh-fushaum for what appear to be failures on their part. He clearly had business to attend to here before departing for Isengard.","Gríma has finished his business in Madh-fushaum and now departs for Isengard.","The discussion has ended, and you should talk to Herubrand about what you saw","You find Gríma Wormtongue in a heated discussion with the leaders of Madh-fushaum. It is pretty clear he is unhappy about something, and you should see what he has to say....","It appears that Gríma Wormtongue does indeed have business in Madh-fushaum, and his journey this far north was no coincidence. He may yet have a role to play in the struggle in the Stonedeans.","Observe Gríma reprimanding the White Hand leaders","'You found Gríma Wormtongue among the White Hand in Madh-fushaum? He is a very powerful man, even after being removed from Edoras. It appears he still has quite a bit of influence here in Woodhurst.\
\
'We can only hope that we can uncover his plot against us before it is too late. I do wonder which of my advisors he spoke of....'"},
[12353]={"Los dunlendinos han establecido un campamento maderero en el bosque de Sâd Rechu, donde recolectan madera para el uso de los lacayos de Saruman.","Habla con Inufileg en Gwingris","'Mientras nuestros recursos han disminuido, nuestros enemigos se han vuelto más audaces. Los dunlendinos han establecido un campamento maderero al sureste, a las afueras de Gwingris.\
\
Allí, están descuartizando la madera para proporcionar materiales a los lacayos del traidor, Saruman el Blanco. Sus acciones no pueden quedar impunes tan cerca de nuestro puesto de avanzada, ${PLAYER}.\
\
Dirígete al sureste y busca un pequeño estanque... nuestros exploradores informan que un gran número de dunlendinos se han reunido allí. Derrota a tantos como puedas... deben ser expulsados ​​de estas tierras.'","'Hay un pequeño estanque al sureste de Gwingris. Concentra tus esfuerzos allí y regresa cuando hayas derrotado a los dunlendinos.'","Inufileg se encuentra en Gwingris, al noroeste del campamento de los dunlendinos.\
\
Debes informar a Inufileg sobre tu éxito contra los dunlendinos.","Los dunlendinos se pueden encontrar al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Inufileg te ha pedido que derrotes a los dunlendinos que están devastando el bosque de Sâd Rechu.","'Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}. Con la pérdida de tantos trabajadores y guardias, los dunlendinos deberían estar sumidos en el caos.'","Los guardias de Sâd Rechu","Dunlendinos derrotados  (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota dunlendinos al sureste de Gwingris (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[12354]={"'That ought to do... for the next hour or so.\
\
'I suppose it's the most I can ask.'","Mud can be found throughout the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should clean up splotches of mud left by uncleanly guards in the guard's barracks.","Cleaned up splotches of mud in the guards' barracks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Álarr","Clean up splotches of mud in the guards' barracks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'How am I to make a good impression for the Master? The protection of Lake-town is one matter, but cleanliness seems to elude even the finest of my guards. Again with the mud on their boots! Every day!\
\
'If you scrub that filth up quickly, I'll make it worth your time.'","Captain Álarr can be found in the guards' barracks in Lake-town.\
\
You should talk to Álarr.","Desperate to impress the Master, Captain Álarr has asked for your aid in cleaning the filthy guards' barracks.","The Guards' Mess"},
[12355]={"Rhiangar cree que las respuestas las tiene una saga anciana que vive en la oscuridad del Bosque Viejo","'Luilloth fue una heroína. ¡Siempre lo supe! Parece que encontró la forma de expulsar a los muertos vivientes que asolaban Cardolan, pero no se menciona qué forma fue.\
\
'¡La parte del bosque es intrigante! ¡Crecí escuchando rumores de una saga del Bosque Viejo que embrujó el bosque durante cientos de años! ¡Tenemos que hablar con esta saga! A lo mejor es la que conoció Luilloth más allá de los árboles. Evidentemente, no puedo acompañarte, pero te pido que encuentres a la saga del bosque. ¡Puede ser la clave para entender cómo expulsar a los muertos vivientes!'","'¿Dije cerca? Pensé que estaba cerca, pero parece que está lejos. Para alcanzar el río, ve al este desde mi cabaña, luego al sur. Ahí encontrarás el pez que busco.'","La saga del Bosque Viejo","Encuentra a la saga del Bosque Viejo","Henbran toma el pez con alegría","Henbran te ha pedido que le lleves el pez del río.\
\
El río está cerca de Sarch Vorn, cerca del Bosque Viejo.","'¿Quién eres? ¿Te ha mandado la Capa Azul? Ah, no. Veo que solo eres alguien con mala suerte.'\
\
Empiezas a explicar que estás buscándola, pero levanta las manos y te interrumpe.\
\
'Espera. No quiero escuchar tu historia. ¡Tengo mucho que hacer! Solo soy una pobre anciana viviendo sola en un bosque oscuro. Normalmente el hombre con la capa azul viene con una cesta de comida, pero no le he visto en varios días. No sé quién es, pero vaya, me volví dependiente de él con el primer pez que trajo.\
\
'¡Tengo una idea! Parece que quieres algo de mí, aunque solo sea una pobre anciana que no tiene nada. ¡Nada! ¿Por dónde iba? Ah, sí, quieres algo de mí. Y yo quiero el pescado de esta semana. Trae algunos peces del río cercano. Entonces escucharé tu historia. Si no, ¡que te vaya bien!","'¿Tú otra vez? ¡Pero traes el pescado! ¡Excelente! Dámelo y hablamos.'","Lleva el pez a Henbran","Rhiangar te ha pedido que busques a la saga del Bosque Viejo.\
\
El bosque Viejo está en el noroeste de Cardolan.","Pez atrapado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Captura peces (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Saludos. ¿Saga del Bosque Viejo? ¿Todavía nos llaman así? Vaya, vaya. Bueno, probablemente estés buscando a mi hermana, Henbran. Está más allá de la colina, hacia el norte, y luego atravesando el bosque.'","Deberías llevarle el pez que has pescado a Henbran Amon.\
\
Henbran está en el Bosque Viejo, en el noroeste de Cardolan."},
[12356]={"Bands of savage half-orcs have set upon the folk living on the outskirts of Lhanuch. Siorus Brehur of the Council of Thanes has asked if you have the strength to aid the people of Lhanuch and defeat these raiders before they destroy more homesteads. If you can do so, he will argue in council against the demands of Isengard.","Talk to Siorus Brehur in the Brenin's Hall","Defeated Bûzog","Derrota a los semiorcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","semiorcos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Bûzog","'If you can defend us against the half-orcs, I will speak in support of your duvodiad friends.'","'You have fought bravely on our behalf, Duvodiad. \
\
'I have little doubt that these raiders owe their allegiance to Isengard, but that matters little if they force us to concede to Saruman's demands.\
\
'You have bought us some time and shown us the strength of the North-men. I shall try to convince Glynn Brenin to remain neutral for as long as we may.'","Siorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Nan Laeglin.\
\
You should return at once to Siorus Brehur with news of your success.","The Half-orcs","Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farms.\
\
Siorus Brehur has asked you to repel the half-orc raiders and their leader Bûzog from Nan Laeglin.","'Columns of smoke rise through the air south of here. The homes of my people are burning, and we have not the strength to defend them while raiders threaten the walls of this village.\
\
'If you can aid us by doing battle with the half-orcs -- at least keep them at bay for a time -- then I will support you in the Council of Brehur.\
\
'Otherwise, it seems that we must take up the banner of Isengard along with our kinsmen in the South, lest we be swept away upon the tides of war with no allies to call upon in time of need.'"},
[12357]={"'Your aid against the half-orcs of Saruman meant much to my people, ${PLAYER}. Unfortunately, the vile creatures have renewed their attacks upon the cartrevs.\
\
'Will you aid us once again by hunting the foul vermin?'","Bands of savage half-orcs have set upon the folk living on the outskirts of Lhanuch. Siorus Brehur has asked if you have the strength to aid the people of Lhanuch and defeat these raiders before they destroy more homesteads.","Talk to Siorus Brehur in the Brenin's Hall","Derrota a los semiorcos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Any aid you can provide us will be much appreciated.'","semiorcos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Siorus Brehur is at the Brenin's Hall in the village of Nan Laeglin.\
\
You should return at once to Siorus Brehur with news of your success.","The Half-orcs -- Repeatable","'You have fought bravely on our behalf, ${PLAYER}. Saruman's lackeys will think twice about attacking us again...I hope.'","Half-orcs can be found throughout Nan Laeglin, especially where they have raided Uch-lûth farms.\
\
Siorus Brehur has asked you to repel the half-orc raiders from the farms of his people."},
[12358]={"Dornhador está en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Dornhador con las noticias de tu victoria.","'Derrotar a los cuidadores de lobos en Barad Morlas podría ayudar a desbaratar los planes de los semiorcos.'","Los cuidadores de lobos semiorcos pueden encontrarse patrullando Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Dornhador te ha pedido que derrotes a los cuidadores de lobos semiorcos en Barad Morlas para ayudar a desbaratar sus planes.","Cuidadores de lobos semiorcos derrotados en Barad Morlas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las bestias de los semiorcos","'${PLAYER}, no sabemos a ciencia cierta qué buscan los semiorcos en Barad Morlas, pero sí sabemos que cuentan con muchos lobos malvados en sus filas. Estas bestias podrían conducirles rápidamente hacia lo que buscan.\
\
'Creo que quizás deberíamos intentar frustar sus esfuerzos terminando con los semiorcos que cuidan a los lobos. Sin su guía, los lobos podrían desistir de su cometido.\
\
'Ve a Barad Morlas, al suroeste de aquí, y termina con los cuidadores de lobos. ¡No debes fallar!'","'Lo has hecho bien, ${PLAYER}, pero tengo otra tarea para ti, si me prestas tu atención un momento...'","Los semiorcos de Barad Morlas están usando lobos malvados para explorar las ruinas.","Derrota a los cuidadores de lobos semiorcos en Barad Morlas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Dornhador en Echad Eregion"},
[12361]={"The Halls of Black Lore","The time has come to enter the Halls of Black Lore.\
\
Speak to Rhadrog near the Halls to begin 'Instance: Nothing for Nothing'.","'${PLAYER}! You made it back! Was that really Viznak? If it was, we have left him to die! Oh no, I will never be able to live with myself if Lhaereth got him. You know, I really am quite fond of that goblin. Don't tell Faeron I said that.\
\
'Wait, Faeron is not with you? Where is he?!'","Faeron has asked for you to search for the Halls of Black Lore. They are somewhere in the Circle of Madness in Minas Morgul.\
\
You should find the Halls and then signal the Rangers by <rgb=#FF00FF>whistling</rgb>.","'Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. Steel yourself; we know not what lies inside, but we will soon discover what Lhaereth seeks.\
\
'A word of warning: We know of what the Lady of Blight is capable. The four of us are no match for her. If she has arrived before us, do not engage.'","'We must seek the Halls of Black Lore, but I know not where they lie within the Circle of Madness. The four of us must search for it, and then enter together when it is found. I will be sending Dolenthol on this mission as well. I have only worked with him for a short time, but his ingenuity and enthusiasm have impressed me.\
\
'Should you find the Halls, give the signal, and we will find you. Good luck out there.'","<rgb=#FF00FF>Whistle</rgb> while near the Halls of Black Lore","'It is time, then? Ugh... I do hope Lhaereth is not inside....'","Talk to Rhadrog","Speak to Rhadrog to complete 'Instance: Nothing for Nothing'","Rhadrog has returned to Barad Elenath, the Star-gazers' Spire.\
\
You should talk to Rhadrog.","Talk to Faeron","These must be the Halls of Black Lore","Rhadrog, Faeron, and Dolenthol emerge from the shadows","Faeron and the rest of the Rangers have moved to the Halls of Black Lore.\
\
You should talk to Faeron.","You have discovered evidence that Lhaereth is searching for a place called The Halls of Black Lore within the Circle of Madness."},
[12362]={"The Hand of Isengard","The emissary's champion is in the Brenin's Hall in Lhanuch.\
\
You should speak with the emissary's champion.","'And what do we have here? A bit far afield aren't you, Duvodiad? You are not welcome here. The affairs of Dunland do not involve you, and your presence does naught but threaten the tentative peace of these lands.\
\
'With the pact I offer, these lands shall be forever safe from the looming threat of the North-men under the protection of Isengard.\
\
'Now begone, before I am tempted to rash and unsightly action to remove you.'","'You are not welcome here, Duvodiad!'","Talk to the emissary's champion in the Brenin's Hall","You have encountered an unusual pair of Men, sent it seems from Isengard to offer a treaty of fealty between the Uch-lûth and Saruman.","'And here I was just looking for a bit of sport among this backwater collection of hovels. I had not dared hope for any fool Duvodiad to offer themselves up to my blades.\
\
'Alas, it shall have to wait. My lord has business to attend to with the brenin.\
\
'But do not wander too far, little vagabond. Once our treaty is in hand, I shall have the time to deal with the likes of you.'"},
[12363]={"'Those Aragorn has seen to will heal, in time. Now he will attend the hurts of the others that rest in these Houses of Healing, and only then will he return to his pavilion outside the city.\
\
'These wounded are fortunate indeed that Aragorn came to this city, and that Ioreth remembered that doggerel from her youth. The hands of a healer, indeed!\
\
'For now, our friends must rest. But it is good to know that they will recover from their hurts and be themselves once again.'","'I am weary, but there is no time to rest. Time is short for each of them, but for Faramir most of all.'","Aragorn is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith.","Talk to Aragorn and assist him with healing the wounded","The Hands of a Healer","'It seems that folk have been ransacking their cupboards and closets in search of a flowering weed, ${PLAYER}. Do you know anything about this?\
\
'If you speak with Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, perhaps he can tell you if enough was found.'","'I have come from the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, and I am sworn to keep secret the goings-on within. But I can tell you that your presence is requested!'","'Some kingsfoil has been found, but it remains to be seen if it will be enough. I may need someone to help me as I move from bedside to bedside, ${PLAYER}. Will you be that ${RACE}?'","Talk to Gandalf in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing","The healers have brought Aragorn some kingsfoil, and now he hopes to use it to heal the wounded.","Talk to Aragorn in the High Hall of the Houses of Healing","Gandalf is inside the High Hall of the Houses of Healing, located on the Sixth Circle of Minas Tirith."},
[12368]={"Pick flowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hithlos's vase, goblet, box, and harp can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should seek out Hithlos's lost items.","Found the harp!","'Hail, good ${RACE}. The time draws ever near for the departure of our king to the Undying Lands. This is no time for gloom though. No, it is a time of celebration. Evil has been vanquished and the wood will be the realm of the Wood Elves once more.\
\
'I am a musician of the great halls of Felegoth. My harp rings bright and true through the caverns around us. I play each day, songs of old and songs of joy. Today there is a problem though. I seem to have lost my harp. I lost not just my harp, but also many of the items that make each performance a great experience. For added ambience I prefer to play with my vase, my goblet, and my box, just in case a passerby provides a gracious donation.\
\
'If you could find these items for me, I shall fill these halls with the sweet sounds of my harp.'","Hithlos's vase can be found beside him in Felegoth.\
\
You should put the flowers in the vase for Hithlos.","Found the goblet!","Found the box!","Talk to Hithlos","Flowers can be found in the gardens of Felegoth.\
\
You should pick flowers for Hithlos's vase.","Hithlos can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Hithlos.","Bring the items you found to Hithlos","'You have found my belongings. I am indebted to you. I must be more careful and not misplace these precious items again.\
\
'Now, something is missing. Yes, my vase needs fresh flowers in it. If you could make haste to the gardens here in Felegoth, there should be some nice golden flowers to fill the vase.'","Find Hithlos's lost items (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Now I am ready. Let the music begin.'","Picked flowers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Harpist of Felegoth","Hithlos can be found in Felegoth.\
\
You should bring the items you found to Hithlos.","Found the vase!","Hithlos, a musician in Felegoth would like to perform his uplifting music, but seems to have misplaced his harp.","Put the flowers in Hithlos's vase"},
[12369]={"Destroyed the second barricade","Dolenthol has a plan.","Defeated Dargásh","Defeated Shaktur","You should seek out Shaktur, the leader of Ugrukhôr's forces, and defeat him.","'Our actions have instigated a fight between Ugrukhôr's forces and those loyal to Gothmog! If fortune is on our side, this may allow the Rangers to proceed further into Minas Morgul.\
\
'But we should do what we can to better their chances of survival, and I know just the thing to do it: defeating the commanders of each army will throw the Orcs into disarray! To reach them we will need to clear several of the barricades between us and them, so let us begin.'","Defeat Dargásh","You should seek out Dargásh, the leader of Gothmog's forces, and defeat him.","Dolenthol asked you to travel to the second barricade and destroy it.","The Harrowing of Morgul-- Solo","The Harrowing of Morgul is underway, and two Orc-armies do battle, each intent on seizing control of the Circle of Wrath for their master.","Destroy the first barricade","Destroy the second barricade","Talk to Dolenthol","Destroyed the first barricade","Find and defeat Shaktur","Dolenthol asked you to travel to the first barricade and destroy it."},
